window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":201,"title":"Chapter 201 - Dont Mess With Qiao Xi!","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi chuckled, and her eyes were filled with coldness.","“In your eyes, I’m just a toy. I have to do whatever you want me to do. Even if you want to kill me, I should accept it. You all think that Meng Wan has been wronged, so I should apologize?”","Madam Gu was slightly surprised. She did not expect that Qiao Xi would not be nervous at all and would actually retort.","“You... You actually dare...”","“Madam Gu, I’m not a pushover that anyone can bully. I won’t let you manipulate me. Moreover, it was Meng Wan who destroyed Gu Zheng’s medicinal herbs, yet you guys kept avoiding the facts and treating it as my fault!”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “Looks like... Madam Gu really wished that she would destroy Gu Zheng’s things. You want him ruined. Furthermore, I’m not at your mercy. Is that why you want us to get a divorce?”","Everyone gasped, and the surroundings were perfectly silent.","They all knew very well that Madam Gu hated Gu Zheng and wished for him to die.","Madam Gu and Old Master Gu had asked Meng Wan to marry Gu Zheng because they wanted her to control Gu Zheng. It would be best if she could let Gu Zheng walk toward death step by step.","It was just that they pretended not to know anything and were speaking self-righteous words.","Had Qiao Xi gone mad?","“Nonsense! Shut up!” Madam Gu was surprised. Then, she flew into a rage and shouted.","Her hands trembled as she pointed at Qiao Xi. “Capture this sl*t! How shameless!”","The servants immediately went forward. Just as they were about to do something, the door slowly opened.","Gu Zheng strode in with large strides and shielded Qiao Xi’s face as he looked at Madam Gu with a gloomy gaze.","“I said not to provoke Qiao Xi!”","With Old Master Gu around, Madam Gu instantly had the confidence to scold him loudly. “Gu Zheng! I’m your mother! This b*tch is just your toy. I was just teaching her how to be a qualified daughter-in-law. Is that wrong?”","Everyone held their breaths.","Suddenly, Gu Zheng sneered. “Madam Gu, if you think you’re very free, I can make you busy. For example, I can make you leave the Gu family?”","Madam. Gu was so angry that her whole body was trembling. Gu Zheng was threatening her? He was going against her because of that b*tch Qiao Xi?","“Brother Gu Zheng, it’s all my fault,” Meng Wan said with tears. “Aunt Lan is doing this for your own good. Sob... If I hadn’t gone to the Gu family to look for you, nothing would have happened. I’ll leave now...”","Gu Zheng looked up at Meng Wan.","He waved at the people behind him. Song Shijing walked up to her and said in a cold voice, “Miss Meng, the president has told you not to come looking for the Gu family anymore.”","Meng Wan lowered her head in grievance and sobbed. “Brother Gu Zheng...”","Hearing Meng Wan’s cries, Madam Gu’s face was filled with viciousness. “Gu Zheng, I asked Qiao Xi to apologize to Wan Wan because I wanted to quickly resolve this matter. The Gu and Meng families have been close for so many years, so we can’t fall out over a woman!”","Gu Zheng’s expression was calm, and his eyes were cold.","Song Shiyu said again, “Miss Meng, please leave.”","Madam Gu and Old Master Gu’s expressions darkened.","Old Master Gu was infuriated. Gu Zheng was too unbridled!","He roared angrily, “Gu Zheng! Have you gone mad? You’re going against everyone for this b*tch?”","Old Master Gu slammed the table. “I absolutely don’t agree! I won’t allow this shrew to affect the Gu family. She was the one who seduced you and made you hide Jinchuan Grass. When you saw that Old Master Meng was seriously ill, you refused to take it out! You’re simply ungrateful!”","Qiao Xi: “...” The old master was indeed good at scolding people!","Meng Wan looked pitiful. “Brother Gu Zheng, it’s fine if you don’t like me, but you can’t cut ties with the Meng family for Miss Qiao’s sake. It’ll affect your future!”","Everyone agreed. “Miss Qiao, I advise you to be sensible. You don’t deserve to be the mistress of the Gu family. Only a young miss like Miss Meng has the right.”","“You still have the cheek to pester Young Master Gu at a time like this?”","Madam Gu was delighted. “Gu Zheng, Wan Wan also knows that you don’t like flowers and plants, so she destroyed those things. It’s all for your own good. How can you blame her?”","Gu Zheng mocked. “For my own good? I’m really thankful to her, then!”","Qiao Xi: “...”","Everyone was silent, and Old Master Gu’s expression was gloomy. “Gu Zheng, it’s fine if you don’t get Qiao Xi to apologize, but you have to stop oppressing the Meng family! In the future, you’ll know that Wan Wan is the most suitable person for you. That woman is just a toy. You can play with her, but the mistress of the Gu family is absolutely not her!","“If you hand over Jinchuan Grass now, I can forgive you. Take her back!”","Gu Zheng narrowed his eyes. Jinchuan Grass?","Now that everyone knew that he had Jinchuan Grass, Old Master Gu naturally heard about it too.","Hence... they were causing such a commotion today because they wanted Jinchuan Grass?"]},{"number":202,"title":"Chapter 202 - Mr. Feng Is Here","paragraphs":["“Gu Zheng, since you have so much Jinchuan Grass, it doesn’t matter if you give one to Old Master Meng. Save him first!”","As soon as Old Master Gu finished speaking, everyone looked greedy.","This was Jinchuan Grass they were talking about! Gu Zheng actually had over a hundred stalks in his hands! There would be enough to give one to everyone here.","Their eyes were fixed on Gu Zheng, and Old Master Gu frowned. “Gu Zheng, Old Master Meng saved my life, after all. Even if you’re dissatisfied, you should give him a stalk of Jinchuan Grass. Moreover, my health has been poor recently, so you should give me some too. It can be considered as filial piety.”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. Old Master Gu was really thick-skinned.","In order to force Gu Zheng to hand over Jinchuan Grass, he got a bunch of people to pressure him.","Old Master Gu and Madam Gu looked at Gu Zheng greedily.","He coldly swept his gaze across the crowd and said indifferently, “I don’t have it.”","The atmosphere instantly became awkward.","Old Master Gu glared at him and stood up abruptly. “Gu Zheng, what do you mean by this? Rumor has it that you have more than a hundred stalks of Jinchuan Grass. If you don’t have any, why would such news spread? I think you’ve been bewitched by that woman! You’re not even listening to my words anymore...”","Madam Gu’s face was filled with anger. “Qiao Xi... It’s all because of Qiao Xi... It’s just a few flowers and plants, yet she refuses to let the matter go. Someone! Chase her out! I don’t want to see her anymore!”","Gu Zheng’s expression was ice-cold as he pulled Qiao Xi along and intended to leave, yet Qiao Xi stopped him.","She smiled slightly. She could not leave now because the show was about to start.","At this moment, a servant rushed in. “Old Master, Madam, Mr. Feng, the man beside the divine physician, is here.”","The divine physician?","Mr. Feng was the assistant of the divine physician. Why was he in the Gu family’s old mansion?","Everyone was in disbelief. They rubbed their eyes and clearly saw Mr. Feng slowly walking over.","It was indeed Mr. Feng!","All these years, the divine physician had been traveling everywhere with Mr. Feng. Furthermore, the divine physician had saved Old Master Lu many years ago, so they had all seen him before.","Although Mr. Feng was old, his face was ruddy and he looked strong.","Old Master Gu walked past the crowd and quickly went forward. He said warmly, “Mr. Feng, I didn’t know you were coming. Sorry for not going out to meet you.”","The divine physician had been living in seclusion for many years. No one knew his whereabouts, and it was rumored that he had already passed away.","Mr. Feng’s sudden appearance meant that the divine physician might be in Li City too.","Gu Zheng looked at Qiao Xi. His poison was probably something that only the divine physician could cure. It just so happened that Feng Zhang was here with the Gu family. Could it be...","Feng Zhang swept his gaze over everyone before it finally descended on Qiao Xi. He instantly stared with wide eyes. “Six...”","Old Master Gu and Madam Gu hurriedly went forward to welcome him. “Mr. Feng, please have a seat.”","“I came here today because of Jinchuan Grass.” Feng Zhang sat down and got straight to the point.","“Young Master Gu, you have a hundred stalks of Jinchuan Grass. It’s extremely precious, but ordinary people won’t know how to use it. I’m just here to tell you how to use it.”","A plan instantly hatched in Madam Gu’s mind. She sighed helplessly and said, “Mr. Feng, so you’ve already heard that Gu Zheng has Jinchuan Grass. Now that Old Master Meng is seriously ill, he urgently needs it. However, this unfilial son of mine refuses to give it to him!","“Our Gu family and the Meng family have always been close, but Gu Zheng was seduced by that vixen and hid away Jinchuan Grass. He watched as Old Master Meng was enduring the pain of his illness. The person in charge of the Gu family is so ungrateful. If news of this gets out, the entire Gu family will be affected. That vixen is really vicious!”","Meng Wan sobbed softly.","Feng Zhang frowned.","She scolded Sixth Miss for being vicious in front of him? She even wanted Jinchuan Grass?","The reason why Feng Zhang was here was because Third Young Master had called and asked him to cooperate with Sixth Miss in putting on an act.","He cleared his throat. “Since Old Master Meng is in danger, we should indeed give Jinchuan Grass to the Meng family. Xi Xi, give the Jinchuan Grass to Miss Meng.”","Everyone was stunned. Why would Mr. Feng call Qiao Xi ‘Xi Xi’?","Then, Qiao Xi’s face was full of helplessness as she said in a weak voice, “Mr. Feng, I no longer have Jinchuan Grass.”","Meng Wan was angered to the point of gnashing her teeth, and she wished for nothing more than to charge over and tear Qiao Xi into pieces.","B*tch! Vixen! She was deliberately not giving it to her.","Meng Wan retracted her fierce gaze and pretended to be aggrieved. “Miss Qiao, even though I destroyed your flowers and plants before this, I’ve already apologized and paid the price. Yet you still refuse to forgive me and you’re even disregarding my grandfather’s life!","“Now that Mr. Feng has already spoken, you’re still refusing to give it to me. Are you really going to watch my grandfather die in front of you? You’re so vicious! Why don’t you just kill me...”"]},{"number":203,"title":"Chapter 203 - She Was In Big Trouble","paragraphs":["Old Master Gu frowned and berated, “How can the Gu family have a daughter-in-law like you? Quickly hand over Jinchuan Grass. If anything happens to Old Master Meng, I’ll turn you into a cripple!”","Feng Zhang’s expression was cold. He was about to speak...","Qiao Xi took out an exquisite bag and handed it to Feng Zhang with a helpless and sad expression.","“Mr. Feng, it’s not that I’m being petty, but the Jinchuan Grass has been destroyed. I gave it to Gu Zheng as well, but they’re all destroyed. There’s nothing I can do about it!”","Feng Zhang opened the bag and saw that there were a few crushed stalks of Jinchuan Grass inside.","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi’s sorrowful gaze fell on Meng Wan.","“Mr. Feng, Gu Zheng also needs Jinchuan Grass to treat his illness... However, there’s not even one stalk left. How can I give it to Old Master Meng? The Jinchuan Grass was crushed before they could even grow.”","Feng Zhang took out the destroyed Jinchuan Grass. Everyone could clearly see that it was already in pieces.","His expression darkened. “It was destroyed? Who’s so bold?”","Gu Zheng smirked.","He was very clearly aware in his heart that Feng Zhang had already recognized Qiao Xi when he first entered, but he just did not acknowledge her and played along with her.","Meng Wan looked at the grass in Feng Zhang’s hands and her heart suddenly thumped.","After that, Qiao Xi sighed. “Mr. Feng, I planted Jinchuan Grass in the backyard of Longwan Residential and have been taking good care of it. Unexpectedly, Miss Meng drove in that day, so...","“At that time, the butler kept stopping her, but Miss Meng did not listen at all. She knew that I had planted the herbs myself and deliberately crushed all the Jinchuan Grass. Not a single stalk was left. If you don’t believe me, I can show you the surveillance footage of the backyard.”","Meng Wan’s body trembled, and her legs went weak.","What?","She could not believe it.","Qiao Xi said that the grass she crushed was Jinchuan Grass?","Before she could recover from her shock, Qiao Xi spoke again, “Jinchuan Grass is extremely precious, but Miss Meng is unwilling to compensate. I was really angry, so I sent someone to smash her cars. Who knew that she was unwilling to accept it? She even insisted that my grass was worthless and said I was vicious...”","Qiao Xi said unhurriedly, “Now that the Jinchuan Grass has been completely destroyed by Miss Meng, there are still rumors spreading that Gu Zheng has it. Gu Zheng is unable to take it out, so he’ll be misunderstood as an ingrate. I didn’t know that Miss Meng’s thoughts are so vicious!”","“Mr. Feng, please be the judge.”","Everyone was dumbfounded.","It turned out that Meng Wan had deliberately destroyed Jinchuan Grass and even released fake news that Gu Zheng had it. She came up with everything herself.","Meng Wan’s legs went weak and she almost fell.","This was slander! How could the flowers and plants in the backyard be Jinchuan Grass?","His grandfather had searched for many years but did not find a single stalk. Where did Qiao Xi get the Jinchuan Grass from? Moreover, there were more than a hundred stalks!","Just as she was about to retort, Feng Zhang slowly said, “Young Miss Meng, were you the one who crushed the hundred stalks of Jinchuan Grass? Now that there isn’t a single stalk left, you’re even forcing Gu Zheng and Xi Xi to hand it over. What are your intentions?","“The environment in the backyard of Longwan Residential is very good, so I sprinkled some seeds there and got Xi Xi to take care of them for me. They finally germinated after a long time, but they’re all gone now...","“Miss Meng, I hope you can give me an explanation. Why did you destroy the Jinchuan Grass?”","Meng Wan’s mind was blank, and her face was pale.","It was over!","She was in big trouble!","Qiao Xi pursed her lips and imitated Meng Wan’s tone as she said, “Old Master Gu, Madam Gu, Gu Zheng originally wanted to wait for the Jinchuan Grass to mature before giving some to the two of you. The Gu family’s relatives and friends would naturally also have a share so as to fulfill his filial duties. He never once thought of hiding it.","“It’s just that Jinchuan Grass was crushed by Miss Meng, but you didn’t hold her responsible. You kept forcing Gu Zheng to hand over the Jinchuan Grass and even wanted to chase me out of the Gu family.","“I feel so aggrieved. I’ve been taking good care of the Jinchuan Grass for so long because I wanted to give it to everyone here. It looks like you don’t want the Jinchuan Grass and only think that Miss Meng has done no wrong.","“Mr. Feng, you have to stand up for me! If apologizing can turn hostility into friendship, I can apologize, but I want to ask you to prove that it’s not that we can’t bear to give the elders the Jinchuan Grass.”","Everyone was silent as they glared at Meng Wan, gnashing their teeth in hatred.","More than a hundred stalks of Jinchuan Grass were all destroyed by this b*tch, Meng Wan!","The Jinchuan Grass was all gone because of this little wh*re, Meng Wan!","Meng Wan took a few steps back, trembling in fear.","When Qiao Xi said that the Jinchuan Grass was supposed to be distributed to everyone present, she had aimed everyone’s anger onto her.","Since she ruined the Jinchuan Grass, Old Master Gu and Madam Gu would not stand up for her anymore."]},{"number":204,"title":"Chapter 204 - Meng Wan Wants To Kill Him?","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi lowered her eyes in sorrow. “I heard that Old Master Meng is very ill, but I really can’t take out a single stalk of Jinchuan Grass, much less save him. I admit that I’m responsible for not guarding the Jinchuan Grass well, but the one who destroyed everything is still Miss Meng.”","Song Shijing: “...”","When Young Madam said this, everyone understood that it was not that the president was ungrateful and was unwilling to give them Jinchuan Grass, but that Old Master Meng’s precious granddaughter had destroyed the herb.","Meng Wan’s face was pale. “No, I didn’t know that it was Jinchuan Grass. She must have framed me. I only crushed a few weeds, but she’s framing me for crushing Jinchuan Grass!”","Qiao Xi pretended to be weak. “Miss Meng, Mr. Feng planted Jinchuan Grass in the backyard. I was just taking care of it for him. Are you saying that Mr. Feng lied? It’s fine if you don’t admit it. I have a surveillance video that can allow Mr. Feng to confirm if the plants you crushed were indeed Jinchuan Grass.”","Meng Wan bit her pale lip. Her mind was blank, and she felt weak all over.","Everyone stared at Meng Wan and discussed among themselves. “Old Master Meng has been begging for Jinchuan Grass for so many years but it was all ruined by his precious granddaughter. How laughable.”","“How can Miss Meng not know Jinchuan Grass? I heard that she has been helping look for it. It’s definitely impossible for her not to know it.”","“If she knows it, why did she deliberately ruin the Jinchuan Grass? I heard that Old Master Meng loves his granddaughter very much. I didn’t expect her to be so heartless as to kill him.”","Qiao Xi wiped her tears. “Gu Zheng, it was Miss Meng who destroyed the Jinchuan Grass that could save Old Master Meng. She even maligned me for not being willing to give it to you. For the sake of achieving her goal, she completely disregarded the life of her loved one. It’s too scary...”","Song Shijing: “...”","Now, he finally knew why Song Shiyu said Young Madam was awesome. She was also good at pretending to be weak.","It would be a pity if she did not become an actress with such acting skills.","The president probably knew that Young Madam was acting...","At this moment, Gu Zheng said slowly, “It seems that this matter has nothing to do with us. Meng Wan wanted Old Master Meng to die, so she deliberately destroyed the Jinchuan Grass and blamed me and my wife.”","Song Shijing: “...” The president did not even blush when lying?","Qiao Xi cried and said, “I feel so aggrieved! I don’t know about the grievances between the noble families. I was just heartbroken that the Jinchuan Grass that I had taken care of for so long was destroyed before they could even mature...","“Poor Old Master Meng. He’s still waiting for the medicine to save his life. Who would have thought that his own granddaughter would harm him...”","‘Shut up!","‘I didn’t hurt Grandpa!’","Meng Wan’s eyes were filled with fear. She rushed in front of Old Master Gu and explained agitatedly, “No! I didn’t mean to harm Grandpa... Grandpa Gu, you know I wouldn’t do something like this! Qiao Xi has wronged me! You must stand up for me! She’ll harm the Gu family!”","Old Master Gu and Madam Gu’s faces darkened.","They originally wanted to take this opportunity to chase Qiao Xi out of the Gu family. Unexpectedly, Meng Wan was useless and was taken advantage of.","Now, even if they could speak up for Meng Wan, they had no reason to. Meng Wan had already offended everyone present.","Old Master Gu abruptly stood up with a gloomy expression. “Qiao Xi, let’s forget about this matter, but I hope you know your place and not affect Gu Zheng’s future and ruin the Gu family.”","After that, Old Master Gu left angrily with Madam Gu following closely behind.","Gu Zheng said slowly, “Song Shijing, send Miss Meng home and tell the elders there the truth of what happened today.”","Meng Wan’s eyes were filled with horror. Her legs went weak as she knelt on the floor and shouted weakly, “No!”","“I didn’t do anything! Brother Gu Zheng, you can’t tell Grandpa that I hurt him!”","Old Master Meng did indeed love her, but if he found out that she had deliberately destroyed the Jinchuan Grass, he would definitely not let her off!","She could not let this news spread! Otherwise, she would be doomed!","Meng Wan struggled to get up and glared at everyone with vicious eyes. “No one can say anything! All of you have to keep your mouths shut!”","Qiao Xi hid behind Gu Zheng as if she was afraid. “Miss Meng, are you threatening everyone? This is the truth, and there’s even a video as evidence. Could it be that you want to kill everyone?”","Everyone gasped.","It was originally a private matter between the Gu family and the Meng family. They were just here to watch the show, but now, Meng Wan wanted to silence them.","The people who came today were all famous figures in Li City. Meng Wan was just a junior in the Meng family. How dare she threaten them like this?","Gu Zheng glanced coldly at Meng Wan, then he held Qiao Xi’s hand and left.","Song Shijing walked over and said coldly, “Miss Meng, the young madam and the president are a loving couple. You’re just an outsider. Don’t try to ruin their relationship. I’m just reminding you that if you dare to frame the young madam again...","“The Meng family will vanish from Li City.”"]},{"number":205,"title":"Chapter 205 - Gu Zhengs Presents","paragraphs":["At this moment, Meng Wan fell to the floor weakly. She was filled with resentment and grievances.","How was this possible? She had actually been defeated by Qiao Xi?","...","Qiao Xi returned to Longwan Residential and went upstairs to rest.","Song Shiyu smiled. “President, about that...”","Gu Zheng took off his jacket and looked at him with interest.","Song Shiyu said, “President, Young Madam looks very tired today. As her husband, you should take this opportunity to give her warmth and care.”","The butler was speechless. What did Song Shiyu know? He really dared to teach the president!","At this moment, Song Shijing and the butler were hiding in a corner, listening to the sounds coming from the other side of the wall.","Song Shiyu took out a book. Its title was, ‘How To Make A Woman Fall In Love With You.’","He flipped open the book and pointed to a paragraph. “The book says that this is the easiest time for a woman to be touched. Give Young Madam some clothes and jewelry. She’ll be very happy.”","Song Shijing: “...” Song Shiyu was going to teach the president how to date, but he had never even done that before!","Gu Zheng glanced at the book. That was indeed what it said.","Buy jewelry and clothes?","It was a good idea! All women liked these things.","Gu Zheng did not say anything and called the person in charge of a fashion brand.","Song Shiyu saw him go upstairs without saying anything and looked helpless.","“President, you’re too stingy! You’re not even willing to buy Young Madam clothes. Just be Young Madam’s bastard forever, then.","“Forget it, it’s fine if you don’t want to give her presents, but as your assistant, I have to help you!”","...","The next day, when Qiao Xi returned from work, what greeted her eyes was a pile of exquisite gift boxes.","These boxes were all decorated with bows. Just as she was about to leave, Song Shiyu came over and smiled obsequiously. “Madam, these are all from the president!”","Qiao Xi: “...”","These were from Gu Zheng?","Song Shiyu smiled sneakily. He was sure that Young Madam would like what he had prepared and would be very touched.","Qiao Xi frowned. What did Song Shiyu’s expression mean? Was there a bomb in the gifts?","“Young Madam, quickly open them.”","Qiao Xi was slightly hesitant.","Were these really gifts from Gu Zheng?","She was suddenly curious. What sort of gifts would Gu Zheng give her?","Qiao Xi opened the first gift box and when she saw what was inside—","!!!","What was this?","Her face turned red as she slammed the box shut, her fingers trembling.","It was a set of black nightwear, but the fabric was made of transparent gauze. It could not cover her body!","Gu Zheng gave her this?","She did not expect that this wretched man was such a person. He was too shameless!","Qiao Xi forced herself to calm down and looked at Song Shiyu coldly. “Are you sure... this was given to me by Gu Zheng?”","Song Shiyu nodded guiltily. “Yes, yes, Young Madam. I’ll bring them to the bedroom for you.”","Qiao Xi recalled the rumors about Gu Zheng from the outside world. They said that he was cold, heartless, overbearing, dignified, and never approached women.","However, this Gu Zheng had given her nightwear that could not cover her body?","Qiao Xi felt her legs go soft. She was not in the mood to listen to Song Shiyu at all. She held the railing and went upstairs.","Song Shiyu watched Qiao Xi leave with a puzzled expression.","The butler leaned forward and asked, “You prepared this gift, right?”","Song Shiyu was shocked. “Yes, it’s me. Why? Young Madam must be very happy. It’s just hard to express it in front of me.”","The butler smiled. “I don’t think Young Madam is happy about it at all. She’s a little angry.”","“...” Song Shiyu took a deep breath. “It’s over. I might have caused trouble this time.”","The butler: “?”","He was a little curious about what Song Shiyu had given her.","...","After Qiao Xi went upstairs, she directly rushed into the washroom and washed her face with cold water before calming down with great difficulty.","She sat on the bed, opened the other gift boxes, and took out the ‘presents’.","Besides the nightwear, there were also some undergarments and gowns. However, without exception, they were all seductive. Qiao Xi was able to discern with a single glance that these clothes were of considerable value and did indeed seem to be Gu Zheng’s style."]},{"number":206,"title":"Chapter 206 - Who Was His Wife?","paragraphs":["Did Gu Zheng want to see her wearing such things?","Was he a little sick?!","Qiao Xi was extremely conflicted, but she could not help but call Gu Zheng.","...","In Gu Corporation’s office, Gu Zheng leaned lazily on the sofa with his phone in hand. His voice was calm as he said, “Work overtime these few days and design a few sets of clothes.”","The woman hurriedly asked, “... Ah Zheng, what clothes do you need? Are you attending an event?”","“I’m not the one wearing it. It’s for a woman. I’ll give you the size,” Gu Zheng said thoughtfully. “I want four designs for each season. They need to be sent over next week.”","The woman took a deep breath and smiled awkwardly. “Ah Zheng, that’s a total of 16 sets of clothes. I might not even be able to finish designing all of them, much less finish the final product. Everything needs to be handmade, so it’ll take quite a long time. In such a short period of time, I really...”","“If you can’t do it, then I have no reason to continue investing in you.” Gu Zheng did not listen to her anymore.","Yao Mengqing, the designer on the other end of the phone, bit her lip and squeezed out a smile. “Okay... I’ll do it as soon as possible.”","Yao Mengqing tried to say, “Ah Zheng, this lady is your... I just want to ask how old she is. The style of the clothes will also be customized based on her age, so...”","Gu Zheng was about to hang up when he said calmly, “She’s my wife.”","Yao Mengqing gasped, and her voice trembled slightly. “You... You’re married? Don’t you never get close to women? Why didn’t you tell me about your marriage? I would have attended your wedding.”","Gu Zheng frowned, clearly a little impatient.","Yao Mengqing smiled and said, “Since it’s for your wife, I know what to do. I promise I’ll complete the task. Also... I’m going back soon. I want to have a meal with you. It’s been a long time since we last met.”","“Ah Zheng, can I? Bring Sister-in-law over. I want to see who’s so blessed.”","After saying that, there was silence on the other end of the phone for a moment, making Yao Mengqing feel extremely awkward.","Gu Zheng seemed to be busy as he replied impatiently, “Alright, let’s talk later.”","The phone was hung up mercilessly. Yao Mengqing’s face was gloomy.","Unexpectedly, Gu Zheng had quietly gotten married. Rumor had it that he never got close to women and he did not have any scandals, so Yao Mengqing always thought of herself as a special existence.","No matter what, they were childhood playmates. Moreover, their two families were of equal status. In the past, they always went out to eat together, so they affectionately called him ‘Ah Zheng’.","After all, they were childhood friends. Gu Zheng was not stingy either and invested in Yao Mengqing’s fashion studio.","She knew her limits and only addressed herself as Gu Zheng’s good friend. She also often attended events with Gu Zheng and was the only woman who could stay by his side all these years.","She originally thought that Gu Zheng would marry her if he ever chose to get married, but he was married to someone else now.","Which b*tch seduced Gu Zheng?","Yao Mengqing had a malicious look on her face. She picked up her phone and made a call.","She said in a gentle tone, “Ah Jie, why didn’t I know that Ah Zheng is married? He told me just now and even asked me to design a dress for Mrs. Gu. Why didn’t I hear that he’s in a relationship?”","The person on the other end of the phone sounded surprised. “What did you say? Ah Zheng? I don’t know either!”","Yao Mengqing said helplessly, “Marriage is such a big thing. He didn’t even tell us.”","“Gu Zheng didn’t inform everyone about his marriage. Maybe it’s because he doesn’t like that woman. Maybe it’s because his family was rushing him, so he casually found a woman to deal with his elders. Who knows, they might divorce at any time.”","Yao Mengqing said happily, “You’re right, but Gu Zheng seems to be very good to her. He even asked me to design clothes for Mrs. Gu. He told me to design 16 sets in one go...”","She exchanged a few words with the man before hanging up.","Since Ah Zheng’s friends did not know about his marriage, it must be because he was dissatisfied with his wife that he did not hold a wedding.","Since Ah Zheng did not like his wife, she was confident in chasing that woman away."]},{"number":207,"title":"Chapter 207 - One Can Never Know Ones Heart","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Corporation.","Song Shijing walked in. “President, when you were on a call just now, Young Madam called.”","He paused for a moment, then handed the phone to Gu Zheng and said awkwardly, “She said... she received your gifts.”","Song Shijing knew very well that Song Shiyu had given the gifts in the president’s name, but he did not know what he had given to make Young Madam call all of a sudden.","Gu Zheng was stunned for a moment. He took the phone from Song Shijing, who immediately left.","“Hello.”","Qiao Xi’s voice trembled slightly. “You gave those things to me?”","Gu Zheng had just ordered the clothes, so they definitely could not be delivered so soon.","He thought for a moment and suddenly recalled that there was a fashion brand that was in a business deal with Gu Corporation. They had given him some new female clothes, and they were all custom-made according to Qiao Xi’s size. She must be talking about those clothes.","Gu Zheng said nonchalantly, “They were sent by a fashion brand. They were all custom-made to match your size. They’re definitely not better than your own designs, but you’ll just have to wear them.”","Qiao Xi: “...” ‘I don’t design such provocative nightwear!’","She turned to look at the bed full of gauze and sighed. “I’ll ask again. Are you sure you gave them to me?”","Gu Zheng curled his lips. “Yes. You don’t like them?”","Such a shameless man!","These were not clothes, they were just pieces of fabric! It would be as if she was wearing nothing!","Gu Zheng suddenly remembered Song Shiyu’s words. ‘Don’t hide what you’ve done. Let Young Madam know.’","After a moment of silence, he smiled. “I participated in the design of a few garments. I think you’ll look good in them.”","Qiao Xi was dumbstruck.","She never knew that Gu Zheng was so open-minded and even participated in designing such clothes.","She thought of Gu Zheng discussing the details of the clothes with the designer with a cold face. The dignified president of Gu Corporation did not even care about his reputation anymore?","Qiao Xi gasped and forced herself to calm down. “Gu Zheng, you really want me to wear these clothes?”","Gu Zheng picked up the coffee on the table and turned on his computer. With a focused gaze, he casually said, “Yes, I’m going on a business trip in two days. You’ll go with me. Just treat it as a trip. Bring some of the new clothes with you.”","Qiao Xi was a famous designer. She could go over and discuss designing work as well as choose some clothes she liked.","Qiao Xi: “!!”","This bastard wanted her to bring these clothes on a trip?","He was shameless! How dare he play such tricks? Perhaps he had already played with other women like this.","Qiao Xi burned with rage and roared furiously. “Shameless! Bastard!”","She slammed the phone down.","Gu Zheng looked innocent as he held his phone in confusion.","Could it be that those clothes were not nice? After all, Qiao Xi was a famous designer and would have high expectations, but she would not be so angry, right?","...","Longwan Residential.","Qiao Xi lay on the bed and calmed her emotions. She had already put away those clothes, but the image kept lingering in her mind.","He had finally revealed his true identity!","What a beast!","It turned out that he liked such things. One could never judge a book by its cover!","Qiao Xi tossed and turned, her heart in a mess. She suddenly realized that Gu Zheng had probably given these clothes to her for...","When she kissed Gu Zheng, she would temporarily recover her taste buds. If she wanted to recover completely, would she have to do it that way?","Qiao Xi felt that perhaps she could give it a try...","However, those clothes were too embarrassing!","Qiao Xi got up, opened a gift box, and took out a revealing dress.","‘Calm down. You must calm down.’ She blushed and went into the bathroom with the dress.","...","Gu Zheng rushed home.","Just then, Song Shijing received a call from a fashion brand. “Special Assistant Song, I’m really sorry. Those clothes will be delivered later. Please don’t have President Gu blame me.”","After hanging up, Song Shijing hurried upstairs to look for Gu Zheng, only to find that he had left long ago.","Actually, it was not a big deal. It was just a few clothes.. The president would not care."]},{"number":208,"title":"Chapter 208 - Gu Zheng Is Truly Shameless","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Although Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng did not stay in the same bedroom, the second floor was their private space, so no one would disturb them.","At this moment, Qiao Xi crept into Gu Zheng’s bedroom and pushed open the bathroom door. She looked at herself in the mirror with a shy expression.","‘You call this clothes?’","There were only a few pieces of fabric in total and they were all transparent. Just looking at them made her on the verge of getting a nose bleed. She did not know what Gu Zheng would think if he saw her like this.","Her breathing was rapid. After thinking for a moment, she pushed open the bathroom door and rushed under the blanket to cover her seductive body.","On the other side, Gu Zheng’s car slowly came to a stop. He had a serious expression on his face. “Where’s Young Madam?”","Song Shiyu was flustered. His mind was filled with thoughts of his salary being deducted, but he only did it for the president’s sake!","Hearing the president’s voice, he walked over in a daze and said nervously, “Young Madam? She’s back in the bedroom.”","Gu Zheng nodded and was about to walk away.","Song Shiyu rushed over with a guilty look on his face. “President! I’ve been working hard for you for so long and it’s all for your own good. If I’ve offended you in any way, please spare my life, President!”","Gu Zheng: “...”","Had water entered Song Shiyu’s brain?","He ignored him and went upstairs.","The moment he entered the bedroom, he realized that someone had entered it and could not help but frown.","Not to mention the servants but even Song Shiyu, who was always by his side, could not enter his room. Who was so audacious?","His eyes turned cold as he took off his jacket and walked in. When he saw the scene in front of him, he widened his eyes.","...","Just before he came in.","Qiao Xi covered herself with the blanket, her heart thumping.","Gu Zheng was coming back soon. What should she do?!","What would he say when he saw her like this?","Should she say, ‘Have you been thinking about it for a long time? Is that why you bought such embarrassing clothes for me?’","Or should she pretend to be weak? ‘Ah Zheng, you’re so annoying! Do you like me wearing clothes like this?’","This was too embarrassing!","The footsteps outside got closer and closer. Qiao Xi’s heart seemed to be about to jump out.","Forget it, forget it. She was not going to do it anymore. It was too strange to have sex so suddenly. She should nurture their relationship first.","Qiao Xi shook her head and felt that she must have been muddled-headed for a moment there. She was actually considering selling her body to recover her taste buds.","No matter what, Gu Zheng was her senior. After spending ten years together, he suddenly became her husband. It was hard to accept that he would do such a shameful thing.","Qiao Xi went back on her word and quickly got up, wanting to go back to the bathroom to change.","At this moment, the bedroom door was pushed open.","Qiao Xi was instantly petrified as she raised her eyes to look at the man in front of her. “...”","She stood there with a dumbfounded expression. She really wanted to find a hole to bury herself in.","Gu Zheng knew that there was someone in the room and also knew that it was probably only Qiao Xi who had the guts to come in here. Hence, he did not have any concerns and directly walked in. It was just that he did not expect the bedroom to be filled with such a beautiful scene.","Gu Zheng’s heart seemed to have been dealt a heavy blow.","Qiao Xi was wearing a white dress that was as thin as a cicada’s wings. All parts of her body were exposed, and she was shockingly beautiful. For the first time, Gu Zheng experienced a strong impulse as the blood in his entire body surged. He exclaimed.","Had she... gone mad?","The man’s Adam’s apple moved, and he hurriedly closed the door. His voice was hoarse. “Qiao Xi, you...”","Qiao Xi covered the important parts of her body and kept retreating as she shouted, “Gu Zheng! You actually bought such clothes for me? You’re too shameless! I thought you were very pure! Looks like you can never judge a book by its cover!”","Gu Zheng: “...”","What? He bought it?","When did he buy such a thing for Qiao Xi?","A strange image of Song Shiyu and his guilty face suddenly appeared in Gu Zheng’s mind.","Oh~","It was Song Shiyu!","The man curled the corners of his mouth and slowly walked over to Qiao Xi. He placed his palm on her back and moved it to his waist, his voice filled with delight.","“Yes, it’s beautiful.”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched.","Her voice trembled. “Gu... Gu Zheng, how could you buy such clothes? Shameless...”","Gu Zheng pulled her into his arms, his body burning. There was a calmness in his voice.. “What’s there to be shy about? We’re husband and wife, so it’s only right.”"]},{"number":209,"title":"Chapter 209 - Concealment","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi’s body was red as she lowered her head shyly.","However, she thought about it again. She had already worn it, so why should she be shy?!","In order to recover her taste buds, she would go all out!","She was mentally prepared and placed her hands on Gu Zheng’s shoulders. “Ah Zheng, we...”","Before she could finish, Gu Zheng carried her to the bed.","His warm kisses landed on her body, making her shudder.","Qiao Xi’s mind instantly exploded, and her heart thumped while her entire body trembled.","They were husband and wife, so this kind of thing had to happen sooner or later. What was there to be nervous about?! It was a good opportunity to recover her taste buds!","Thinking of this, Qiao Xi took the initiative to hook her arms around his neck and responded warmly.","The man’s body stiffened as his body became hot. She was really too tempting like this. She was wearing such clothes but she was still so proactive.","Gu Zheng’s deep eyes landed on her as he curled his lips in satisfaction.","Qiao Xi suddenly did this probably because she wanted to recover her taste buds, not because she really wanted to have sex with him.","Gu Zheng’s eyes gradually recovered their clarity as he ended a long kiss. His voice was hoarse as he said, “Qiao Xi.”","Qiao Xi slowly opened her misty eyes and replied softly, “What’s wrong?”","Her body was pressed tightly against the man, but even though his body was burning, he did not move.","The man chuckled and leaned over to kiss her forehead. He asked gently, “Do you want it?”","Qiao Xi instantly blushed and lowered her head, not daring to look at the man in front of her.","Needless to say, she had already taken the initiative!","“Mrs. Gu,” Gu Zheng spoke again, his voice magnetic.","Qiao Xi’s voice trembled slightly. “I, I...”","“You want me?” Gu Zheng exhaled a fiery breath.","Qiao Xi nodded and licked her lips. “Alright, stop asking. I’m so shy!”","Unexpectedly, Gu Zheng chuckled and abruptly stood up. He said unhurriedly, “Continue thinking about it, then.”","Qiao Xi did it for the sake of recovering her taste buds. Gu Zheng did not want to be used by her. He would wait until the day Qiao Xi was willing.","Gu Zheng strode into the bathroom and slammed the door shut.","Qiao Xi propped herself up on the bed with a surprised expression. “...”","“Gu Zheng, what do you mean?”","Are you playing with me?’","Qiao Xi lay on the bed with a dumbfounded expression, her heart filling up with anger.","Then, she suddenly thought of something and gasped—","Could it be that Gu Zheng... could not do it?","...","Qiao Xi somehow fell asleep until the next morning. When she opened her eyes, Gu Zheng was already at work.","This was the first time she was sleeping in Gu Zheng’s bedroom. There were no clothes in the room, so she got the servants to send a set over.","After washing up, she went straight to Longwan Residential’s medical center.","“Young Madam, why are you going to the medical center?” Song Shiyu hurried over.","Ever since last night, Song Shiyu and the butler had been gossiping.","Young Madam and the president had slept in the same bedroom. This morning, Young Madam even called the servants to send clothes over and took a shower there.","They... had succeeded!","Most importantly, Song Shiyu realized that Young Madam was walking strangely today. She seemed to be very tired.","The president had finally succeeded!","Unexpectedly, Young Madam was going to the medical center when she left the house, so Song Shiyu chased after her to ask about it.","Qiao Xi frowned and had a helpless expression. “...”","What else could she do? She could not keep watching Gu Zheng fall sick!","Of course, she could not tell anyone that a man was incapable. For a man like Gu Zheng who cared about his reputation so much that he would even refuse to seek treatment, it would only delay his illness.","Gu Zheng was probably the only one who knew about this. If he could not even tell Song Shiyu, she would not tell anyone either.","Hence, she thought for a moment. “... Um, I’ll make some tonic soup for Ah Zheng.”","Song Shiyu was dumbfounded.","It seemed like Young Madam was very dissatisfied with the president’s performance and wanted to make tonic soup for him to improve his ability.","Damn!","Song Shiyu looked at Qiao Xi’s back in confusion. Unexpectedly, he turned around and saw Gu Zheng.","Gu Zheng was wearing sports attire with sweat on his forehead.. He was a little puzzled. “She’s going to the medical center?”"]},{"number":210,"title":"Chapter 210 - Gu Zhengs Friend","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Song Shiyu looked nervous as he asked carefully, “President, last night, you and Young Madam...”","Gu Zheng smiled. “Right, you were the one who gave her that nightwear.”","Seeing the man’s smile, Song Shiyu felt his hair stand on end. He said in fear, “President, I did it for your own good. On the account that I’m loyal to you, please forgive me this time...”","“You have good taste. I won’t deduct your salary anymore.” Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow with a smile in his eyes.","Song Shiyu: “...”","Not deduct his salary? It seemed like the president was very satisfied with his gifts.","Hearing this, Song Shiyu immediately heaved a sigh of relief. He immediately said excitedly, “President, it’s good that you like it, but it’s useless even if you do. Young Madam is very dissatisfied with your skills. What a pity about the nightwear I gifted!”","...","The atmosphere instantly became awkward.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with danger.","He had pulled back from the cliff last night, but in Mrs. Gu’s eyes, he was incapable?","Gu Zheng sneered and glanced at Song Shiyu indifferently. He said casually, “I won’t give you your salary anymore. I’ll satisfy you.”","Song Shiyu: “?”","He was just repeating Young Madam’s words. It was not what he meant. Why was his salary being deducted again?!","...","In the next few days, as long as Qiao Xi saw Gu Zheng, she would think of the things that he could not do.","That day, she had already gone all out, but Gu Zheng still could not do it.","She was really embarrassed to see Gu Zheng, so she worked overtime in the university every day. After returning home, she would go straight upstairs to avoid meeting Gu Zheng.","Song Shiyu was as anxious as an ant on a hot pan. He could not wait to bring Gu Zheng to get treated.","His head was about to explode, but he could not think of a solution.","Just then, the butler entered. “The clothes the president customized for Young Madam has arrived. Miss Yao is already outside.”","Song Shiyu slapped his thigh. Yes, there were these clothes! These were the president’s gift to Young Madam!","The clothes designed by Yao Mengqing were all luxury goods. Any one of them would cost over 100,000 yuan. This time, she had brought 16 of them!","Although Yao Mengqing could not compare to Gu Shan, she was still a famous designer. Unexpectedly, she even came personally to deliver the clothes.","Qiao Xi saw two cars parked outside. The butler went out to welcome the guests and seemed to be very respectful.","“Miss Yao, please come in!”","Yao Mengqing replied generously, “I didn’t give a call before coming over. Would Ah Zheng be unhappy?”","“Don’t say that. The president will definitely welcome you.” The butler quickly invited her into the house.","Yao Mengqing’s voice was sweet. “Butler, it’s been a long time. I’ve been too busy overseas and didn’t have time to come back to take a look.”","Suddenly, she thought of something. “I heard from Ah Zheng that he’s married now. I haven’t seen Mrs. Gu yet. Is she at home? I should greet her.”","The butler replied, “She’s upstairs.”","At this moment, Qiao Xi slowly came downstairs. When Yao Mengqing saw her, she reached out her hand warmly. “You’re Mrs. Gu? I’m Yao Mengqing, Ah Zheng’s childhood friend.”","Qiao Xi nodded and stretched out her hand politely.","Song Shiyu said in her ear, “Madam, Miss Yao and the president are good friends.”","Song Shijing introduced Yao Mengqing to her in a low voice, “Miss Yao is the third daughter of the Yao family. She’s now a designer in the studio that the president invested in. She’s very famous overseas.","“Although the president and Miss Yao are childhood playmates, they’re actually just ordinary friends.”","Qiao Xi nodded as she finally knew who this Miss Yao was.","Seeing that Yao Mengqing was very polite, Qiao Xi smiled as well. “Hello, Miss Yao.”","“Right, Qiao Xi, Ah Zheng customized some clothes for you. See if you like them?” Yao Mengqing held Qiao Xi’s hand and was full of smiles.","Qiao Xi’s gaze fell on their hands as she said indifferently, “Okay.”","Yao Mengqing instructed someone to bring the clothes in and hang them on the rack. They were very eye-catching under the light.","“When Ah Zheng asked me to design the clothes, he said that he wanted me to come up with 16 garments in a week. I didn’t understand why he was in such a rush. It turns out he wanted to give you a gift. Quick, take a look at these clothes. Do you like them?”","Qiao Xi’s face sank when she saw the clothes."]},{"number":211,"title":"Chapter 211 - Another Scheming B*tch","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Any ordinary person would not be able to tell what was wrong with the clothes by just looking at them, but she was Gu Shan. She could tell what was wrong with the clothes at a glance.","Yao Mengqing looked very friendly, but she was actually filled with hostility.","The fabric of haute couture gowns needed to be very exquisite. Not only did they have to be beautiful but they also had to be comfortable. However, the fabric of these clothes was flashy without substance. It would definitely be uncomfortable wearing them.","One of the gowns was heavy and had a thin layer of inferior fabric around the waist. If she were not careful, it would tear from her waist. The other gown was the exact opposite. There were many layers of fabric stitched around the waist, but the skirt was as light as tulle. It would make her look extremely uncoordinated and 20 pounds fatter.","They were both designers. Of course, Qiao Xi had heard of Yao Mengqing. She had won many awards, so her design skills should not be like this.","Hence, it meant that Yao Mengqing wanted her to be embarrassed at whatever banquets she would attend with Gu Zheng.","Seeing Qiao Xi remain silent, Yao Mengqing’s face was filled with disappointment.","A smile appeared on the corners of her mouth. “Xi Xi, you don’t like these clothes?”","Perhaps others thought that it was already very rare for Yao Mengqing to design 16 pieces of clothing in such a short time.","She even personally brought the finished products to Longwan Residential. It could be said that she was full of sincerity.","If Qiao Xi did not show her any due respect, then she would be asking for it.","Yao Mengqing smiled awkwardly. “It’s okay if you don’t like them. I can change them or do them again. You can tell me if you have any ideas.”","She sneered in her heart. How could a country bumpkin know anything about design?","Qiao Xi did not say anything.","Yao Mengqing sighed. “Looks like Xi Xi doesn’t like the clothes I designed. I’ll design a few more...”","At this moment, her assistant spoke up to seek justice. “Sister Mengqing, you’ve been working late every night to design these 16 gowns. If you have to design more, your body won’t be able to take it. Even if you’re Mrs. Gu, you can’t torture others like this, right?”","“Lil An, don’t spout nonsense. It’s so hard being a designer, but the customers are the gods.”","Yao Mengqing turned and smiled. “Xi Xi, Lil An is a straightforward person. Don’t take it to heart. You can voice out your thoughts. I’ll make new clothes as soon as possible according to your requirements.”","Qiao Xi’s expression was subtle as the corners of her mouth twitched.","Yao Mengqing took out a notebook from her bag and said with a smile, “Xi Xi, Ah Zheng asked me to stop all my work and focus on your clothes. I’m really envious of you. The life of a rich madam is really luxurious!”","Then, she talked to her assistant in English. She spoke fluently and looked like a capable woman.","Yao Mengqing looked helpless. “I’m different. I’m busy designing every day. I have to take care of all the matters in the studio. Business is really difficult to do. My dream is to be like you and find a man to support me, preferably a man as rich as Ah Zheng.","“Xi Xi, after marrying Ah Zheng, you don’t have to work anymore, right? You’ll be doing beauty treatments and drinking tea every day. You should be very free, right? Why don’t you give me your contact details? You can tell me if you have any ideas.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","Others might not understand the “friendly” words Yao Mengqing said, but it was obvious to Qiao Xi what she was doing.","Yao Mengqing even said sarcastically that she had nothing to do after marrying Gu Zheng.","She was not the kind of woman who relied on men to live!","Song Shiyu sensed the tension between the two of them. It seemed that Yao Mengqing was mocking the young madam?","Song Shijing said, “Miss Yao, Young Madam is very busy and may not have time to contact you. If you have any questions, you can call me. I’ll pass along your message.”","Yao Mengqing’s assistant pursed her lips. “What’s there for her to be busy with...? She just plays cards, drinks tea, and shops. Unlike our Sister Mengqing who’s busy designing clothes every day-“","Yao Mengqing quickly interrupted, “Lil An, don’t say anymore. Xi Xi, if you-“","“Our young madam is going to be a judge for the International Real-time Translation Competition.. She also needs to come up with the topic of the competition and design clothes for the leaders of various countries...”"]},{"number":212,"title":"Chapter 212 - Rich Kid","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Song Shijing continued, “Young Madam, you’ve also been invited to F Nation’s fashion show. Last week, they were urging you about the 100 million dollar-design draft. You should take some time out to work on it.","“Although you’re very busy and don’t have enough time to rest every day, it’s still the wedding gown of the richest man in the capital. You’d better hurry.”","The smile on Yao Mengqing’s face vanished instantly.","Song Shiyu was dumbfounded. When did his brother become so eloquent?","Since his brother had spoken out, Song Shiyu would not back down. “Brother, what are you talking about? So what if Young Madam doesn’t design it? So many people are looking for her to design clothes every day. We can’t agree to all of them. Besides, with our president around, even if she doesn’t do anything, who can say anything?”","The corners of Yao Mengqing’s mouth twitched. She was extremely embarrassed.","The Song brothers echoed each other. Had they already noticed that she was shooting daggers at Qiao Xi?","Song Shiyu said unhappily, “Our young madam is Gu Shan. Not just anyone can afford to invite her to design for them. Everyone who wants to ask her for designs could form a line all the way to the capital. Brother, don’t rush her for the design drafts.”","Yao Mengqing shuddered and was surprised.","Qiao Xi was Gu Shan?","She was the international designer, Gu Shan?","Yao Mengqing had always been overseas and never paid attention to the news in the country, so she did not know that Qiao Xi was Gu Shan.","She bit her lip tightly. Gu Shan’s identity had always been very mysterious. It was uncertain whether Qiao Xi was the real Gu Shan. Perhaps she had simply lied in order to take Mrs. Gu’s identity.","Yao Mengqing pretended to be surprised. “Xi Xi is Gu Shan? I’ve always admired Gu Shan. I knew that the person Ah Zheng likes would definitely be very outstanding.”","Qiao Xi said lightly, “Miss Yao is right.","“I’m very idle. A dress that I design is priceless. I have so much money that I can’t finish spending it, so I don’t have to overwork myself by designing clothes every day. Money is just a number to me.”","Yao Mengqing almost vomited blood.","From Qiao Xi’s eccentric tone, she meant to say that the clothes she painstakingly designed were worth less than a dress designed by Qiao Xi?","Yao Mengqing’s face was pale. She forced a smile. “That’s right. No wonder you don’t like the clothes I designed. You’re a designer too, so you must have higher expectations. Don’t worry, I’ll design a new batch for you as soon as possible...”","“Gu Zheng, are you just going to watch Sister Mengqing be bullied like this? Sister Mengqing had to work overtime every day to make 16 clothes but she doesn’t like them?”","At this moment, a young man’s voice sounded from the door. Qiao Xi turned around to see Gu Zheng and a young man slowly walking over.","The young man was dressed in casual clothes that were from designer brands. He looked to be about 18 or 19 years old.","Qiao Xi knew who he was the moment she saw him.","This was Gu Zheng’s biological younger brother, the son whom Madam Gu doted on the most, Gu Yao.","If it were not for the fact that Gu Zheng had completely taken control of the Gu family after he became an adult, the head of the Gu family would have been Second Young Master Gu.","Gu Yao raised his head arrogantly with a cigarette in his mouth, looking very arrogant.","“Is this woman worthy to be the mistress of the Gu family? A gentle woman like Sister Mengqing is more suitable!”","Yao Mengqing quickly said, “Gu Yao, don’t say that!”","She then looked at Gu Zheng with a gentle expression. “Ah Zheng, he’s still a child. He’s always been willful. Don’t take it to heart.”","“Sister Mengqing, am I wrong? You worked so hard to design 16 sets of clothes, but she didn’t even say a word of thanks. She’s even making things difficult for you! Qiao Xi! Why are you so petty?”","Qiao Xi chuckled.","Wouldn’t Yao Mengqing receive payment for designing these clothes? Since she received the money, wasn’t this what she should do?","Why did designing a few sets of clothes make her feel aggrieved?","Moreover, if Yao Mengqing had been sincere in designing clothes for her, she would accept them no matter whether they looked good or not. However, these clothes were full of sly intentions.","Yao Mengqing lowered her eyes and drooped her head aggrievedly. “Ah Yao, don’t speak up for me. Xi Xi is your sister-in-law. You can’t talk to her like this. I’ll design a few more clothes. Don’t let me affect your relationship..”"]},{"number":213,"title":"Chapter 213 - Poor Quality Gowns","paragraphs":["Gu Yao was exasperated. “Qiao Xi is just making things difficult for you. The clothes you design are very popular overseas, so why are they suddenly unsatisfactory in front of her? You worked overtime to make them, but she wants you to make them again? I’ll teach her a lesson today!”","Yao Mengqing tried to persuade him but she did not stop him at all. “Ah Yao... Ah Zheng, this...”","“Miss Yao, Second Young Master Gu.”","Qiao Xi suddenly said, “When did I say she should do them again?”","Gu Yao snorted. “You didn’t say it? Then why didn’t you accept the clothes? Sister Mengqing’s clothes are very expensive. If you don’t accept them, it’s equivalent to you not knowing what’s good for you!”","Qiao Xi sneered.","She looked up at Yao Mengqing, then asked, “Ah Zheng, how much are these gowns?”","Yao Mengqing’s expression suddenly changed.","Gu Zheng replied casually, “Over eight million dollars.”","Qiao Xi seemed to be lost in thought. “A gown costs more than 500,000 yuan, which is the price of a high-end gown. Be it the fabric or the craftsmanship, it has to be of high quality. However...”","She paused for a moment before continuing, “These fabrics are of poor quality. It’s not even worth 50 yuan, much less 500,000!”","Gu Yao was instantly angry. “Qiao Xi, are you saying that Sister Mengqing’s gowns are worthless? Her studio uses high-quality fabrics, yet you’re accusing her of using inferior-quality goods?","“Many noble young ladies have invited her to design their gowns, and those pampered young misses don’t even mind the fabrics. With your status, how dare you be so picky?”","Yao Mengqing’s eyes turned red as she pursed her lips. “Xi Xi, our studio uses expensive fabrics. We don’t use any low-quality fabrics.","“It’s fine if you don’t like me, but you can’t slander my work!”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “Miss Yao, you indeed used top-quality fabrics on the top of the gown. It can also be seen that you had put some effort into your craftsmanship as well. The gowns look absolutely stunning.”","Gu Yao reprimanded her loudly, “You already said that the gowns are very good, yet you’re still finding fault with them? You’re just jealous of Sister Mengqing! Move out of Longwan Residential right now. I won’t agree to have you be my sister-in-law!”","Gu Zheng glanced at him. “You’re not my younger brother at all. Of course, she’s not your sister-in-law.”","Gu Yao looked at Gu Zheng awkwardly, his cheeks puffing out from anger.","Yao Mengqing said aggrievedly, “Xi Xi, I don’t know how I’ve offended you. You’re targeting me like this the first time we meet, but I won’t blame you. As long as you apologize to me, it’ll be fine. We can’t let our conflict affect their relationship as brothers.”","“Did you give me a chance to explain? Moreover, Second Young Master Gu immediately thought that I was making things difficult for you. I’m Gu Zheng’s wife, but you guys didn’t give me the most basic respect!”","Qiao Xi said coldly, “Although it can’t be easily seen that there’s anything wrong with these gowns upon first glance, there are problems upon closer inspection. The value of a high-end gown is that besides looking good, it also needs to be comfortable, so the quality of the fabrics is very important.","“A gown worth 500,000 yuan should definitely do that. However, you used the most basic materials on the inner part of the gowns. The fabric around the waist is not only rough but also very easy to tear.”","Qiao Xi tugged on one of the gowns. The inside was indeed made of coarse and poor-quality fabric. The ends of the fabric had come loose, seemingly tearing apart.","Yao Mengqing’s face turned pale as she lowered her head.","Qiao Xi looked at her coldly. “Miss Yao, all the clothes you design are high-end formal wear. Moreover, they’re specially designed for the daughters and madams of wealthy families. Their skin is exquisite and sensitive, so they have to wear exquisite materials. They won’t be able to wear rough fabrics. If someone wears such clothes on their upper body, their skin will be left with scratches.","“Since Gu Zheng has already paid you, Miss Yao, you don’t have to redo the clothes as it’s money we can afford. It’s just that I won’t wear such poorly made gowns. In any case, if news of this gets out, I won’t be the one losing my reputation.”","Gu Yao touched the rough fabric, disbelief written all over his face. “Sister Mengqing, what’s going on? The gown you made for my mother previously was made using silk!”","Yao Mengqing’s mind was blank. She really did not know how to explain.","Her face was pale, and her lips were trembling. “I... I didn’t do it.”","Gu Zheng looked up and glanced at Yao Mengqing coldly, making her tremble."]},{"number":214,"title":"Chapter 214 - Designer Yun Chu","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Yao Mengqing did not think too much about it when she was making the gowns. She only wanted Qiao Xi to make a fool of herself in front of everyone. Unexpectedly, Qiao Xi discerned the problem with the gowns with a single glance.","Now that the truth was out, she absolutely could not admit it! Otherwise, it would affect her studio.","“Ah Zheng... I didn’t know. I only use high-quality fabrics. I don’t know why the inner lining became rough. I...”","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. “I heard that you’re a renowned designer and very famous overseas. Don’t tell me that you can’t differentiate between silk and rough fabric? If you could become a designer with such standards, that’s really too laughable!”","Gu Yao was instantly speechless, not knowing how to defend Yao Mengqing anymore.","Gu Zheng cleared his throat. “Throw them all away.”","The butler immediately got someone to bring the gowns out.","Yao Mengqing’s tears welled up in her eyes. “Ah Zheng, I worked overtime in the past few days to design the gowns but I left some of the designs to someone else. They must have changed the fabrics behind my back to save money on materials. It wasn’t me...”","Gu Zheng’s face was still cold. Yao Mengqing was so anxious that she stomped her feet. “Ah Zheng, we’ve been playmates since we were young. You should know what kind of person I am. Why would I harm others?”","“Miss Yao, have you ever thought about what the consequences would be if I really wore these gowns?”","Qiao Xi spoke coldly.","This was definitely not just about changing the fabrics. She had been up to no good since the start of the designing process.","Furthermore, Yao Mengqing had personally come to deliver the gowns because she wanted everyone to know that she was warm and kind-hearted. She wanted to leave everyone the impression that she would not do such a thing.","Gu Yao raised his eyes to look at Qiao Xi. He still felt that he had to help Yao Mengqing, so he shouted, “Qiao Xi, what do you mean by this? Isn’t it just a few gowns? This isn’t Sister Mengqing’s fault!”","Yao Mengqing’s eyes were filled with tears. She choked and said, “Ah Zheng, I just wanted to finish the gowns as soon as possible, so I got others to help out. I didn’t expect it to be like this.”","Just then, she heard the hum of a car outside.","The butler rushed in. “Young Madam, someone’s looking for you.”","Qiao Xi nodded. “Let them in.”","After a while, a woman dressed exquisitely walked in with a group of staff behind her. She was carrying a golden box in her hand and asked respectfully, “May I know which one of you is Miss Qiao? This is the jewelry Master Yun Chu designed for you. There are a total of 12 sets here. I hope you like them.”","With that said, the staff member opened the box. Everyone’s eyes lit up.","These pieces of jewelry were really too dazzling, making Yao Mengqing’s gowns look dull.","Yao Mengqing was embarrassed as if she had been smacked in the head.","Yun Chu was a famous jewelry designer domestically and internationally. Her works were praised as a treasure of art and received everyone’s recognition. Having Yun Chu’s works was something to be proud of.","Unexpectedly, Yun Chu actually gave Qiao Xi 12 sets of jewelry at once!","Gu Yao looked at the shining jewelry and asked with a puzzled expression, “Sister Mengqing, isn’t Qiao Xi very poor? She even needs Gu Zheng’s help to buy clothes. Why would Yun Chu design jewelry for her?”","Yao Mengqing’s face was gloomy and awkward.","Her nails dug into her palms. “The clothes I designed... are indeed not comparable to Yun Chu’s designs. I’ll go back and redesign the clothes now. I’ll... leave first.”","Yao Mengqing covered her face in embarrassment. A few tears fell from the corner of her eyes as she said weakly, “Ah Zheng, I know you’re probably still angry with me, but it’s been so long since we last met. Can’t you forgive me? I could come back to the country for you, so just...","“It seems like I was thinking too much...”","Yao Mengqing smiled bitterly.","Gu Zheng glanced at her indifferently.","Yao Mengqing thought that he was touched and was about to take another step forward.","“I didn’t ask you to come back.”","Gu Zheng said coldly, “Yao Junjie gave the entire Yao family to me so that I could help you establish your own company abroad. Your brother spent all his wealth to give you such a happy life overseas, so you shouldn’t have returned.”","Yao Mengqing’s face turned pale.","“Butler, see the guest out,” Gu Zheng said coldly.","Gu Yao immediately felt indignant.. “Sister Mengqing has just returned and you’re chasing her away?”"]},{"number":215,"title":"Chapter 215 - Brothers From The Same Mother","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Ah Yao, don’t say anymore. I shouldn’t have come back... Now that Ah Zheng is married, I really shouldn’t be looking for him anymore.” Yao Mengqing shed a tear and left angrily.","Gu Yao looked at Yao Mengqing’s back and hurriedly chased after her.","“Sister Mengqing! Sister Mengqing!”","Yao Mengqing was crying so hard that Gu Yao’s heart ached. “Sister Mengqing, don’t cry anymore. It has been so long, and my brother probably forgot about it long ago. Besides, he’s already married.”","Yao Mengqing’s eyes were filled with tears. “I know, Ah Zheng. He doesn’t really like Xi Xi. He just got married to a random woman. If he had really met his true love, I wouldn’t disturb him anymore.”","Gu Yao tried to persuade her. “I think Gu Zheng cares about that woman a lot. Besides, you insisted on leaving back then. It’s not good for you to look for him again, right?”","Yao Mengqing looked sad. “Ah Yao, you don’t understand. I love him... If I can’t be with him, my life will be meaningless. I’ve always thought of myself as a friend, but he’s still angry with me. I really don’t know what to do to make him forgive me.”","Gu Yao looked helpless, and his voice was hoarse. “Sister Mengqing, you love Gu Zheng? You only came back to the country to look for him?”","Yao Mengqing was confused, not understanding what Gu Yao meant.","Gu Yao was extremely shocked. “Although I don’t like Qiao Xi and even asked her to get lost from Longwan Residential, she’s my brother’s wife, after all. I don’t have the right or authority to ask her to get lost, let alone you. Sister Mengqing, get this straight!”","Yao Mengqing’s expression darkened. She could not defend herself and could only cry silently.","“Ah Yao, I’m not being selfish. If Ah Zheng really likes Xi Xi, I’ll give them my blessing. However, their marriage is just a formality. They’ll have to end this marriage sooner or later. They might as well give it up now. I’m doing this for Ah Zheng’s sake!","“I won’t be a third party. I just hope that Ah Zheng can be happy.”","Gu Yao finally heaved a sigh of relief. “Sister Mengqing, it’s good that you understand.”","Madam Gu was a mistress. Gu Yao and Gu Zheng were both illegitimate children. They had been mocked and looked down upon by the public since they were young.","That was why he hated women who tried to ruin other people’s relationships the most.","He did indeed hate Qiao Xi and thought that she was not worthy to be the mistress of the Gu family. However, she and Gu Zheng were legally married. She was Gu Zheng’s legitimate wife.","Yao Mengqing wiped her tears. “Ah Yao, I only hope that he can be happy. If Xi Xi is his lover, I’ll give them my blessings. Qiao Xi is your sister-in-law, so you should be more respectful to her in the future.”","Gu Yao nodded. Sister Mengqing was still so kind-hearted and even asked him to respect Qiao Xi, hence she would not be a third party.","Yao Mengqing lowered her eyes as a glint flashed across them. She must snatch Gu Zheng back!","...","In the hall.","Qiao Xi asked casually, “That kid is your younger brother?”","Gu Zheng took a sip of coffee. “Mhm.”","“The two of you don’t look like brothers. Gu Yao and Madam Gu are quite alike, but you don’t look like either of them.”","Qiao Xi stood up and sized up Gu Zheng with her eyes. “You’re not like anyone from the Gu family. You’re unique.”","Gu Zheng smirked and remained silent.","Qiao Xi moved in front of him and smiled slightly. “Could it be that you’re not a child of the Gu family? Otherwise, why would they not treat you well but are especially kind to Gu Yao? You’re both from the same mother, so they can’t be so biased, right?","“And that Gu Yao looks like a good-for-nothing. If the two of you were born from the same mother, why are your characters and IQs so different?”","Gu Yao could not see through Yao Mengqing’s intentions, which was really telling of his IQ.","Gu Zheng leaned lazily on the sofa. “Are you done?”","Qiao Xi pursed her lips. “I just don’t understand. You and Gu Yao are both Madam Gu’s children. Why would she love that silly son so much?”","“Everyone thinks that you represent Madam Gu’s despicable days and that you’re evidence that she was the third party. However, Gu Yao was the child she had during her marriage. The two of you mean something different to her.”","Song Shiyu waved his hands to interrupt, but Qiao Xi ignored him and continued, “But it’s abnormal for Madam Gu to abuse you. Perhaps you’re really not Madam Gu’s child..”"]},{"number":216,"title":"Chapter 216 - Gu Zhengs Life Experience","paragraphs":["The hall was so quiet that one could hear a pin drop.","Song Shiyu’s heart thumped. Someone had asked the president this before, and they met a terrible end.","Unexpectedly, Young Madam asked the question so directly. She was too straightforward!","Gu Zheng sneered and slowly looked up at her.","“What do you think?”","Qiao Xi was instantly speechless. The man was avoiding her question.","She could not help but think of the two of them. Back then, he was Mo Yuan while she was Black Tide. Before the two of them met, she would often look for him to have a heart-to-heart talk about her sorrows. She once said that she was bullied by her stepmother and chased out of the house. She had no home to go back to.","Mo Yuan replied: [I’m the same as you.]","Qiao Xi: [Not only am I homeless, but my mother has also passed away.]","Mo Yuan: [Mine too.]","Qiao Xi was not sure if Mo Yuan did not have a home or if his mother had passed away. Or both?","Back then, when Qiao Xi was homeless and did not even have enough to eat, it was Mo Yuan who helped her. He gave her money and arranged a place for her to stay.","All these years, the two of them had supported each other. She was very grateful to Mo Yuan. Now that she knew that Gu Zheng was Mo Yuan, her relationship with him had not changed.","Gu Zheng had been treated as an illegitimate child by everyone since he was young. He was despised and cursed by countless people. However, she did not think that Gu Zheng was what they made him out to be.","The two of them looked at each other in silence.","Song Shiyu stood at the side, his pupils trembling. He could not help but say, “Young Madam, the president...”","Before he could finish, the cup in Gu Zheng’s hand suddenly fell to the floor. A painful memory surged in his mind as sharp pain assaulted him.","Song Shiyu jumped in shock and rushed over. “President, President? Brother! Help the president upstairs!”","Qiao Xi hurried forward but was stopped by Song Shijing. “Young Madam, are you that curious about whether the president is Madam Gu’s biological son?”","Then, Song Shijing looked serious as he said slowly, “But what’s the point even if the president is Madam Gu’s biological son?”","Qiao Xi asked in confusion, “Why is it meaningless? If Gu Zheng isn’t Madam Gu’s biological son, then he isn’t an illegitimate child. Madam Gu...”","“If the president isn’t Madam Gu’s child, who else could his mother be?”","Song Shijing said helplessly, “Young Madam, you’re very smart. You should know how difficult it is for the president to prove all this and how many people’s interests will be violated.”","Qiao Xi frowned.","Actually, she had long thought that Gu Zheng was not Madam Gu’s biological son but Lu Qingyun’s.","If Gu Zheng was not a child of the Gu family, Madam Gu only needed to announce his true identity to chase him out. However, Madam Gu was so afraid of Gu Zheng, which meant that Gu Zheng was most likely the child of Lu Qingyun and Chairman Gu.","However, why did he not look for the Lu family? If the Lu family knew...","“I know you want to ask why the president hasn’t looked for the Lu family. Of course, he did when he was young.”","Song Shijing explained, “The president wanted to save himself and take a paternity test with Madam Gu. However, the old master of the Lu family was seriously ill at that time. After Madam Lu passed away, who in the Lu family would care about him?”","“After that, they adopted Lu Yan.”","Lu Yan? The heir of the Lu family. Rumor had it that he was Lu Qingyun’s child.","Qiao Xi’s nose turned sore. “Why didn’t the Lu family do a paternity test? Lu Yan isn’t from the Lu family, they...”","Song Shijing said helplessly, “Of course, the Lu family had already investigated it. They also know who the parents of the president are, but the grudge between the two families was established the moment Miss Lu died. It won’t change just because of the Gu family, nor will it affect the Lu family’s reputation.”","Qiao Xi gasped.","She finally understood.","Although the Lu family now knew Gu Zheng’s identity, he had appeared in front of the public as Madam Gu’s child and had been in the Gu family for so long.","If they told everyone now that Gu Zheng was Lu Qingyun’s biological son, the world would be turned upside down.","Firstly, everyone would wonder how Lu Qingyun’s child ended up in the hands of the mistress. Was it because the Lu family was too useless?","A wealthy family like the Lu family would never allow such negative news to spread. Hence, they would rather not acknowledge Gu Zheng and sever all ties with him.."]},{"number":217,"title":"Chapter 217 - Blood Detoxification","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Everyone clearly knew the truth, but they did not say anything and just let Gu Zheng shoulder the burden of being an illegitimate child.","The Lu family was supposed to save Gu Zheng from the fire, but they had now become the ones pushing him into it.","Song Shijing sighed. “Young Madam, the president no longer anticipates clearing his name. He just wants to know who killed Madam Lu.”","To Gu Zheng, the Lu family and the Gu family were the same. They would do anything for benefits.","Qiao Xi sniffled. “I understand.”","...","In the bedroom.","Song Shiyu looked anxious. “President, does your head still hurt?”","Gu Zheng remained silent and frowned.","Qiao Xi carefully walked in and saw that his eyes were closed. He looked to be in pain.","Song Shiyu asked in a low voice, “Young Madam, do you know everything now?”","When Qiao Xi saw the fine sweat that seeped out from Gu Zheng’s forehead and his fists that were tightly clenched, she instantly came to a sudden understanding. “The poison is acting up?”","Song Shiyu nodded. “Yes, we can only let him endure it when the poison acts up. It’ll be fine as long as he survives. We can only watch him suffer. There’s nothing we can do about it.”","Qiao Xi bent down and gently stroked his cheek. She could sense his pain and uneasiness.","“Madam Gu poisoned him?”","“Only she would do such a vicious thing. When the president was young, he was always locked in a small dark room by that vicious woman. She even poisoned him because she wanted to wait for him to die from the poison so that her son could inherit the family business. Fortunately, the president gritted his teeth and survived. If it were someone else, they would’ve...”","Song Shiyu said through gritted teeth.","Qiao Xi’s heart trembled. She was both angry and heartbroken.","Gu Zheng was Lu Qingyun’s child. Did the Lu family ignore him and let a mistress torture the legitimate wife’s child?","Song Shiyu frowned. “Back then, Old Master Lu was seriously ill and the Lu family was leaderless. No one could make decisions. After that, the person in charge of the Lu family became Miss Lu’s father. It’s just that he didn’t like his daughter, Miss Lu. Of course, he didn’t care about the president’s life or death.","“The Lu family is more complicated than you think. Maybe Madam Lu’s death was caused by the Lu family!”","Qiao Xi’s pupils constricted.","Could it be that the Lu family was really the culprit behind the tragedy?","If that was the case, they were scarier than the Gu family!","Qiao Xi sat quietly on the bed. After Song Shiyu left, she began to read her grandfather’s diary.","The diary was already very old, but it was well-preserved. Qiao Xi flipped through it carefully.","It wrote that 40 years ago, Old Master Lu had invited him to treat the seven-year-old Madam Lu. At that time, Madam Lu’s illness was the same as Gu Zheng’s. Grandpa wrote in his diary: [It’s too late. If it were a year earlier, perhaps she could have been saved. However, there’s no cure now.]","Qiao Xi could not help but be stunned.","She originally thought that Madam Lu was poisoned after marrying into the Gu family. Unexpectedly, she was already poisoned when she was young and at about the same time as Gu Zheng.","Was there a special reason for them to be poisoned when they were young?","Qiao Xi stretched out her hand to wipe the sweat on Gu Zheng’s forehead and sighed.","If she really could not detoxify the poison in Gu Zheng’s body, there was still something else she could do.","As the descendant of a divine physician, she had a special skill—her blood could cure all poisons.","Of course, this kind of thing could not be spread to outsiders. Otherwise, she would become the target of everyone’s competition.","However...","Qiao Xi closed the diary and took out a sharp knife. It quickly cut through her skin, and she poured blood into his mouth.","After drinking the blood, Gu Zheng’s expression eased up greatly. Qiao Xi heaved a sigh of relief and fell asleep for some reason.","At this moment, a breeze blew past. The diary flipped to the last page: [Blood Detoxification causes immeasurable side effects.]","...","The next morning.","Qiao Xi opened her sleepy eyes. She was exhausted and found herself sleeping on the bed.","This was? Right, this was Gu Zheng’s bedroom.","After feeding Gu Zheng her blood last night, she might have gotten a little weak, so she fell asleep right there.","However, she remembered that she seemed to have slept on the sofa.. Why was she on the bed when she woke up?"]},{"number":218,"title":"Chapter 218 - Sudden Telepathy","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi woke up in a daze. The moment she went downstairs, she saw Gu Zheng eating breakfast at the dining table.","This man looked quite energetic. She had worked so hard to save him last night, but he did not even thank her once and was eating breakfast alone. He was indeed a bastard!","Unexpectedly, after cursing in his heart, Gu Zheng suddenly looked at her.","Qiao Xi seemed as if she was struck by lightning.","She was scared to death! She had just finished cursing Gu Zheng in her heart when he suddenly looked at her.","It was too scary!","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow.","When Qiao Xi came down, he clearly heard her say, ‘This man looks quite energetic. It worked so hard to save him last night but he didn’t even thank me and is eating breakfast alone. He’s indeed a bastard!’","Gu Zheng’s eyes were slightly puzzled as he raised his eyes to look at Qiao Xi again.","At this moment, Qiao Xi was looking at him with a flattering expression while smiling widely.","Gu Zheng smiled meaningfully. This woman had a malicious smile on her face. She must be trying to use him to recover her taste buds. Since that was the case, she could not scold him so early in the morning.","At this moment, he heard a voice again—","‘Gu Zheng’s gaze is so strange. Is it because I don’t look good?! It’s all because of you, you bastard. I’m almost tired to death!’","It was Qiao Xi’s voice.","Gu Zheng put down the cutleries, a trace of doubt flashing across his eyes. “Song Shiyu, did you hear Young Madam say anything?”","Song Shiyu shook his head immediately. “I didn’t hear anything! You must be imagining things. Your eye problems haven’t even been treated yet, so why are your ears acting up now? My poor president...”","“Shut up!”","Gu Zheng spoke coldly, then looked at Qiao Xi. “Mrs. Gu, you don’t look too good.”","Qiao Xi was angered to the point of laughing.","‘Is this bastard mocking me? In order to detoxify the poison in him, I didn’t even sleep well. My whole body hurts. It’s easy for him to just sit there and talk!","‘Do you think it was easy for me to save you? I’m going to take a full break today and have a big meal!’","This time, Gu Zheng was finally sure that he could hear Qiao Xi’s thoughts.","Unexpectedly... Mrs. Gu was as interesting as he knew her to be.","Want to have a big meal?","Gu Zheng said slowly, “Song Shiyu, get the imperial chef here for Young Madam.”","After the imperial chef rushed over, he heard that Young Madam was injured last night, so he made a few dishes that were light and nutritious. He also carefully advised, “Young Madam, your body is weak and you have a strong temper. It’s better to eat less spicy meat. Try eating lighter-tasting foods instead.”","Qiao Xi was instantly unhappy when she heard this.","Before she fell asleep last night, she had thought that after Gu Zheng woke up, she would tell him how she had saved his life last night. She could at least ask for a few kisses, right?","Gu Zheng would definitely be very grateful to her. He would take the initiative to kiss her and then bring her to eat barbeque!","She had not even kissed him yet and there was no barbeque. She even had to eat bland food. Qiao Xi cursed in her heart.","‘I want to eat barbecue! This bastard is too annoying. It’s fine if he isn’t bringing me to eat barbeque, but he didn’t even kiss me!","‘Gu Zheng! Damn you! I want to eat barbecue!’","Gu Zheng abruptly stood up and hugged her waist, his hot breath spraying on her face. “How about I bring you out to eat?”","Qiao Xi nodded madly while almost drooling. “Yes, I want to eat...”","The man curled his lips and gently pressed them against her forehead, but he did not kiss her lips even after a long time. “Barbeque won’t do. Your body is weak, so you can’t have greasy food.”","Qiao Xi stared fixedly at his thin lips with glowing eyes. She smiled slyly. “Fine, I won’t eat. I’ll listen to whatever Ah Zheng says. I want to kiss you~”","Gu Zheng smiled and lowered his head to kiss her.","When he kissed Qiao Xi, she was especially obedient and hid in his embrace.","However, her heart was racing like a wild horse.","‘I want to eat barbecue! Gu Zheng, you’re not a real man! I want to eat barbecue! I want it freaking spicy! Boo-hoo! I forgot what barbeque tastes like! You bastard! Do you think you can get rid of me with just a kiss?]","Gu Zheng looked at her with deep eyes and asked in a hoarse voice, “Are you unhappy that I’m not letting you eat barbeque?”","Qiao Xi hurriedly squeezed out a smile and said with a flattering expression, “How could that be?! I love Ah Zheng the most. I’ll listen to you.”","Then, Gu Zheng heard a wave of crazy thoughts.."]},{"number":219,"title":"Chapter 219 - The God Of Plague, Second Young Master Gu","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","‘Yes, I am unhappy! Bastard! You can’t hear me even if I scold you in my heart! I’ll scold you as much as I can!’","Gu Zheng sneered. His eyes were filled with smiles as he asked slowly, “Did you save me with your own blood, Mrs. Gu?”","The smile on Qiao Xi’s face froze.","Actually, a little blood loss was nothing. If it could help Gu Zheng relieve the poison in his body, it would be worth it.","Moreover, when he was Mo Yuan, he had taken good care of her. Hence, she had to save Gu Zheng no matter what.","‘It’s just a little blood. It’s no big deal. It can still be replenished.","‘It’s better if I don’t tell Gu Zheng the truth. Otherwise, he’ll definitely be reluctant for me to use my blood to detoxify the poison in his body when it flares up again in the future. It’s better not to tell him!’","Qiao Xi cleared her throat. “Ah Zheng, you’re thinking too much. How could a weak and delicate woman like me bleed to save you?","“I only accidentally scratched myself. How can my blood detoxify the poison? That’s impossible!”","Gu Zheng’s eyes burned as warmth welled up in his heart.","The man abruptly pulled her into his arms, his heart thumping furiously.","She did not want to tell the truth as she was afraid that he would feel heartache and worry.","At this moment, even if Qiao Xi wanted his life, Gu Zheng would probably agree without the slightest hesitation.","Gu Zheng nodded. “Okay.”","Qiao Xi paused for a moment. She wanted to ask Gu Zheng how he was going to deal with the Lu family’s matter, but she could not bear to speak in the end.","Gu Zheng was the legitimate eldest young master of the Gu family. However, he had always been regarded as an illegitimate child and was hated by everyone.","Even Lu Yan, the adopted child, could live comfortably, but Gu Zheng had to suffer inhumane abuse.","He was clearly the most innocent person, yet he had to bear the ill will of both families.","At this moment, Qiao Xi felt that what she had suffered was utterly not worth mentioning when compared to Gu Zheng’s experiences.","She suddenly remembered that she had not seen Qiao Rou in a while.","...","In the afternoon, Qiao Xi received a call from Qin An. “Little Six, quickly come to Fragrance Hotel. I’ll bring you to see Teacher!”","Qiao Xi immediately packed up and went out. She went straight to the Fragrance Hotel that Qin An had mentioned.","Who knew that before she even entered, she would meet the God of Plague—Gu Yao?","In Qiao Xi’s eyes, Gu Yao was a rich good-for-nothing. He did not even know that he had been deceived by that scheming b*tch, Yao Mengqing. He was truly a good-for-nothing.","Moreover, Gu Yao was Madam Gu’s biological son, so she hated Gu Yao even more.","However, she was here to see her third brother, after all. She did not have time to care about Gu Yao.","However, just as she was about to leave, Gu Yao rushed over.","Qiao Xi: “...” What did this kid want?","Gu Yao raised his head arrogantly. He was wearing luxurious designer clothes and looked like a rich man.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched. Fragrance Hotel was full of famous people, so she had to take note of her image. She walked past Gu Yao and continued walking.","However, this brat was like a wall blocking her way.","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “Second Young Master Gu?”","Gu Yao was still arrogant. “Qiao Xi.”","The surrounding people all recognized Gu Yao. He was the second young master of the Gu family and the crown prince of Li City!","Anyone who offended Gu Yao would die a horrible death.","Qiao Xi was not afraid of him at all. If they were to fight, she would indeed not be able to defeat a man, but this was her third brother’s territory. Even Gu Yao could not leave unscathed.","When she thought about this, Qiao Xi went all out and shook her fist. “What do you want?”","Gu Yao glanced at her, took out a bank card, and said in an extremely disdainful tone, “Qiao Xi, this is 200 million. Take the money and get lost from the Gu family!”","Qiao Xi: “...”","Was this not a f*cking plot in a novel? The male protagonist’s mother would ask the female protagonist out to meet her and then ask the female protagonist to leave the male protagonist?","Gu Yao snorted. “Qiao Xi, you’re indeed different, but you’re not worthy of Gu Zheng at all. You’re not worthy to be the mistress of the Gu family. I advise you to be sensible and leave with the money immediately!”","Qiao Xi said, “Um...”","Gu Yao said, “Aren’t you doing this for money? I’m giving it to you now.”","Qiao Xi smiled awkwardly. “Second Young Master Gu, your brain...”","Gu Yao did not listen to her at all and continued, “You think 200 million is too little? Since you’re capable of marrying Gu Zheng, this amount of money shouldn’t matter to you, huh? I can increase the amount.. As long as you agree to take the money and leave, anything can be discussed.”"]},{"number":220,"title":"Chapter 220 - Can I Hit Him?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi lost a lot of blood yesterday and did not sleep well. She suddenly felt a little dizzy and nauseous. She could not help but cover her mouth.","Gu Yao was shocked. “You want to extort me? You’re too scheming!","“No! Don’t tell me you’re pregnant? You want to get rich using your baby? You want to completely trap Gu Zheng by your side?”","Qiao Xi: “...”","Get rich using a baby? Trap Gu Zheng by her side? Second Young Master Gu’s thoughts were too naive!","Seeing that Qiao Xi did not take the bank card, Gu Yao heaved a sigh of relief.","Gu Zheng’s woman was alright. She was not tempted by money and was much better than he had imagined.","However, Qiao Xi was thinking in her heart, ‘Is Gu Yao crazy? He should hurry up and treat his illness!’","Just as Qiao Xi was about to leave, she suddenly realized that Gu Yao’s clothes looked a little familiar.","They were designed by her as Gu Shan and were one of the few male outfits she made.","Second Young Master Gu said somewhat awkwardly, “Don’t think too much. I just wanted to try out the clothes you designed. After all, you represent the entire Gu family now.”","With that, Gu Yao’s face turned red.","Qiao Xi suddenly remembered that day at Longwan Residential. The Song brothers had said that she was Gu Shan, so Second Young Master Gu secretly bought her clothes.","Actually... Second Young Master Gu was quite cute.","Gu Yao pursed his lips. “Just because I bought your clothes doesn’t mean I accept you. I just want to see how capable you are and if you’re really as good as what the rumors say! Do you have any complaints?”","“No...” Qiao Xi hurriedly denied it.","At this moment, a gentle voice sounded from behind. “Xi Xi, long time no see.”","Qiao Xi instantly felt a chill run down her spine. The person who spoke was actually Gu Moling.","Gu Moling looked at Gu Yao with an unfriendly gaze and snorted. “Who is this kid? I can tell at a glance that he’s a good-for-nothing!”","Gu Yao: “...”","Qiao Xi: “...”","What? Gu Moling was also from the Gu family, so how could he not have seen the well-loved Gu Yao?","Gu Moling and Qiao Rou stood together. They were a perfect match.","Gu Moling’s mother stood beside him and glared at Qiao Xi with resentment.","Qiao Rou glanced at Gu Yao and Qiao Xi, the corners of her mouth curving upward into a meaningful smile. “Sister, what a coincidence. I didn’t expect to see you here. Today is the day of my engagement with Brother Moling, and our families are discussing our marriage here.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to glance at her.","She leaned against Gu Moling closely as if she had no bones.","Qiao Xi’s expression was composed as she said indifferently, “Congratulations! I hope the two of you can be united forever and have a child soon.”","Qiao Rou looked aggrieved. “Sister, are you still unwilling to forgive me? You can hate me, but Brother Moling likes me. Feelings can’t be forced. I hope you can let go of this relationship and start afresh!”","Qiao Xi was instantly speechless. When did she have any feelings for Gu Moling?","She was congratulating this adulterous pair for their engagement. She hoped that they would be busy with each other and not bring harm to others.","Gu Moling pursed his lips. “Xi Xi, although we’re not together, I still treat you as my younger sister. Don’t casually look for a man outside, lest you regret it.”","Qiao Xi was really unwilling to pay attention to these two people, yet they just had to come over.","“Don’t spout nonsense, you two. I’m not related to you in any way. Besides, when did you see me casually looking for a man?”","Gu Moling looked at Gu Yao. Though unspoken, everything was made clear.","Mrs. Gu was not a kind person. She said sarcastically, “You still have the cheek to say that? Our Moling doesn’t want you anymore, so you came here to eat with another man! How shameless!”","She turned to look at Gu Yao. “Pretty boy, are you Qiao Xi’s lover? You don’t mind having the woman my son abandoned?”","Gu Moling frowned. “Xi Xi, don’t be silly. Don’t casually look for a man just to anger me.”","Gu Yao was stunned. He rubbed his palms together and asked, “Qiao Xi, who is this fool? Can I hit him?”","Qiao Xi said slowly, “Up to you..”"]},{"number":221,"title":"Chapter 221 - Second Master Wants To Hit Someone Today","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Yao scanned Qiao Rou and Mrs. Gu, then looked at Gu Moling before punching him mercilessly.","Gu Moling cried out in pain and staggered before falling to the floor.","Everyone’s gazes were drawn to Gu Moling. He struggled up with a livid expression. “Xi Xi, don’t be rash!”","Mrs. Gu screamed in shock, “Ah! You dare to hit my son?”","“Moling kindly advised you not to go astray, but you actually instructed that man to hit my son? Seeing that Moling and Rou Rou are about to get married, it’s normal for you to be jealous. However, how could you hit someone?”","Qiao Rou sized up Gu Yao, looking at his clothes and watch. She knew that this man’s identity was extraordinary.","Her eyes shifted as she said sorrowfully, “Sister, you’re fooling around outside. You’ll regret it sooner or later. We’re all trying hard to persuade you for your own good. If you don’t listen, you’ll definitely pay the price in the future!”","Qiao Xi frowned. When Qiao Rou spoke, she had the impulse to hit her.","Just then, Gu Yao said, “Why do I feel like hitting her the moment she says something?”","Qiao Xi sneered. “Then I’ll really have to thank you.”","Immediately after, the woman screamed.","Although Gu Yao was stubborn and bad-tempered, he had his limits. He would not hit women.","However, he could not help it today. Whenever he saw this woman, his hands itched.","Qiao Rou fell to the floor weakly and sobbed aggrievedly.","“Sister, I didn’t expect you to hate me so much. I just wanted to advise you not to take the wrong path. You actually got someone to hit me? Why are you doing this to me? Boo-hoo...”","Mrs. Gu humphed and said, “As Rou Rou’s sister, you’ve been going against her all the time. Rou Rou is doing this for your own good. She’s afraid that you’ll ruin your life by sleeping with a random man!”","“It’s not without reason that you like Qiao Rou so much, Mrs. Gu. After all, you and she are both mistresses. You must have a lot in common, right?” Qiao Xi mocked mercilessly.","The three of them turned livid.","Mrs. Gu flew into a rage out of humiliation. “Qiao Xi! You were dumped by my son, so you’re taking revenge on Moling and Rou Rou! Moling abandoned you, so you should gain some self-awareness!”","Gu Yao instantly widened his eyes. This was the first time he had seen a woman who was more unreasonable than his mother. Moreover, they were all mistresses.","“Qiao Xi, can I...” Should he hit this woman?","Gu Yao really wanted to beat someone up today. It did not matter if she was a woman or not, he would beat her up!","Before he could finish, Mrs. Gu interrupted.","“Pretty boy, let me tell you that Qiao Xi is a woman that our Moling doesn’t want! You’ll regret being with her!”","Gu Yao pursed his lips. “Qiao Xi, why did you think of getting together with such a man back then? Luckily, you’ve already broken up with him.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","Mrs. Gu was infuriated.","Was this wild man mocking her son?","“Qiao Xi! You b*tch! It’s good that Moling broke up with you! You still dare to hit people? I’ll teach you a good lesson today. Let’s see if you still dare to provoke us in the future.”","Mrs. Gu raised her arm and attacked Qiao Xi—","The next second, Gu Yao reached out and grabbed her wrist.","Mrs. Gu hollered, “Let go! How dare you stop me?”","Gu Moling frowned. Even though his mother-in-law was slightly agitated, it was all for Qiao Xi’s sake. It was better than watching her walk down the wrong path.","However, judging from Qiao Xi’s expression, she seemed to think that her mother was making things difficult for her.","Gu Moling was about to speak when a voice came from behind. “What are you doing?”","Mrs. Gu turned around and hurriedly rushed toward the person who had just arrived. She complained, “Old Gu, Qiao Xi instructed a wild man to beat up Moling. She’s even trying to ruin Moling and Rou Rou’s marriage. I really couldn’t stand it anymore and wanted to stop her. However, this man still wanted to attack me!”","Mr. Gu’s expression was ugly. It was Moling’s fault that he had an affair, but Moling and Qiao Rou were about to get engaged. Since things had come to this, why did they have to make things worse?","He sighed and was about to mediate the situation when he saw Gu Yao.","Mr.. Gu’s lips twitched!"]},{"number":222,"title":"Chapter 222 - Ive Hit Gu Zheng Before","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Mrs. Gu refused to budge. “Qiao Xi! Don’t think I can’t do anything to you just because you have a wild man by your side! I’m-”","“Stop fighting!”","To her surprise, Mr. Gu instantly flew into a rage and berated her agitatedly, “Who did you say is a wild man? Watch your tongue and stop spouting nonsense!”","Mrs. Gu’s heart sank, and her eyes were filled with horror. Seeing that Mr. Gu had flown into a rage, she hurriedly hid behind him.","At this moment, Mr. Gu hurriedly went forward with a look of flattery on his face.","“Y-Young Master Gu, my wife is ignorant. She just spouted a few nonsense words. Don’t take them seriously...”","Everyone was dumbfounded by Mr. Gu’s respectful behavior!","Surprised, Mrs. Gu muttered indignantly, “Who is he? Do you have to be so afraid of him? He’s just a good-for-nothing!”","“You’re still talking?” Mr. Gu glared at her.","Gu Yao had an arrogant look on his face, exuding a noble aura as he scoffed.","“Gu Yan, just what kind of family do you have here?! It’s fine that they don’t know me, but they’re even calling me a wild man! Are you leaving me with no dignity?”","Mr. Gu broke out in a cold sweat.","Gu Yao sneered. “I remember that you guys have a collaboration with the main Gu family, right?”","Mr. Gu instantly shuddered. “Second Young Master, yes, yes.”","“In that case, I officially announce that the collaboration is canceled. Your wife and son actually dare to insult me? If I don’t make you pay the price, my surname isn’t Gu!","“Also, if my brother knows that you’re scolding me like this, you’ll end up worse off!”","Gu Yan’s body went soft and he almost fell to the floor, his body trembling uncontrollably.","In order to collaborate with the main Gu family, their company had spent a lot of effort but it ended up failing overnight.","Gu Yan quickly begged, “Second Young Master, the contract has already been signed and the project is underway. If the investment is suddenly withdrawn, it’ll affect your company too. Please let us off this time!”","Gu Yao snorted. “The Gu family doesn’t lack this bit of money. It’s just a drop in the ocean to us.”","Gu Yan trembled and stood there helplessly. He then looked at Qiao Xi.","“Xi Xi, actually, I’ve always thought very highly of you. My unfilial son has let you down, and I’ve also reprimanded him. I won’t let him disturb you again in the future, and our family won’t make things difficult for you anymore. Please help persuade Second Young Master. Xi Xi, I’ve never once made things difficult for you!”","Qiao Xi’s expression was strange.","The company’s money was Gu Zheng’s money. She was not willing to let Gu Zheng suffer any losses, so...","Unexpectedly, Mrs. Gu suddenly screamed loudly, “Old Gu! What are you talking about?! Why are you asking for help from that b*tch?! She’s the vixen who seduced a man and beat up Moling. Why are you being so humble?! Who do you think Qiao Xi is? You must be muddle-headed to be afraid of her!”","Gu Yan’s lips turned pale!","Qiao Xi withdrew her original thoughts and sneered. “Uncle Gu, it’s not that I’m not giving you due respect here, but your wife keeps calling me a vixen. How can I help her? I think I should go.”","Gu Yan was so angry that his whole body was trembling. He glared at Mrs. Gu angrily.","“Old Gu! That kid even punched Moling. Can you take it lying down? Hurry up and...”","Gu Yao turned around to look at the fierce Mrs. Gu, saying arrogantly, “Can’t I hit your son? I’ve even hit Gu Zheng before, so why can’t I hit your son?”","He had already held back with that punch earlier, mainly because he thought that his hand would hurt if he hit too hard.","Gu Yan was so scared that his face turned pale. His legs gave way and he fell to the floor, his eyes filled with horror.","“You crazy woman! It’s Moling who had an affair with Qiao Rou. Qiao Xi did nothing wrong. Make a detour if you see her in the future!","“Do you know who this man is? He’s Gu Yao, the youngest son of the Gu family and Gu Zheng’s younger brother!","“You keep saying that Qiao Rou is good. If she hadn’t caused trouble, would we have offended Gu Yao? Her mom is the third party, and her daughter isn’t a good person either. She’s not worth mentioning!”","Qiao Rou’s face was green with grievances. “Uncle Gu...”","As soon as she finished speaking, the manager of Fragrant Hotel walked over. “I’m sorry, but the customers of Fragrant Hotel are all reputable people. We need a quiet dining environment.. I hope you can leave as soon as possible.”"]},{"number":223,"title":"Chapter 223 - Destroying The Qiao Family","paragraphs":["Gu Moling’s expression darkened. “Why should I?”","Fragrance Hotel was not the Gu family’s property but the Qin family’s. Why were they being kicked out?","The manager said calmly, “Because you’ve disturbed our eldest miss.”","Before they could react, the bodyguards rushed over and chased the family away.","Qiao Rou was the center of attention no matter where she went. This was the first time she was being looked down upon like this. She could not take it anymore and her whole body was trembling.","“Fragrance Hotel’s eldest miss... Why haven’t I heard of her before?”","Mrs. Gu shouted, “Let go! What kind of lousy place is this?! How dare they chase away the customers?! It must be Qiao Xi’s doing!”","Seeing that she was still unconvinced, Gu Yan raised his hand and slapped her.","“Shut up! You’re being chased out by Fragrant Hotel in public. From now on, it’s impossible for us to be invited to any more banquets. This means that we can’t get to know new customers. Do you know how big of a loss this is for the company?”","Mrs. Gu covered her face and screamed, “I didn’t know the consequences would be so serious! We don’t know the eldest daughter of the Qin family either. It must be Qiao Xi who did it! I’ll kill this b*tch!”","Gu Moling was extremely depressed.","Ever since he got together with Qiao Rou, he had been extremely unlucky.","The company was affected and now, they were even being kicked out of Fragrance Hotel.","Qiao Rou lowered her head, her eyes vicious. She would not let this go.","...","Fragrance Hotel.","Gu Yao said arrogantly, “Your ex-boyfriend’s family is too stupid. Are they crazy?”","Qiao Xi nodded.","Gu Yao continued to mock them. “And your sister, what’s her name? She’s so ugly but she’s still pretending to be weak. How disgusting!”","Qiao Xi’s mind was filled with one thing and she could not help but say, “Gu Yao.”","“What’s wrong?”","Qiao Xi’s expression was serious. “You beat Gu Zheng before?”","When Gu Yao was mocking everyone earlier, he said that he had hit Gu Zheng before, so who would he not dare to beat up?","Gu Yao frowned, feeling awkward at first. Then, he glared at her. “When he hit me, I struggled back a little. It’s considered a hit too. Are you unconvinced?”","Qiao Xi: “...”","Fortunately, Gu Zheng was not bullied. She was relieved.","She suddenly remembered that she was here for the appointment and went upstairs in peace.","On the other side, Gu Zheng was lazily leaning against the sofa, playing with a knife in his hand.","Song Shiyu’s heart pounded as he looked at the cold knife.","“President, this is Fragrance Hotel, after all. It might not be too good if someone from the Gu family dies!”","Gu Zheng asked casually, “How’s the investigation going?”","Song Shiyu replied in fear, “Young Madam’s mother was killed by Qiao Zhenguo and Xu Mei. After that, Young Madam was locked up by the Qiao family and chased out ten years ago!","“The Qiao family announced to the public that Young Madam had gone missing, but it was actually Xu Mei who chased her out.","“After that, they went to look for Young Madam again. Qiao Rou had always wanted to kill Young Madam and even tried to murder her a few times. However, she failed and slandered Young Madam for killing someone instead. Outsiders all say that Qiao Rou is kind-hearted and never took issue with Young Madam.","“After that, Qiao Rou stole Gu Moling from her and wrongly accused Young Madam of doing something wrong. President, how do you want to deal with these people?”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were indifferent but a trace of murderous intent flashed past them.","“What is the Qiao family most afraid of?”","Song Shiyu replied, “The Qiao family... might be afraid of losing their reputation and their company.”","Gu Zheng nodded. “Since we’re going to deal with them, we’ll have to destroy what they care about the most.”","Qiao Xi had already suffered a lot. In the future, he would not let Qiao Xi suffer again, much less let the Qiao family bully her.","The Qiao family had always cared about their reputation. In that case, he would announce to the world that Xu Mei was the third party. He would let everyone see how Xu Mei killed the first wife and became Mrs. Qiao.","They would watch as the Qiao family paid a painful price for what they had done in the past.","If his wife knew about this, she would probably be happy.","...","Upstairs in Fragrance Hotel.","Qin An flew into a rage. “Who the heck is the Qiao family? How dare they bully Little Six? I’ll kill them!”","Uncle Liang said indifferently, “Xi Xi has never been one to be bullied. You don’t have to worry..”"]},{"number":224,"title":"Chapter 224 - Sister-in-law And I Are Innocent","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qin An could not help but nod. Uncle was right. Ten years ago, Little Six came to them and was bullied by a bunch of brats.","In a few years, Little Six dealt with the families of those people and made them pay the price for their mistakes.","Qin An had even asked her why she did not seek his help when she was bullied.","Little Six said that she could handle it alone and she enjoyed subduing her opponents.","Uncle Liang sighed. “The Qiao family and Little Six have a grudge over the death of her mother. Without sufficient evidence, they won’t rashly attack.”","Qin An looked anxious. “Then are we supposed to just watch those people disturb her?”","Uncle Liang smiled slightly. “The news that Qiao Rou was chased out of Fragrance Hotel will soon spread to the entire Li City. The Qiao family will definitely come and beg for forgiveness. At that time, you’ll let them know who the eldest miss of Fragrance Hotel is! If they want to enter this door again, they have to apologize to the eldest miss!”","Qin An hurriedly nodded. This was indeed a good idea.","Right when the Qiao family came to apologize, they would realize that the eldest miss was Xi Xi. It would definitely be exciting!","...","That night, the news that Gu Yao had beaten Gu Moling up in Fragrance Hotel spread throughout Li City.","The Second Young Master of the Gu family was a famous hedonistic son. He was mischievous and eccentric. It was no surprise that he would beat someone up.","However... the female lead in the news this time was Qiao Xi.","They seemed to have heard the news—","Gu Moling had an affair. Furthermore, he and Qiao Rou always mocked Qiao Xi about it. Unexpectedly, Gu Yao protected Qiao Xi and even beat Gu Moling up before chasing him out of Fragrance Hotel. From then on, Gu Moling could no longer participate in any upper-class banquets.","This was what it meant by a hero saving the beauty!","Although Gu Yao was a good-for-nothing, he was still very manly for standing up for Qiao Xi.","Not long after Qiao Xi and Gu Moling broke up, Gu Yao protected Qiao Xi in public.","This was love!","If Qiao Xi married Gu Yao, she would be the future mistress of the Gu family. Her value would instantly rise.","Gu Yao, who did not know the inside story, woke up after sleeping. He saw countless messages on his phone, all of them congratulating him.","He looked puzzled: “?”","Why were these people asking when he would get married?","He did not even have a girlfriend, how was he going to get married?","Gu Yao turned on his phone and scrolled through the messages.","[Gu Yao, I’ll go support you when you get married!]","Gu Yao: “?”","[You haven’t had a girlfriend for so many years. I thought you didn’t like women, but it turns out you’ve taken a liking to Qiao Xi! Tell me the story of your relationship!]","Gu Yao: “!!”","When the heck did he fall in love with Qiao Xi?","[Gu Yao, the news that you saved the damsel in distress in Fragrance Hotel has spread. The body that you’ve been protecting for so many years can finally be of use!]","Gu Yao: “??”","‘Holy sh*t! Me and Qiao Xi?’","Qiao Xi had married Gu Zheng a long time ago, so why did they misunderstand that he was together with Qiao Xi?","Gu Yao’s body trembled as his heart jumped.","‘Damn! You’re trying to frame me for being unrighteous! My sister-in-law and I are innocent. How did things end up like this in your mouths?’","Panicking, he hurriedly called Gu Zheng.","...","Gu Zheng had naturally heard of the rumors.","Song Shiyu stood by the side in fear, feeling sorry for Gu Yao.","“President, actually...”","Gu Zheng asked slowly, “Gu Yao saved the beauty?”","Song Shiyu looked terrified. “This...”","Gu Zheng said, “Gu Yao has been single for so many years and has finally met the destined one?”","Song Shiyu was going crazy. He tried to persuade him patiently, saying, “President, these are all lies! I’ll go to the public relations department now. Calm down!”","At this moment, Gu Zheng’s phone rang. Gu Yao’s crying voice came through the phone.","“Brother, I didn’t do anything! I really didn’t do anything. Sister-in-law and I are innocent! This is just a misunderstanding! Don’t hit me! I’m already so old. It’s really not good for you to hit me again! You have to believe me!”","Gu Zheng: “...”","Gu Yao was shocked. “Qiao Rou framed me, that vicious woman. She’s trying to kill me!”","Gu Zheng remained silent, scaring Gu Yao so much that his heart was almost dead.."]},{"number":225,"title":"Chapter 225 - Madam Is Pregnant?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Yao cried out in fear. “Don’t do anything to me! I don’t like Qiao Xi at all. She’s my sister-in-law! How would I dare to be so unscrupulous? Boo-hoo... Don’t misunderstand!”","“Gu Yao,” Gu Zheng suddenly said.","Although Gu Zheng was not there at the scene, he knew very well what had happened. Hence, he said casually, “You did well this time.”","Second Young Master Gu stopped crying and asked in disbelief, “... What?”","Did well? What did that mean?","Rumors about him and Qiao Xi were flying everywhere. Was Gu Zheng not angry? He was even praising him?","After hanging up, Gu Yao, who was still confused, finally heaved a sigh of relief.","On the other side, Gu Zheng asked, “Song Shiyu, have you found Qiao Xi’s teacher?”","Song Shiyu said, “President, Madam’s teacher is a famous doctor.”","Gu Zheng nodded. He thought about how his eyes had completely recovered the next day after his relapse.","He was aware that Qiao Xi had used her blood to detoxify the poison in his body. It was a unique mystic medicine that could only be used when necessary.","He could hear her thoughts the next day. It had to be because of her blood.","“Gu Zheng, why aren’t you turning on the lights?”","At this moment, Qiao Xi walked in. She had just said something when she felt her stomach surge.","Gu Zheng heard—","‘Why am I always nauseous? Could it be that I ate something bad?’","He curled his lips slightly. It was a good thing that he could hear Mrs. Gu’s thoughts.","He did not expect Mrs. Gu to be so full of emotions.","He stood up and walked to her. He asked slowly, “Mrs. Gu, what’s wrong?”","Song Shiyu turned on the lights, and his eyes gradually got used to the brightness.","Qiao Xi was just about to answer when she felt abnormally nauseous. She had the urge to vomit and rushed into the washroom.","Just then, Gu Zheng heard a voice—","‘Teacher’s dishes are really biochemical weapons! I shouldn’t have eaten them. How can my weak body stand his scary dishes?! Seriously, why did Third Brother have to call me over?!","‘It’s so uncomfortable! I’m gonna throw up!’","Song Shiyu leaned over to Song Shijing’s ear and muttered, “Madam is vomiting! Is it...”","Song Shijing glanced at him. “It’s none of your business.”","“How is it none of my business?! I mean, the president and Young Madam have been sleeping separately. Did they do the deed?”","Song Shiyu smiled wretchedly. “Brother, it must be that. You know what I mean. Why aren’t you curious at all?”","Song Shijing: “...”","How did he have such a wretched younger brother?","He was very curious. With the president’s temper, how could he tolerate Song Shiyu’s nonsense?","The president was too kind!","Song Shiyu’s thoughts were in a mess. The president seemed to be very good at this. If they slept in the same room, Young Madam would definitely be pregnant soon.","Qiao Xi had taken her medicine and was lying on the chair with her eyes closed.","She regretted it so much! She would never eat Uncle’s dirty dishes again.","No, she seemed to have gained weight. Why was there a layer of fat on her stomach?!","Qiao Xi jumped up in horror and hurriedly took a ruler to measure her waist. She had indeed gained weight...","She suddenly heard Third Brother’s careful reminder. “Little Six, your dress is too small today.”","Qiao Xi had always been thin since she was young. Moreover, there was something wrong with her taste buds, so she was not interested in food. It was fine as long as she was not hungry. However, after being by Gu Zheng’s side for a few months, she had unexpectedly gained weight!","For women, the most terrifying thing was gaining weight.","At this moment, the butler walked in with a plate of fried chicken.","Qiao Xi really liked crispy and juicy fried chicken because even though she could not taste it, she could enjoy the texture of the food.","The butler knew that she liked it, so he often made it for her.","It was just that Qiao Xi was feeling nauseous now. As soon as she smelled the greasy aroma, she immediately covered her mouth and waved her hand. “I don’t want to eat that for now.”","The butler was enlightened.","Young Madam was disgusted the moment she smelled oil. She had even gained weight. Could it be...","The butler hurriedly congratulated her. “Young Madam, why didn’t you say so earlier? Pregnancy is a good thing!”","Qiao Xi was dumbfounded: “??”","The butler was all smiles. “I thought you had gained weight.. Looks like you’re pregnant. The president probably doesn’t know yet, right? I’ll go tell him!”"]},{"number":226,"title":"Chapter 226 - Bastard Said Sweet Words","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Wait...” Pregnant?","Before Qiao Xi could finish, the butler left in a hurry.","Not long after, Gu Zheng walked over with a smile. “I heard you’re pregnant?”","Qiao Xi: “...”","They had never even done that, so how could she be pregnant? Was this bastard joking?","‘If I’m pregnant, that means it’s someone else’s child. Does Gu Zheng want to be cuckolded so badly?","‘Bastard, if you dare say I’m fat, I’ll kill you!’","He hugged her waist. She had indeed gained weight, but she seemed to have become cuter. She was too skinny earlier, but now that he touched her flesh, it felt better this way.","“Mrs. Gu, you’re not fat at all,” the man said with a chuckle.","Qiao Xi’s expression eased up a little. Fortunately, Gu Zheng did not say anything. She said aggrievedly, “Everyone says I’m fat.”","Gu Zheng smiled slightly. “That’s because they don’t understand aesthetics. Your figure now is the most perfect.”","Qiao Xi widened her eyes in pleasant surprise.","Oh my God! This man was saying sweet things!","Qiao Xi’s heart raced. She finally knew why women liked sweet-talking men.","Hearing him say sweet words, she instantly felt much better.","“Am I really not fat? Nowadays, girls all want to be skinny and young. I think I’m a little heavy.”","Gu Zheng stroked her hair, his heart almost melting. “You’re not heavy at all. All the other girls out there must be very envious of your figure.”","Qiao Xi’s face was dyed red, and it gradually spread to her ears.","She abruptly raised her eyes and heard Gu Zheng say slowly, “You eat so much but you only gained this little bit of weight. This is already very impressive, so they should be very envious of you!”","“...”","Qiao Xi was stunned for a few seconds.","‘Bastard! Nothing good comes out of your mouth!’","Her little heart that was still beating rapidly instantly steadied as she gritted her teeth in anger.","She would rather believe that there were ghosts in this world than a man’s words!","If she were to wait for him to say a few nice words, she might as well just sleep and listen to his sweet words in her dreams.","Qiao Xi turned around and was about to leave when Gu Zheng grabbed her. “What’s wrong?”","‘What do you think is wrong? Bastard, you’re doing this on purpose, right?! Before I met you, I thought you were a caring big brother. After we met, I realized you’re just a bastard!’","Gu Zheng curled his lips into a devilish smile. “I’m quite happy.”","Qiao Xi almost spat out a mouthful of blood.","If she was guilty, please just have God punish her and not send Gu Zheng to torture her!","When he entered earlier, Gu Zheng had a cold face. Now, he was smiling like a blooming flower.","Gu Zheng’s thin lips moved slightly. “I was originally unhappy, but after seeing you, I’m happy.”","Qiao Xi’s mouth was wide open as her heart thumped.","What did he say?","Did it mean that he wanted to see her?","Just then, her phone suddenly rang. It was a message, and it interrupted her thoughts.","Gu Zheng turned his face away to cover his red ears. He pretended to be calm and asked, “Are you going to investigate Qiao Zhenguo and Xu Mei?”","Qiao Xi was stunned for a moment, then nodded.","After so many years, it was not easy to find evidence.","Gu Zheng’s expression was serious. “What do you want to do?”","Qiao Xi seemed to be lost in thought. She did not understand why Gu Zheng was asking this. Did he want to help?","“I want to find out the truth of the matter and let the culprit be punished!”","However, this was only the beginning. She still had to announce what Qiao Zhenguo and Xu Mei had done to the world to comfort her mother’s soul in heaven.","Also...","‘I also want Qiao Zhenguo to lose everything. I want him to walk into hell step by step. I want him to live a life worse than death!","‘I want to let this adulterous pair fall into despair. I want to have Xu Mei experience endless pain. I want her reputation to be ruined and for her to be abandoned by everyone. It’s best if she eventually dies from depression.’","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly as she frowned slightly.","‘About these things... I’d better not tell Gu Zheng. It hasn’t been easy for me to pretend to be weak. If I open my mouth and say these, my image will be ruined. All men probably hate vicious women.","‘No man would like a revengeful woman, and I happen to be such a person.’","Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with disappointment.","However, Gu Zheng could clearly hear her thoughts and did not say anything.."]},{"number":227,"title":"Chapter 227 - Coordination","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Zheng’s gaze was sharp. “Qiao Xi, you’re too kind.”","Qiao Xi abruptly raised her eyes with a puzzled expression.","His voice was cold as he said what he was thinking.","“You have to destroy everything they have. You have to make them wish they were dead. You have to make them fall into despair. You have to destroy their reputations and make them be abandoned by everyone.","“You have to torture them and make them feel endless pain. You have to make them kneel down and beg you. In the end, they’ll die of depression.”","Gu Zheng said casually, “This is the only way to take revenge.”","Qiao Xi was unable to recover from her shock for a long time.","Gu Zheng... was on the same page as her?","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with surprise, but she still pretended to be weak.","“Ah Zheng, I’m such a weak person. How can I be so vicious...”","“Mhm.” Gu Zheng knew that if he exposed her, it would definitely make her feel awkward, so he followed her words and said, “You don’t have to do it. I’ll help you.”","She did not have to do such a bloody thing herself.","Qiao Xi was slightly stunned, and her heart felt warm.","‘Wow! Gu Zheng is too manly! I like him too much!","‘Qiao Xi, calm down. Your little heart is beating too quickly. You can’t be charmed by a man!","‘But I can’t control myself! He’s so handsome! I love him so much!","‘Gu Zheng! Muacks!’","Gu Zheng listened to her heartfelt words with a gentle gaze. He gently pulled her into his arms and pressed his body tightly against hers.","They could clearly hear each other’s heartbeats. He had never been so happy before. It was as if he had obtained the most precious treasure in the world.","He could hear her heart because he had drunk her blood. Perhaps the blood would lose its effect after a while. He could only hear her thoughts again the next time the poison acted up.","However, Gu Zheng’s heart ached for her. In order to save him, she had to cut herself.","He would rather endure the pain of the poison acting up and not being able to listen to her thoughts than see her get hurt.","The man lowered his eyes and walked straight to the study. He closed the door and called Qin An.","Qin An was Qiao Xi’s senior. He would be very willing to suppress the Qiao family with him.","...","A few days later, Qiao Zhenguo called.","He said in an arrogant tone, “The owner of Fragrance Hotel has invited our family to a banquet. As a member of the Qiao family, you have to attend as well. Wear appropriate clothing and don’t embarrass the Qiao family. Be at the entrance of Fragrance Hotel tomorrow at ten.”","Then, he hung up.","Qiao Xi was speechless. Her father would not do things for no benefits. He definitely had a reason for asking her to attend the banquet.","Going up against her? How laughable!","Where did he think Fragrance Hotel was? It was her territory!","...","The next day at ten.","Qiao Xi was wearing a long black dress that outlined her perfect figure. Her seaweed-like hair fell on her shoulders, and she had an extremely imposing aura that caused everyone to raise their eyebrows.","Xu Mei was chatting with a middle-aged man. When he saw Qiao Xi, he was stunned. “President Qiao, your eldest daughter is so beautiful?”","Qiao Zhenguo looked obsequious. “President Qian, you’re too kind. Actually, my younger daughter is more outstanding. It’s just that she’s already engaged to the young master of the Gu family, so I let the eldest daughter come. What do you think?”","President Qian’s eyes were filled with wretchedness. “Very good! I like her very much...”","Xu Mei and Qiao Zhenguo looked at each other before hurriedly going forward to welcome Qiao Xi.","“Xi Xi, the Qiao family is in a bit of a dilemma now. You’re from the Qiao family, after all. You have to do something to help us tide through this crisis. President Qian is a rich man. As long as you marry him, this matter will be settled. In the future, you can live the life of a rich madam.”","Qiao Xi was so angry that she laughed. How could Xu Mei have the cheek to say such things? Why didn’t she marry President Qian herself, then?","How laughable!","Qiao Xi’s face was covered in disdain.","“Xi Xi, you can’t just watch the company go bankrupt, right?”","Xu Mei looked sad. “You’re also a daughter of the Qiao family, so you have to make some contributions. Back then, a president took a liking to your mother and wanted her to sleep with him. If she hadn’t refused, the Qiao family wouldn’t have fallen to this state! You two can’t just care about yourself. You have to think about the Qiao family too!”","If Xu Mei only wanted to anger her, she had already done it.."]},{"number":228,"title":"Chapter 228 - Where Did The Qiao Familys Eldest Miss Go?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Qiao Rou is also the daughter of the Qiao family. Why can’t she marry him?”","Xu Mei looked unhappy. “Rou Rou is already engaged to Moling. She’s marrying into the Gu family. You don’t have a boyfriend and you’re not married. You can marry President Qian and solve the Qiao family’s urgent problem. Besides, you won’t be able to marry with your reputation, so we found a good marriage partner for you.”","Qiao Zhenguo was impatient. “Rou Rou is pure and innocent. What kind of trash are you? You’re not even worthy of carrying Rou Rou’s shoes. It’s your responsibility to marry and contribute to the family!”","With that, he roughly dragged Qiao Xi into a room and locked the door.","“Be good and wait here. When President Qian comes over in a while, perform well. If you dare to resist, you’ll suffer!”","After Qiao Zhenguo said those words, he swaggered off with Xu Mei and Qiao Rou.","Qiao Xi sized up the surrounding environment. It was not bad, so she lay on the bed and rested for a while before making a call.","“Sixth Miss, it’s all been recorded. The image is very clear.”","Qiao Xi smiled lightly. “Very good.”","The person on the other end of the phone shuddered. “S-Sixth Miss, everyone attending this banquet is famous in Li City. It’s best if no one dies today!”","Qiao Xi: “?”","She said helplessly, “Don’t be afraid, I know what to do.”","...","At the banquet downstairs, Qiao Rou pretended to be worried. “Dad, with Sister’s character, she won’t be willing. Isn’t it a little too much to force her like this?”","“Rou Rou, why are you worried about her? She’s not a good person. She’s always fooling around outside. Since she sleeps around with others, she might as well do something useful this time. It’s her honor that President Qian is willing to marry her!”","Xu Mei immediately retorted. Qiao Zhenguo said in a gentle tone, “Rou Rou, don’t worry about her. Perform well at the banquet later. If you meet the eldest daughter of Fragrance Hotel, you must think of a way to please her.”","Xu Mei played along. “That’s right, Rou Rou. Today’s banquet is for the eldest daughter of Fragrance Hotel. If you can build a good relationship with her, it’ll be good for the company. After Qiao Xi marries President Qian, you can just stay at home and be a rich madam. She won’t be able to go out anymore and definitely won’t disturb you.”","Qiao Rou nodded obediently and smiled victoriously.","She had long heard of President Qian. He was an old gangster and had violent tendencies. If Qiao Xi married him, she would definitely be killed by him.","From today onward, their lives as sisters would change completely!","The guests entered one after another. The banquet was about to officially start.","Qiao Rou was very excited. This was her first time attending such a grand event. She felt that everything was new.","“President Qiao, I heard that your eldest daughter is here too. Why don’t I see her?”","At this moment, someone asked curiously. They all knew that Qiao Zhenguo had two daughters, and they had always wanted to meet the legendary eldest daughter.","Qin An also asked, “President Qiao, where’s Qiao Xi?”","Qiao Zhenguo was a little embarrassed and pretended to be helpless. “She was here just now but disappeared in the blink of an eye. This child is too worrisome. The banquet has already started, so I wonder where she went to fool around!”","Qiao Rou hesitated. “I know... Sister seems to have gone upstairs.”","Upstairs? Those were all suites. Why would she be there?","Qiao Rou hesitated for a moment and said awkwardly, “I think she’s following... No, don’t misunderstand. I don’t know!”","Her eyes widened, and she looked innocent as if she had accidentally let it slip.","Qin An walked over and gently coaxed her, saying, “Miss Qiao, what’s there not to say here?”","‘Tell me! How am I going to continue acting if you don’t tell me?’","Qiao Rou was a little afraid and looked troubled. She hesitated for a moment.","“Sister went upstairs with a man. I’m very afraid. Will she be in danger?”","Qiao Zhenguo also pretended to be worried. “My eldest daughter has never attended such a grand banquet. Maybe she’s in trouble. I’d better go look for her quickly!”","His face was full of worry, but there was something sinister in his eyes. In front of everyone, he indeed looked worried about his daughter.","However, as long as everyone went upstairs, they would discover that Qiao Xi and President Qian were together. At that time..."]},{"number":229,"title":"Chapter 229 - Scheme","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qin An smiled. “If anything happens to Miss Qiao in Fragrance Hotel, we’ll be held responsible. Let’s go take a look together.”","Qiao Rou naturally hoped that Qin An would go. The more people there, the better. She wanted everyone to see that sl*t, Qiao Xi, in action.","Xu Mei smiled sinisterly. She was waiting to see Qiao Xi make a fool of herself.","Back then, that b*tch died in her hands. Her daughter could forget about living well too.","Qiao Xi would soon make a fool of herself at such an important banquet. Who would dare to marry such a woman in the future? If Gu Yao saw her with another man, he would definitely abandon her!","When everyone saw her naked body, she might kill herself in shame, but it would be too easy for her to die like that.","Qiao Xi was the Qiao family’s eldest daughter, while Qiao Rou was the daughter of a mistress. Therefore, she innately had a sense of envy and resentment toward Qiao Xi.","After Qiao Xi married President Qian and was played by him day and night, the Qiao family would enjoy the wealth and resources that Qiao Xi had traded her body for.","Everything in the Qiao family would belong to Rou Rou. She would trample Qiao Xi under her feet and make her never recover!","Xu Mei curled the corners of her lips. Qiao Xi was probably in great pain now!","...","Half an hour ago.","Qiao Xi lazily leaned against the sofa, the surveillance footage playing on her phone.","Xu Mei’s voice was heard. “President Qian, she’s waiting for you in the room. She’ll definitely serve you well. Here’s the room card!”","“This elder daughter of ours doesn’t have any other merits except that she’s good-looking and knows how to serve others. You’ll definitely like her. After you marry her, she’ll be at your mercy!”","It was unknown what the other party said, but Xu Mei said with a flattering expression, “We’ve already given you Qiao Xi. Can you give us the resources you have?”","Qiao Xi could not help but purse her lips. This Xu Mei was like a pimp!","Xu Mei and Qiao Rou had already planned everything out. They would lock her in her room and wait for President Qian to come over to sleep with her. Then, they would bring people along to catch her in bed with President Qian. With countless eyes watching, she would completely lose her reputation and be forced to marry President Qian.","Just then, the door opened—","Qiao Xi stood up and revealed a cold smile.","President Qian had a big belly and smiled wretchedly. “Little beauty! Hurry up and welcome me. Let me dote on you... Ah!!”","Qiao Xi grabbed the fat hand that he stretched out and pulled forcefully, causing his bones to crack.","She pulled the bedsheet beside her and tied him up.","President Qian was dumbfounded. “What are you doing? Are you rebelling? Qiao Zhenguo has already given you to me. You... Ah!”","Qiao Xi kicked his knee hard, and President Qian immediately screamed.","“President Qian, I advise you to be more obedient. Otherwise, I won’t be polite anymore.” Qiao Xi’s gaze swept past him coldly.","President Qian shuddered and roared, “B*tch! You dare to threaten me? When you marry me, I’ll definitely torture you to death!","“Xu Mei said that you’re a b*tch who has to be beaten and scolded to be obedient...","“Ah!","Qiao Xi picked up the knife at the side and stabbed it fiercely into his body as she said slowly, “You still dare to scold me?”","She slashed with the knife and blood gushed out. It was so painful that President Qian gritted his teeth and could not help but curse.","“Your father has sold you to me! You’re my woman. Are you trying to rebel?! I’ll kill you when I get out!”","Qiao Xi sneered as she looked at his ugly face. She pulled out the knife, picked up a fork, and stabbed it back in.","“President Qian, you’ve harmed so many innocent women and now you’re trying to harm a weak woman like me. Even if I kill you, it’s self-defense. At most, I’ll be detained for a few days before coming out.”","Upon hearing this, President Qian’s eyes were filled with horror. “What are you trying to do? If you kill me, you, you...”","Qiao Xi grunted coldly. “Killing you like this is too easy for you.”","He should be glad that Gu Zheng and Third Brother were not here. Otherwise, this *sshole would have died miserably.","The fat on President Qian’s body trembled as he roared in pain. “I’m going to kill you, b*tch! Xu Mei is coming here soon. I’ll tell her that you kidnapped me and extorted me.. You can’t escape...”"]},{"number":230,"title":"Chapter 230 - Bribing The Secretary","paragraphs":["“President Qian.” Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “You’re really laughable. Since I’m able to attack you, it means that I’m confident enough. You pressed the service bell multiple times but no one came to look for you. Why don’t you think about why that is?”","President Qian widened his eyes.","Qiao Xi sneered. “Fragrance Hotel has very good service, so why are they ignoring you this time? Why are they turning a blind eye despite knowing I’m attacking you?”","She threw the knife away and clapped her hands. Then, a group of people walked in. One of them was the manager of Fragrance Hotel.","The manager walked in front of Qiao Xi and said respectfully, “Eldest Miss.”","Qiao Xi looked at President Qian’s surprised expression and said slowly, “Fragrance Hotel is my third brother’s territory. No one will care even if I kill you.”","President Qian’s face was filled with horror as his body trembled. His eyes rolled back and he fainted.","Everyone quickly tidied up the room and carried President Qian out. The suite was restored to its original state.","...","On the other side, Qiao Rou and Qiao Zhenguo had also arrived upstairs.","Qiao Rou looked anxious. “Where’s my sister? Dad, will she be fine? Boo-hoo...”","A few of her friends hurriedly tried to comfort her. “Rou Rou, don’t worry. Your sister is already an adult, so she’ll know how to take care of herself.”","“Besides, Fragrance Hotel is very safe. As long as she rings the service bell, the staff will definitely appear.”","Everyone knew clearly in their hearts that Qiao Xi had suddenly vanished and gone upstairs with an unfamiliar man. Hence, she was definitely...","Needless to say, this Qiao family’s eldest daughter was really embarrassing the family.","Qiao Rou bit her lip and looked pitiful. “It’s all my fault. I didn’t look after my sister just now. If something happens to her, how will I be able to continue living? Boo-hoo...”","“You’re looking for Qiao Xi?” At this moment, a man walked over.","Xu Mei’s eyes lit up. This man was President Qian’s secretary.","In order to act out this scene well, they needed someone else to testify. Hence, Xu Mei had already bribed President Qian’s secretary and told him what to do. When the time came, Qiao Xi would not be able to deny it in front of everyone!","President Qian’s secretary was already waiting for this group of people to go upstairs. He did not know that something had happened to President Qian.","“Miss Qiao Xi left with President Qian. How could something have happened to them?”","The secretary smiled meaningfully, and everyone instantly fell silent.","Although the secretary did not say it, everyone understood what he meant.","Tears trickled down Qiao Rou’s face. “Don’t spout nonsense! How could Sister be with President Qian?! Sister... Sister wouldn’t do such a thing. How could she be with President Qian...”","She pretended to be pleading for Qiao Xi’s defense, her eyes filled with helplessness.","The secretary retorted loudly, “You mean to say that I’m lying? Miss Qiao Xi and President Qian have been together for a long time. She even said that she wants to marry President Qian. After meeting him at the banquet this time, she couldn’t wait to get a room with him.”","Everyone gasped. This was such explosive news!","Moreover, President Qian’s secretary made it sound so convincing...","Although President Qian was not good-looking and was quite old, he was indeed rich and powerful. Qiao Xi must have taken a fancy to his money.","However, Qiao Xi was the eldest daughter of the Qiao family, after all. She did not look like she was lacking in money. Why did she have to marry President Qian?","Suddenly, Qiao Rou covered her face and cried. “That’s impossible... Boo-hoo, my sister wouldn’t do such a thing. Dad, it’s all your fault. If you hadn’t frozen my sister’s card, she wouldn’t be lacking money. Although she did something wrong, you can’t do this to her. It’s too much!”","Qiao Zhenguo’s face was instantly filled with sorrow and regret. “That child spent a fortune. I just wanted to teach her a lesson. I didn’t expect that I would force her to take the wrong path. It’s all my fault!”","Everyone instantly understood. So that was how it was. Qiao Xi did not have a source of money right now, so she had to rely on President Qian.","It was just that Qiao Xi was so anxious to get a room with President Qian at Qin An’s Fragrance Hotel. Was she not taking Qin An seriously?","They could not help but look at Qin An. He looked rather calm.."]},{"number":231,"title":"Chapter 231 - Severing Relations?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Zhenguo gritted his teeth and decided to uphold justice.","“My eldest daughter has always been naughty and mischievous. She has caused trouble again this time. I’ll take her away now and go home to discipline her! However, President Qin, can you come with me? After all, I’ve disturbed you when I can’t afford to. I just want to save my daughter!”","Qin An sneered in his heart. If he had not known about the Qiao family’s scheme, he would have really thought that Qiao Zhenguo was a good father.","Thinking of the scene later, Qin An could not wait any longer. However, he said calmly, “Alright.”","Qiao Rou and Xu Mei were extremely excited.","They would see how Qiao Xi was thinking of escaping this time. If this matter blew up, the Qiao family’s shareholders would definitely not support her anymore.","Everyone hurried to the door of the suite. There seemed to be voices of a man and a woman inside the suite, making everyone gasp.","Xu Mei tugged on Qiao Zhenguo and seemed to be in a dilemma. “Old Qiao, Xi Xi must really like President Qian, which is why she lost her cool. It’s reasonable for them to be in a relationship. Don’t teach Xi Xi a lesson in front of everyone...”","“If I don’t teach her a lesson, how can she learn? Think about it! My entire life has been ruined by this daughter of mine. This time, she actually dares to seduce a man at a banquet. She’s simply throwing our Qiao family’s reputation to the ground!","“I’ll call my lawyer now and cut all ties with her!”","Everyone quickly tried to persuade him. Qiao Zhenguo held his chest and looked disappointed. “Her mother was like this back then. I wanted to teach her a good lesson, but I didn’t expect...”","“Dad! You’re cutting ties with me?”","At this moment, Qiao Xi suddenly pushed open the door of the suite and slowly stuck her head out, feeling slightly surprised. “Oh! Everyone’s here! What’s with the commotion?”","Everyone sized up Qiao Xi and scoffed when they saw that she only opened the door by a crack. They also heard a man’s voice inside.","Qiao Zhenguo was angry as he shouted, “Qiao Xi! What are you doing here? Open the door!”","Qiao Xi looked at everyone innocently with a helpless expression. “I don’t think so.”","Her nonchalant look infuriated Qiao Zhenguo.","Everyone also started criticizing her. “Miss Qiao, your parents are doing this for your own good. You did such an embarrassing thing at a banquet. Hurry up and admit your mistake.”","“Even if it’s for money, you can’t degrade yourself like this. You’re really embarrassing the Qiao family!”","Xu Mei was overjoyed.","Qiao Xi was bound to be her daughter’s stepping stone. She would never be able to make a comeback.","It would not be long before Qiao Xi was tortured to death by President Qian and went to hell to see her mother.","Xu Mei pretended to be sad and wiped her tears. “Forget it. Although Xi Xi isn’t my biological daughter, I’ve always treated her as such. Even so...”","Qiao Zhenguo’s expression was gloomy. “Qiao Xi, why aren’t you opening the door? What are you doing?”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up. “Are you sure you want me to open the door?”","Qiao Zhenguo was afraid that President Qian would not admit that he had slept with Qiao Xi, so he brought everyone here to catch them in the act. After the matter blew up, for the sake of his reputation, President Qian could only admit his relationship with Qiao Xi and marry her.","At this moment, he was a little impatient. “What’s wrong? You’ve done something shameful, so why are you afraid of others finding out? Hurry up and come out!”","Qiao Xi frowned. “But...”","Xu Mei’s scoundrel friend snorted. “Miss Qiao, don’t you want us to see what’s in the room? You’re just a child without a mother. How dare you mess around on such an important occasion?!”","“Her reputation has always been bad, so it’s not strange for her to do such a thing!”","“President Qiao! You have a clean family background. How did you give birth to such a daughter? You should educate her. If news of this gets out, it’ll ruin the Qiao family’s reputation.”","Qiao Zhenguo burned with rage. Even though this was all his plan, flames of rage arose in his heart when he thought of Qiao Xi ruining the Qiao family’s reputation.","At the thought of this, Qiao Zhenguo could not suppress his anger anymore and pulled the door open fiercely.","“What exactly have you done? You’re still hiding—”","!!","Qiao Zhenguo immediately choked and was dumbfounded.","Everyone rushed in and looked at the bed in the bedroom. The bed was empty and neat. There were no special traces at all.","In the living area, three people were sitting together with poker cards on the table."]},{"number":232,"title":"Chapter 232 - Disturbing Three Major Figures","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Yao was holding the poker card, his eyes filled with excitement. “I’ll definitely win this round, just admit defeat!”","However, Gu Yao turned around and looked at everyone in confusion. “Qiao Xi, what’s going on? Why did they rush in?”","The other two people were clearly aware of Qiao Xi’s plan, and they were smiling.","One of them was Zhou Guanjin. Qiao Xi had long notified him and asked him to bring a friend over to set this up.","They were having fun when they were interrupted. Hence, they stood up and said unhappily, “President Qiao, what are you doing? Why does it feel like you’re here to catch us in the act or something?”","Among the four of them, Gu Yao was the only one who did not know anything. He asked in confusion, “Are you guys crazy?! What does it have to do with you if I’m playing cards in the suite? We’re playing cards with Qiao Xi, but you’re not happy with that? You’re crazy!”","Qiao Zhenguo looked embarrassed, and his heart was in a mess.","Where was President Qian?","Gu Yao and Zhou Guanjin were in the room. Where did President Qian go?","Everyone looked at each other in confusion.","Xu Mei and Qiao Rou panicked as they looked for President Qian.","Xu Mei had seen President Qian enter with her own eyes. How did he disappear so suddenly?","President Qian should have started torturing this b*tch, Qiao Xi, the moment he entered the door. Why was Qiao Xi playing cards with Gu Yao instead?","Everyone laughed awkwardly. They did not dare to offend Second Young Master Gu, so they all lowered their heads.","Gu Yao was the second young master of the Gu family, and Zhou Guanjin was the heir to the Zhou family. The other person was not ordinary either. She was Qin Shuwan, the daughter of the Qin family.","Any one of these three people could arouse reverence in the hearts of everyone. Why were they suddenly gathered here together to play cards? Moreover, they were sitting together with Qiao Xi?","At this moment, Qiao Xi should be sleeping with President Qian. Moreover, President Qian’s secretary had said that he saw Qiao Xi and President Qian enter the room together. The two of them were very close.","Zhou Guanjin put down his cards with a disappointed look on his face. He swept his cold gaze across the crowd.","“President Qiao, can’t we play cards with our friends? Qiao Xi is just playing cards with us. She didn’t commit any crime. Why did I hear that you want to cut ties with her?”","Gu Yao frowned as well. “I’m really impressed! I’m having a good time here but why did you rush in? I paid for the room, but you’re still calling the shots here? You’re so free, huh?”","Qin Shuwan was Zhou Guanjin’s friend and was only dragged over to play along with him.","Although Zhou Guanjin did not tell her what was going on, she immediately understood what was going on.","The Qiao family had come up with a scheme and wanted to catch Qiao Xi in the act. They wanted to ruin Qiao Xi’s reputation and force her to leave the company.","She stood up slowly and said casually, “President Qiao, you seemed to be looking for someone when you rushed in. Don’t tell me you think Xi Xi did something wrong?”","Qiao Zhenguo trembled in fear.","He really did not expect to see these three big shots instead of President Qian when he rushed in.","Xu Mei was angered to the point of stomping her feet. Not only had she not embarrassed Qiao Xi this time, but she had even caused trouble for herself.","She smiled obsequiously. “You’re thinking too much. We were just afraid that she would be in danger, so we came to look for her. Our Old Qiao is a little impatient, but he’s also worried about Xi Xi.”","Xu Mei’s words were reasonable, and everyone heaved a sigh of relief. They felt that the three of them would not pursue the matter.","However, Qin Shuwan sneered in front of her and glanced at her. “Who are you?”","The smile on Xu Mei’s face froze. “I’m from Zhenguo...”","“Oh, you’re President Qiao’s mistress, right?” Qin Shuwan suddenly realized what was going on and chuckled. “You’re just a mistress. You have no right to speak on such an occasion. Qiao Xi is the eldest daughter of the Qiao family and the daughter of the legitimate wife. You should call her Miss Qiao.”","Xu Mei immediately choked as her expression darkened.","Qiao Rou bit her lip tightly. She knew that these three great figures were all on Qiao Xi’s side, and their faces were filled with resentment.","In the future, after she married Brother Moling and became the mistress of the Gu family, she would see how arrogant they could be!","Qiao Zhenguo’s face was livid but he still forced an awkward smile.","“I-I saw that Qiao Xi went missing, so I was afraid that she would get lost. Hence, I brought some people over to look for her. It’s nothing serious.","“It seems Xi Xi is very safe now, so we won’t disturb you anymore. Please continue.”","Qiao Zhenguo cursed Qiao Xi in his heart, but he did not dare show it on his face.."]},{"number":233,"title":"Chapter 233 - Madam Xu Sure Has Good Tricks","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Zhenguo’s expression was gloomy. Qiao Xi had clearly called these three people over to make him look bad.","He thought that it would end like this, but Zhou Guanjin suddenly stood up. “Wait! President Qiao, don’t leave yet!”","“This matter won’t end so easily!”","Everyone gasped.","Zhou Guanjin’s expression was serious. “I just heard President Qiao, Madam Qiao, and Miss Qiao Rou say that Qiao Xi did something shameful. They say that her reputation is bad and she has ruined the Qiao family’s image. Is the Qiao family worthy of having Qiao Xi ruin your image?”","Qiao Zhenguo’s face was livid, and his body was trembling slightly.","Zhou Guanjin’s voice was cold. “Qiao Xi was only playing cards with us yet she got scolded. Since that’s the case, we naturally won’t feel good about it. Am I wrong, President Qiao?”","Qin Shuwan sneered. “Why don’t you guys just say that I’m Qiao Xi’s sugar mommy?”","Qiao Zhenguo broke out in a cold sweat. “Y-You’ve misunderstood. I only listened to others...”","“In other words, all of you suspect that Qiao Xi is being kept by someone and went upstairs to get a room with that guy?”","Zhou Guanjin smiled sinisterly, then looked at Qiao Xi. “Xi Xi, you’re the Qiao family’s eldest daughter! A mistress is about to climb all over your head and she even brought people here to catch you in the act! She’s so anxious to frame you. Madam Xu sure has good tricks!”","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes, her face filled with grievances. “Sigh, I can’t do anything about it. Dad only has eyes for Aunt and Sister. I thought that everything would be fine after I left home, but I never expected that they would still not let me off!”","Xu Mei and Qiao Rou widened their eyes with a trace of ruthlessness.","Qiao Zhenguo’s mind was blank. He did not dare to retort Zhou Guanjin and could only listen obediently.","However, he could not allow Qiao Xi to exaggerate the situation!","Qiao Zhenguo watched his wife and daughter silently cry. He was instantly infuriated. “Qiao Xi! I misunderstood you this time, but this matter has nothing to do with your aunt and sister. How can you say that? They didn’t believe that you would do such a thing!”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. “Oh?”","Qiao Zhenguo suppressed his anger. “Young Master Zhou, Young Master Gu, Miss Qin, it was actually President Qian’s secretary who misled us. That’s why I said I wanted to sever ties with Xi Xi.","“Earlier, Xu Mei and Rou Rou had been speaking up for Xi Xi. Xu Mei even begged for leniency for Xi Xi, but she slandered Xu Mei. Everyone says that it’s difficult to be a stepmother. That’s indeed the case. Xu Mei has done so much for her, but she doesn’t know how to be grateful at all. She even slandered her stepmother! She’s really vicious!”","Qin An was speechless.","Qiao Zhenguo was really good at distorting the facts.","In his eyes, no matter how much Little Six had been bullied and slandered, she should just let the matter rest. If she said anything, it would mean that she did not know how to be grateful.","Xu Mei sobbed. “Xi Xi, I know you hate me. I understand, but I...","“Haven’t I been good enough to you? In order not to make you sad, I never held a wedding with your father. Rou Rou has been called an illegitimate daughter since she was young. Whenever there’s anything good in the family, she always thinks of you. Rou Rou can only pick up your leftovers. Rou Rou and I are like your servants. We serve you tea, respect you, and love you, but you’re still not satisfied!","“I really didn’t do this. It was President Qian’s secretary who said that he saw you getting a room with President Qian. I even said that you wouldn’t do such a thing, but... You actually think that I’ve wronged you! Boo-hoo... I really can’t clear my name!”","Just then, President Qian’s secretary was escorted over by the bodyguards. His face was pale from fear. “I saw Miss Qiao and President Qian get a room together with my own eyes. What I said... is true. It was not... instructed by Madam Xu.”","Xu Mei sighed. “Xi Xi, now you know. This has nothing to do with me.","“If you think that I’m framing you, I have nothing to say. I’m used to you holding a grudge against me...”","Qiao Rou, who was at the side, cried out in grievance.","Everyone tried to persuade Qiao Xi. “Miss Qiao, it’s just a misunderstanding. It has nothing to do with Madam Qiao.”","“You can’t malign her just because she’s your stepmother!”"]},{"number":234,"title":"Chapter 234 - You Booked The Suite!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Xu Mei hurriedly stopped them. “Forget it, don’t say anymore. It doesn’t matter what Xi Xi thinks, so all of you don’t have to blame her anymore.”","“Only Madam Xu can take it lying down. She’s too kind!”","“If it weren’t for the fear that Qiao Xi would be sad, it would be impossible for her to not hold a wedding for so many years. This Eldest Miss Qiao is too willful!”","Xu Mei was overjoyed when she heard everyone’s criticisms. Although she had not seen Qiao Xi and President Qian getting intimate with each other with her own eyes, this incident still gave Qiao Xi the reputation of being willful, naughty, and callous.","Her acting was not in vain.","She smiled bitterly. “Everyone, disperse. Hurry up and attend the banquet. We can’t delay President Qin’s work because of our Qiao family’s private matters.”","“Madam Xu.”","Meanwhile, Qiao Xi, who was being criticized by everyone, spoke slowly.","Her eyes were cold. “I’m sorry, but this matter won’t end so easily.”","Xu Mei had an innocent look on her face. “Xi Xi, what exactly do you want?”","“You’re right. Actually, President Qian was indeed in this suite before this.”","Qiao Xi’s words surprised everyone. She said slowly, “President Qian said that my parents sold me to him!”","Qiao Zhenguo: “!!”","Everyone was dumbfounded. What was going on?","In that case, President Qian’s secretary was not lying?","Qiao Xi continued, “After that, Young Master Gu, Young Master Zhou, and Miss Qin rushed over to save me. Only then did I escape. Dad, did you sell me to President Qian?”","Qiao Zhenguo abruptly looked up and found everyone’s disgusted gazes on him.","“Xi Xi, don’t listen to President Qian’s nonsense. I’m your biological father. How could I sell you to him? He must have found a random reason!”","“Ah! You must be right.” Qiao Xi had a helpless expression.","“But how did President Qian know that I was here? He even had the card to this suite. Who on earth gave him one?","“And I’m here to attend the banquet. Dad and Madam Xu, you guys said that the banquet wouldn’t be starting for a long time, so you pulled me upstairs to rest. That’s why I was waiting here.","“However, the moment I entered, the room was locked. After a while, President Qian pushed the door open and came in. He even wanted to do something to me. So after I was saved, I went to investigate...”","Xu Mei instantly became nervous when she heard Qiao Xi’s words.","She hurriedly interrupted Qiao Xi and said agitatedly, “Xi Xi, I saw that you were a little weak earlier, so I asked you to go upstairs and rest...”","She shifted her eyes. “You must have accidentally lost your room card. President Qian happened to pick it up and followed you in.”","Qiao Xi neither agreed nor disagreed. “You may be right, but...”","She dragged her last word and glanced at Xu Mei coldly. It was too fun to see her nervous and guilty expression.","“Madam Xu, have you forgotten that you booked this suite?!”","Xu Mei’s face turned pale!","“You brought me here, gave President Qian a room card, and brought everyone here to catch us in the act. How exciting, huh?”","Clap! Clap!","Qiao Xi slowly clapped.","Xu Mei’s expression was extremely ugly.","Zhou Guanjin sneered. “So the person who booked the suite is Madam Xu!”","“Xi Xi was brought to the room by Madam Xu and President Qiao before she was locked up. Even the cameras have captured it. Later, President Qian took the room card and came to this suite. It’s really puzzling!”","Qiao Xi said aggrievedly, “Madam Xu, you said that this has nothing to do with you, but why did you force me to go upstairs? President Qian happened to come in soon after that. Isn’t this too much of a coincidence...","“Did you sell me to President Qian and use me to exchange for his resources? Did you want me to get lost from the Qiao family forever so that I won’t appear in front of you and your daughter again?”","Xu Mei’s face was pale. She was so nervous that her entire body was trembling.","Qiao Xi was talking nonsense!","She was slandering her stepmother by saying these things in public!","Everyone looked at Xu Mei suspiciously. She lowered her head guiltily.","“Stop talking!”","Qiao Zhenguo spoke abruptly, his expression terrifyingly dark.","“You’re my daughter! How could Xu Mei and I do such a thing? This is the end of the matter.. It’s fine that you’ve wronged Xu Mei, but don’t let our Qiao family’s private matters interfere with the banquet.”"]},{"number":235,"title":"Chapter 235 - Pretending To Be Unconscious Again","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Rou shed tears aggrievedly. “Sister, how can you say that about Mom? Don’t you know how she has treated you all these years? If you frame her like this, how is she going to face others in the future? Just take it as I’m begging you, alright?”","Xu Mei nodded.","Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with coldness.","All these years, even when Xu Mei’s evil plan was exposed, Qiao Zhenguo would unconditionally side with that woman and even ask her to let the matter rest.","Was someone like him worthy of being a father?","At this moment, Gu Yao slowly spoke.","“The surveillance cameras won’t lie. Since you insist on saying the same thing, let’s check the surveillance cameras and see if it was Xu Mei who gave the room card to President Qian.”","Qiao Zhenguo’s heart trembled as he hurriedly said, “Forget it, I don’t want to pursue the matter anymore. The Qiao family is the one who blew up the matter and embarrassed themselves. Moreover, it’s impossible for Xu Mei to have done this. Xi Xi, what do you think?”","Xu Mei’s scoundrel friend chimed in, “That’s right, how could Xu Mei do such a thing? It’s Qiao Xi who wrongly accused her and fabricated the story!”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. There was a new lackey now?","She clapped her hands as a staff member walked in and turned on the computer in the suite.","“Miss Qiao, it’s ready.”","Qiao Zhenguo’s heart suddenly thumped. He was just about to talk when Qiao Xi slowly spoke.","“Everyone thinks that I’m in the wrong, and even my dad thinks so. In that case, I have to prove my innocence, lest you wrongly accuse a good person! Let’s begin!”","As soon as she finished speaking, the staff member played the surveillance video.","Xu Mei clenched her fists nervously, her heart thumping. She quickly rushed over to stop the staff member. “Stop! Stop right now! Who allowed you to play the video?!”","A few bodyguards quickly subdued her, letting her scream.","The staff member played the video of the surveillance footage.","The person in the video was Xu Mei. She was talking on the phone with a flattering smile on her face.","“President Qian, she’s waiting for you in the suite. She’ll definitely serve you well. I’ll send the room card over later.","“This eldest daughter of mine doesn’t have any other merit except that she’s good-looking and knows how to serve others...","“I’ll give Qiao Xi to you. In the future, the Qiao family’s business will depend on you. Take good care of Rou Rou!”","Xu Mei had a sinister look on her face.","She was using Qiao Xi as a stepping stone to pave the way for Qiao Rou. Her expression was truly nauseating.","One could hear a pin drop.","Xu Mei stopped struggling. Her eyes were empty as her legs went limp.","How did Qiao Xi have this surveillance footage?","How could they let outsiders see the surveillance footage of Fragrance Hotel?","Xu Mei forced herself to calm down. She would not confess until the last moment.","She pinched her thigh and squeezed out a few tears. She said very sorrowfully, “Xi Xi, in order to accuse me, you actually fabricated the truth! I did make a call, but I didn’t say those words. You must have gotten someone to dub the voice recording!","“Xi Xi, I’ve been tolerating you for so many years, so why won’t you let me off? What have I done to you?”","Xu Mei clutched her chest in sorrow. Then, her body went limp and she collapsed onto the floor.","She insisted that Qiao Xi had fabricated the truth before fainting from grief. No matter how Qiao Xi tried to explain herself, it would all be in vain.","Qiao Rou rushed over anxiously. “Mom! Wake up! Sister, you know that Mom’s health isn’t good, yet you still want to malign her. Are you trying to anger her to death?”","Qiao Xi was so angry that she laughed. Xu Mei’s act of pretending to be unconscious was really effective every time!","“Hey! Call an ambulance if she’s fainted. Why are you shouting at me?”","The staff member immediately took out their phone and called the ambulance.","Qiao Zhenguo’s expression was gloomy as he roared, “Qiao Xi! Are you done?”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to sweep him with her gaze but did not say anything.","Qiao Zhenguo roared. “You fabricated the surveillance footage to frame your stepmother. She has already fainted. What else do you want? Even if you were framed today, you can’t anger your stepmother like this. You’re being unfilial!”","Ignoring the fact that everyone was present, he berated loudly, “You’ve simply disgraced our Qiao family! Hurry up and get lost!”"]},{"number":236,"title":"Chapter 236 - Repeat What You Just Said","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","They came to attend the banquet today because they wanted Qiao Rou to take this opportunity to build a good relationship with the eldest miss of Fragrance Hotel, yet Qiao Xi had ruined this opportunity!","The entire venue was silent.","At this moment, Qiao Rou’s eyes were filled with tears. “Dad, since Sister doesn’t welcome us, I’ll take Mom and we’ll leave the family!”","Qiao Zhenguo looked at his daughter who had been wronged and was instantly infuriated. “Qiao Xi! You edited this video! Are you going to force your sister and stepmother to die? You’re really vicious!","“You scourge! You’re a jinx! Why can’t you be as sensible and gentle as your younger sister? Get out of the Qiao family immediately!”","“President Qiao.”","Suddenly, Qin An said with a sneer, “I’ve been listening for a long time. Why are you getting more and more confused?”","He slowly walked in front of Qiao Zhenguo and said in a cold tone, “It seems that Qiao Xi was framed. Why did you ask her to swallow her anger? And why are you scolding her so fiercely?”","“President Qin, don’t blame my dad. He’s just...” Qiao Rou explained hurriedly. Her eyes were red and she looked very aggrieved.","Qin An waved his hand. “Miss Qiao Rou, I’m not talking to you. Please shut up, but what you just said makes sense.”","Qiao Rou was originally disappointed. However, when she heard the last sentence, her eyes lit up.","Qin An was affirming her words. From the looks of it, there was a chance. Had he taken a liking to her?","Qiao Rou showed a shy expression. “President Qin, actually, I...”","“You said that you should leave the Qiao family with Xu Mei immediately. That makes sense, so I think it’s a good idea.”","Qin An said slowly, “Xu Mei is a mistress who destroyed someone else’s family. You have also inherited my mother’s bad habit. You stole someone else’s boyfriend. You should indeed get lost.”","Qiao Rou’s lips were pale as her body trembled. Her face was filled with disbelief.","Qiao Zhenguo hurriedly explained, “President Qin, Xu Mei was framed. Qiao Rou only said that for the sake of her health. They shouldn’t be the ones leaving. They’re too gentle and kind-hearted...","“Qiao Xi is putting painstaking efforts to chase them away. This is all her fault and has nothing to do with Xu Mei and her daughter!”","Qiao Zhenguo was making things worse. Everyone looked at him suspiciously.","Qiao Xi crossed her arms. “Dad, do you really think so? So it turns out that I’m such a person in your eyes!”","“Traitor! How dare you lie about the truth?! Shut up! Go home-”","Qiao Zhenguo was still roaring angrily, but before he could finish, Qin An interrupted him.","“President Qiao, I think it’s necessary for me to tell you that I was the one who gave the video to Qiao Xi.”","...","Qiao Zhenguo instantly choked, and his face turned livid.","His eyes were filled with shock, and his entire body was trembling. It was as if he had been struck by lightning.","“President Qin, you... Impossible...”","“Why? Are you saying that I lied?” Qin An raised his eyebrows. “If you don’t believe me, we can call the police. I believe someone can prove that the video is real.”","“Impossible! This... It must be fake...” The corners of Qiao Zhenguo’s mouth twitched as he stammered, “Xu Mei is gentle and kind. She, she...”","“Do you mean to say that you don’t believe in President Qin? If Second Young Master Gu and the other two hadn’t appeared, my life would’ve been ruined. You didn’t say anything to stand up for me but were helping Xu Mei escape punishment. Could it be that you were also involved in the framing this time? You wanted to ruin your own daughter?”","Qiao Xi’s words made Qiao Zhenguo’s face grow paler and paler when he heard them.","He never expected that Qiao Xi would be able to say such words, and he was instantly infuriated to the point of stomping his feet. “Bastard! Shut up! You still dare to slander me? You’re as heartless as that damned mother of yours!”","Qiao Xi’s gaze turned cold.","Qiao Zhenguo was infuriated and said without thinking, “This matter ends here. Don’t pursue the matter anymore, otherwise...”","“President Qiao, are you threatening me?” Qin An’s eyes were deep.","Qiao Zhenguo instantly choked and swallowed the words in his mouth. The next second, a cold weapon appeared above his head with the muzzle of the pistol pressed against his forehead.","Everyone screamed in shock and fled in all directions.","Qiao Zhenguo was so scared that he broke out in a cold sweat. “P-President Qin...”","“President Qiao, why don’t you repeat what you just said?” Qin An’s voice was low."]},{"number":237,"title":"Chapter 237 - Pushed Into A Dead-end","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Zhenguo was so scared that his face was pale. His voice was trembling. “President Qiao, I’m sorry. I... I shouldn’t have disturbed your dinner, but this incident happened because of Qiao Xi. I...”","“Heh.”","Qin An sneered and played with the pistol. His finger was on the trigger. “It seems that only a bullet can make you understand!”","“P-President Qin, calm down. How did I offend you? Please tell me.”","Qin An smirked. “You’re probably here to meet Fragrance Hotel’s eldest miss, right?”","“Do you know who Eldest Miss is?”","Qiao Zhenguo shook his head in confusion.","In fact, he had never heard of such a person before, but since Qin An had said so, he must have seen her before.","Who could it be?","Their family had indeed come to see the eldest miss, but why did Qin An mention it at this moment?","If it weren’t for that bastard Qiao Xi, how could things have ended up like this?","She would rather die than sleep with President Qian!","Qiao Zhenguo’s body trembled as an idea suddenly appeared in his mind.","He widened his eyes and looked at Qiao Xi in horror.","Qiao Xi crossed her arms across her chest with a calm expression. She was not shocked at all when she saw Qin An take out a pistol.","Everyone was scared out of their wits when they saw the pistol. She was the only one who looked calm as if she was not surprised at all.","Thoughts crept into Qiao Zhenguo’s mind like vines.","“President Qiao, do you understand now?”","Qin An put down the pistol in his hand. “In that case, why did you allow Xu Mei to frame her? Are you looking down on Fragrance Hotel?”","Everyone carefully ruminated over Qin An’s words. Xu Mei framed Qiao Xi while Qin An was standing up for Qiao Xi.","In other words, Qiao Xi was Qin An’s younger sister, the eldest miss of Fragrance Hotel?","“Qiao Xi went missing when she was young. She might have been adopted by the Qin family, so...”","“The Qiao family abandoned Qiao Xi back then. Who would have thought that she would benefit from a disaster and become the daughter of the Qin family?!”","Qiao Zhenguo broke out in a cold sweat when he heard everyone’s words.","His legs turned weak as he staggered and knelt on the floor. He looked up in horror—","Qiao Xi was actually Qin An’s younger sister? The eldest miss of Fragrance Hotel?","However, Qiao Xi grew up in the countryside. She did not have enough to eat, had no clothes, and didn’t even have warmth. How did she meet the Qin family?","Qiao Rou and Xu Mei’s faces turned deathly pale.","How could Qiao Xi be so lucky to have actually become the eldest miss of the Qin family?","Everyone discussed in low voices. “In that case, President Qiao brought Qiao Rou here to apologize but they offended Eldest Miss again!”","“In order to compete for the Qiao family’s assets, Xu Mei plotted to frame Qiao Xi. Unexpectedly, Qiao Xi has Qin An as her backer...”","“I heard that Qiao Rou is very favored in the Qiao family as though she’s the true daughter of a rich family. Qiao Xi is worse than a servant in the Qiao family.”","“Now it would seem that Qiao Xi is countless times stronger than Qiao Rou. She’s the daughter of the Qin family, so the Qiao family is nothing in her eyes!”","“Qiao Rou has been pretending all this time. Look at her, she finally can’t pretend anymore. Her expression is so ugly!”","Instantly, everyone kicked the people who were down!","Qiao Xi had the Qin family to back her up. Even if she made a mistake today, no one would say anything about it.","Qin An’s tone was gentle. “Little Six... Xi Xi, what do you want to do with them?”","Qiao Zhenguo was about to speak when he was interrupted by Qiao Xi. “Dad, you don’t think that I’ll let this matter go, do you? You’ve been wrongly accusing me all this while, and Xu Mei even schemed to frame me. Could it be that you want me to swallow my anger?”","Qin An instantly understood. “If one does something wrong, one will be punished. Why don’t I kill you?","“All of you have repeatedly made things difficult for Xi Xi. I think there’s no need for any of you to be around any longer.”","With that said, Qin An raised his pistol and aimed it at Qiao Zhenguo’s forehead.","“President Qin, please let me off! I was blind! Xu Mei... Xu Mei! Apologize quickly!”","Qiao Zhenguo was so scared that he pissed his pants.","At that moment, he no longer had any dignity. He knelt on the floor and begged for Qin An’s forgiveness.","This was because he knew very well that this was Qin An’s territory. Killing him would be like crushing an ant.","Qiao Zhenguo rushed to Xu Mei’s side and shook her crazily.. Seeing that she did not react, he grabbed her hair and forced her to kowtow to Qin An."]},{"number":238,"title":"Chapter 238 - Every Dog Has Its Day","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Bang! Bang! Xu Mei instantly felt dizzy and she gritted her teeth in hatred.","It was all Qiao Xi’s fault!","Who would have thought that she would be so lucky? She had even climbed up the ladder by clinging to Qin An. In the future, wouldn’t Qiao Xi trample on the two of them?","“A mistress still dares to frame the legitimate daughter? Qiao Zhenguo is really muddle-headed. He actually helped his mistress harm his own daughter?”","“President Qian is an old hoodlum. Xu Mei sold Qiao Xi to him to torture her to death!”","The crowd’s criticisms reached Xu Mei’s ears. She could no longer pretend and abruptly opened her eyes.","Qiao Xi slowly walked in front of Xu Mei, bent down, and said softly in her ear, “You hate me to death, right? But you don’t dare to touch me. You even have to kowtow and apologize to me because Qin An is protecting me!”","Xu Mei and Qiao Rou glared at her fiercely.","A scene suddenly flashed past their minds.","More than ten years ago, when Qiao Xi was chased out by them, Xu Mei had stood in front of her and forced her to kneel.","‘Little b*tch! You hate me to death, right? Unfortunately, the Qiao family will belong to me and my daughter in the future, while you have to stay in the countryside for the rest of your life. You might die there before you reach adulthood!","‘Don’t waste your effort. No one in the Qiao family can save you. Your father knows everything that I’ve done. The old madam loves Rou Rou and won’t care about you. You’d better die outside and never return to the Qiao family again!’","Qiao Xi had knelt on the ground and silently swore in her heart that sooner or later, she would make Xu Mei and her daughter kneel in front of her and beg for mercy.","After Xu Mei drove her away, she took Qiao Rou to enjoy everything that should rightfully belong to her and her mother. They even occupied all of her assets.","She did not care about returning to the Qiao family, but only by taking back everything that belonged to the Qiao family could she make Xu Mei and her daughter suffer.","The scene from more than ten years ago was still vivid in her mind. Qiao Xi’s eyes were deep. “Aunt Xu, every dog has its day. It has only been ten years but I’ve already made you guys kneel in front of me and beg me for mercy. Moreover, from today onward, all of you have to humble yourselves when you see me.","“All of you, remember to be more polite when you see me in the future. Otherwise, I can destroy you with just my finger!”","Xu Mei’s eyes widened in anger as her body trembled. Her breathing quickened, and she convulsed twice before fainting.","“Mom!”","“Xu Mei!” Qiao Zhenguo’s face was filled with sorrow. However, he could not do anything because Qin An’s pistol was still pressed against his forehead.","Qin An glanced at him in disdain and put down the pistol in his hand. “Carry her out! Don’t dirty my territory!”","Little Six had said that he did not want the Qiao family to die so easily, that she wanted them to suffer pain and torture, so he would spare their lives first.","There was still time...","In any case, since the Qiao family had found out about her identity, they would no longer dare to be disrespectful toward her. Whenever they saw her, they would have to kneel and kowtow to her.","How did they feel when they saw Qiao Xi, the person they had once looked down on, suddenly become the daughter of the Qin family?","Qiao Rou looked at the high and mighty Qiao Xi and gnashed her teeth in hatred.","No! It was not over yet!","She still had a chance!","Qin An was nothing. Her fiancé was the young master of the Gu family!","The Gu family was an existence that even Qin An did not dare to touch!","...","After the Qiao family was chased out of Fragrance Hotel, everyone dispersed.","Qiao Xi bade farewell to the others before leaving through the back door of Fragrance Hotel.","She was in a good mood today and definitely wanted to eat barbecue. Although she had not recovered her taste buds, she salivated when she thought about the sizzling meat.","Just as she was about to leave, she bumped into a hard chest.","Qiao Xi raised her eyes. “...”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes, his gaze deep. There was a cigarette between his fingers, and he extinguished it in one smooth action. He said softly, “Mrs. Gu, I’ve wronged you.”","At this moment, Qiao Xi’s thoughts vaguely sounded.","‘Why is this bastard Gu Zheng here? It must be Zhou Guanjin who told him! I want to eat barbecue! How can I eat if he’s here? Isn’t he the president? Why is he so free every day? Does Gu Corporation have nothing to do? At this rate, they’ll go bankrupt sooner or later! If they go bankrupt, I won’t have money to eat barbecue anymore!’","Qiao Xi was silent for a moment before she said slowly, “Ah Zheng, you’re here to pick me up, right? I’m so happy you’re here!”"]},{"number":239,"title":"Chapter 239 - Theres Something Wrong With Mrs. Gu","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng remained composed as the corners of his mouth twitched lazily.","Qiao Xi instantly felt her hair stand on end.","‘What is this bastard smiling about?! He’s scaring me to death!’","Gu Zheng put an arm around her waist and went to the lounge. He sat on the sofa and asked casually, “Are you hungry?”","Qiao Xi nodded abruptly. She wanted to eat barbecue and spicy food, but Gu Zheng would definitely not let her. Moreover, he might not even let her kiss him. Hence, she smiled obsequiously and said, “Ah Zheng, you decide. I’ll listen to you!”","Gu Zheng chuckled. “Then... let’s have a barbecue.”","Qiao Xi nodded lightly, then her entire body suddenly froze.","Wait, did she hear wrongly?","How did Gu Zheng know that she wanted to eat barbecue? Even in her dreams, she had been dreaming of eating barbecue.","She even wondered if Gu Zheng could read her mind. How could he guess what she wanted to eat?","Qiao Xi was excited to the point of almost jumping up and down. She was on the verge of crying from joy.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were full of smiles.","Mrs. Gu was so cute. It was actually very easy to make her happy!","The man straightened his body and cleared his throat, waiting for Mrs. Gu’s response.","After calming down, Qiao Xi found it a little strange. Gu Zheng had never liked barbecue. Why would he suddenly say he wanted to eat barbecue?","Gu Zheng sat there with his eyes narrowed.","‘He doesn’t like smoky environments and finds it very unhygienic. Previously when I said that I wanted to eat barbecue, he would always refuse without hesitation.’","She propped her chin and thought about it carefully. Suddenly, she came to a realization.","‘Could it be...’","Gu Zheng curled his lips. Was Mrs. Gu very touched? She knew that he did not like barbecue, but he was still willing to go for her sake.","The president, who had always been cold, felt that he was making his feelings very obvious. Mrs. Gu would definitely love him more.","Qiao Xi suddenly looked at him.","‘Could it be that he has bought over a barbecue chain and wants to bring me to taste the food? Is Gu Corporation involved in such a wide range of businesses nowadays? He even wants to venture into barbecue restaurants?’","Gu Zheng: “...”","He was speechless.","Mrs. Gu was indeed crazy. He would have to bring her to the hospital someday.","However, no matter what the reason was, she was already thankful that she could eat barbecue.","She pulled Gu Zheng along and was about to leave when Gu Zheng suddenly stopped in his tracks. “Mrs. Gu.”","“What’s wrong?”","His expression was calm as he slowly lowered his head, his hot breath spraying on her face.","His cold voice was exceptionally gentle at this moment. “I almost forgot to kiss you.”","As soon as he finished speaking, he placed a hand on the back of her head and planted a gentle kiss on her soft lips.","Qiao Xi’s eyes widened as her mind went blank and her heart pounded violently.","What did this man mean? Was he kissing her to let her recover her taste buds, or was it just a kiss?","Why did he suddenly want to kiss her?","‘Holy sh*t! Is this bastard trying to seduce me?’","Hiss!","Gu Zheng bit her lip, and the stinging pain made her collect her thoughts.","At this moment, Gu Zheng’s eyes were burning. His hair fell across his forehead and hung lazily in front of his eyes, adding a trace of lingering and ambiguity.","Qiao Xi’s entire body was wobbly and soft. Her body leaned weakly against Gu Zheng’s body as if she could only steady herself by hugging him.","Gu Zheng was not satisfied with a single kiss. From being gentle at the start, he started becoming wanton and forceful. It was not until Qiao Xi began to struggle that the kiss ended.","A gentle kiss landed on her forehead and neck.","Qiao Xi’s thoughts were in a mess and she had completely lost her mind. She even forgot to breathe.","She gasped for breath and said, “Gu...”","Just then, an inappropriate voice interrupted her.","“Gu Zheng, I want to eat barbecue too! Bring me along!”","Gu Yao barged in and pushed open the door, smiling like a silly prodigal son of a rich family.","Gu Zheng: “...”","‘Tell me, how do you want to die?’","Although Gu Yao often fooled around outside, he was still an innocent boy. He had never been in a relationship and did not know what the two of them were doing just now.","The first thing he saw was Gu Zheng hugging Qiao Xi tightly. Qiao Xi’s eyes were like spring water, her lips were red, and her eyes even carried a trace of confusion?","Gu Yao said, “Qiao Xi, your lips are so red. You’re wearing lipstick? Don’t bother putting on makeup anymore, I’m starving. Let’s go eat barbecue!”","Qiao Xi: “...”","Gu Yao suddenly thought of something and frowned.."]},{"number":240,"title":"Chapter 240 - The Innocent Second Young Master Gu","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Zheng thought that this child was not too stupid. He knew that he had disturbed the couple, so he felt very sorry.","He had just been engrossed in kissing Mrs. Gu when he interrupted them. Now, he really wanted to beat this brat up!","Gu Zheng looked at Gu Yao coldly, waiting for him to get out of the lounge.","Unexpectedly, Gu Yao suddenly rushed over, pulled the two of them apart, and said earnestly, “It’s normal for couples to have conflicts. Gu Zheng, as a man, you should let her have things her way. You’re a good man, how could you hit her? Just look at how red her face is! Even her lips are red!”","Qiao Xi: “??”","It was really not easy for Gu Yao to have lived for so long.","Gu Zheng frowned.","Facing Gu Yao, he was really speechless!","He had always been cold and heartless. With just one look, everyone around him would tremble in fear. However, he could not do anything to these two people in front of him.","One of them was Qiao Xi, who was often stupid.","The other was the extremely naive Gu Yao.","Gu Yao sized up the two of them. Could it be that Gu Zheng was jealous because Qiao Xi had played cards with him, so they ended up fighting?","He was suddenly afraid and could not help but take a few steps back.","Gu Zheng was such a volatile person. Would he be jealous and beat him up?","He could not help it! He was indeed handsome and easy to misunderstand, but he would not lay a hand on Sister-in-law.","However, it seemed that the two of them were no longer angry and would not quarrel. He finally heaved a sigh of relief.","Gu Zheng asked Qiao Xi in a light voice, “Are we bringing him along?”","Although her first meeting with Gu Yao was not pleasant, Qiao Xi knew that although Gu Yao looked willful, he was not a bad person.","Back then, Gu Yao and Yao Mengqing went to Longwan Residential to find trouble with her because they thought that Gu Zheng was treating his childhood friend so coldly after getting married. Hence, they could not stand his behavior.","In his eyes, he had always thought that since Yao Mengqing was his good friend, he should stand up for her.","Hence, Second Young Master Gu was just too naive and silly. He was still very kind-hearted.","Qiao Xi replied, “Let’s go together.”","Gu Yao looked at them in confusion. Why did he suddenly feel so humble?","He was a ferocious profligate son in front of outsiders, but in the eyes of the couple, he was like a pet!","...","Gu Corporation was involved in a wide range of activities. They did have a chain barbecue shop, and the interior was luxuriously decorated.","The three of them had just gotten out of the car when Gu Yao saw a familiar person. He swallowed the words that were about to come out of his mouth.","Qiao Xi looked at him with slight doubt.","The familiar face was Yao Mengqing, but she and his sister-in-law were not on good terms, so the situation would be awkward.","Hence, he hesitated for a moment and shook his head. “It’s fine.”","It was better for Sister Mengqing to meet Gu Zheng less often. Otherwise, Sister-in-law and Gu Zheng would start fighting again.","Gu Yao retracted his gaze and followed Qiao Xi into the shop.","Yao Mengqing, who was in a corner, had already seen the three of them. She gritted her teeth in hatred.","At this moment, a man walked over. “Wasn’t Gu Yao very close to you previously?”","Yao Mengqing smiled bitterly. “That’s right, but not anymore. I don’t know what charm Qiao Xi has to make Gu Yao so close to her in just a few days!”","This b*tch had snatched Gu Zheng away and even roped Gu Yao in!","The fact that Gu Yao was her friend had helped make Yao Mengqing extremely successful in high society.","But now... Gu Yao even pretended not to see her and deliberately turned his face away. He took her as a stranger.","No! This could not go on!","The man snorted. “Who does she think she is? If you don’t like her, I’ll finish her off!”","She pretended to be sad. “Never mind, Cousin.”","“Then are you just going to let her be so arrogant?”","Yao Mengqing was helpless. “As long as she’s good to Gu Zheng, it’s alright even if I suffer.”","The man glared fiercely at Qiao Xi’s back view and gnashed his teeth. “Why should I let you suffer? I’ll take care of her for you!”","Yao Mengqing shook her head, and the two of them entered the shop as well.","...","Although Qiao Xi had lost the function of her taste buds, just the sight of barbecued meat was enough to whet her appetite.","However, it was Gu Zheng’s first time in a barbecue shop. Looking at the food covered with seasoning, he could not help but frown.","Gu Yao and Qiao Xi were eating happily, their faces full of happiness."]},{"number":241,"title":"Chapter 241 - Be Careful","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Brother, eat it!”","Gu Yao stuffed lamb skewers into his mouth while signaling to Gu Zheng.","Damn, did anyone not like barbecue?","Qiao Xi and Gu Yao ordered something on the menu, which was spicy as well. Looking at the bright red chili peppers, their fingers twitched.","However, Gu Zheng did not seem to be able to eat spicy food, so Qiao Xi ordered some non-spicy food for him.","Qiao Xi looked at the pile of food and felt that it was a little too bland. She did not have any appetite at all.","Just then, Song Shiyu walked over and whispered something in Gu Zheng’s ear before Gu Zheng followed him out.","When he returned, the table was already filled with food—","“The place Gu Zheng chose is really good! I’ve never eaten such high-end barbecue before. The meat is too tender! The ingredients are definitely good! Do you think it’s delicious?”","Gu Yao had just swallowed a bite when he stuffed more into his mouth hurriedly.","He handed Qiao Xi two sticks of kidney slices. “Some people might not be used to this taste, but I like it very much. The kidney slices here are too delicious. Quickly try them!”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow.","He had only been out for a while, yet the two of them were already so close?","The first time they met, they were still so hostile. Now that the three of them were sitting together, he seemed to be an outsider.","Gu Zheng sneered. “Gu Yao.”","Gu Yao looked up in confusion.","The man smiled. “Eat fewer kidney slices.”","Gu Yao said unhappily, “You’re not eating but you’re not letting others eat as well? Are you looking down on kidneys? I’ve been eating barbecue for so many years and eaten so many kidneys. I’ve never heard about them being bad for you. You never eat barbecue, so you have no right to speak!”","“I didn’t say that kidney slices are bad.” Gu Zheng looked at the internal organs and did not know how to eat them.","Then, he slowly said, “Kidneys are good a man’s sex drive. The problem is, is it even useful to you?”","Qiao Xi’s face was slightly red. “Cough, cough...”","Gu Yao looked at the two of them in confusion. What did this mean?","At this moment, Gu Zheng said casually, “If you want to eat internal organs, why don’t you eat pig’s hearts and pig’s brains to nourish your damaged brain?”","Qiao Xi clicked her tongue. How did Gu Yao live till now when he had such a terrifying brother?","His mouth was too vicious!","It was a wonder that Gu Yao was not autistic.","He stared blankly at Qiao Xi, then lowered his eyes to look at the dishes on the table. He had an expression as if he was facing death.","“Xi Xi, what do you want to eat? I’ll get it for you!”","Qiao Xi was about to refuse when Gu Yao handed the barbecued food to her. He gave her everything delicious and even personally poured her drinks. He even took a napkin to wipe her mouth.","Gu Zheng remained silent.","Song Shiyu was so anxious that he stomped his feet and said in a low voice, “President! Look! Second Young Master is your role model! You should be like him and take care of Young Madam!”","Gu Yao looked at Gu Zheng arrogantly.","‘Hmph! Fight me!’","Qiao Xi was already full, and she didn’t see any reaction from Gu Zheng. She had a puzzled expression.","‘Why isn’t Gu Zheng saying anything? Gu Yao is being so obvious yet he’s still indifferent?","‘Gu Yao is a good lad. Can’t Gu Zheng learn from his younger brother?’","When Gu Zheng heard her thoughts, the corners of his mouth twitched before he suddenly said, “Qiao Xi.”","Qiao Xi instinctively raised her eyes.","Gu Zheng’s words were shocking. “One is marked by the company one keeps. Be careful not to become as stupid as him.”","Song Shiyu immediately rolled his eyes, and his heart almost stopped from anger.","‘President! How can you say that about Young Madam?","‘You’re really a block of wood! Can’t you be a little more gentle?","‘With your temper, it’s really not easy for you to have gotten a wife. If this goes on, perhaps Young Madam will divorce you one day!’","Gu Yao was flustered. “Are you calling me stupid?”","Holy sh*t! Gu Zheng’s mouth was really vicious!","What had he done wrong that he had to suffer the torture of this husband and wife?","Gu Yao really wanted to curse, but he did not have the guts, so he swallowed the words in his heart.","At this moment, Qiao Xi was burning up from the spicy food and went to get a glass of iced orange juice.","Just as she was about to return with a glass, a woman ran into her in a hurry.","The glass in Qiao Xi’s hand slipped and fell to the floor, spilling orange juice everywhere."]},{"number":242,"title":"Chapter 242 - Enemies Are Bound To Meet","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Ah! My dress!”","The woman screamed fiercely, “Are you blind?! You spilled orange juice all over me. I just bought this dress. What do you think I should do now?”","Qiao Xi was forcefully slammed into the corner of the wall by her. A sharp pain swept through her entire body.","It was always the party at fault who was the first to complain.","However, when Qiao Xi saw that the woman’s white dress was stained with orange juice, she did not bicker with her. “How much is the dress? I’ll pay you.”","She had already agreed to compensate, but the woman snorted.","“Compensate? Can you afford it? Do you know that my dress is a limited edition? You can’t buy it now even if you wanted to. Is there a point in paying me? You knocked into me, so apologize!”","Qiao Xi sized up the woman’s dress. It was indeed not cheap, but it was not a limited edition. This brand existed in the mall, so she said indifferently, “I’ll buy you a new one.”","The woman crossed her arms and looked arrogant. “Compensate me now. Otherwise, what if you escape?”","Qiao Xi: “...”","At this moment, she finally knew that this woman was deliberately looking for trouble.","If her dress was dirtied, the only options are to pay for it or get her a new one. Even if she went to buy a new one now, it would take time for it to be delivered here. This woman could not even wait for a while?","This woman was the one who bumped into her, yet she was still being so unreasonable?","A waiter immediately came over to coax her. When he saw the woman, he could not help but take a deep breath and say while trembling, “Miss Jin, I’m really sorry. This was an accident...","“She also said that she’ll compensate you. Don’t be angry...”","“What do you mean?” Miss Jin immediately flew into a rage. “How do you know that it was an accident on her end? My dress, which is worth over ten thousand yuan, is dirty now. Do you want me to forgive her?”","Miss Jin casually picked up a glass and slammed it onto the floor. “This dress costs more than 10,000 yuan! It’s what you earn in two months! Hurry up and compensate me! Otherwise, I’ll call the police and arrest you!”","The waiter had a look of horror. Miss Jin was Young Master Chen Chi’s girlfriend. Moreover, Young Master Chen and Miss Yao Mengqing were both in the shop. That was why Jin Weiwei could be so arrogant.","He tried to persuade her in a low voice. “Miss Jin, calm down.”","He looked at Qiao Xi helplessly.","Qiao Xi took a deep breath and sneered. “Call the police.”","Everyone was surprised.","She said slowly, “Miss Jin, I was originally happy when I came here for dinner. I don’t want to bicker with you, but you knocked into me first and you’re still throwing a tantrum here. That doesn’t make sense, right?","“It looks like I was polite and it boosted your arrogance!”","“You!” Jin Weiwei was infuriated.","Qiao Xi said slowly, “I shouldn’t have taken the initiative to say that I’d compensate you just now. If you want to call the police, go ahead. We’ll know who knocked into who after checking the surveillance footage.”","The atmosphere instantly became awkward.","Jin Weiwei gritted her teeth. “You...”","“Why are you being so noisy?” Just then, a man walked out of the crowd.","The man was dressed in designer clothes and looked like he was from a rich family.","He slowly walked to Jin Weiwei’s side and said impatiently, “What kind of place is this? Can’t you pay attention to your identity?”","Jin Weiwei had an innocent look on her face. She removed her shrewish expression and said with an aggrieved look, “Ah Chi! She knocked into me and dirtied my dress. Help me teach her a lesson!”","Chen Chi looked at Qiao Xi and was instantly shocked in his heart.","It was her?","Was she not the woman who had bullied her cousin?","Mengqing and Gu Zheng were originally a couple, but this woman snatched Gu Zheng away and married him. She even roped in Gu Yao now. She was simply bullying others!","Unexpectedly, enemies were bound to meet here!","Chen Chi snorted. “Hey! So it’s you, Miss Qiao!”","Qiao Xi was slightly surprised. This man actually knew her?","She was calm as she sized up the man in front of her. She was sure that she had never seen this man before, so she took out her phone to call the police.","Unexpectedly, Chen Chi took a big stride forward and snatched Qiao Xi’s phone away. He slammed it onto the floor and said fiercely, “Don’t call the police, Miss Qiao. It’s just a small matter. As long as you apologize to Weiwei, then this matter will be over. Otherwise, it won’t end! I forgot to tell you that I’m very familiar with your man.. Do you think he’ll offend me, his friend, for your sake?”"]},{"number":243,"title":"Chapter 243 - Digging Up His Identity","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi’s expression turned cold.","Where did this stupid man come from? Her man? This stupid man was talking about Gu Zheng?","The matter had blown up. The waiter and waitresses quickly cleared the area and apologized to the customers.","Soon, there were only the staff members and the three of them left.","When Jin Weiwei heard this, she cried out in surprise. “I didn’t expect her to be your friend’s woman. I’m really sorry, but why don’t we forget about it...”","Chen Chi quickly interrupted, “Why should we? She bullied you, so should I just let it go? She’s just a mistress who covets money. You’re my girlfriend, so you don’t have to give in to her!","“Moreover, Miss Qiao’s man and I are childhood friends. Although we haven’t been in contact for the past few years, there are still past sentiments.”","Then, he shouted coldly, “Apologize to my girlfriend!”","Chen Chi had a look of satisfaction.","So what if Qiao Xi was together with Gu Zheng? He and Gu Zheng were childhood friends and he knew Gu Zheng very well. He did not even fancy Mengqing, so how could he like other women?","Moreover, his girlfriend had been bullied. If news of this got out, he would lose his reputation.","When Chen Chi saw Qiao Xi remaining silent, he thought that she was afraid and became even more arrogant. “I don’t think you have the money to compensate. As long as you apologize, this matter will be settled. I won’t make things difficult for you anymore.”","Jin Weiwei covered her face and laughed. “Miss Qiao, it’s not easy for you to be a mistress, so you don’t have to compensate me. However, you dirtied my dress. Shouldn’t you at least apologize?”","Qiao Xi was angered to the point of laughing.","In the end, this adulterous pair was mocking her for being a mistress.","She knew that Young Master Chen knew Gu Zheng and Yao Mengqing.","Hence, Young Master Chen was probably Yao Mengqing’s friend or relative. He was here to stand up for her.","Chen Chi sneered. “Miss Qiao, what’s wrong? If you don’t apologize, don’t blame me for being nasty. By then, you won’t even be able to be my mistress!”","The wait staff did not dare to breathe loudly. Qiao Xi sneered, her eyes cold.","“Oh? Young Master Chen, are you so capable?","“It’s just that there doesn’t seem to be a rich family with the surname Chen in Li City. However, Yao Corporation went bankrupt a few years ago and after that, the entire family moved overseas. The Yao family has in-laws surnamed Chen. Could it be that you’re from this family, Young Master Chen?”","Qiao Xi cried out in surprise, “So the Young Master Chen who has just returned from overseas is actually so capable?”","An awkward atmosphere spread.","Qiao Xi revealing Chen Chi’s true identity in public immediately caused his expression to turn livid.","“B*tch!”","Jin Weiwei cursed and roared, “Aren’t you just a mistress? If it weren’t for that man, you might even be sleeping with everyone! Ah Chi is asking you to apologize to give you a way out. Don’t be ungrateful!”","Chen Chi nodded, and his expression softened a little.","Unexpectedly, Qiao Xi laughed with ridicule and spoke once more.","“Miss Jin, I’m not talking to you. Why are you acting up by yourself?","“You said that you’re Young Master Chen’s girlfriend, but why have I seen you with different men? Speaking of which, you’re the one who’s a mistress, right? It must be hard accompanying different men every day, right?”","Jin Weiwei’s face was filled with horror, and she was so scared that her face turned pale.","Everyone looked at Jin Weiwei. From what Miss Qiao said, Jin Weiwei was not Young Master Chen’s girlfriend?","Jin Weiwei was so angry that she gnashed her teeth and roared, “B*tch! You’re slandering me! You’re a mistress yourself! But you’re wrongly accusing me too! I-I’ll tear you apart! Ah...”","She bared her fangs and brandished her claws as she rushed over. Before she could touch Qiao Xi, she was kicked by someone and abruptly flew out. She fell heavily to the floor and felt her entire body crumble.","At this moment, a dignified voice was heard.","“Who said she’s a mistress?”","Everyone looked in the direction of the voice. The person was exuding a suppressive aura. His footsteps were steady and he had the aura of a king.","Gu Zheng was calm as he glanced at the crowd indifferently and finally looked at Jin Weiwei.","His eyes were deep and filled with endless coldness. It made one shudder.. Jin Weiwei only felt intense fear surge into her heart."]},{"number":244,"title":"Chapter 244 - Were Not Friends","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Jin Weiwei was the daughter of an ordinary family, but she had always wanted to squeeze into high society. Therefore, she had seen many pictures of rich young masters, but she had never seen this man before. Therefore, he should not be a big shot!","Her boyfriend was the young master of the Chen family. Would she be afraid of him? Hence, she shouted, “Who the heck are you? How dare you kick me? I’ll kill...”","Smack!","Chen Chi raised his hand and slapped her hard. He gritted his teeth and said, “Shut up!”","His face was ashen, and his body was trembling.","Gu... Gu Zheng?","Qiao Xi had clearly come with Gu Yao, so why was Gu Zheng here as well? Was he also here for barbecue?","Gu Zheng’s eyes were deep as he lowered his eyes to look at Jin Weiwei. He said firmly, “Qiao Xi is my wife. A good-for-nothing’s mistress can’t compare to her!”","Jin Weiwei’s face was filled with shock, and she even forgot to breathe.","She did not understand why Chen Chi was so respectful to this man.","Chen Chi’s expression was ugly. Gu Zheng had scolded the two of them.","He was the good-for-nothing he mentioned!","His mistress was Jin Weiwei.","However, he did not dare to retort. He nodded and bowed, saying obsequiously, “President Gu, why are you here?”","Hearing him address this man as ‘President Gu’, everyone’s hearts skipped a beat.","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow. “Do I need to report to you that I’m here?”","Chen Chi was so scared that his face turned pale. His forehead was covered in a cold sweat as he said tremblingly, “You... You’ve misunderstood. I... I...”","Previously, Yao Mengqing had a good relationship with Gu Zheng. Hence, he, her cousin, gained some reputation in high society as well. Everyone was respectful toward him when they saw him. When had he ever been so embarrassed?","Gu Zheng’s cold gaze landed on him. “Did you just say that my wife can’t even be your mistress?”","Chen Chi was trembling in fear as he stammered while explaining, “I... I didn’t know she was your wife. If I knew, I wouldn’t have been rude to her. Please let me off...”","Gu Zheng said indifferently, “You don’t know just because she didn’t say anything? I don’t believe that Yao Mengqing didn’t tell you that Qiao Xi has already married me.”","Chen Chi gasped!","He was just about to explain when he heard Gu Yao say in confusion, “Sister Mengqing knows that Qiao Xi and my brother are married. If she didn’t tell you, how could you possibly know Qiao Xi? How would you know about Qiao Xi’s relationship with my brother?”","Chen Chi thought that Qiao Xi was Gu Zheng’s kept woman. It was either Chen Chi had deliberately said it or the person who told him this was deliberately misleading him.","These words scared Chen Chi so much that his legs went weak. He suddenly knelt in front of Gu Zheng, his face filled with horror.","At this moment, Gu Zheng was really too scary. He did not move at all and just stood there, making others wet their pants in fear.","Chen Chi really could not believe that Gu Zheng would care about a woman. He did not even fancy Mengqing, so how could he fancy someone from the Qiao family?","Could it be that this woman had tricks up her sleeve?","“Cousin, Weiwei, you two... Ah Zheng?”","At this moment, a weak female voice sounded.","Yao Mengqing walked over slowly and was surprised to see everyone. “Ah Zheng, why are you here? Why are my cousin and Weiwei on their knees?”","Chen Chi seemed to have found a ray of hope and hurriedly rushed in front of Yao Mengqing. “Sister! Quickly plead for me!”","Yao Mengqing lowered her head to look at Chen Chi, then at Jin Weiwei. Finally, her gaze landed on Qiao Xi.","She slowly walked in front of Qiao Xi and said gently, “Xi Xi, what did my cousin and Weiwei do wrong? Weiwei’s dress is dirty now. We’re all friends... Can we just let the matter go? Let them pack up and we’ll leave right away!”","Chen Chi nodded fervently.","Qiao Xi looked at Chen Chi who was kneeling on the floor and sneered in her heart.","‘Weren’t you noisy just now? Didn’t you want to continue quarreling? Weren’t you quite capable just now? Why are you so scared that you knelt on the floor the moment you saw Gu Zheng?’","Yao Mengqing pretended not to know anything. Actually, she had been hiding in the dark for a long time.","‘We’re all friends’?!","Qiao Xi was just about to retort when Gu Zheng said slowly, “Miss Yao, we’re not friends.”","Yao Mengqing’s expression froze.","Gu Zheng said, “Even if you’re my friend, you can’t make my wife suffer. What more if you aren’t my friend?”"]},{"number":245,"title":"Chapter 245 - How Dare You?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Yao Mengqing was embarrassed and forced a smile. “Ah Zheng, don’t misunderstand. Everyone’s watching. Don’t make things worse...","“My cousin and Weiwei are both famous figures in Li City, so it’s better to treat them nicer. Otherwise, outsiders will say that Xi Xi refuses to let them off and this will affect Xi Xi’s reputation.”","Gu Zheng’s expression was slightly cold.","Qiao Xi was angered to the point of laughing. This woman really knew how to twist her words!","Jin Weiwei was the one who knocked into her and demanded an apology!","Then, the adulterous couple rushed up to her and called her a mistress!","Now, Yao Mengqing still had the cheek to say that she was being unreasonable?","How could she be so shameless?","Had Yao Mengqing become the good person while she became the bad person?","Qiao Xi’s hot temper could not help but flare up. “Miss Yao...”","“Sister Mengqing.”","Unexpectedly, Gu Yao spoke first.","A trace of disappointment flashed through his eyes. “Sister Mengqing, it was Jin Weiwei who bumped into Xi Xi first. She even said that Xi Xi was a mistress, and then Chen Chi forced Xi Xi to apologize. What right do you have to make Xi Xi forgive them?","“If you don’t know anything, don’t poke your nose into it!”","In Gu Yao’s eyes, Yao Mengqing had always been gentle and kind. This time, although she was pretending to be gentle on the surface, she was actually forcing Qiao Xi to forgive her every word.","Yao Mengqing gritted her teeth in anger.","Why did Gu Yao start speaking up for Qiao Xi?","Why couldn’t she poke her nose in this?","Seeing that Yao Mengqing was silent, Gu Yao smiled bitterly. “Sister Mengqing, since you have nothing to say, it proves that I’m right.”","Yao Mengqing raised her eyes and looked at Gu Zheng and Gu Yao’s cold expressions. She could not help but tremble as her heart felt heavy. She walked forward and said softly, “Ah Yao, you’ve misunderstood... I was just a little anxious. Chen Chi is my cousin. I know him well. When I saw him and Wei Wei kneeling on the floor, my heart ached for them.","“I shouldn’t have been so rash. I should’ve known better.”","Yao Mengqing lowered her eyes as a few tears fell.","She looked innocent, but there was no pity in Gu Yao’s eyes anymore.","Gu Zheng asked slowly, “Chen Chi is also a famous figure in Li City? It won’t be good for Qiao Xi’s reputation if news of this gets out?”","When Yao Mengqing heard Gu Zheng speak, her eyes instantly lit up. She pretended to be aggrieved. “Ah Zheng, it’s my fault. I didn’t understand the situation and begged Miss Qiao for forgiveness, but I did it for everyone...”","“The Chen and Yao families are really powerful, huh?! They’re actually big shots in Li City, huh?!”","Gu Zheng said sarcastically. Yao Mengqing and Chen Chi’s faces turned ashen.","Yao Mengqing trembled.","She did not understand why Gu Zheng would do this to her.","Ah Zheng did not like Qiao Xi at all. Otherwise, why would he not hold a wedding with her? Moreover, there was no official announcement of their marriage.","This meant that Ah Zheng did not care about Qiao Xi. Since he did not, then why was he doing this to her and her cousin because of Qiao Xi?","At this moment, Chen Chi already knew that if he did not apologize, he would definitely not be able to walk out of this door.","Hence, he pulled Jin Weiwei to kneel in front of Gu Zheng. “Apologize now!”","Jin Weiwei widened her eyes. Anger and shame mixed in her heart, and she did not say anything for a long time.","“B*tch! I told you to apologize! You’ve offended Mrs. Gu. Quickly admit your mistake!”","If President Gu blamed the Chen and Yao families for this, he would be in big trouble. Hence, he could only push the blame to Jin Weiwei.","Qiao Xi naturally saw through Chen Chi’s thoughts. If he wanted Jin Weiwei to take the blame, he and Yao Mengqing could stay out of it.","How could things be so easy in this world?","At this moment, Gu Yao spoke again, “Chen Chi, answer me honestly. Did you know that Qiao Xi had already married my brother, or did you only think that she was my brother’s mistress?”","Yao Mengqing was shocked when she heard that.","Gu Yao’s expression was serious. “Don’t tell me you didn’t know. If you didn’t know Qiao Xi, how would you know that she’s my brother’s woman? Outsiders don’t know about my brother’s marriage at all, much less that the woman beside him is Qiao Xi!","“There’s only one possibility. Someone else told you that and the person who told you is Sister Meng Qing!”"]},{"number":246,"title":"Chapter 246 - Young Master Chen Is The Scapegoat","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The moment Gu Yao’s voice fell, the air fell silent.","He continued to ask, “Could it be that Sister Mengqing only told you that Qiao Xi is my brother’s kept woman and didn’t say that Qiao Xi has already married my brother? That’s why you look down on her so much and feel that even if you offend her, she’s just a mistress, so my brother won’t fuss about it with you.”","Everyone’s eyes landed on Yao Mengqing.","Yao Mengqing’s heart twitched.","She was so scared that her face turned pale and her body trembled uncontrollably.","Qiao Xi did not expect that Second Young Master Gu to actually be able to ask such a question. After all, he had always treated Yao Mengqing as a friend and their relationship had always been quite good. Now, every single word he said was filled with doubt.","If Yao Mengqing admitted that she did not tell Chen Chi about their marriage and instead said that Qiao Xi was a kept woman, then she must have ulterior motives. She was deliberately trying to make things difficult for Qiao Xi with Chen Chi.","How could Yao Mengqing continue to pretend to be weak? How could she maintain her image in front of the Gu brothers?","Gu Yao’s gaze was deep. “Sister Mengqing, you told me before that you like Gu Zheng, but you wanted him to be happier. As long as he could get along with Qiao Xi, you’d wish him a happy life and promise not to ruin their relationship.","“But what about now? You schemed in secret and spread rumors that Qiao Xi is a mistress, then instructed others to deal with her!”","Yao Mengqing was shocked!","It was over! It was all over!","She felt that everyone’s burning gazes were about to burn her to ashes.","“I-I didn’t... Cousin, say something. I told you they were married a long time ago. I didn’t say that Xi Xi is a mistress. Quickly prove it for me!” Yao Mengqing begged.","Chen Chi broke out in a cold sweat as he clenched his fists tightly. Fear and helplessness intertwined within him.","His cousin wanted him to take the blame...","If he refused to admit it and insisted on confronting Yao Mengqing, the Yao family would be doomed.","Mengqing was the lucky star of their two families. It was because of her relationship with the Gu brothers that the Yao and Chen families were able to survive till today.","Chen Chi hesitated for a moment, and he looked as if he was facing death. “Yes, Mengqing said that Qiao Xi and President Gu were husband and wife. Just now... I saw Weiwei being wronged and was anxious, so...”","Gu Yao was surprised. The truth was already out, but Chen Chi still denied it.","He looked up at Yao Mengqing and saw a smile flash past her lips.","Gu Zheng snorted. “You two are indeed relatives. Yao Mengqing, what do you have to say?”","Yao Mengqing forced herself to calm down. “I told my cousin about your relationship with Qiao Xi a long time ago. I didn’t expect him to... Moreover, Xi Xi is your wife. Why would I say that about her?”","She had to get Chen Chi to take the blame for this. Otherwise, Gu Zheng would completely loathe her.","Gu Zheng narrowed his eyes. “Yao Mengqing, tell Yao Junjie that he can either expel Chen Chi from the Chen family or I’ll make both your families disappear from Li City!”","Yao Mengqing trembled. She did not expect Gu Zheng to be so heartless.","Chen Chi’s face turned pale. Expel from the Chen family?","He had merely cursed Qiao Xi a few times, yet he had to pay such a huge price?","He had only wanted to stand up for Meng Qing. How did things turn out like this?","Suddenly, his pupils constricted. Could it be that Yao Mengqing had Jin Weiwei deliberately knock into Qiao Xi?","The punishment for being expelled from the Chen family was too heavy for him. Why should he be responsible for Yao Mengqing’s scheme?","At the thought of this, Chen Chi quickly retorted, “President Gu, I didn’t-”","“Cousin!” Yao Mengqing interrupted him with a gloomy face. “Xi Xi is Ah Zheng’s wife. How could you say that she’s a mistress? You’ve disrespected her, but I know that you only said those words carelessly.","“However, you’ve already committed the mistake, so it’s only right for Ah Zheng to expel you from the Chen family. Otherwise, my brother won’t let you off!”","Chen Chi looked at Yao Mengqing in disbelief.","He had always been on good terms with Yao Mengqing. He did not expect that she would push him out to take the bullet in the face of a calamity.","Yao Mengqing knew very well that Gu Zheng had already suspected her, but even so, she could not admit it!","Chen Chi’s lips trembled slightly before he laughed crazily.","Forget it, it was useless for him to explain anything. If he exposed Yao Mengqing in front of Gu Zheng, what would Yao Junjie do to him?"]},{"number":247,"title":"Chapter 247 - The Innocent Second Young Master Gu","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","In order to protect the two families, Yao Junjie had to expel him from the Chen family.","Chen Chi was disappointed. He knew that he had been used by Yao Mengqing, but he realized it too late.","His eyes were empty as he smiled bitterly. “I deserve to die! I shouldn’t have insulted Mrs. Gu. All of this has nothing to do with Mengqing... Second Young Master Gu, don’t misunderstand Mengqing.”","Yao Mengqing said aggrievedly, “Ah Yao, you’ve really misunderstood me. Don’t you know me?”","Know her?","Gu Yao used to think that he knew Sister Mengqing very well, but now, he realized that the woman in front of him was so unfamiliar.","He sneered. “Sister Mengqing, I’m not stupid. I won’t be deceived by you again.","“You know very well whether you told Chen Chi the truth or not, but... I remember that you said that you hate mistresses who destroy other people’s families the most. Then, I’d like to ask if you’re familiar with Jin Weiwei?”","Yao Mengqing did not understand what was going on and said, “Yes, Weiwei is my friend.”","“In that case, why did you let your friend date your cousin? According to what I know, Young Master Chen has a fiancee. Are you tolerating your friend being a mistress because you hate Chen Chi’s fiancee?”","Yao Mengqing wanted to get rid of all the people she hated, so she got Jin Weiwei to seduce Chen Chi and become the third party.","It was also because of this that although Yao Mengqing said she hated mistresses, she still tried all means to be Gu Zheng’s woman even after she found out about his marriage.","Being exposed by Gu Yao so straightforwardly, Yao Mengqing’s face instantly turned pale and her expression froze.","Gu Yao was in a bad mood and left. Qiao Xi hurriedly chased after him.","Seeing that the two of them had left, Yao Mengqing said in a weak voice, “Ah Zheng...”","“Song Shiyu, inform Yao Junjie that if Xi Xi doesn’t forgive Yao Mengqing, business with the Yao family will be suspended.”","Gu Zheng’s expression was cold. Song Shiyu replied immediately and took out his phone.","Yao Mengqing looked up in disbelief. If Gu Zheng and the Yao family canceled their collaboration, it would be equivalent to killing the Yao family!","Her voice trembled. “Ah Zheng!”","Gu Zheng ignored her and strode away.","...","When Qiao Xi returned to the shop, the barbecued foods on the table were already cold. Song Shiyu instructed the waiter to prepare some more.","Gu Yao leaned against the chair, his head lowered unhappily.","Qiao Xi sat by his side. “Are you unhappy?”","Gu Yao turned away, his eyes red.","Qiao Xi knew that Gu Yao had always treated Yao Mengqing as a friend. He could not accept it when he suddenly realized that Yao Mengqing was a scheming b*tch who went against all his expectations.","She pushed the food in front of Gu Yao. Seeing that he was unwilling to eat, she picked up a piece of meat with the chopsticks and fed it to him.","Gu Yao’s face was serious. “Qiao Xi, you knew that Yao Mengqing was like this the first time you saw her, right?”","Qiao Xi was slightly hesitant because she was afraid of hurting this child’s fragile heart.","Gu Yao’s handsome features were full of dejection. “All of you knew it very well, even Chen Chi. He took the responsibility for the sake of the Chen and Yao families. It seems that only a fool like me was deceived by her!”","He choked slightly. “She has always been very close to Gu Zheng. I thought she was gentle and kind, so I treated her as my biological sister. Who knew that she was using me?!”","Qiao Xi was at a loss for what to do and truly did not know how to comfort him.","Gu Yao was a little angry. “I finally see her true colors. I’m too disappointed. How can she be like this?!","“I’m the only one who didn’t know. I’m too stupid.”","His voice trembled slightly. “You must be laughing at me. You think I’m useless for being deceived by such a woman. I’ve known her for so many years but haven’t seen her true colors.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with heartache.","The arrogant and willful Second Young Master Gu also had such a weak side to him. When he said that he was too stupid. It really made her heart ache.","Qiao Xi had always been very clearly aware that even though Second Young Master Gu seemed to be absurd and uninhibited, he had very good morals.","He knew that his mother was a mistress, and he had always been criticized by others because of it. That was why he hated mistresses the most.","It was just that he had been used by Yao Mengqing previously. However, this was not his fault. It was just because he was too naive.","Qiao Xi sighed lightly. “Gu Yao.”","Second Young Master Gu looked up slowly.."]},{"number":248,"title":"Chapter 248 - Precious Paintings","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi moved closer and said with a serious expression, “Yao Mengqing was indeed using you but it’s not that you’re too stupid. You’re just too naive. That’s not wrong.","“It’s exactly because she knew that you’re innocent that she used you. You thought she was very good to you, so you treated her sincerely. You couldn’t guess her motives. Actually, this is a good thing. At least, in your eyes, the world is pure.”","Gu Yao was intoxicated by her gentle voice. Qiao Xi’s comforting words made him feel enlightened, and his dark eyes lit up.","Qiao Xi’s words came from her heart. Gu Yao was just an innocent boy. He would give up everything to whoever treated him well. That was why Yao Mengqing had targeted him and made use of his innocence.","Unexpectedly, after saying this, Gu Yao’s tears fell.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched as she panicked. What should she do now?","After returning home, Qiao Xi felt a little upset. She thought that Gu Yao liked to draw a lot and it just so happened that she had a few paintings in her hands. They should be able to cheer Gu Yao up.","She hurriedly got up and rummaged through the storeroom until she found a few dusty paintings.","The next morning, she hurriedly sent them to Gu Yao.","Qiao Xi rubbed his head. “Ah Yao, I find you more and more likable. Although you caused me trouble the first time we met, you were still willing to accept me and bought the clothes I designed. I’m really very happy. I know you like to paint, so I’m giving you a few paintings. Although they got a little dirty in the storeroom, they’re still paintings. Don’t be sad anymore.”","Gu Yao had already recovered from his sorrow, but he was not too interested in the paintings she mentioned.","He was not someone who would take a liking to just any painting. Qiao Xi could not produce anything of value either, but on the account of her kind intentions, he would definitely accept them.","However, when Qiao Xi revealed the canvases...","Gu Yao widened his eyes. “You put these paintings in the storeroom?”","These were the paintings of the genius painter, Xue Liang! Qiao Xi actually kept them in the storeroom?","Qiao Xi: “?”","These paintings were all defective goods that Fourth Brother did not want. She had been keeping them in the storeroom and chose a few relatively clean ones to give to Gu Yao. She just wanted him to look at the paintings and not think about sad things.","Did Gu Yao have to be so surprised?","...","Longwan Residential.","Song Shijing said respectfully, “President, Miss Yao Mengqing called and said that she would give you two tickets to Xue Liang’s art exhibition. You can bring Young Madam there. It’s an apology for what happened earlier.”","Gu Zheng paused in his actions, his expression cold.","Xue Liang’s art exhibition?","He said casually, “Say that I don’t have time.”","Song Shijing knew that the president would not go. It was just an art exhibition. If the president really wanted to see it, the person in charge would have sent the tickets over personally. Yao Mengqing did not have to send him tickets at all.","If the president accepted these two tickets, it would mean that he had forgiven Yao Mengqing.","Yao Mengqing had been waiting for the call but when she received the reply, she gritted her teeth and smiled awkwardly. “Alright, bye.”","After hanging up, she frowned slightly.","Yao Mengqing’s younger sister asked curiously, “He’s still not willing to forgive you?”","The two of them were in the coffee shop. Yao Mengqing was sad. Her younger sister, Yao Mengqi, knew that she was having a conflict with an important friend, so she accompanied her out to relax.","Yao Mengqi was somewhat surprised. “He’s not willing to go even though you’ve invited him to Xue Liang’s art exhibition? Does he even know about Xue Liang?”","Xue Liang was a genius painter. His works were hard to get even if one had money, and the art exhibition would be packed with people. Even the president would bring his family to attend it. Moreover, the people who could attend his art exhibition were all either rich or noble.","The Yao family had tried their best to get two tickets to the art exhibition, but the other party rejected the tickets?","The tickets to Xue Liang’s art exhibition were tickets to enter the high society. Many big shots could be seen there.","That person was actually unwilling to go. It seemed that he did not know Xue Liang’s identity and did not know how precious this ticket was.","Yao Mengqi mocked, “He’s obviously a country bumpkin. Sister, how did you get to know such a friend? He doesn’t even know Xue Liang, so he’s definitely not a big shot.”","Gu Zheng naturally knew about Xue Liang, but it was hard to say for Qiao Xi. She might not have gone to an art exhibition before and could not appreciate paintings.."]},{"number":249,"title":"Chapter 249 - The President Is A Little Dumb","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Zheng thought that Qiao Xi would make a fool of herself if she went, so he rejected the two tickets.","That must be it!","Yao Mengqing suddenly felt more at ease. She smiled. “Forget it. Since he doesn’t want to go, I won’t force him. Maybe he’ll forget about the matter in a few days.”","...","Longwan Residential.","Qiao Xi was slightly surprised when she heard about Xue Liang’s art exhibition. “His art exhibition? In Li City?”","Gu Zheng nodded. “Do you want to go?”","As long as she wanted to go, he just had to make a call and someone would personally send the tickets to him. He did not have to accept Yao Mengqing’s kindness at all.","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes and said indifferently, “Forget it.”","She had been looking at Xue Liang’s paintings since she was young. They were nothing new to her.","However, why did Fourth Brother not notify her when he came to Li City this time? Why did he seem to be sneaking around?","It had been a long time since they last met, so she was a little upset.","Qiao Xi went upstairs and changed before rushing out.","Song Shijing asked immediately, “President, should I follow Young Madam?”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent as he shook his head. “There’s no need.”","Song Shijing was a little worried. “It’s getting dark. If Young Madam goes out at this time and encounters bad people...”","“Xue Liang will protect her.”","Song Shijing was surprised.","Who was it? Xue Liang? Young Madam actually knew him?","Song Shijing was very curious, but when he thought about how Song Shiyu often got his salary deducted for being too talkative, he swallowed his words.","Unexpectedly, Song Shiyu pulled him aside and whispered in his ear, “Brother, something’s wrong! I think Young Madam went out to see Xue Liang at this time?”","Song Shijing: “...” ‘You don’t want your salary, but that doesn’t mean I don’t want mine!’","“Brother, if you were the madam, would you like the president?”","Song Shijing: “?” Why would he like the president? He was not the young madam, so why should he think about all this?","Song Shiyu said excitedly, “If I were the young madam, I definitely wouldn’t like the president. He’s too cold. Look at Xue Liang. He’s a genius artist. Artists are usually more interesting. Look at these two. The difference between them is obvious!”","Song Shijing: “...” Heh, this brother of his was really shocking.","Song Shiyu looked helpless. “Young Madam is so outstanding. She’s the champion of the translation competition and can even write scripts. She’s also a hacker. Look at the president. He’s so poor that all he has is money. He’s also so straight!","“There must be something going on with Young Madam and Xue Liang since she’s going to see him tonight! Don’t you think that the president is a little dumb? As his assistant, I have to think about his marriage!”","Song Shijing wanted to roll his eyes.","A moment later, the brothers returned to Gu Zheng’s side. Song Shijing advised, “President, why don’t I go protect Young Madam?”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow and sized up Song Shiyu. “You want to go out?”","Song Shijing was a little nervous. “No, no... Madam didn’t bring her bag. If she needs money...”","She could not spend Xue Liang’s money either!","Gu Zheng said slowly, “Can Song Shiyu spend your money?”","Song Shijing was confused. “Of course! He’s my brother. What’s wrong with spending money on him?”","“In that case, Qiao Xi can spend Xue Liang’s money. Did Song Shiyu say something to you? I don’t think he cares about his salary anymore. Go tidy up the backyard.”","Song Shijing: “...”","On the other hand, Qiao Xi had just contacted Xue Liang and they were supposed to meet at the entrance of the mall.","After a while, Xue Liang and an old man walked over. Qiao Xi jumped up excitedly and ran over. “Fourth Brother! Teacher!”","The old gentleman was none other than Uncle Liang Pingchuan. His medical skills were outstanding, and he knew more than ten classical musical instruments. He wore a long robe and looked like a great sage.","Xue Liang quickly went forward to welcome her and hugged her to steady the woman.","“You’re already an adult, yet you’re still jumping around.”","Qiao Xi was extremely happy. “Why didn’t you tell me in advance that you were coming?”","Xue Liang said indifferently, “I was just passing by Li City and didn’t have the time to tell you.”","Actually, Xue Liang had always been thinking about this junior of his. He did not tell her at first because he wanted to give her a surprise.","Qiao Xi smiled gently. These brothers and elders all treated her extremely well.. They were the closest people to her."]},{"number":250,"title":"Chapter 250 - Can’t Tell Treasure From Sh*t","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“It’s rare for me to see you. Let’s go shopping,” Xue Liang said.","The three of them went straight to a branded women’s clothing shop after entering the mall. Xue Liang seemed to be very busy. He took a call and asked Qiao Xi to pick out some clothes first.","“Sister, there are two tickets to Xue Liang’s art exhibition. Who are you going to attend it with?”","Qiao Xi smiled lightly. It seemed that her fourth brother was quite popular.","Immediately after, another woman said, “I plan on going with Brother. But since he won’t accept the tickets, there’s nothing I can do.”","Qiao Xi was suddenly stunned and found that this voice was slightly familiar.","Yao Mengqi defended the injustice. “Sister! Qiao Xi definitely doesn’t know anything about art. After she was abandoned by the Qiao family, she stayed in the countryside. How could she have gone to such elegant events like an art exhibition before? Even if she had gone to such events before, she would be like a caveman who can’t tell treasure from sh*t.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","Enemies were bound to meet each other. She did not expect to meet Yao Mengqing here.","Liang Pingchuan frowned unhappily. ‘Little Six doesn’t know anything about art?’","She had been looking at Xue Liang’s paintings since she was young and was even sick of them. Was there a need for her to attend an art exhibition?","Yao Mengqi became more enthusiastic and laughed loudly. “Sister, is someone like her even worthy of being your friend? It’s already her honor that you’re willing to talk to her. Don’t talk to her anymore. Being with someone like her is degrading yourself.","“She grew up in the countryside and is a wild girl. I think she should stay in the countryside forever.","“You still want to apologize to her? Is she worthy? You’re the daughter of the Yao family!”","Liang Pingchuan was displeased. All these years, they had never said anything harsh to Little Six, yet today, they heard these two women say so much about Little Six.","The Yao family seemed to think highly of Xue Liang’s art exhibition?","If Xue Liang knew that they were talking about Little Six like this, he would definitely chase them all out!","Liang Pingchuan frowned. “Little Six, they...”","As he spoke, he was about to rush over and argue.","Qiao Xi hurriedly stopped him. “Teacher, they won’t admit it if you question them now. Moreover, they’ll even turn the tables on us and make us lose our dignity.”","Liang Pingchuan thought for a moment and flipped his wrist. A silver needle appeared on his fingertip.","Swoosh!","“Ah! My back hurts!” Yao Mengqi screamed and instantly jumped up. She looked around but did not see anyone suspicious.","Yao Mengqing noticed Qiao Xi who was not far away.","She slowly walked over and pretended to be friendly. “Xi Xi? What a coincidence! Isn’t Ah Zheng here?”","Yao Mengqi felt a sharp pain in her back. Immediately after, she saw Yao Mengqing greeting Qiao Xi.","So she was Qiao Xi!","She was in so much pain that she was anxious. Finally, she found a place to vent her anger. “Sister! This is that country bumpkin who’s not interested in Xue Liang’s art exhibition!”","Yao Mengqi’s voice was ear-piercing and attracted everyone’s attention.","Looking down on Xue Liang’s art exhibition? This woman was too arrogant!","Yao Mengqing stopped her. “Qi Qi, don’t spout nonsense. Xi Xi simply doesn’t want to go to Xue Liang’s art exhibition. It’s not that she doesn’t like it, but she might not know anything about art.”","Qiao Xi was speechless.","Teacher Liang who was at the side flipped his wrist again. Yao Mengqing screamed too, her face filled with shock.","If it were not because he was in Li City, he would have killed the two of them to vent his anger on behalf of Little Six. He was letting them off easy by just pricking them a few times.","“Little Six, let’s go. I’ll buy a present for you.”","Qiao Xi curled her lips and nodded.","Yao Mengqing suddenly realized something and sarcastically asked, “Wait! Xi Xi, you haven’t introduced this gentleman to me... Why would he buy you a gift? You and he...”","She looked at Qiao Xi meaningfully, and the surrounding people revealed disdainful gazes.","Yao Mengqi snorted. “Tsk! She’s really unrestrained! How can she bear to do such a thing with such an old man? I think she only has eyes for money. She even seduced this old man!”","Yao Mengqing said helplessly, “Maybe they’re just relatives...”","Liang Pingchuan brought Qiao Xi into the store and wrapped up all the clothes that she liked. The sales assistant hurriedly straightened her clothes as a trace of envy flashed past her face.","Although this man was a little old, he was quite generous. He did not even blink when spending so much money.","She could also tell that he was a handsome man when he was young.","After checking out the clothes, the cashier smiled and said to him, “Sir, there are a total of 15 sets of clothes here, totaling 320,000 yuan. Do you want to scan the QR code or swipe your card?”","Teacher Liang: “...”","QR code? Swipe card?"]},{"number":251,"title":"Chapter 251 - How Long Are You Going To Keep Pretending?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Liang Pingchuan was stunned for a moment. He did not care what QR code it was. All he needed to do was swipe his card.","He touched his pocket and suddenly froze, frowning.","Damn, his clothes did not have any pockets, hence he handed his bank card to Xue Liang for safekeeping!","The smile on the cashier’s face gradually vanished. Qiao Xi took out her bank card and handed it to her.","At this moment, Yao Mengqi seized the opportunity and mocked sarcastically, “Hah! So this old man doesn’t have any money either. Since he doesn’t have any money, why does he have the cheek to keep a woman? Qiao Xi, are you blind?! Be careful or you’ll go broke!”","Qiao Xi frowned.","Liang Pingchuan was angry. “People who spout nonsense will have their tongues pulled out in hell after they die.”","Hearing this, Yao Mengqi had a look of disdain. “Old man! You came from the mountains, right? What tongue-pulling in hell are you talking about? I don’t believe it! You look strange wearing ancient clothes. You must be a big liar!”","Qiao Xi put away the bank card, and her expression turned cold.","She did not want to make a fuss about it, but this woman actually scolded her teacher?","Qiao Xi calmly took out her phone, signed a contract, and transferred a sum of money to him. After that, the corners of her mouth curled into a smile.","“Qi Qi, don’t say that. He probably just forgot to bring his card.”","Immediately after, Yao Mengqing looked at Qiao Xi and said with an apologetic expression, “Xi Xi, it’s my fault for what happened before. I wanted to give you the tickets to Xue Liang’s art exhibition, but you didn’t accept them. Why don’t... I buy you the clothes? I’ll fork out the money, but you and Ah Zheng are already married. It’s better... to keep a distance from other men.”","Yao Mengqing slowly walked up to the cashier and said gently, “Hello, I’ll help Miss Qiao pay. Just swipe my card.”","The cashier immediately smiled and said, “Alright! Miss Yao, you’re so generous!”","“Some people shouldn’t pretend to be rich if they don’t have money! Since Miss Qiao is already married, why is she still shopping with another man? She’s really a loose woman!”","The cashier handed the bag of clothes to Qiao Xi and glared at Liang Pingchuan. “Tsk! Why are you pretending to be rich?!”","Qiao Xi looked at the shopping bags and said coldly, “I don’t want the clothes anymore.”","Yao Mengqing said gently, “Xi Xi, don’t be polite with me. Take it as my apology. I hope you won’t mind what happened before...”","“I’m not being polite.”","Qiao Xi’s expression was composed. “Do I need to spend money to get the clothes in my own shop?”","Liang Pingchuan had a proud look on his face. ‘Our Little Six is so domineering!’","The smile on Yao Mengqing’s face froze. Yao Mengqi, who was at the side, could not help but laugh.","“Did I hear wrongly? You said this shop belongs to you? Do you think I’m stupid?! How can this shop belong to you?”","“I just bought this shop.”","Qiao Xi instructed the manager, “Kick everyone else out.”","The cashier shuddered and turned pale.","Yao Mengqi looked at this scene in disbelief. The owner of the shop had changed so quickly?","Yao Mengqing frowned. “Xi Xi, you said that you just bought this shop? Did you use Ah Zheng’s money to do it?”","Everyone looked at her in confusion.","Yao Mengqing bit her lip and hesitated. “As Ah Zheng’s wife, it’s fine for you to spend his money, but...","“In order to stand up for this man, aren’t you spending... too much of Ah Zheng’s money?”","Yao Mengqi reacted and instantly shouted, “Qiao Xi! You’re spending your husband’s money to fool around outside! If your husband finds out, he’ll definitely beat you to death!”","Seeing that Qiao Xi did not say anything, Yao Mengqi became even fiercer. “If you don’t say anything, then it means that you’re tacitly agreeing! Your father has already cut off all ties with you. Now, it’s your husband who’s supporting you. Instead of coaxing your husband, you even dare to acquire a shop for an old man? You’re really crazy!”","Yao Mengqing said earnestly, “Xi Xi, I’ll pretend I didn’t see it this time. I won’t tell Ah Zheng, but I hope you can... stop contacting this man as soon as possible. Don’t ruin your family because of him.”","She slowly went forward and advised gently, “Wake up a little. Consider breaking up with him for Ah Zheng’s sake!”","Qiao Xi glanced at the man not far away and said with an icy cold voice, “Yao Mengqing, how long are you going to keep pretending?”","Yao Mengqing widened her eyes in grievances.."]},{"number":252,"title":"Chapter 252 - The Women At The Foot Of The Mountain Are Tigers","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Yao Mengqi suddenly rushed over and roared, “My sister is doing this for your own good. She’s worried that you’ll go astray. How dare you say that she’s pretending? You’re already married but you’re still fooling around with old men. You pretend to be noble, but you’re actually dirtier than anyone else!","“I think there are many more men apart from this old uncle, right? How many men have you been with? Are you crazy? My sister tried to persuade you out of kindness, but you think she’s harming you—”","“Heh! The Yao family is really full of talents.” The man’s cold laughter sounded slowly.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were deep, and his expression was cold as he slowly walked out with his long legs.","Liang Pingchuan looked at the man’s cold expression and wondered if he had caused trouble.","He had only wanted to give Little Six a few clothes, but he did not expect that others would misunderstand their relationship. It would be troublesome if Little Six’s husband got jealous.","Maybe he should hurry back up the mountain. The women at the foot of the mountain were like tigers!","Liang Pingchuan was about to call Xue Liang.","Yao Mengqi looked at the person who had just arrived and shouted unhappily, “I’m not done talking yet you’re interrupting me? Who the heck are you?”","Gu Zheng’s entire body exuded the aura of a king, making Yao Mengqi feel fear in her heart. However, she cared about her reputation and shouted unwillingly, “Qiao Xi, where did you seduce this wild man again...?”","“Qi Qi!” Yao Mengqing stopped her immediately, her face pale.","She was the eldest daughter of the Yao family, after all. She had been through a lot. She squeezed out a smile and said gently, “Ah Zheng, you’re here too.”","Gu Zheng glanced at her coldly and turned his face away in disgust.","Song Shijing said coldly, “Miss Yao, not everyone can call the president by his name. Only those close to him can call him ‘Ah Zheng’. You’re not related to the president, so you should still call him ‘President Gu’ in the future.”","Yao Mengqing choked and her heart trembled.","Yao Mengqi, who was standing at the side, trembled in fear when she heard this person’s name. Her face was filled with horror. “President Gu?”","He was the rumored head of the Gu family, Gu Zheng?","At this moment, Yao Mengqi was extremely regretful. Why did she have to say such things just now? She looked at Yao Mengqing, who had a calm expression.","Gu Zheng would probably not bicker with her. After all, the two of them were doing this for Gu Zheng. It was Qiao Xi who was fooling around with a man behind his back, while the two of them were even advising Qiao Xi!","Gu Zheng stood by Qiao Xi’s side and lowered his head slightly. His voice was calm, and one could not tell if he was angry. “Mrs. Gu, you’ve suffered.”","Liang Pingchuan was a little uneasy. He was thinking about how he should greet Gu Zheng, but he was afraid that Gu Zheng would misunderstand his relationship with Little Six. That would be awkward.","Before Liang Pingchuan could speak, Qiao Xi’s cold face suddenly became aggrieved.","“Ah Zheng, I feel so wronged! Miss Yao said that she’s your friend and she’s doing everything all for my own good. She didn’t listen to my explanation and immediately started lecturing me. I was too embarrassed to retort.","“Besides, if I said anything unpleasant, it’d ruin your friendship.”","Yao Mengqing felt suffocated. Qiao Xi was really good at acting!","She said that she did not want to ruin their friendship, but every word was an accusation.","Gu Zheng frowned and did not even bother looking at Yao Mengqing. “Song Shijing.”","Song Shijing understood what he meant. “Miss Yao, you and the president only know each other. You’re not friends at all. Even if Young Madam has done something wrong, you’re in no position to educate her.","“Miss Yao, have you thought about the consequences of trying to get close to the president and even bullying the young madam? You’re a smart person. I won’t say anything unnecessary. What do you think?”","Yao Mengqing’s eyes were vicious. She was so angry that she gritted her teeth.","Was Ah Zheng going to cut off all ties with her for Qiao Xi’s sake?","They had grown up together since they were young and had been friends for more than 20 years. However, he did not even want to be friends anymore because of Qiao Xi?","B*tch! She still dared to complain?","Could it be that Ah Zheng really liked women with Qiao Xi’s character?","Perhaps Ah Zheng was just trying to get something new. It was her fault for being too reserved and conservative all these years. If she had tried to seduce Ah Zheng like Qiao Xi, would the outcome have been different?","Yao Mengqing sniffled and choked. “Alright, I was too nosy. Ah Zheng... No, I shouldn’t have interfered in President Gu’s matter.. I was wrong.”"]},{"number":253,"title":"Chapter 253 - If You See Young Madam, Please Walk The Other Way","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Seeing her sister suffer, Yao Mengqi was exasperated.","“Sister! What did you do wrong? It’s her...”","Yao Mengqi looked at Qiao Xi’s proud expression and was angered to the point her face turned livid. She could not care less.","“President Gu, my sister did it for your sake in case you didn’t know that you’re being cuckolded! Qiao Xi got together with this old man and even bought a shop for him. That has cost you a lot of money, President Gu. You—”","“Cuckold?” Gu Zheng sneered, his deep voice sounded urgent.","Yao Mengqi was so scared that she took a few steps back. Her voice was trembling. “Yes! She made you a cuckold. Otherwise, why did she come out to shop with an old man?”","“Miss Yao, you don’t have an uncle?” Gu Zheng asked coldly.","Yao Mengqi was stunned. She was so nervous that she could not say anything.","“When you saw Qiao Xi with a man, your thoughts went astray. Could it be that this is the upbringing of the Yao family? Aren’t all of your thoughts too dirty? What’s wrong with Qiao Xi going shopping with her elders? How did it become an inappropriate relationship in your eyes?”","Gu Zheng’s thin lips parted slightly, and his voice was filled with disdain. “I’ve broadened my horizons today. The Yao family’s upbringing is indeed extraordinary.”","Yao Mengqing’s legs went weak and she almost lost her balance. She hurriedly explained, “Ah Zheng, I...”","Just then, Song Shijing stopped her. “Miss Yao, our young madam is innocent and weak. Our president doesn’t want her to be bullied again or be led astray by the Yao family.","“Miss Yao, please walk the other way if you ever see Young Madam in the future.”","Yao Mengqing defended herself weakly. “Ah Zheng, Qi Qi and I misunderstood, but I really did it for your own good. I didn’t mean to bully Xi Xi!”","Qiao Xi gently advised. “Hubby, Miss Yao is right. She’s beautiful and kind-hearted. She didn’t mean to say that I made you a cuckold! She’s also your friend. How could she wish to ruin our marriage?","“I think the elders of the Yao family must have done something out of line to make Miss Yao misunderstand me. You can’t blame her for this. It’s the influence of her family!”","Yao Mengqing: “...”","‘B*tch! I’ll kill you!’","Her heart felt heavy and she was so angry that she was about to vomit blood. However, she still forced herself to smile bitterly. “Ah Zheng, in that case... I’ll take my leave.”","Yao Mengqing’s tears streamed down her face as she cried and rushed out.","At this moment, someone ran over. “Mengqing?”","Yao Mengqing saw the person in front of her and wiped her tears aggrievedly.","The person in front of her was Gu Zheng’s good friend, Lin Jie. He looked at Yao Mengqing, who was sobbing uncontrollably, and his heart ached. “Who bullied you? I’ll take revenge for you!”","Yao Mengqing quickly denied it. “No, no.”","Lin Jie’s eyes turned cold. Yao Mengqing was the only woman among their group of childhood playmates, so everyone doted on her and treated her as their own sister. With the few of them as her backers, who would dare to bully her?","Yao Mengqing had always been an optimistic person, and this was the first time she cried so miserably. Lin Jie asked softly, “Mengqing, don’t be afraid. Tell me what happened.”","“Ah Jie, I-I’m fine...”","Yao Mengqi came running out to catch up to her sister. When she saw this, she blurted out, “How could you be fine? She treated you like this, so why would you show her any mercy?!”","“Young Master Lin, do you know about President Gu’s marriage? That Mrs. Gu is really a vicious person. She bullied my sister and even made President Gu cut off all ties with my sister!”","Yao Mengqing hurriedly said, “Qi Qi, stop talking!”","“Ah Jie, Sister-in-law... She’s just jealous and thinks because I’m a woman, she doesn’t want me to keep in contact with Ah Zheng. I understand her intentions, so just stay out of this...”","Lin Jie was instantly infuriated. “I didn’t expect Ah Zheng to bully you after marrying such a woman. You’re our younger sister. Even if you marry one day, you’re still the most important person to us.","“Our brothers all have girlfriends or wives by our side, but we get along very well with you. Is it just this Mrs. Gu who doesn’t take you seriously?","“We grew up together. You and Ah Zheng even slept on the same bed with the same blanket. At that time, Mrs. Gu still didn’t know Ah Zheng!","“Who does she think she is? She even made Ah Zheng cut ties with you?”"]},{"number":254,"title":"Chapter 254 - Being A B*tch While Trying To Get A Good Reputation","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Yao Mengqing looked sad. “I didn’t want this to happen either. I cherish my friendship with Ah Zheng and have tried my best to protect it, but Xi Xi just can’t stand me. She thinks I’ll snatch Ah Zheng away. If I really liked Ah Zheng, we would’ve gotten married a long time ago and might even have children by now. She wouldn’t even have gotten a chance.”","Lin Jie patted her shoulder gently. “Don’t cry. When I go to Longwan Residential with you, let’s see what she can do to me! We’ll watch a movie with Ah Zheng all night and sleep in Longwan Residential. We’ll show her who’s boss!”","...","Qiao Xi heard their conversation and smiled meaningfully.","What a good friend!","The man was already married but still wanted to sleep at another person’s home. If she dared to object, it would mean that she was jealous and petty enough to want to ruin their friendship.","Moreover, Qiao Xi had already expected that as long as it happened for the first time, Yao Mengqing would come countless times after that. She would even say, ‘We’re just friends. Don’t misunderstand. Don’t be so petty. Give your husband to me for a night.’","In that case, didn’t it mean that Yao Mengqing had slept with the entire industry?","Hence, these men were all her backers.","How could there be such a shameless woman? She was hanging out with these men as a friend, so it was only right that she became a public figure.","Normal women would keep a distance when they knew that the other party was married. They would not stick close to them as Yao Mengqing did.","Yao Mengqing was a b*tch who was trying to gain a good reputation. She would play along with her and become a b*tch too, then!","...","When the few of them came out of the mall, Liang Pingchuan pulled Qiao Xi over and asked in a low voice, “Little Six, is he your husband?”","Qiao Xi was slightly guilty. After she went down the mountain, she secretly got married and did not tell her elders.","Just as she was thinking about how to explain it, Liang Pingchuan said thoughtfully, “He looks a little familiar to me. I think he’s been to the mountain before.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes widened. “Huh? He’s been to the mountain?”","The place on the mountain was their shelter and outsiders were practically not allowed to enter. It was impossible for Gu Zheng to have gone there.","It was possible for Teacher Liang to say that he had seen him before, but Gu Zheng having gone to the mountain before? It was really unbelievable.","At this moment, Liang Pingchuan looked serious. “It’s him! He even went twice. He’s good-looking and has a strong aura, so I remember him very well.”","Liang Pingchuan had always been a reclusive person who paid no attention to external affairs. He knew that Gu Zheng had been to the mountain but did not know why.","The old man was the one who made the decisions on the mountain. After the old man went missing, Teacher Liang took on the responsibility.","Qiao Xi thought about it. In her memory, the only person who could ascend the mountain was probably the big shot that her third brother spoke of.","The legendary fiance.","It was just that wasn’t her former fiance Lu Yan? Lu Yan was the heir of the Lu family and he also held the resources of precious elements.","If that was the case, what was Gu Zheng’s identity?","Could it be...","Qiao Xi came to a sudden understanding!","“Teacher, I understand! Do you know who Gu Zheng’s biological mother is? It’s Madam Lu Qingyun! Lu Yan isn’t Madam Lu’s son at all!”","She said in a low voice, “Grandpa treats Madam Lu as his biological daughter. If he knows that Gu Zheng is Madam Lu’s child, he’d naturally allow him to go up the mountain!”","Liang Pingchuan frowned.","Why did Little Six not think that Gu Zheng was that legendary figure? Her ex-fiance?","However, since Little Six had already said so, Liang Pingchuan could not retort. “You’re right.”","“Teacher, I have something to ask you.” Qiao Xi’s expression became serious.","“Gu Zheng and Madam Lu... have been poisoned by the same kind of poison. They’ll go blind in the dark. I’ve also seen his poison flare up once. It’s extremely painful. I could only use my blood to temporarily suppress the poison.”","Liang Pingchuan widened his eyes in shock. “You fed him your blood?”","Little Six was really fearless. She actually dared to feed him her blood. Then wouldn’t Gu Zheng know what she was thinking?","Then there was no need for her to pretend to be weak anymore. Anyway, he would already know what she was thinking.","Qiao Xi had a puzzled expression. “Teacher? Why are you reacting so strongly?”","“...” Liang Pingchuan stroked his beard, his voice trembling. “You... You don’t know?”"]},{"number":255,"title":"Chapter 255 - Her Weak Persona Has Collapsed!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi’s heart thumped. “W-What are you talking about?”","Liang Pingchuan really wanted to knock Little Six on the head to teach this child a lesson.","She did not even know the side effects of doing this yet she still dared to rashly use her blood to save someone. As long as she used her blood to save someone, the other party would be able to hear her thoughts.","Moreover, over time, their lives would be closely linked.","She was a silly child. Even though she had married Gu Zheng, she could not risk her life. If she regretted it, there would be no way out.","Liang Pingchuan’s expression was gloomy. He was just about to remind her when he heard Qiao Xi speak abruptly.","“Teacher, I understand. You’re afraid that Gu Zheng will imprison me after finding out about this. When the poison takes effect, he’ll want to feed on my blood to detoxify the poison?”","Liang Pingchuan rolled his eyes.","“If you know that, how dare you still do it? Do you know Gu Zheng? Do you dare to reveal your secret? If he’s vicious, you’ll be his antidote that can be regenerated indefinitely!”","Qiao Xi had long considered this matter. If Gu Zheng was really such a person, then her future would definitely be very painful.","However, she believed that he would not do that.","Liang Pingchuan’s face turned red with anger when he thought of how painful it would be for Little Six. “Do you know him well? It’s fine that you got married in a flash, but you—”","Qiao Xi said indifferently, “Teacher, I know him. I’ve known him for ten years.”","Liang Pingchuan choked and looked at her in disbelief.","Qiao Xi took a deep breath. “Teacher, do you know about my senior?”","Liang Pingchuan nodded without hesitation.","The mountain was originally filled with men. The old man had taken in four disciples, all of whom were boys. One day, he brought back a girl.","Qin An and Xue Liang found her cute and wanted her to call them ‘Senior’, but the child refused. After they got to know her better, she said that she only had one senior. He was the hacker, Mo Yuan. Hence, she no longer called others her seniors.","After that, the few of them did not force her and just let her call them ‘Brother’. That was how everyone got to know the hacker Mo Yuan.","Hence, Liang Pingchuan was clearly aware of how much Qiao Xi cared about Mo Yuan. It was just that he never expected that Gu Zheng would be Mo Yuan.","At this moment, Gu Zheng walked over slowly. “The sisters have left. It’s been hard on you, Mrs. Gu.”","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes and pretended to be aggrieved, but she was thinking—","‘If it weren’t for the sake of maintaining my weak image, I would’ve dealt with them long ago! How dare they fight me?! They’re still too inexperienced!’","When she looked up again, her eyes were red. “They’re so scary! They didn’t even want to listen to my explanation. I’m too weak. I can’t beat them at all.”","“...” Liang Pingchuan gaped.","Little Six’s image of a weak woman was really awesome!","Back on the mountain, everyone knew her character. No one would believe her even if she pretended to be weak. Now, everyone here thought that Little Six was weak and could not take care of herself.","Unfortunately, she could deceive others but not Gu Zheng! He could hear Little Six’s thoughts.","At this moment, Little Six should be scolding Yao Mengqing in her heart. Her image as a weak woman had collapsed!","If Gu Zheng thought that she was two-faced, he might hate her.","Liang Pingchuan was flustered and thinking about how to help her out of this predicament. Gu Zheng, who was beside him, said nonchalantly, “You’re really too weak. They bullied you so badly, but you didn’t resist at all. In the future, the management here won’t let the Yao family come to this mall anymore. They won’t be able to bully you anymore.”","Qiao Xi said, “Ah Zheng, you’re so good to me!”","Liang Pingchuan: “...”","He even wondered if he had remembered wrongly. Could it be that such side effects would not occur after blood treatment?","If Gu Zheng could hear her thoughts, how could he still think that she was weak?","Moreover, she had known Gu Zheng for ten years. Hence, Liang Pingchuan was sure that Gu Zheng was just not exposing her and just wanted her to continue maintaining her weak image.","“...” Should he tell Little Six the truth?","The atmosphere suddenly turned awkward.","‘What’s with Teacher’s expression? Why is he hesitating? Is he going to expose my weak image?","‘My good teacher! You’ve lived with me for so long. Of course, you’ll find it a little strange, but Gu Zheng likes my weak persona! Don’t expose me!’"]},{"number":256,"title":"Chapter 256 - Husband’s Decree Appears","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Just as Qiao Xi was muttering in her heart, Gu Zheng suddenly coughed.","Liang Pingchuan knew that Gu Zheng must have heard something. Moreover, Little Six did not know this secret. He did not know what nonsense she was thinking about in her mind.","He looked up at Gu Zheng and realized that he was also looking at him. The two of them looked away.","Qiao Xi suddenly said, “Teacher, you seemed to have something to tell me just now. What do I not know?”","Liang Pingchuan hesitated. He wanted to tell Little Six that using blood to save someone had side effects. The other party would be able to hear her thoughts.","Now...","Liang Pingchuan frowned.","Gu Zheng seemed to enjoy this kind of feeling. If he told her about this, would it not ruin the fun between the couple?","Hence, he cleared his throat and said, “I don’t remember.”","Qiao Xi sighed. “Alas, you’re old now and your memory isn’t good anymore.”","Liang Pingchuan: “...”","Little brat!","When Liang Pingchuan left, he instructed in a low voice, “Little Six, we’re not on the mountain now. You have to restrain yourself outside. Don’t—”","‘Don’t keep thinking nonsense. There’s no need to pretend to be weak on the surface.’","However, before he could finish his sentence, Qiao Xi said with a puzzled expression, “Restrain myself? Gu Zheng is very good to me!”","Liang Pingchuan: “...” ‘You don’t understand me!’","He looked at Gu Zheng with a meaningful gaze and wanted to say something, but he suddenly saw a very ordinary-looking jade token hanging on Qiao Xi’s neck. His entire body instantly trembled.","This was...","Liang Pingchuan looked up in shock. “President Gu? You gave this to her?”","Gu Zheng’s expression was calm. “I gave her a small gift.”","Qiao Xi nodded. “Yes, Teacher, what’s strange about it?”","It was just a jade token. Compared to the other gifts Gu Zheng had given her, this was considered cheap. However, the center of the jade token was empty. It was just enough to hold a few silver needles. If necessary, it could be used as a concealed weapon.","Liang Pingchuan: “!!!” This jade token was the Husband’s Decree of the Gu family! How could Little Six not know this?","Liang Pingchuan had heard of the Husband’s Decree. It was something only the mistress of the Gu family could possess. A Husband’s Decree could command the entire Gu family.","The Gu family’s assets were owned by the head of the family and the madam who held the Husband’s Decree. With the Husband’s Decree, it meant that Little Six owned half of the Gu family’s assets.","Rumor had it that the Husband’s Decree was lost and no mistress had received it in the past hundred years.","Liang Pingchuan thought that the Gu family had long since abolished the Husband’s Decree. Who would have thought that Gu Zheng would actually give it to Qiao Xi?","Most importantly... she did not know!","Liang Pingchuan was speechless. “President Gu, I’m afraid that’s not appropriate.”","Little Six was holding the Husband’s Decree. If someone were to see this, they would definitely think of ways to deal with her.","Gu Zheng said indifferently, “There’s nothing wrong with it.”","Liang Pingchuan was about to retort when Gu Zheng said seriously, “Since I gave it to her, it means that I can protect her.”","She was the person most qualified to hold the Husband’s Decree.","Liang Pingchuan took a deep breath and waved his hand to get Qiao Xi to leave his side. He lowered his voice and asked, “President Gu, Little Six is stubborn by nature. She grew up on the mountain and hates being tied down. Even with the Husband’s Decree and the blood treatment, you can’t control her.”","Gu Zheng understood Liang Pingchuan’s intentions, so he promised, “Mr. Liang, I’m not trying to control her, but I think she has the right to hold the Husband’s Decree. I also have the ability to protect her without worry, and the blood treatment...”","Liang Pingchuan thought that Gu Zheng would promise not to hurt Little Six because of her blood.","However, Gu Zheng became serious. “I won’t take her blood anymore, much less let her be injured.”","That time, he had lost consciousness because of the poison and allowed Qiao Xi to save him with her blood.","If his poison remained a mystery, wouldn’t he have to continue taking Qiao Xi’s blood? It might even cause irreversible harm to her.","Gu Zheng could not bear to see her take such a risk.","Liang Pingchuan’s heart trembled as he sighed. “Alright, bring Little Six home, then.”","The man Little Six had taken a liking to was really not bad. After all, they had known each other for ten years.. He was bold and responsible. He was a good man!"]},{"number":257,"title":"Chapter 257 - Rejected","paragraphs":["The next day.","Xue Liang’s art exhibition began at three in the afternoon.","Qiao Xi had been looking at his paintings since she was young and had long lost interest in them.","However, Song Shiyu was Xue Liang’s die-hard fan and the tickets for the art exhibition were hard to come by. Many wealthy families could not get them, so how could he, an assistant, get one?","Moreover, Gu Yao had been clamoring to go. Hence, Qiao Xi asked Xue Liang for two tickets.","At two in the afternoon, Song Shiyu and Gu Yao were wearing suits and waiting at the entrance of the art exhibition.","At half-past two, everyone gradually came into the venue.","Gu Yao looked at the people around him. They were all from the noble families of Li City. Even the people from the bureaucracy were here.","He could not help but sigh. “My idol is really too handsome! Xue Liang is the best!”","No matter how powerful and noble a person was, they had to queue up obediently just to see his art exhibition. This was the greatest affirmation.","This was a relatively high-end venue. It was quiet and orderly, but the silence was broken by a harsh female voice.","“Look clearly, these are our tickets! What right do you have to stop us from entering?”","Gu Yao and Song Shiyu looked in the direction of the voice.","A middle-aged woman dressed in exquisite clothes and silver jewelry had a vicious look in her eyes. Her face was red. “Let me in! Why aren’t you giving me a reasonable explanation? I already spent money to buy a ticket!”","Everyone’s gazes landed on her, making her feel extremely awkward.","Gu Yao muttered, “Madam Yao? Why isn’t she allowed in? Could she have offended Xue Liang?”","At this moment, Madam Yao’s expression was ugly. She wished for nothing more than to find a hole to bury herself in it.","The Yao family only managed to get two tickets. She was accompanying her daughter to attend the art exhibition.","However, when they reached the door, they were stopped.","Madam Yao had never been so humiliated. “Give me a reason!”","The staff member smiled helplessly. “I’m sorry, but this is an instruction from the higher-ups. We can’t let you in.”","Madam Yao wanted to curse but was stopped by Yao Mengqing.","Yao Mengqing said gently, “The tickets were bought through the legal channels. There shouldn’t be anything wrong with them. Please help me investigate what went wrong.”","Yao Mengqing had a good reputation in the circle, so someone quickly spoke up for her. “That’s right. How could the eldest daughter and madam of the Yao family buy fake tickets? You must be mistaken.”","The staff member was helpless. He could only turn around and make a call. After a while, he walked out and said with a helpless voice.","“I’m sorry, Miss Yao and Madam Yao. I’ve already asked Mr. Xue’s assistant. Mr. Xue was the one who canceled the Yao family’s tickets. As for the reason, I suggest you ask Mr. Xue directly.”","Madam Yao was so angry that she nearly vomited blood!","Her daughter had finally gotten two tickets and she even posted them on her WeChat Moments to show off. Unexpectedly, she could not enter today.","They even said that the Yao family’s invitation was canceled, but she could not figure out when the Yao family had offended Xue Liang.","Madam Yao looked ferocious. “Shut up! The Yao family has never offended Xue Liang! You must have done it on purpose. Hurry up and let us in!”","Yao Mengqing remained silent and did not stop Madam Yao.","This was because she also thought that Xue Liang would not do this. It must be because this staff member was dissatisfied with the Yao family.","“There’s really no law! We spent money to buy the tickets, so why can’t we enter? You said that it was Xue Liang’s assistant who said it? Then get him to come out and give us an explanation!”","“Alright, I’ll give you an explanation.”","At this moment, a gentle voice sounded.","Xue Liang had rushed over from his studio to make the final arrangements with the staff.","He said indifferently, “There’s no need to look for my assistant. I’ll tell you myself.”","When everyone saw Xue Liang appear, they all rushed over. “Ah! Xue Liang is here!”","“Not only is Xue Liang talented but he’s also very handsome!”","“I heard that Xue Liang has a gentle character. Why would he make things difficult for the Yao family? The Yao family must have done something overboard to anger Xue Liang!”","Hearing the discussion of the crowd, Madam Yao gritted her teeth and shouted, “We’ve never seen Xue Liang before at all. How did we offend him? Mr. Xue, you came at the right time. I want to ask why you’re not letting me in? Was it your assistant who interfered?”","Xue Liang glanced at Madam Yao coldly and landed his gaze on Yao Mengqing.","“Miss Yao, don’t you want to say anything?”"]},{"number":258,"title":"Chapter 258 - Brother Xue Liang Slaps Her Face","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Everyone widened their eyes. Could it be that Yao Mengqing had angered Xue Liang?","Madam Yao blurted out, “What does this have to do with Mengqing? My daughter is beautiful and kind-hearted. How could she have possibly offended you? If you don’t give me a reason, I won’t be leaving today!”","“In that case, I’ll tell Madam Yao about it myself.”","Xue Liang sneered, his eyes filled with indifference.","Making things difficult for Little Six was equivalent to offending him!","He heard that Yao Mengqing had a good reputation and she had many men backing her up. He wanted to know who would stand up for her today.","Whoever dared to bully Little Six would be going against him!","Xue Liang said coldly, “Madam Yao, the reason why I canceled the Yao family’s invitation is that the elders of the Yao family are really shameless. An art exhibition is a place for the nobles, so the Yao family is not allowed to enter.","“Madam Yao, you shouldn’t be arguing with me. Why don’t you ask Miss Yao what she has done?”","Hearing Xue Liang’s words, Madam Yao’s face turned pale and her lips trembled.","Were the elders of the Yao family shameless?","Who exactly had offended Xue Liang?","Madam Yao looked at the burning gazes around her and felt uncomfortable. She did not have time to think and immediately retorted, “Nonsense! What did the elders of the Yao family do? What did my daughter do? Tell me clearly! Otherwise, I’ll sue you for slander!”","Looking at the farce in front of him, Gu Yao said to Song Shiyu in a low voice, “Madam Yao’s shrewish behavior proves that the elders of the Yao family are shameless.”","Song Shiyu nodded furiously.","Xue Liang asked slowly, “Madam Yao, do you really want me to say it?”","Yao Mengqing’s face sank and she felt uneasy. She hurriedly said, “Mr. Xue...”","Xue Liang ignored her and said slowly, “Yesterday, Miss Yao bumped into my sister and uncle at the mall. Miss Yao mocked my sister for being our uncle’s mistress.”","Everyone gasped.","Xue Liang said coldly, “My uncle hasn’t seen my sister in a long time and wanted to buy her a few sets of clothes. In Miss Yao’s eyes, it became an inappropriate relationship between a man and a woman. I think it’s probably because the elders of the Yao family are keeping young mistresses, which is why Miss Yao thought so.","“Miss Yao can’t be blamed for this. After all, it was the elders of the Yao family who did those shameless acts.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Xue Liang glanced at her indifferently. “Madam Yao, did Miss Yao not tell you what happened yesterday?”","Everyone looked at the Yao family’s mother and daughter in disdain.","It was not aimed just at them but at the entire Yao family.","Everyone in the industry knew that although Xue Liang was not good at socializing, he had an easy-going character and was aloof from worldly affairs. This time, he had stepped forward to berate the Yao family. The Yao family must have gone too far.","Moreover, he had also said that the people Miss Yao bullied were his uncle and younger sister. How could he sit idle when his own family was being insulted?","It was reasonable that the Yao family was not allowed to attend his art exhibition.","“The Yao family still has the cheek to come here. You just insulted Xue Liang’s relatives and still have the gall to ask how you’ve offended him? You b*tches!”","“I heard that Xue Liang’s uncle is Liang Pingchuan!”","“Huh? Liang Pingchuan? The master of musical instruments who’s also good at medicine?”","“The Yao family dares to insult Mr. Liang like this? They’re really audacious! Xue Liang was already being polite by just refusing to let them attend his art exhibition. If it were me, I would’ve given them two tight slaps and told them to scram. How could they still have the cheek to demand an explanation?”","Madam Yao trembled as she watched in disbelief.","Yao Mengqing hurriedly supported Madam Yao, who was on the verge of collapse. Her expression was very ugly as she bit her lip. “I’m sorry, Mr. Xue. I didn’t do it on purpose yesterday. I... I’ll apologize to you in person. I’m very sorry!”","Although everyone did not know who Xue Liang’s sister was, just Liang Pingchuan’s identity was enough to make them angry.","Madam Yao and Yao Mengqing left dejectedly, and the crowd entered the venue one after another.","After a while, Lin Jie rushed over. “Mengqing!”","Yao Mengqing’s tears trickled down. “Ah Jie...”","“I heard that you and Aunt were chased out. What happened?”","Yao Mengqing looked aggrieved. “Yesterday, I saw Xi Xi shopping at the mall with Xue Liang’s uncle.. The two of them were very close. Moreover, that old man even bought things for Xi Xi, so there was a misunderstanding...”"]},{"number":259,"title":"Chapter 259 - Time To Make A Move","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“I didn’t do it on purpose. It’s just that I’ve never seen that old man before. Moreover, why would he spend so much money on Xi Xi for no reason? I just thought that they had an inappropriate relationship.","“I also did it for Ah Zheng, so I tried to persuade Xi Xi to cut off all contact with that man. I had no ill intention. Who knew that I would offend Xue Liang?”","Yao Mengqing choked and said, “It doesn’t matter if I suffer a little, but it implicated my mother too.”","Lin Jie was infuriated when he heard that. “Qiao Xi is such a scourge! She and that man are not related, so it’s normal for others to misunderstand if a man is spending so much money on her.","“You can only blame her for having a bad reputation. If it were you, no one would think that way!”","Yao Mengqing lowered her eyes. “If I anger Xue Liang, I might implicate Brother. I’m afraid...”","Lin Jie comforted her softly. “Don’t be afraid, I’ll help you. There’s an auction in Li City in two days. Xue Liang once said that he really wanted one of the violins to give it to his younger sister. If we can get the violin so he can give it to his sister as our apology to him...”","When Yao Mengqing heard the words ‘give it to his younger sister,’ she thought of Qiao Xi.","Could it be that Qiao Xi was Xue Liang’s younger sister?","Impossible!","Qiao Xi did not have an elder brother at all. It was definitely because of Liang Pingchuan’s reputation that Xue Liang refused to say that his relationship with Qiao Xi was improper, so he said that Qiao Xi was his younger sister.","Yao Mengqing nodded. If she gave Xue Liang that violin, he would probably not hate the Yao family anymore.","However, she thought about it and frowned. “That violin is handmade. It’s worth... five million dollars. I can’t take out that much right now...”","Lin Jie immediately understood what she meant. He patted his chest and said, “It’s just five million! I’ll pay for it for you!”","“Ah Jie! I can’t...”","“We’re good friends. Giving you a violin is nothing. To me, five million is nothing as long as you’re happy! Mengqing, I’ve never even given such a valuable gift to my girlfriend before. However, if it’s for you, I can buy it no matter how expensive it is.”","Yao Mengqing’s face turned red. She said gently, “Ah Jie, you’re the best.”","Gu Yao, who was hiding in the dark, overheard their conversation. His eyes were filled with disappointment.","This Lin Jie was also a wonder!","Since he liked Yao Mengqing so much, why did he look for other women? Couldn’t he just be with Yao Mengqing?","She thought of him as a friend but was closer to him than his girlfriend. Didn’t this mean she was having an affair?","Lin Jie hugged Yao Mengqing and said softly, “Mengqing, there’s one more thing. I’ve investigated Qiao Xi and found that she didn’t take the college entrance examination.”","Yao Mengqing’s eyes immediately lit up. “That’s impossible, right?”","“She didn’t take the college entrance examination but was able to enter Li City University. It must be because she seduced a certain man or is being kept by someone. Her sugar daddy must have done something for her.”","Yao Mengqing’s eyes darkened. She pretended to be surprised. “How can Li City University, a century-old university, accept a teacher like her?”","...","At this moment, Qiao Xi saw the message sent by Xue Liang. She said firmly, “Teacher, did you tell Fourth Brother something, so he started having ideas?”","Liang Pingchuan leaned lazily on the chair. “You girl! When your fourth brother gets angry, he can even kill Yao Mengqing. I tried to persuade him repeatedly before he agreed to only chase her out.”","Qiao Xi nodded. He was right.","Fourth Brother looked harmless and had a gentle character. In reality, he was the most terrifying when he was angry. He could easily kill someone.","At this moment, Qiao Xi’s phone rang. It was a call from the Qiao family’s old residence.","She had a strange expression on her face. Why was the Qiao family calling her?","“Little Six.” Liang Pingchuan saw her hesitation. “The Qiao family has been looking for your third brother recently, asking him to forgive the Qiao family.”","Qiao Xi was slightly surprised. “Third Brother didn’t tell me!”","“He knows that you hate the Qiao family and can’t bear to disturb you. But even with the Qiao family’s courage, they won’t dare to touch you anymore. It’s time to take action, don’t you think?” Liang Pingchuan raised an eyebrow.","Her teacher was worthy of being a cultured person. Even his harsh words were spoken so tactfully, yet Qiao Xi instantly understood what he meant.","She should indeed make a trip to the Qiao family’s house!"]},{"number":260,"title":"Chapter 260 - Taking The Way Of A B*tch","paragraphs":["Qiao Zhenguo had called her because he wanted her to get Third Brother to let them off.","In this world, no one wished for the Qiao family to perish more than Qiao Xi. How could she plead on their behalf?","She picked up the phone. Qiao Zhenguo took two deep breaths before he calmed down. His suppressed voice came slowly. “Xi Xi...”","Qiao Xi’s brows raised.","Qiao Zhenguo pretended to be weak. “I’m sick. Can you come back and see me? I miss you.”","Hah! Qiao Zhenguo was sick? He wanted to see her? How could she possibly believe him?","In order to deceive her, he even came up with such a lie. Was he not afraid of losing his life?","However, Qiao Xi was still very calm. Since he wanted her to go back, then she would go back and play with the Qiao family. She would see what they could do.","Qiao Xi chuckled. “Alright, I’ll go see you right away.”","She was just feeling bored when the Qiao family came knocking on her door. She could go and have some fun!","...","In the Qiao family’s house.","Qiao Zhenguo looked anxious. “She agreed to come back, but I don’t think she’s easy to deal with. What will we do about President Qin, then?”","Two days ago, Qin An gave the Qiao family a final call. He told them that if they could not obtain Qiao Xi’s forgiveness, the Qiao family would completely disappear from Li City.","What had Qiao Xi done to make the person in charge of the Qin family and the eldest daughter of the Qin family pressure the Qiao family?!","Now that the Qiao family was forced into a dead-end, they could only beg Qiao Xi for forgiveness.","Previously, the old madam of the Qiao family had been unwilling to apologize to this wild girl. Qiao Zhenguo also could not bear to let Xu Mei and Qiao Rou lower their heads, so this matter was dragged on until today.","Later on, Old Madam Qiao came up with a plan, so he called to invite Qiao Xi over.","Qiao Zhenguo asked somewhat uneasily, “Will this method work?”","Old Madam Qiao had a look of disdain. “What’s wrong with it?! The Qiao family is all her relatives. We’re asking for forgiveness in front of those students. If we say a few good words, what more could she ask for?”","“Zhenguo, tell Rou Rou and Xu Mei not to care about their reputation anymore. Just lower their heads. I’ll plead with her too. Coupled with the students’ advice, she’ll definitely forgive us.”","If Qiao Xi was unwilling to forgive them even after they did this, it would not be good for her reputation if news of this got out. Others would say that she was heartless.","Qiao Zhenguo was still uneasy. “What if Qiao Xi agrees now and regrets it later?”","“Record a video as evidence. If she dares to back out, we’ll upload it online. We’ll let everyone see how she treats her family. She’ll be left with no reputation!”","Qiao Zhenguo’s heart finally calmed down a little. He had asked Qiao Rou to call the students in the university to come over as guests. With so many people present, how could Qiao Xi not forgive them?","...","Qiao Xi slowly went downstairs after changing.","Pfft! Liang Pingchuan looked up and spat out a mouthful of tea.","She was wearing a simple and elegant dress, making her look frail and weak. She had only applied light makeup on her face, and her lips were pale. Her eyes were slightly red, while her long hair hung loosely on her shoulders. her appearance made one want to protect her.","What was going on?","Gu Zheng’s expression was magical as he stared at her.","Qiao Xi smiled.","‘That’s right! With this expression, they’ll naturally be shocked. They’ll think I’m weak and pitiful!","‘Look at my red face and slightly red eyes. With some eye drops, others will definitely think that I’ve suffered a great grievance!’","Liang Pingchuan wiped the tea from his mouth and asked in horror, “Little Six, did someone hit you in the eyes?”","Gu Zheng: “...”","Qiao Xi raised her brows.","‘This is exactly the effect I wanted! With my superb makeup skills, nobody will be able to detect any flaws. It’s comparable to special effects makeup!’","Gu Zheng said calmly, “She just put on makeup.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","‘Why is this bastard Gu Zheng exposing me? Even a straight man can’t tell that I’m wearing makeup. How did he figure it out’]","Gu Zheng smiled. Even if he could not hear Mrs. Gu’s thoughts, he would know that she was pretending.","This was because Mrs. Gu was best at pretending to be weak. She had chosen to deal with the Qiao family by taking the way of a b*tch.","Qiao Xi muttered in her heart—","‘Oh my God! I remember now! Gu Zheng is no ordinary man! Could it be that he’s gay?’"]},{"number":261,"title":"Chapter 261 - President Qiao Is Truly Loyal!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Zheng frowned and secretly clenched his fists.","Hah! It turned out that this was what Mrs. Gu thought of him in her heart.","Gu Zheng said casually, “I’ll send you there.”","Qiao Xi sat on the sofa beside him and said slowly, “Wait a little longer.”","...","At eight in the evening.","The students had all arrived at the Qiao family’s house, but the main character of the party was not here yet. Qiao Rou stomped her feet anxiously. “Is Sister not coming?”","Xu Mei sighed. “I think Xi Xi must have something urgent to attend to, so she couldn’t arrive in time. She didn’t mean for everyone to wait.”","Everyone frowned and complained, “Qiao Xi is really rude! She invited us to participate in the banquet but she’s late herself.”","Qiao Rou bit her lip and advised softly, “Don’t be anxious. My sister will definitely come. Let’s wait a little longer...”","A student snorted. “As the Qiao family’s eldest daughter, she doesn’t know any etiquette at all. It’s indeed different to have grown up in the countryside!”","“Rou Rou, don’t defend her. She won’t appreciate your kindness at all.”","Qiao Rou’s face turned red. “Don’t say that. She definitely isn’t doing it on purpose. Let me explain...”","Bang!","Someone slammed the wine glass down, causing the alcohol to spill onto the table.","Xu Mei’s eyes turned cold. Who was so insensible to not give Rou Rou face? When she saw that the other party was Xue Yi, she could only swallow her words.","Behind Xue Yi was the Xue family of the capital, so she naturally did not dare to offend them. Furthermore, Xue Yi was a musical genius herself. Li City University had invited her to join them so that she could bring honor to the university back then.","Qiao Rou invited her over because of her special identity. With her around, it would be easier to deal with Qiao Xi. Then, she would not have to be afraid of Qin An anymore.","Hence, Xu Mei could only smile and did not dare to say anything bad to Xue Yi.","Qiao Rou was stunned for a moment. Xue Yi and Xue Liang were both surnamed Xue. Could it be that both of them shared a relationship?","No, impossible!","Xue Yi was from the Xue family in the capital, while Xue Liang had always been overseas. It should be a coincidence and they shouldn’t be related at all!","Everyone was silent. Xue Yi said slowly, “This glass is nice.”","Qiao Zhenguo had a smile on his face. He did not expect that the glass would catch Xue Yi’s eye. He said obsequiously, “This glass was bought by me for 500,000 yuan. The glass in your hand matches the glass in Rou Rou’s hand.”","Xu Mei smiled and said, “Yes, this was my birthday gift from Zhenguo 20 years ago. I thought that since we were having important guests today, I should bring them out.”","Everyone sighed. The Qiao couple was really loving. They bought a pair of glasses for 500,000 yuan. It was really too extravagant.","Unexpectedly, Xue Yi said indifferently, “This white porcelain is exquisitely carved and has a clear color. It’s indeed worth 500,000 yuan. However, President Qiao didn’t have a family business to run 20 years ago, so how could you afford such expensive glasses?”","“...”","The venue was silent.","Xue Yi looked calm and said indifferently, “I think the glasses must be a treasure previously bid by Qiao Xi’s mother, President Qiao’s first wife, right? Since you still have these glasses, it means that President Qiao is still thinking about his first wife. How loyal!”","...","Everyone looked awkward and could not help but look at Xu Mei.","She remembered that Xu Mei had just said that these glasses were a birthday gift from Qiao Zhenguo.","The people who attended the banquet were all ordinary students. Be it the Qiao family or Xue Yi, they did not dare to offend either of them. Hence, they lowered their heads and drank their beverages, not daring to say a word.","Qiao Zhenguo hurriedly looked at Old Madam Qiao. The old woman was, after all, a wily old woman. She sighed softly. “I’m old and my body can’t take it anymore. Why isn’t Xi Xi back yet? We agreed to meet at 7: 30 pm. It’s already past 8 pm, but she’s still nowhere to be seen...”","Old Madam Qiao targeted Qiao Xi with her words.","Qiao Rou’s eyes lit up. It did not matter whose glasses they were. The important thing was why Qiao Xi had not appeared yet. Letting a group of people wait for her was really rude!","Old Madam Qiao was helpless.. “Looks like Xi Xi still blames me... Sigh! Zhenguo called to beg her. I thought she would come back, but judging from the situation, it’s hard to say...”"]},{"number":262,"title":"Chapter 262 - The Host Appears","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Xu Mei quickly went over to calm her down. “Mom, watch out for your health. Although Xi Xi is a little willful, there are so many people here today. She won’t do such a thing. Moreover, she hasn’t been home for so long. She’ll definitely come back to see you.”","Xue Yi swept a cold glance over at Xu Mei. This mistress was indeed capable. She pretended to persuade the old madam, but in reality, she was saying that Qiao Xi was unfilial, reckless, and willful.","It seemed that Xue Liang was right. The Qiao family was really detestable.","Xue Yi did not say anything else because she knew that Little Six would definitely come and not let this group of people off easily.","After a while, everyone complained loudly.","They could not interfere with the Qiao family’s matters, but Qiao Xi being late meant that she did not take them seriously!","Qiao Zhenguo looked at the time, his eyes filling with anger. He gritted his teeth and said, “I’ll call and ask if she’s still coming. In order to celebrate her return, I invited so many people over, but she made us wait so long without saying anything!”","Xu Mei had an apologetic look on her face as she bent down to the crowd. “Students, I think Xi Xi won’t be coming anymore. I’m really sorry for taking up so much of your time.”","Qiao Rou pretended to be lonely. Actually, it was a good thing that Qiao Xi did not come. It caused Qiao Xi to have the reputation of being disrespectful to her elders and willful.","Immediately after, she slowly stepped forward and was at a loss. “There must be a reason why my sister isn’t here. Maybe... she’s still unwilling to forgive me. If you want to blame someone... blame me. It’s all my fault. It has nothing to do with my sister!","“I’ve let everyone down. Please forgive me!”","Qiao Rou’s tears fell. Her pitiful appearance made the male students’ hearts ache, so they comforted her softly. “Rou Rou, it’s not your fault.”","“Yeah, it’s clearly Qiao Xi’s fault. What does it have to do with you?”","“Qiao Xi is too much! Does she think we’re monkeys?”","“When we get back to the university, I’ll write a thread and attack her. I’ll let everyone see what kind of person she is! She lets her elders and students wait for her without the intention of appearing—”","“Dad, I’m sorry I’m late.”","At this moment, a weak and trembling voice was heard. It sounded as if she would cry the next second.","Qiao Xi was wearing a plain dress and looked frail like a flower that was swaying in the wind.","Her eyes were lonely. “A-Are all of you leaving?”","Qiao Zhenguo could not suppress his anger and shouted, “You still have the cheek to come? If you didn’t want to come, you should’ve given me a call to let me know. You made everyone wait so long for nothing. What do you mean by this?”","Qiao Rou cried out, “Sister, you must hate me, so you didn’t want to come. But since you agreed, why did you still do this? Grandma’s health isn’t good, and Dad is sick. They had been waiting for you.”","The label of being unfilial fell heavily on Qiao Xi.","Qiao Rou was well aware that with Qiao Xi’s character, she would absolutely retort.","If Qiao Xi dared to retort, she would cry. At that time, everyone would attack Qiao Xi and Qiao Xi would not be able to explain herself.","Qiao Rou lowered her head and secretly revealed a proud smile.","Unexpectedly, as soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi’s entire body trembled as her eyes turned red.","“Sister, I’m sorry. I didn’t do it on purpose. The security guards at the door didn’t let me in.","“They said that the Qiao family has only one young miss, and that’s you. I’m just a wild girl. They even told me to get lost! I... They refused to let me in no matter what, so I was late. I’m sorry, everyone.”","Xue Yi: “...”","Qiao Rou choked, and her face turned pale.","What was going on? Was Qiao Xi pretending to be weak?","Qiao Xi sighed helplessly, but she sneered in her heart. Qiao Rou was stunned just like that? Yet she still dared to fight her?","She scanned the crowd indifferently. Indeed, the Qiao family’s expressions were extremely ugly as if they were constipated.","Qiao Xi said again, “Dad, please forgive me. I didn’t know that the security guards at the door didn’t know who I was. I called you, but you didn’t pick up. After that, it was the bodyguard Third Brother sent who subdued the security guards outside, which is how I managed to come in...","“Who knew that you would scold me the moment I came in? Boo-hoo...”"]},{"number":263,"title":"Chapter 263 - Ruining Qiao Xi For An Illegitimate Daughter?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi covered her face and cried. “All of you don’t like me. I’m an outsider, and the Qiao family is unwilling to accept me. Even when I came back, the security guards wouldn’t let me in. Dad kept saying that he hoped I would come back, but he refused to pick up the phone. He even complained that I was late!”","Gu Zheng, who was pretending to be a bodyguard at the side: “...”","Mrs. Gu’s ability to act weak had improved again.","If he had not heard Mrs. Gu’s thoughts, he would have been deceived by her acting skills.","Half an hour ago, the two of them had already arrived at the Qiao family’s villa.","Gu Zheng looked at his watch. “It’s supposed to start at 7:30 pm. It’s already 8 pm.”","Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression. “Even if I arrive on time, Qiao Zhenguo will still send people to stop me. He just wants me to be late so that everyone will think I’m unfilial and rude.”","“Do you see those security guards? I bet they’ll stop me.”","As expected, Qiao Xi had just taken a few steps when the security guards stopped her. They even said that the Qiao family only had one daughter, which was Qiao Rou. They told her to scram as far as she could.","Qiao Xi retreated unhurriedly, took out a mirror and a blush from her bag. She carefully touched up her makeup. “I already guessed it. They want me to be unable to raise my head in Li City University once this banquet is over.”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were slightly cold. “Those students will naturally be angry after waiting for so long. At that time, the people you’ll have to face won’t just be the Qiao family.”","These students were young and rash. They might do something later.","They would not think about why Qiao Xi was late at all. They only knew that it was her fault for being late, and she had to pay the price.","Qiao Xi smiled. “What are you afraid of? These people can’t cause trouble because my people are among them!”","...","At this moment, Gu Zheng’s gaze was on Xue Yi. It must be her.","She was a daughter of the Xue family and a musical genius.","Was this who Qiao Xi was talking about?","The faces of the Qiao family members turned livid. They did not expect that Qiao Xi would actually expose them in front of everyone.","The little b*tch had learned her lesson. She knew how to tolerate things now?","Qiao Rou cursed in her heart. Previously, when Qiao Xi was innocent, she had never explained herself. Hence, she would try her best to slander Qiao Xi and ruin her reputation. She thought that Qiao Xi would quietly endure it, but she never expected that she would actually cry at the banquet.","Qiao Xi ran away while crying, but Xue Yi grabbed her first.","Xue Yi’s expression was cold as her gaze landed on Qiao Zhenguo. “So it’s not that Qiao Xi was unfilial that she was late but President Qiao got the security guards to stop her and deliberately did not pick up her calls?","“I’ve been in the university for so long. I heard that Qiao Xi is gentle, polite, and very talented. How could she possibly be late on purpose?","“So President Qiao was the one who forbade Qiao Xi from entering and even scolded her when she entered. This was your plan all along, wasn’t it? What right do you have to scold her?”","Xue Yi looked at Qiao Rou and sighed.","“I understand. You must be doing this for your illegitimate daughter. If Qiao Xi is too outstanding, your illegitimate daughter will be suppressed. However, if you make it seem that Qiao Xi has a bad character, then your illegitimate daughter will be praised.","“So for Qiao Rou, you have to destroy Qiao Xi first. President Qiao, you’re a good player!”","The entire venue was silent, and even everyone’s breathing could be heard. Everyone was extremely anxious.","If it were anyone else, they would have retorted long ago, but the person who spoke was Xue Yi. Whoever dared to speak out would be going against the Xue family in the capital.","The Qiao family also knew Xue Yi’s background and naturally did not dare to offend her, so they remained silent.","Qiao Rou’s face turned ashen as she bit her lip.","This Xue Yi actually... reprimanded her for being an illegitimate daughter?","If it were not for Qiao Xi and her sl*tty mother blocking the way, she would be the legitimate eldest daughter of the Qiao family.","Qiao Xi was mischievous and unqualified to be the Qiao family’s eldest daughter. She should have died a long time ago.","At this moment, Old Madam Qiao coughed and pulled Qiao Rou to her side. She patted her hand to comfort her, then looked coldly at the crowd.","“Since we invited Qiao Xi back, we couldn’t have sent the security guards to stop her. She was late and found a random reason to malign Zhenguo and Rou Rou. Quickly apologize!”","Xue Yi’s expression turned cold.. She was about to retort when she was stopped by Qiao Xi."]},{"number":264,"title":"Chapter 264 - I Want To Stay In My Original Room","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi gave a small smile before putting on an aggrieved expression. She pinched her fingers uneasily as if a gust of wind could blow her over.","“Grandma, since you’ve said so, then I was in the wrong! If I knew this would happen, I wouldn’t have come. The security guards didn’t stop me. I was late. I’m sorry, everyone!”","Old Madam Qiao’s expression softened a little. “At least you’re sensible! You shameless thing!”","Not long after, a group of students gathered together and muttered while glancing at Old Madam Qiao from time to time.","“Madam Qiao is too much. It’s obvious that Qiao Xi was stopped by the security guards, which is why she’s late. She didn’t do it on purpose, yet she’s still talking about her like this.”","“Why is Qiao Rou pretending to be aggrieved? Qiao Xi is clearly the innocent one. If Xue Yi hadn’t said anything, I would really have misunderstood Qiao Xi!”","Xu Mei had sharp ears and heard the crowd’s discussion, so she hurriedly interrupted. “It’s good that you’re here, Xi Xi. In order to invite you back, your father specially held a banquet and even got someone to tidy up your room. He wanted to give you a surprise.”","Qiao Rou also hurriedly said, “Sister, I helped you clean your room. I hope you’ll like it.”","Xu Mei suppressed the anger in her heart and squeezed out a smile. “Xi Xi, although you’re not my biological daughter, I’ve always treated you as my own. You should come back home. Your father and I are very worried about you. Living with those men isn’t a long-term solution.”","Everyone instantly opened their eyes wide and pricked up their ears to listen. Qiao Xi had been living with men recently, and there was more than one?","Xu Mei said earnestly, “I know you’re close to President Qin, but there’s a difference between a man and a woman. It won’t be pleasant if news of this gets out...”","Qiao Zhenguo also said, “Xi Xi, I think so too. Your grandmother and I both want you to come back. You should move back as soon as possible and cut off all contact with those men.”","The scene fell silent again.","Everyone in high society knew about the incident at Fragrance Hotel, but the students of Li City University were not aware of it. Hence, they did not know who President Qin was. Immediately, they imagined a bald and greasy uncle who was providing for Qiao Xi.","Immediately after, Old Madam Qiao spoke coldly and added another stab—","“Qiao Xi! You’re shameless, but our Qiao family still cares about our reputation!”","These words pushed Qiao Xi into the abyss.","The students had surprised expressions as they looked at Qiao Xi in disbelief. Soon, their eyes were filled with disdain.","Qiao Xi took a sip of tea unhurriedly and smiled indifferently. “Sure, I’ll move back.”","Qiao Zhenguo’s expression softened. He did not expect that this little b*tch would not resist this time.","As long as she severed ties with Qin An, Qin An would probably not stand up for her. Then, he would get Rou Rou to curry favor with Qin An. Rou Rou was gentler and more understanding than Qiao Xi. She would definitely capture Qin An’s heart and he would not make things difficult for the Qiao family anymore.","Qiao Zhenguo nodded in satisfaction. “Xi Xi, since you’ve agreed, don’t leave tonight.”","“It’s just that I can’t sleep after changing beds. I think...”","Qiao Xi paused for a moment and looked at Qiao Rou with a smile. “I want to stay in my original room.”","Qiao Rou’s face turned pale as she trembled.","Qiao Zhenguo’s expression darkened as he said impatiently, “Rou Rou is staying in that room now. Don’t look for trouble!”","Xu Mei smiled awkwardly. “Xi Xi, Rou Rou has already gotten used to staying there after so long. You should choose another room.”","Wang Qing had also come to the Qiao family’s house. After quitting university, she had always held resentment against Qiao Xi and finally found a chance to deal with her. Hence, she shouted, “Qiao Xi! You’re really shameless! It’s fine if you’re living with different men, but the Qiao family wants you to stay at home now. However, you even want to snatch Rou Rou’s room? Rou Rou has already cleaned a room for you, but you just can’t accept it! Why are you so petty?!","“If you ask me, Rou Rou shouldn’t have helped you clean your room. You’re really vicious!”","At this moment, a young man who liked Qiao Rou said, “Qiao Xi, you’re Rou Rou’s elder sister. How can you snatch her room? Shouldn’t you give in to your younger sister?”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes indifferently. “I’m snatching her room?”","She curled her lips and sighed helplessly. “But I really want to sleep on the same bed as I did back then. The basement is cold and dark. Aunt Xu said that she has let my younger sister stay in my room.. The Qiao family doesn’t have any other rooms, so I can only stay in the basement. But I’m so scared!”"]},{"number":265,"title":"Chapter 265 - Common Language Between Illegitimate Daughters","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“There are cockroaches in the basement, and it’s very humid. I won’t be able to sleep. If you want me to sleep in the basement, I’ll just sleep in my adoptive mother’s house. Although we’re not related by blood, at least I have my own room. I don’t have to step on eggshells around the servants either...”","Every single word of Qiao Xi’s seemed to be a blade as she voiced out all the grievances and unwillingness she had felt all these years.","The young man who spoke up for Qiao Rou earlier immediately looked embarrassed and retreated.","Xue Yi sneered. “I’ve learned something today. The illegitimate daughter stole the eldest miss’ room while the eldest miss was forced to sleep in the basement... Madam Xu, you’re really capable!”","Xu Mei’s mind buzzed. “No, it’s not like that...”","Xue Yi’s words were sharp. “Although the Qiao family’s house isn’t big, it’s still a villa. The servants all have their own rooms, but they’re letting Qiao Xi sleep in the basement? As expected of a mistress. Her reputation isn’t good and she’s also vicious!”","Everyone nodded.","Qiao Rou shed tears aggrievedly. “Boo-hoo... Sister, I didn’t mean to. I’m sorry, I’ll give up my room right now. I don’t deserve to stay in your room... Boo-hoo...”","“Since you know that you’re not worthy, how did you still have the gall to stay in that room for so long? You’ve been living with a clear conscience for so many years. Why are you talking nonsense now?”","Xue Yi berated coldly, “You even had the cheek to clean a room for Qiao Xi? Just give up your room. Why are you acting pitiful here?”","Qiao Xi sighed in her heart. Sister Yi was indeed the daughter of the Xue family. With her around, there was no need for her to speak at all.","Qiao Rou’s face was pale as she clenched her fists. Her nails dug into her palms as her body swayed.","“Qiao Xi! Don’t accuse Rou Rou!”","Wang Qing shouted, “When you went missing, no one was staying in that room, which was why Rou Rou moved in. She’s also a daughter of the Qiao family, so why can’t she stay there?","“She has been staying there for so many years, yet you want to snatch it away. She’s a little reluctant to part with it. Isn’t this normal? Don’t be so unforgiving!”","Qiao Xi calmly listened to Wang Qing’s angry roar and said unhurriedly, “That room was decorated by me and my deceased mother. My mother designed it according to my preferences. Moreover, the room also has my mother’s jewelry, precious antiques, and paintings.”","Her tone was gentle, but every word was sonorous. Xu Mei’s face was as pale as paper.","Qiao Xi slowly said, “I didn’t mind if Qiao Rou stayed in my room when I wasn’t around, but after I returned to the Qiao family, I was made to stay in the basement.","“Wang Qing, I heard that your Wang family has an illegitimate daughter who’s about your age. Can you let the illegitimate daughter stay in your room and occupy the jewelry, clothes, and shoes in your room? What do you think?”","“No.” Xue Yi smiled and said, “Qiao Xi, you’re wrong about something. Wang Qing is not the daughter of the first wife. She’s also an illegitimate daughter, so it’s reasonable for her to speak up for Qiao Rou. After all, they share a common language.”","Everyone immediately looked at Wang Qing with disdain.","“She’s also an illegitimate daughter!”","Qiao Xi pretended to be surprised. “So that’s how it is! No wonder you’re so close to Qiao Rou. I understand now.”","Wang Qing gritted her teeth in anger but could not say anything.","Qiao Rou lowered her head and swayed.","This b*tch! She actually dared to mock her in front of so many people!","Qiao Xi had not even returned home and she was already going to occupy her room. If she really came back, how could she live a good life in the future?!","“Rou Rou has been staying in that room for so many years. She must already be used to it. It’s too troublesome to swap rooms. As her sister, can’t you just let her have her way? Why must you be so overbearing?”","Old Madam Qiao’s face was tense. “The Qiao family is already treating you well by ignoring the past and bringing you back. Don’t go too far!”","Qiao Zhenguo suddenly squeezed out a smile. “Xi Xi, I’ve arranged a room for you and even renovated it. If you’re not satisfied, we can discuss it again, but we still have something important to discuss.”","Oh! They were finally getting to the main topic.","Qiao Zhenguo cleared his throat and seemed to be in a dilemma. “The Qiao family is in trouble now, and the company isn’t doing too well. Besides, your adoptive mother thinks that the Qiao family isn’t good to you.. In order to stand up for you, she attacked the Qiao family’s company.”"]},{"number":266,"title":"Chapter 266 - Shocking! The Innocent Goddess Qiao Rou Is An Illegitimate Daughter!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“We’re all your family. Are you going to watch the company go bankrupt and leave us with nowhere to go? You’re the Qiao family’s eldest daughter. If you sit by and do nothing, others will say that you’re heartless,” Qiao Zhenguo said loudly.","Xue Yi glanced at him disdainfully.","Qiao Xi nodded. “Then what do you think I should do?”","Qiao Zhenguo looked at everyone and started pretending to behave like an elder. “Xi Xi, you’re a member of the Qiao family, so you must not be able to bear to see the company go bankrupt. Quickly get your third brother to stop.","“Besides, he’s not related to you by blood. We’re your family!","“In order to invite you back, I’ve gathered so many people to make you happy. Haven’t I treated you well enough?”","Everyone kept quiet.","Qiao Xi calmly said, “So this banquet is held for me? Or for Third Brother?”","Qiao Zhenguo frowned. “You can’t say that. I do miss you. I was worried that it wouldn’t be safe for a girl like you to stay outside, so I’m asking you to come home.”","“I remember you telling me to get out of the Qiao family two days ago. It turns out that you suddenly told me to come home because you want Third Brother to let you off!” Qiao Xi pretended to be surprised, but there was a trace of a smile in her eyes.","Qiao Zhenguo’s face darkened. This little b*tch didn’t want to give him any respect!","Silence filled the air.","“Heh!” Xue Yi sneered. “I know now. It turns out that the Qiao family specially invited Qiao Xi back to attend this banquet for the sake of the company’s interests. They’re not sincere about letting Qiao Xi come back home at all.”","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes as her body trembled slightly, her face filled with sorrow.","“I thought my dad really missed me, but it turns out it’s just for Qiao Rou and Xu Mei. He wants me to forgive them!”","“After that incident, I begged Third Brother, but he insisted on helping me take revenge. He said that it’s because Xu Mei sold me to President Qian and almost killed me. He canceled Qiao Rou’s contract to teach you a lesson. He’s not deliberately hurting the Qiao family’s interests...”","Everyone was enlightened when they heard this.","These students didn’t harbor complicated thoughts. They could tell right from wrong. They looked at Qiao Xi with eyes filled with heartache, and they decided that they must help Qiao Xi.","These people immediately took out their phones, logged into Li City University’s forum, and created a few posts—","[You can’t judge a book by its cover. The pure goddess Qiao Rou’s heart is as vicious as a snake!]","In the post, everyone criticized Qiao Rou for being an illegitimate daughter. She was occupying Qiao Xi’s room and even pretended to be pitiful to frame her sister. She was a two-faced b*tch.","Qiao Rou’s mother, Xu Mei, was even more ruthless. When she chased Qiao Xi out of the Qiao family, Qiao Xi would’ve died if she wasn’t adopted. Now, Xu Mei even sold Qiao Xi to the old hooligan, President Qian. If it wasn’t for Qiao Xi’s third brother, she wouldn’t have been able to escape from the tiger’s den.","The mother and daughter had done so many dirty things, yet they still had the cheek to ask Qiao Xi to forgive them?","At this time, there were many students on the forum. When they saw this post, they reposted it crazily. They even took photos of Xu Mei and her mother and posted them online.","All the students present said the same thing, once again proving the authenticity of this matter.","[Oh... Qiao Rou is an illegitimate daughter! I remember she said that Qiao Xi was an adopted daughter from the countryside. In the end, Qiao Xi is the real Qiao family’s eldest daughter while Qiao Rou is a mistress!]","[Qiao Rou is so shameless! An illegitimate daughter dares to snatch the eldest miss’s room? She even let Qiao Xi sleep in the basement! The daughter of a mistress is so vicious!]","[Everyone knows President Qian, right? He’s a famous old hooligan in the industry. If Qiao Xi had fallen into his hands, who knows what kind of abuse she’d have to suffer?! Qiao Rou and Xu Mei still have the nerve to force Qiao Xi to forgive them?]","[Qiao Zhenguo is not fit to be a father! Qiao Xi is his daughter, yet he tolerates Xu Mei framing Qiao Xi time and time again. What a scumbag father!]","Originally, only a small group of people knew about the incident in Fragrance Hotel, but now, the news had spread all over Li City University.","Li City University’s forum was abuzz, so someone posted about it on Weibo.","Twenty minutes later, Qiao Rou’s manager anxiously called her.","“What? Say that again? Why should we terminate the contract?”","Following that, Qiao Zhenguo also received a message. It was Qin An’s assistant who had sent him a few words.."]},{"number":267,"title":"Chapter 267 - Im Smashing My Own House","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qin An said: [I wanted the Qiao family to beg my sister, but you took the opportunity to bully her. Since that’s the case, don’t blame me for being heartless!]","Not long after, the Qiao family’s business partners called to cancel their contracts. Qiao Zhenguo’s phone was exploding with calls.","Qiao Zhenguo’s entire body went limp as he collapsed onto the sofa weakly. He glared at Qiao Xi furiously. “Qiao Xi! You...”","Seeing this, everyone immediately found an excuse to leave. Before long, only Xue Yi, Qiao Xi, and the Qiao family were left in the house.","As soon as Xu Mei heard that Qiao Rou’s contract was terminated and the Qiao family’s company was being suppressed, she couldn’t hide her hypocritical side anymore.","“Qiao Xi, it’s fine if you’re unwilling, but what are you doing? Are you trying to kill the Qiao family?”","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. “Yes, I’m happy to see all of you so anxious!”","When Old Madam Qiao heard this, she was so angry that her vision blurred.","She raised the cup at the side and threw it at Qiao Xi. “Qiao Xi! Go die! You bastard! Why are you still alive?","“You jinx! You should have died with your mother a long time ago!”","Song Shijing stood in front of Qiao Xi and caught the cup.","When Qiao Xi heard the old woman’s angry roar, she stopped in her tracks as her eyes turned cold. “I’m afraid I’ll have to disappoint you.","“Because you will definitely die before me!”","As soon as she finished speaking, Song Shijing threw the cup back and smashed it right next to Old Madam Qiao. His eyes were cold. “Destroy everything!”","Once the order was given, the bodyguards attacked one after another. The living room of the Qiao family was instantly in chaos.","Qiao Zhenguo wanted to make a move to stop them, but he was sent flying with a kick. He could only roar helplessly, “Bastards! Quickly make them stop!”","Qiao Rou hid at the side and shivered. “Sister, this is your home too! You, how can you...”","Qiao Xi stood at the yard with her arms crossed and a roguish smile on her face. “Yeah, this is my house. I can do whatever I want, can’t I? Song Shijing.”","Qiao Xi said indifferently, “Someone cursed me to death. I want to see her die with my own eyes today!”","“Yes!”","Song Shijing rushed up to the Qiao family with a murderous look on his face. The old madam was so scared that she trembled and twitched a few times before fainting on the chair.","Qiao Rou’s eyes were filled with fear. “Sister! This is your grandma! Are you going to kill Grandma? You’re unfilial!”","Qiao Xi sneered as she turned around and walked out of the door. She paid no further attention to them.","That was the old madam of the Qiao family. She had nothing to do with her.","That old madam had hated her since she was young and even asked Xu Mei to throw her to the countryside. She didn’t treat her as her granddaughter at all. Since that was the case, she didn’t have to treat the old madam as her grandmother.","...","Gu Zheng waited at the door.","Xue Yi and Qiao Xi went out together and saw Gu Zheng at the side. Was this Little Six’s bodyguard?","No! This person was...","“I didn’t expect President Gu to be so free and even pretend to be a bodyguard to accompany me?”","Gu Zheng glanced at her indifferently. “It looks like the eldest daughter of the Xue family is very free to attend such a banquet.”","Xue Yi snorted coldly. “Since you’re here, why aren’t you willing to show yourself? If you did, would that bunch of trash from the Qiao family still dare to bully Qiao Xi? You’re not a good bodyguard at all! You came for nothing!”","Qiao Xi said, “Wait...”","“You just watched her get bullied. As her bodyguard, you have to protect her closely, but you hid here alone.”","Qiao Xi tried to interrupt, “Listen to me...”","“That old lady even wanted to hit Qiao Xi. Aren’t you going to avenge Qiao Xi?”","Qiao Xi said again, “Xue...”","“Little Six, you don’t have to explain for him!”","Qiao Xi said awkwardly, “Sister, he went to avenge me just now.”","Xue Yi: “???”","Qiao Xi explained, “Apart from Xu Mei and Qiao Rou, the servants in the Qiao family also often bullied me...”","Xue Yi was stunned for a moment. She asked in disbelief, “He went to beat them up?”","Qiao Xi initially wanted to do it herself, but she was unable to leave then, so she let Gu Zheng do it.","Gu Zheng dealt with all the servants who had bullied her and her mother.","Xue Yi was a little surprised. Little Six was still so simple and crude, but wouldn’t it be bad if Gu Zheng knew that she was so violent?"]},{"number":268,"title":"Chapter 268 - Illegitimate Children Are Not Qualified To Come To Qingyuan Pavilion","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Then, Xue Yi asked curiously, “President Gu, you did it yourself? Aren’t you afraid of being gossiped about?”","Gu Zheng smiled meaningfully. “The Qiao family’s company owes a lot of money.”","Xue Yi was enlightened.","Gu Zheng had brought those angry creditors here, and they coincidentally met the Qiao family’s servants who were trying to intimidate them. Hence, these people started fighting in a fit of anger.","Gu Zheng wiped the blood off his hands and asked casually, “Are you hungry?”","“Mm, let’s go eat dinner!” Qiao Xi chuckled and asked, “Sister Yi, are you coming with?”","Xue Yi looked up and sized up Gu Zheng. She suddenly thought of something and shook her head.","She felt that Gu Zheng’s face looked familiar, as if she had seen him somewhere before.","...","Gu Zheng personally drove Qiao Xi into a remote alley.","“Where are we going?” Qiao Xi asked.","“Qingyuan Pavilion.”","Qiao Xi thought for a moment, then asked with a smile, “Is it the same Qingyuan Pavilion that only receives three tables of guests every day and the dishes are already determined every day? They don’t follow set operating hours either, do they?”","“Yeah.”","At this hour, Qingyuan Pavilion would probably have closed their doors for the day long ago. However, who was Gu Zheng? As long as he said he wanted to eat it, he would definitely be able to eat it.","If Gu Zheng wanted to eat their food, even if it was early in the morning, the chef of Qingyuan Pavilion would have to get up and cook for him.","Qingyuan Pavilion was a very famous private restaurant, but it was located in a deep alley. The road on both sides was very narrow. After walking for a while, it suddenly became clear that there was a whole new world here.","“I heard that Qingyuan Pavilion closes at seven every day. Why is it still open now?”","Gu Zheng did not say a word. He held her hand as they walked through a small path and arrived at an elegant private room.","On the other side of Qingyuan’s private room, there was a room filled with people. They spoke loudly and stubbornly—","“Back then, that mistress of the Gu family brought Gu Zheng back to acknowledge his ancestors. Now, Gu Zheng is even the head of the Gu family. Are we just going to let this go? This position should have been Lu Yan’s!”","“I think I saw Gu Zheng coming to the Qingyuan Pavilion as well. What right does an illegitimate son like him have to come here?”","Qiao Xi’s heart thumped.","She wished she could rush up and argue with these people. Gu Zheng was clearly the legitimate young master of the Gu family, but he had always been accused of being an illegitimate child.","What was even more heartbreaking was that these people all knew the inside story, but none of them were willing to stand up for Gu Zheng. Instead, they let him suffer from Madam Gu’s abuse when he was young.","Now that Gu Zheng had grown up and become the head of the Gu family, they were still unwilling to face the truth for the sake of benefits. They insisted that he was an illegitimate child, making him unable to raise his head for the rest of his life.","“Stop looking.”","Gu Zheng held her hand gently. “Aren’t you hungry? Let’s eat.”","Qiao Xi bit her lip. “Gu Zheng, they...”","Those people didn’t know they were there, and the more they spoke, the more agitated they became. Qiao Xi felt as if her heart was bleeding as she listened. “They’re too much!”","Gu Zheng’s expression was calm as he gently smoothed her hair. “I’m fine.”","It did not matter what they said. He did not care about those people, much less their words.","The two of them entered the private room. There was clearly a table full of delicious food, yet Qiao Xi had no appetite.","Although she could taste food now, she had no appetite at all.","The current head of the Lu family was Madam Lu’s biological father. He never cared about Madam Lu because she was the daughter of his first wife. Now that he had his second wife by his side and a sensible and obedient daughter, he had probably forgotten about his other daughter, Lu Qingyun.","Back then, Old Master Lu knew that Chairman Gu was not a good person and couldn’t bear for his younger daughter to lose her life’s happiness, so he married Lu Qingyun instead.","After Lu Qingyun married into the Gu family, she spent half her life in misery.","The Lu family knew that Lu Qingyun was humiliated and bullied in the Gu family, but they never stood up for her.","She married into the Gu family and earned endless wealth for the Lu family, allowing the Lu family to have their current status. However, no one in the Lu family remembered her kindness. They only cared about benefits and did not care about her life or death.","No one cared about Lu Qingyun when she was alive. After she died, the Lu family hypocritically came to attack the Gu family and transferred all their hatred to Mrs. Gu and Gu Zheng.","However, Gu Zheng was innocent.. He was Lu Qingyun’s child, but he had to suffer baseless criticisms!"]},{"number":269,"title":"Chapter 269 - The Two-faced Lu Family","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","When Qiao Xi thought about this, she felt her nose turning sore. She was unable to swallow even the most delicious food.","At this moment, there was the sound of footsteps, and a man outside snorted. “Hey! The Gu family’s illegitimate son is here for a meal too?”","Qiao Xi’s face sank.","The few of them laughed. “Gu Zheng, you’re an illegitimate child. Are you worthy to eat in the same restaurant as us? Your dad doesn’t even have the dignity to come, yet you have the nerve to show your face here?”","Gu Zheng was composed.","Seeing that he was silent, those people kicked the door open.","“Are you deaf?! I’m talking to you! Gu family head, what bullsh*t? You’re nothing!”","The Lu family members walked in one after another, staring at him with disdain.","Qiao Xi swept her gaze over coldly. There was only a middle-aged woman among these people, and the rest were all young men. There was also a familiar face—Lu Yan.","The person who shouted was a junior from the Lu family. He was extremely arrogant. “You can’t accept it? Tsk, remember this. Your Gu family owes our Lu family a life. So what if I scold you? You even deserve to be hit!","“The eldest daughter of the Lu family died in the Gu family because of you, an illegitimate son, and your mother!”","Qiao Xi really wanted to sew this person’s mouth shut.","However, Gu Zheng’s expression remained calm as he picked up his chopsticks and ate elegantly.","Seeing that Gu Zheng did not take him seriously at all, the man’s face flushed with anger. “Gu Zheng, I’m talking to you! Say something!”","He was seething with anger as he glared fiercely at Gu Zheng. Only then did he realize that Qiao Xi was sitting opposite him.","“Ha! Where did this woman come from? I thought you didn’t like women? Looks like the rumors are fake. As expected of an illegitimate child, you’re so casual when it comes to finding women...”","Bang!","Before he could finish speaking, a cup flew past his ear and smashed into the wall, almost shattering into powder.","One could hear a pin drop.","Gu Zheng took another cup and said slowly, “If you want to die, I don’t mind sending you to death’s door.”","“You...” The man was so frightened that his face turned pale. He stammered, “Y-You’re crazy. You want to kill me? How can an illegitimate son be so arrogant?","“Keep bragging! Do you dare to touch me? I’ll teach you a lesson today and let you know what it means to be respected! It’s a good chance to take revenge for Aunt Qingyun!”","After he finished speaking, he raised his fist and attacked Gu Zheng. Qiao Xi kicked the chair, causing it to slam into his leg. He grimaced in pain.","Qiao Xi’s gaze was cold as she scanned the Lu family’s faces. “You want to avenge Madam Lu?”","“Indeed! We want revenge...”","“Oh?” Qiao Xi smiled lightly and looked at the man with contempt.","“I heard that the person who was supposed to marry Chairman Gu was the second miss of the Lu family. However, the second miss of the Lu family insisted on not marrying him, so she was replaced by the first miss. The Lu family knew that the Gu family was dangerous, but they still married off the first miss.”","The Lu family gasped.","The middle-aged woman in the crowd turned pale, looking extremely awkward.","Qiao Xi continued, “The eldest miss was married off for the sake of the second young miss, but when she was bullied in the Gu family, why didn’t the second young miss stand up for her sister and bring her back from the Gu family?","“When Chairman Gu cheated on her, did the second young miss ask for an explanation on behalf of the eldest miss? If the second young miss had been willing to help, would Madam Gu have suffered so much?","“When she was still alive, none of you said a word when you saw her being bullied. You pretended not to see it. Now that she’s gone, you’re all talking about revenge!","“The Lu family is really two-faced when it comes to doing things. Your Lu family’s wealth and status were all attained by your eldest miss. Will you really still be so shameless?”","Qiao Xi cursed, then her gaze landed on the middle-aged woman. “What do you think, Second Miss Lu? Or should I call you Madam Jiang?”","The woman was livid.","At first, Qiao Xi was curious why there was only one elder in this group of juniors. It didn’t look like a family banquet. Later on, this group of people came to find trouble with Gu Zheng and used the excuse of ‘taking revenge for Lu Qingyun’. That was when she suddenly understood.","This woman was Lu Qingyun’s sister, Lu Xiang.","Initially, she was supposed to marry Chairman Gu, and Lu Qingyun was supposed to marry into the Jiang family. However, because Lu Xiang was unwilling, the sisters swapped places and their fates changed.."]},{"number":270,"title":"Chapter 270 - Is There Something Wrong With The Lu Family?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched. “Madam Jiang, I heard that you stole Eldest Miss’ fiance back then. Looking at how proud you are, you must be very happy about that, right?”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow.","Lu Xiang looked awkward, but she had experienced a lot and quickly calmed down. Without changing her expression, she said, “Miss Qiao, where did you hear the rumors? Mr. Jiang and I fell in love a long time ago.”","“Why would a mistress admit to being a mistress?”","Qiao Xi sneered. “The Madam Gu who you all look down on has always been unwilling to admit that she’s the third party. However, when she came to the Gu family, Eldest Miss Lu was clearly still alive. If she’s not the third party, what is she?”","When she said this, Qiao Xi paused for a moment. “Right, Madam Jiang, you and Madam Gu both used Eldest Miss Lu to get to where you are today. Since both of you are the same, doesn’t scolding her remind you of yourself?","“You’ve always been the third party. Are you more special than others?”","The room was eerily quiet. The air seemed to have frozen.","Lu Xiang’s body trembled. After so many years of history were exposed on the spot, she could not wait to find a hole to crawl into.","“Shut up! That’s not true at all. Besides, Eldest Miss Lu didn’t marry into the Jiang family back then. Can’t my aunt marry into the Jiang family?”","“Gu Zheng is an illegitimate child! His mother is a mistress! She destroyed someone else’s family, so how can she compare to Aunt?”","A junior of the Lu family shouted angrily.","Qiao Xi sneered. “According to you, only those who interfere in marriages are considered mistresses, so it doesn’t matter if the couple wasn’t married? Is there something wrong with your Lu family’s values? Eldest Miss Lu is really unlucky to have encountered a group of weirdos from your Lu family!”","“You!” The Lu family’s junior instantly choked up.","He had only blurted it out without thinking too much about it. If news of this got out, he would not be able to raise his head again.","Back then, it was true that Eldest Miss Lu and Young Master Jiang were engaged, but it was a marriage between the two families, so they had no relationship with each other.","Moreover, his aunt had been married for so many years and had been living a happy life. This meant that the Jiang family liked her more. She was not a mistress at all!","Lu Xiang forced herself to calm down. “Miss Qiao, I was very sad about my sister’s death as well. Because of that, the Lu family and the Gu family have not been in contact for many years. We’ve been in a deadlock. The Lu family bears a grudge against the Gu family for causing my sister’s death. At the same time, we’re also very guilty. Back then, we didn’t protect my sister well and caused her to suffer so much... However, we’ve found her child now. The child is in the Lu family.”","She waved her hand. “Lu Yan, come over. This is President Qin’s sister, Qiao Xi.”","Lu Yan was dressed in light colors, making him look clean and clear. His voice was gentle. “Miss Qiao, long time no see.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes. “...”","Lu Xiang had a sad look on her face. “It’s a pity that Lu Yan lost his mother when he was young. He refused to acknowledge the Gu family and decided to stay in the Lu family. If it were not for that mistress... my sister would not have passed away. She would have raised Lu Yan herself.”","She was undoubtedly saying that Gu Zheng had snatched what originally belonged to Lu Yan.","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “Isn’t it very good for you to be able to raise Lu Yan yourself?","“Although the person raising him is his mother’s former fiance and his aunt who’s a mistress, it’s fortunate that Lu Yan doesn’t hate you guys. It seems that his feelings for his mother aren’t too deep either. People who live together will grow to have the same temperament. You’re all quite heartless.”","Qiao Xi looked gentle on the surface but she had already cursed them thousands of times in her heart.","“You...” Lu Xiang’s face turned red and white. Tears were about to fall from her eyes.","Miss Qiao, I’ve already said that my husband and I...”","“You’re right. You and your husband are very loving. Even though you were once a mistress, you’re very happy now! You don’t care if your sister is dead or alive. You’re such a good sister. You’re not wrong at all! You should be happy for the rest of your life!”","No way!","Qiao Xi muttered in her heart. Even she felt disgusted saying these words.","“Madam Jiang, you’re living a happy life now, while Eldest Miss Lu is no longer alive. You’re right about everything!”","Lu Xiang’s eyes widened, but she could not say a word. “...”"]},{"number":271,"title":"Chapter 271 - Sister Qiao Xis Crazy Damage","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Lu Xiang’s eyes were vicious. This little b*tch still dared to bully her.","“Are you full?” Gu Zheng asked.","Qiao Xi said delicately, “I just took two bites and this group of people barged in. I’m anxious to teach Madam Jiang a lesson!","“But Madam Jiang doesn’t seem to be very smart. She keeps staring at me. If she thinks it’s right to be the third party, then I have nothing else to say.”","Qiao Xi bit her lip. “Gu Zheng, why doesn’t she appreciate me spending so much effort to teach her how to be a good person? Forget it, I’ll just eat.”","“Alright, let’s eat.” Gu Zheng nodded.","“But how can I eat while they’re standing here? Looking at this group of people makes me disgusted.”","Qiao Xi frowned and sighed. “Madam Jiang’s current position originally belonged to Eldest Miss Lu. If it weren’t for Madam Jiang insisting on changing the marriage back then, Eldest Miss Lu wouldn’t have married President Gu and she wouldn’t have died at such a young age. The Lu family wouldn’t have severed ties with the Gu family either...”","“Miss Qiao!” Lu Xiang interrupted coldly.","“The Lu family’s matter has nothing to do with you! You’re Gu Zheng’s woman, and he’s an illegitimate child...”","Qiao Xi hurriedly said, “Yes, Madam Jiang, I’m really sorry. I’m a straightforward person. How could I talk about the fact that you’re a mistress in public?","“It’s okay, you won’t admit it anyway. Just keep denying it.”","Lu Xiang cared a lot about her image outside, but now that she was publicly humiliated by Qiao Xi, she couldn’t care less about her image. “What exactly do you want to do?”","Qiao Xi pretended to be aggrieved. “Madam Jiang, don’t be angry. I didn’t do it on purpose just now. No matter what you did, it’s all in the past. Aren’t you living well now? If you’re angry, it means that what I just said is true.”","Lu Yan suddenly walked in front of Qiao Xi and said indifferently, “Miss Qiao, outsiders don’t have to worry about the Lu family. I hope you won’t spout nonsense.”","Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression. “Alright, if even you don’t care about this matter, why should an outsider like me care?”","What she meant was that Lu Yan was unfilial. He knew that his aunt had interfered with his biological mother’s marriage but he still pretended not to know anything about it.","Lu Yan’s expression was indifferent. “Miss Qiao, can we talk in private?”","Qiao Xi immediately refused. “That won’t do.”","The Lu family: “...”","This woman was impenetrable!","Qiao Xi sat down unhurriedly, and after eating a few mouthfuls, she tossed her chopsticks aside. “Gu Zheng, these people are making me feel disgusted. I don’t feel like eating anymore. Let’s go.”","A few juniors of the Lu family instantly roared. “Pfft! Gu Zheng! Your mother is a mistress! She caused the death of our eldest miss, yet you still dare to be so arrogant in front of us. Do you still have any shame?”","Qiao Xi was just about to leave when she suddenly stopped in her tracks and slowly turned around. “Madam Jiang.”","Lu Xiang suppressed her anger.","Qiao Xi said slowly, “You should be very clear whether Gu Zheng is an illegitimate child or not.”","She leaned closer to Lu Xiang and lowered her voice to say, “You made Gu Zheng suffer this infamy precisely because he’s not an illegitimate child.","“You were jealous of Eldest Miss Lu because her looks and bearing are superior to yours. Furthermore, she’s the daughter of the first wife. You’re the illegitimate daughter, so you made sure to let her son live in the shadow of an illegitimate child and suffer eternal humiliation.","“It’s just that you didn’t expect Gu Zheng to become the head of the Gu family. No one dares to touch him, so your plan only exists in your imagination.”","She smiled meaningfully and held Gu Zheng’s hand as they left.","Lu Xiang’s heart trembled. Her mind buzzed, and her body went weak.","How could Qiao Xi know?","After the two of them left Qingyuan Pavilion, Qiao Xi got into the car in a huff. She grabbed Gu Zheng’s hand and asked, “Why didn’t you say anything when they bullied you just now?”","Gu Zheng said casually, “It’s unnecessary.”","Qiao Xi was unwilling. “How is it unnecessary? If you don’t explain yourself, no one will ever know!”","“It’s useless to explain to them. They’ll pay for their mistakes anyway.”","Gu Zheng’s voice was indifferent, but his eyes rippled with a trace of coldness."]},{"number":272,"title":"Chapter 272 - Watch The News Tomorrow","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi looked at Gu Zheng in surprise. “What are you gonna do?”","Gu Zheng smiled meaningfully. “You’ll know. Be sure to watch the news tomorrow.”","Qiao Xi: “...” Why did she find this a little scary?","Alright, she would watch the news tomorrow!","“It’s getting late, let’s rest,” Gu Zheng said softly.","Qiao Xi did indeed feel tired. After dealing with two families in a row today, her physical strength had already been exhausted.","After returning to her room, Qiao Xi turned on her computer and logged into Black Tide’s account. She stared at the screen seriously.","...","The room was bright now, but Gu Zheng’s vision was gray.","He had a splitting headache. He relied on his extraordinary consciousness to stay awake and clenched his fists.","Gu Zheng’s footsteps were heavy. He pulled open the drawer and took out a bottle. He casually shook out a few pills and swallowed them.","Song Shijing pushed open the door and hurried in. “President, what’s wrong?”","Gu Zheng bit his lip to suppress his pain. “It’s alright, I’ll be fine in a while.”","Song Shijing looked grim. “President, you ran into the Lu family when you went to Qingyuan Pavilion today?”","Gu Zheng said in a low voice, “Yeah. Go handle it.”","Seeing that he was in so much pain, Song Shijing could not bear to leave. However, at the thought of the arrogant Lu family, he nodded coldly. “Yes!”","Gu Zheng leaned against the sofa, his eyes dull. He rolled up his sleeve and watched the red line on his arm grow longer and longer until it reached his palm.","...","The next morning, a piece of news spread throughout Li City.","[Last night, a drunk woman accidentally fell into the river. Fortunately, a passerby rescued her in time and saved her life.","[According to the passerby, this woman was driving under the influence and also suffers from mental illness as she was shouting the entire time. The public should take good care of their families who are sick and not let them drive under the influence.]","Qiao Xi clicked on the news. Although the face of the woman in the photo was pixelated, she could still tell that it was Lu Xiang.","Some passersby had even taken a video and uploaded it online. After Lu Xiang was rescued, she was drenched and looked extremely disheveled.","Before she fell into the river, the surveillance cameras had captured her suddenly stepping on the accelerator. he shouted,","“Get lost! Aren’t you dead?","“You’ve been dead for so many years, so why are you still looking for me? I wasn’t the one who caused your death! Get lost!","“Dad wanted to harm you, not me! Every grievance has its perpetrator, every debt has its debtor. Why are you looking for me? Go away! Go away! Ah!”","Immediately after, the car lost control and drove down the bridge. The surveillance footage also ended there.","At this moment, Qin An called. “Little Six, have you seen the news? Madam Jiang suddenly fell sick while driving yesterday. She was talking nonsense when she drove down into the river.”","Qiao Xi said, “I saw it. How’s the matter I asked you to investigate going along?”","Qin An was stunned.","Little Six had already logged into Black Tide’s account and dug out all of Lu Xiang’s secrets. She also investigated the Lu family’s past thoroughly.","However, after Lu Xiang married into the Jiang family, all the information seemed to have vanished. They only found out that Lu Xiang and President Jiang had attended a banquet five years ago, then they went to the Lu family’s house to attend another banquet.","Qiao Xi thought that she had missed out on something, so she got Qin An to help her investigate.","Qin An was a little hesitant. “You might not be aware of the current relationship between Lu Xiang and President Jiang.”","Qiao Xi sneered. “They’re husband and wife. Looking at Lu Xiang’s proud expression, they should be very close. After all, she must naturally cherish a man whom she snatched away from someone else.”","When she spoke about this, Qiao Xi’s face was filled with anger. “Lu Xiang is especially good at pretending to be a good person. She even showed off how happy she was in front of Gu Zheng. She even has the cheek to brag about the happiness she stole?”","Qiao Xi was angry because her heart ached for Gu Zheng. The more she spoke, the more she could vent out her anger. “Did Lu Xiang adopt Lu Yan because she wanted to use this opportunity to suppress Gu Zheng? However, she clearly knows that Gu Zheng is...”","“Little Sixth.”","Qin An knew about the past between the Gu family and the Lu family. It was also because of his grandfather that he knew about the relationship between Gu Zheng and Eldest Miss Lu. He also understood the anger in Qiao Xi’s heart.","However...","He thought it was necessary to tell Little Six about this.. He asked, “Gu Zheng didn’t tell you?”"]},{"number":273,"title":"Chapter 273 - Gu Zheng Would Be Sad Too","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi had a puzzled expression. “Tell me what?”","Qin An remained silent: “...”","Had the man forgotten or was he deliberately not saying anything?","The Jiang family and Lu Xiang had long been close to bankruptcy because of him. Furthermore, after Lu Xiang married into the Jiang family, her life had not been easy. The Jiang family despised her identity as an illegitimate daughter.","After that, Lu Xiang grew old and frail. President Jiang liked young and beautiful women. He would even bring them home from time to time. Lu Xiang was in deep waters in the Jiang family.","Everyone else thought that she was living the life of a rich madam in the Jiang family, but who knew that she had suffered for half her life? However, this was all her retribution and had nothing to do with Gu Zheng.","However, there were some things that were indeed done by Gu Zheng.","Qin An slowly said, “Gu Zheng was the one who made Lu Xiang crash into the river.”","Little Six should know very well that Gu Zheng did not need anyone’s pity. He was a lion. He would not let off anyone who had hurt him in the past. Moreover, the Jiang family had already paid the price.","However, Qiao Xi was still puzzled. “Of course, I know, but I still feel bad for Gu Zheng. The Lu family keeps calling him an illegitimate child, but he’s the most innocent one. I really wish I could kill Lu Xiang to take revenge for Gu Zheng.”","Qin An: “...”","When did Little Six become so irritable?","At this moment, footsteps sounded from outside the door. Qiao Xi hurriedly hung up and rushed out. “Gu Zheng!”","The man looked tired as he took off his jacket.","Qiao Xi asked, “You’re the one behind the incident of Lu Xiang falling into the river, right? Then why did you spare her life?”","Gu Zheng said nonchalantly, “She should have died. She got lucky.”","He was not surprised. There were many passersby in that district, so it was expected that she would survive.","“Let’s go, it’s time to go to work.”","Qiao Xi held his hand, her eyes filled with sorrow. “You have to say it if you’re sad. Don’t force yourself until you fall ill.”","Gu Zheng’s Adam’s apple moved, and he felt an indescribable emotion surge in his heart.","Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with heartache. “Do you remember the time we got to know each other? I would tell you anything. It would be good if you also tell me how you feel. If you encounter any problems, you must tell me.”","“I...” He was just about to retort when he saw Qiao Xi’s eyes that were wet with tears. He swallowed his words.","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes. “At first, I was indeed sad.”","Qiao Xi’s heart ached.","Then, he curled his lips and sneered. “But I don’t care at all now. The Lu family is insignificant to me. Their words won’t hurt me.","“The Lu family that was once a wealthy family for a hundred years is on the verge of collapse now. As long as I move my finger, I can destroy the entire Lu family. Therefore, they’re just ants in my eyes. Would you care about ants jumping around in front of you?”","Gu Zheng had always been strong, but when he faced Qiao Xi, he could not help but want to show his weak side.","He looked exhausted. “I’ve always thought so, but...”","Qiao Xi looked at him seriously.","Gu Zheng said slowly, “But there are still times when I’m sad.”","Qiao Xi frowned, and her heart seemed to have been dealt a heavy blow.","Even though Gu Zheng had a hard shell, his heart was still fragile.","Gu Zheng was always abused by the Gu family when he was young. Only Matriarch Gu treated him well, but her health was poor and she often fell sick. She did not manage to care much about Gu Zheng, so most of the time, Gu Zheng had to endure everything himself.","In Qiao Xi’s heart, her senior, Mo Yuan, was like a god. It seemed that nothing could stump him. No matter what difficulties she encountered, so long as Mo Yuan was around, everything would be resolved.","Now, she knew that although Gu Zheng looked like he was impervious to fire and water, there was still a weak spot in the depths of his heart.","Qiao Xi opened her arms and hugged his waist tightly. “Senior, no matter what happens, I’ll always be by your side.”","‘I originally wanted to leave after helping Gu Zheng detoxify the poison in his body.’","Hearing her heartfelt words, Gu Zheng’s heart instantly ached."]},{"number":274,"title":"Chapter 274 - Encounter With An Evil Couple","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","However, in next to no time, Qiao Xi’s thoughts resounded once more...","‘But now, I’ve decided not to leave.’","The man’s heart trembled when he heard this, and he hugged her tightly.","...","Song Shijing and Song Shiyu stood outside the door and waited for Young Madam to come out. Then, they heard their conversation.","The brothers looked at each other and left quietly.","“This is the first time I heard the president say such things. It seems he’ll only take off his cold facade when he’s facing Young Madam.”","“In the president’s eyes, the Lu family is indeed not his match. As long as he wants to , the Lu family will disappear from Li City in an instant.”","“However, that doesn’t mean that he won’t be sad. No matter how strong the president is, he still has a heart. For him to tell Young Madam that he would be sad sometimes, it means that he trusts her a lot.”","Song Shijing smiled. “With Young Madam by his side, the president seems to be getting more human.”","The president used to be like a cold-blooded murderer, but now, he was a little more gentle.","Song Shiyu: “...”","He said in surprise, “Brother, why did you say that the president is getting more human? Did you think he was a dog previously?”","Song Shijing watched as the door opened and his heart skipped a beat. He immediately shot him a look.","However, Song Shiyu did not understand what he meant at all. He thought that his brother was agreeing with him. “I’ve already said that the president is exactly like a dog. He even deducted my salary. How can there be such a dog-like boss? Brother, is there something in your eyes? Why are you blinking?”","Song Shijing saw Gu Zheng smile and thought that Song Shiyu was going to die. His eyes twitched.","“I think you have a serious eye problem. Why don’t you go to the hospital?” Song Shiyu shouted excitedly, “But I’m so happy today. You’ve finally agreed with me. I have to shout out that the president is a dog—”","“Yes, that’s right.” Gu Zheng’s voice sounded unhurried. “Since I’m such a dog, I don’t think you need to stay by my side anymore.”","“...” Song Shiyu’s smile vanished. He was petrified.","He was so scared that his face turned pale. He rushed to Song Shijing’s side and cried, “Why didn’t you tell me the president was behind me? What did he hear?”","Song Shijing sighed helplessly. “I was already reminding you when you asked me what was wrong with my eyes.”","Song Shiyu was full of regret. “I thought you had problems with your eyes and I even wanted to bring you to see a doctor. How would I know that you were telling me that the president was here?!”","...","Gu Zheng sent Qiao Xi to Li City University. Before he got out of the car, he saw a familiar face walking over.","Lin Jie was very enthusiastic. “Ah Zheng, I didn’t expect to meet you here. Mengqing and I were just talking about you!”","Qiao Xi sized up the man in front of her. Who was this?","Lin Jie turned to look at Qiao Xi, who was at the side, and said in a calm tone, “Ah Zheng, this is?”","Qiao Xi thought that this man looked a little familiar. She suddenly recalled that this man seemed to be very close to Yao Mengqing when they were in the mall last time.","This person seemed to be called... Lin Jie?","It was that ingrate!","Gu Zheng looked at Lin Jie and Yao Mengqing, who was behind him. He smiled meaningfully. “Is it necessary?”","Lin Jie placed an arm on Gu Zheng’s shoulder. They seemed to be on good terms. “This is the first time I’m meeting her. Of course, you have to introduce her to me.”","Gu Zheng turned his body slightly to avoid his touch and even put some distance between them. Then, he sneered. “Yao Mengqing should have already told you about her, right?”","Lin Jie’s expression changed.","Of course, Mengqing had already told him, but he could not stand that woman, so he asked on purpose.","Yao Mengqing was afraid that Lin Jie would spill the beans, so she said gently, “Ah Zheng, I just met Ah Jie. I just told him about your marriage.”","Gu Zheng said slowly, “Go ahead, I’m listening.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","She simply admired Gu Zheng so much. Just one sentence from him could make others shut up.","If he wanted Yao Mengqing to introduce her friends to Mrs. Gu, he might as well just ask Yao Mengqing to scram!","Yao Mengqing bit her lip. “This... is Ah Zheng’s wife..”"]},{"number":275,"title":"Chapter 275 - Who Took The Back Door?","paragraphs":["Lin Jie saw that she was in a difficult position and frowned. “Ah Zheng, why are you making things difficult for Mengqing? If you don’t want to introduce your wife to me, then forget it! We’ll just leave!”","Yao Mengqing quickly explained, “Ah Zheng, I’m sorry. Ah Jie is too impatient.”","Qiao Xi watched them leave in a hurry. She did not dare believe that Yao Mengqing would leave just like that.","It was not easy for her to meet Gu Zheng, so she would definitely take the opportunity to seduce him. Would she leave so easily this time?","She had a nagging feeling that something was wrong.","Gu Zheng ignored them and said gently, “You should go, it’s time for class.”","Qiao Xi carried her bag. “Then I’ll be leaving.”","“Okay, call me after work.”","As soon as Qiao Xi entered, she saw a large group of people walking over in a majestic manner. The leader was Wang Qing.","...","On the other side, Yao Mengqing looked helpless. “Ah Jie, you’re too rash. You shouldn’t have reported her...”","Lin Jie snorted. “What I said is the truth. She has never taken the college entrance examination, so what right does she have to teach at Li City University? There must be a conspiracy!”","Yao Mengqing was very uneasy. “But what about Ah Zheng?”","“That woman faked her education. If Ah Zheng finds out about this, he might just hate this woman and kick her out.","“I reported her for the sake of Li Corporation’s reputation.”","Yao Mengqing pretended to be worried. “Sigh! I really didn’t expect that the person who got into Li City University through the back door was Xi Xi... Everyone in the fashion design department already knows about this. They definitely won’t let her off. I...”","“Mengqing, a woman like her doesn’t know shame at all. You don’t have to care about her!”","...","Qiao Xi looked at the time. Class was about to start, so she did not want to pay attention to that group of people and quickly walked to the teaching building.","Unexpectedly, before she could enter, she was stopped by Wang Qing and her group.","Qiao Xi’s gaze turned cold. “Class is about to start. Move!”","“You’re so funny. What right do you have to attend classes? You’re about to be fired!”","Wang Qing sneered and said, “Qiao Xi, I heard about something, so I’ll ask you this to confirm the situation.”","Seeing that the two of them were about to fight, the students all came forward to join in the fun.","When Wang Qing saw that there were many people around, she raised her voice. “Qiao Xi, can you explain why you can teach at Li City University when you never even took the college entrance examination?”","The words immediately caused a stir.","Qiao Xi had never taken the college entrance examination, and no one had heard of her university recommendation. How could she be teaching at Li City University?","Even the children of wealthy families had to sit for the college entrance examination before they could enter university. They could only become university teachers with their qualifications and certificates.","Qiao Xi had never taken the college entrance examination or gone to university, so she must have gotten in through the back door.","Wang Qing had a face full of disdain. “Qiao Xi, did you spend money to get in? Which financier paid for you? You became a university teacher at such a young age. If you didn’t get in through the back door, what else could it be?”","Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent. “Then?”","“You’ll be fired, of course. The vice chancellor said that a teacher like you who got in through the back door can’t stay in the university. You’re ruining the reputation of Li City University!”","Wang Qing roared. “Get out of the university immediately, or I’ll chase you out!”","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. She did not become a teacher at Li City University through the back door. However, she had previously checked the records of Li City University and found that Wang Qing’s score did not reach Li City University’s cutoff score, but she still managed to enter.","Who exactly was the one who took the back door here?","The surrounding students asked in disbelief, “Is that true?”","“She looks quite capable, but she didn’t even take the college entrance examination!”","“However, she won first place in the translation competition. She’s indeed very outstanding!”","“That doesn’t mean that getting in through the backdoor is the right thing to do. She’s a teacher at Li City University, so she’s misleading everyone if that’s really the case! If we don’t investigate clearly, it’ll be a disaster for Li City University!”","Everyone was discussing spiritedly when the announcement suddenly sounded. The vice chancellor’s voice was serious. “Qiao Xi, Wang Qing, please come to the chancellor’s office. Students, please don’t spread rumors. No one can slander Li City University’s reputation. I’ll definitely give everyone an explanation.”","The students all looked at Qiao Xi with burning gazes.","Wang Qing smiled smugly. “Qiao Xi, you’re doomed this time.. You’ll definitely be fired!”"]},{"number":276,"title":"Chapter 276 - Who Wants To Fire Mrs. Gu?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi smiled indifferently.","It was hard to say who would be kicked out of the university after this!","The vice chancellor had asked the two of them to go over together. He had not made it clear who he wanted to deal with.","Wang Qing was delighted. The vice chancellor would definitely not let Qiao Xi off this time!","She had just gone to the vice chancellor’s office and saw him talking to a man. The vice chancellor had guaranteed that he would fire Qiao Xi, which was why she was so sure.","The two of them reached the door. Wang Qing knocked on it, and the vice chancellor’s voice came from inside. “Come in.”","Wang Qing could not help but laugh out loud. “Vice Chancellor, Qiao Xi didn’t take the college entrance examination and got into the university through the back door. I think the university can’t keep such a bad teacher. She has to be fired!”","The vice chancellor’s body trembled with fear when he saw Qiao Xi. He did not dare provoke this figure.","He thought of President Gu’s warning, and his forehead was full of sweat. He cleared his throat and said, “Wang Qing, calm down first.”","“Vice Chancellor, Li City University’s reputation can’t be sullied. If Qiao Xi isn’t fired, it’ll be difficult to convince the public!” Wang Qing said loudly.","The vice chancellor nodded and wiped his sweat.","Wang Qing looked at Qiao Xi with disdain. “Who told you to bully Rou Rou and even go against me? Now, you’ve received your retribution! Soon, the news of you being fired will spread throughout Li City! You won’t be able to raise your head again!”","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. She originally did not want to pay attention to this fool, but Wang Qing insisted on seeking death. Then, she shouldn’t blame her for being merciless.","At this moment, the vice chancellor said, “Qiao Xi didn’t take the college entrance examination...”","...","20 minutes ago.","Gu Zheng sat on the sofa and leisurely drank his tea. “Vice Chancellor, it seems your son is in the midst of discussing a collaboration between his company and Gu Corporation?”","The vice chancellor was also a smart person and immediately understood Gu Zheng’s words.","He asked in a quivering voice, “President Gu, please... Please tell me how my son has offended you?”","Song Shijing’s eyes darkened. “What did Young Master Lin say to you just now?”","The vice chancellor was stunned. Young Master Lin had come to report Qiao Xi for not taking the college entrance examination and getting into Li City University through the back door.","There was indeed such a practice in the university, and he had received a lot of red envelopes from others as well. However, Qiao Xi had never given him money and she had not taken the college entrance examination either. How did she become a teacher in the university?","However, since Young Master Lin had said so, the vice chancellor felt that it was better to fire Qiao Xi for the sake of the university’s reputation.","He had just made up his mind when Gu Zheng walked in with his men.","The vice chancellor looked terrified. “He said that someone got into the university through the back door. President, this... This isn’t important...”","“Who said it’s not important?” Gu Zheng’s voice was indifferent, but his eyes were icy cold.","“She... She and President Gu...”","“You should address her as ‘Mrs. Gu’,” Gu Zheng said in a low voice. “My wife has a gentle character, but I’ve always been someone who doesn’t take offense. I don’t want to hear any rumors that slander my wife. If my wife is sad, I might do something.”","“President!” The vice chancellor was so scared that his face turned pale. His hair stood on end as he knelt on the floor with a plop.","Gu Zheng sneered. “If my wife is fired, she’ll definitely be sad. If she’s sad, I’ll make the person who broke her heart disappear.”","“P-President Gu, I really didn’t know that Qiao Xi is Mrs. Gu. I-I...” The vice chancellor was so scared that he could not even finish his sentence.","“I’ll investigate this matter now. I’ll definitely prove Mrs. Gu’s innocence. I won’t fire her and won’t make her sad. P-President Gu, don’t worry!”","“Vice Chancellor, do you know Wang Qing?” Song Shijing asked slowly.","“Back then, how much did you charge for helping her enter Li City University?”","The vice chancellor’s mind was buzzing. He stammered, “That... That was too long ago. President Gu, I promise to investigate this matter thoroughly!”","He was scared to death. Whether he could keep his position as vice chancellor was secondary. What was important was whether he could keep his life.","...","“Vice Chancellor!” Seeing that he had not said anything for so long, Wang Qing asked loudly, “When are you going to fire Qiao Xi?”","The vice chancellor came back to his senses and said, “The matter about Teacher Qiao not taking the college entrance examination does need to be explained.. I’ll make the announcement now.”"]},{"number":277,"title":"Chapter 277 - Purely A Rumor","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi’s expression was calm. She did not care about the outcome because she knew that even if she was fired today, it would not be long before this vice chancellor begged her to come back.","On the other hand, Wang Qing was overjoyed.","Later, the vice chancellor would announce that Qiao Xi was fired. At that time, Qiao Xi’s reputation in Li City University would be completely ruined. This was simply too exciting.","Wang Qing was extremely expectant and said anxiously, “Vice Chancellor, quickly announce it. The students are all waiting! We can’t keep such a person who got into Li City University through the back door!”","The vice chancellor nodded meaningfully and picked up the microphone nervously.","If it were not for that God of Death suppressing him, he wouldn’t be doing this. His future was completely ruined this time, and he might even have to take legal responsibility.","However, he had to, or his son and his entire family would suffer an unprecedented blow.","He took a deep breath and slowly said, “Teachers and students, Li City University’s reputation can’t be tainted. The university and I have carried out a strict investigation and looked through the admissions information. There are rumors about Teacher Qiao getting in through the back door...”","Wang Qing stared at him fixedly. The teachers and students of Li City University were also focused.","Everyone thought that Qiao Xi would definitely be fired. There was irrefutable evidence. How did she join Li City University if she had never taken the college entrance examination?","Wang Qing stared at the vice chancellor with anticipation, waiting anxiously for him to announce—","The vice chancellor looked nervous. He took a deep breath and said word by word, “The incident of Teacher Qiao getting in through the back door is purely a rumor!”","Rumor?","The smile on Wang Qing’s face vanished abruptly, and her face was filled with disbelief.","Did the vice chancellor say something wrong?","Wang Qing’s lips trembled. “Vice Chancellor, do you know what you’re saying? Someone reported that Qiao Xi got in through the back door. Are you protecting her now?”","The vice chancellor ignored her and said firmly, “Ms. Qiao was specially recruited by Li City University. Although she has never taken the college entrance examination, everyone knows how capable she is. Her design ability is recognized internationally. Students, please don’t spread rumors.”","Wang Qing was surprised.","Qiao Xi was specially recruited?","Every year, Li City University would have a special admissions slot, but very few people could meet the requirements. They had to have international accomplishments in order to enter Li City University.","It was actually understandable for Qiao Xi to enter Li City University as Gu Shan.","Wang Qing slapped her forehead. How could she have forgotten about this?! In that case, Qiao Xi would not be fired.","“Vice Chancellor, you promised me that you would fire Qiao Xi. Why are you going back on your words now?”","Wang Qing was very agitated and asked loudly, “How much did Qiao Xi give you to make you protect her? People who use the back door have impure intentions and motives. Vice Chancellor, are you going to let down the teachers and students of the university by doing this?”","Wang Qing’s words were relayed through the broadcast and immediately caused a heated discussion.","If the vice chancellor had agreed to fire Qiao Xi, why did he suddenly go back on his words? There must be something fishy going on!","The vice chancellor turned around and glanced at Wang Qing with a serious expression. “Those who use the back door will indeed be expelled, but...”","“You’ve already said that but you still want to keep Qiao Xi? Did you accept money from her?”","“It’s just that the person who’ll be expelled isn’t Teacher Qiao, but you, Wang Qing.”","The vice chancellor’s words echoed throughout the university, making everyone gasp.","The person who would be kicked out of the university was actually Wang Qing and not Qiao Xi?","Wang Qing shouted in disbelief, “What right do you have to expel me?! Just because I offended Qiao Xi?”","Everyone was puzzled. Why did the vice chancellor suddenly want to expel Wang Qing?","Qiao Xi smiled lightly. “Wang Qing, I was the champion of the International Real-time Translation Competition for five consecutive years. I also have outstanding talent in design. It’s not strange that I was specially recruited, but you...”","Wang Qing’s expression was gloomy as she stared fixedly at Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi continued, “But your college entrance examination score was 420. How did you get into a popular major at Li City University? Weren’t you the one who got in through the back door?”","The students looked shocked.","Li City University’s admission cut-off score had always been above 600, and the cut-off score for popular majors was ridiculously high.. If Wang Qing’s score was so low, how did she get into Li City University?"]},{"number":278,"title":"Chapter 278 - The Thief Wanted To Stop The Thief—Wang Qing Is Expelled Translator: Henyee Tra","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Wang Qing’s expression was livid as she gritted her teeth and looked at Qiao Xi.","The vice chancellor slowly said, “Wang Qing, you said so yourself that those who get in through the back door have to be removed from the university. Back then, you spent three million yuan to enter the university. The university can’t support this practice. I hope you can immediately register for withdrawal.”","“I got into the university on my own. Did you agree to slander me after taking Qiao Xi’s money?!”","At this moment, someone posted a college entrance examination report card on Li City University’s forum. It clearly stated that Wang Qing had only scored 420.","The vice chancellor said helplessly, “Back then, I accepted three million from you and made an exception for you to enter the university. However, for the sake of Li City’s University’s reputation, I’m willing to shoulder the responsibility and admit my mistake. The people who got in through the back door must pay the price!”","Wang Qing’s body trembled. Her legs went weak and she almost fell to the floor.","The students outside the vice chancellor’s office were discussing. “It turns out this is a case of a thief accusing others of being a thief!”","“She kept saying that she wanted to get Qiao Xi expelled for entering through the back door, but she spent three million yuan to get in. How did she have the cheek to look for trouble with Qiao Xi?”","“The vice chancellor disregarded his future to expose this matter. It must be true!”","“Wang Qing said that someone else reported Qiao Xi but I think it’s her!”","Everyone laughed at her. Wang Qing was about to faint from anger. “Lin Jie reported Qiao Xi. He’s the young master of the Lin family. It has nothing to do with me!”","“Who’s Lin Jie? I’m not close to him, so why would he report me?”","Qiao Xi smiled lightly. “It doesn’t matter who reported me. The truth is out now. I was specially recruited. I can still be a teacher, but you’re going to be expelled. Wang Qing, you left for wool but came home shorn.”","“No! You can’t expel me! Qiao Xi! Just you wait!”","In the end, Wang Qing was dragged out while screaming.","No one expected that after Wang Qing reported Qiao Xi, she would be expelled.","The news that she got into the university through the back door would soon spread to Li City. No university in Li City would be able to take her in anymore.","Qiao Xi slowly walked out of the office, and everyone subconsciously moved aside.","She stopped in her tracks. So it was Lin Jie who reported her?","Wang Qing was just a chess piece. The mastermind was Lin Jie, right?","After Qiao Xi finished her classes, she saw Gu Zheng’s car as soon as she left the university.","Song Shiyu opened the door for her and she climbed into the driver’s seat.","Gu Zheng said softly, “Wang Qing won’t make you angry anymore.”","Qiao Xi knew that Gu Zheng had already helped her solve this problem.","Song Shiyu muttered, “The president had already warned the Wang family long ago but Wang Qing still dared to provoke you, Young Madam. She’s overestimating herself. She won’t be able to stay in Li City anymore!”","Gu Zheng said casually, “Lin Jie was the one who reported it.”","Qiao Xi nodded. “Yeah, I just found out too.”","The man smiled. “I won’t let anyone who makes you angry off, Mrs. Gu.”","“What do you want to do?”","Gu Zheng said slowly, “Since he reported you, I’ll let him have a taste of what it’s like to be reported.”","Qiao Xi was slightly curious. Could it be that Lin Jie had also done something wrong?","The car slowly stopped. Before Qiao Xi entered, she heard a voice coming from the villa.","“Mengqing, you’re Ah Zheng’s childhood sweetheart. She’s just a toy for him. What right does she have to chase you away? She’s so jealous. Could it be that she wants to chase all the women around Ah Zheng away?”","Qiao Xi stopped in her tracks. ‘This person is... Lin Jie?’","Could it be that Lin Jie was talking bad about her in Longwan Residential?","Lin Jie was very angry. “Mengqing, you’re too kind. You’re just enduring it all. That’s why that woman is so arrogant.”","Yao Mengqing smiled bitterly. “I’m doing it for Ah Zheng. I don’t want him to be stuck in the middle. Thinking about it, it was better when we were young. The few of us played carefreely, unlike now when meeting Ah Zheng is a luxury.”","Lin Jie nodded. “That’s right, so your relationship with Ah Zheng can’t be replaced by any other woman. I reckon that after Ah Zheng gets bored, he’ll kick her out.”","Gu Zheng’s expression darkened. At this moment, the butler came forward. “President, Young Master Lin and Miss Yao are here. I said that you weren’t around, but they insisted on entering.. I...”"]},{"number":279,"title":"Chapter 279 - I Wasnt As Childish As You Guys","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The butler looked at Gu Zheng who was frowning deeply and said while trembling, “President, I’ll get them to leave.”","“Wait.”","Gu Zheng stopped him and smiled coldly. “I also have something to ask Young Master Lin. Since he’s here, I don’t have to go look for him.”","When Qiao Xi heard his words, she felt a chill run down her spine. Lin Jie was probably doomed!","Lin Jie and Yao Mengqing sat on the sofa like the owners of the house. They were overjoyed.","“Ah Jie, don’t say that. Xi Xi will be unhappy if she hears this.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Yao Mengqing raised her eyes and saw Qiao Xi, who was at the door. She cried out in surprise, “Xi Xi? You’re back!”","Lin Jie looked up unhappily, his eyes filled with disgust.","Yao Mengqing quickly stood up and said somewhat uneasily, “Xi Xi, Ah Jie was just joking just now. Don’t take it to heart. I just treat Ah Zheng as a friend.”","“Am I wrong? You and Ah Zheng were childhood sweethearts. You even slept on the same bed when you were young. He even said that he would marry you when he grew up. Have you forgotten all this?” Lin Jie looked serious.","Yao Mengqing lowered her head shyly and hurriedly explained, “Xi Xi, when Ah Zheng was young, he did say that he wanted to marry me, but that’s what children say. Children’s words carry no harm. It was just for fun.”","Qiao Xi could not help but sigh. Miss Yao’s acting skills were really good.","She did not take Lin Jie’s words seriously at all, but Yao Mengqing just had to repeat those things. She even looked shy. It was simply making things worse.","Was Miss Yao deliberately trying to make her jealous and angry?","Yao Mengqing pretended to be nervous. “Xi Xi, don’t be angry. It’s just...”","Before Qiao Xi could speak, Gu Zheng said calmly, “Yao Mengqing, you have a bad memory. The person who played around with you when you were young was Gu Yao, not me.”","Yao Mengqing’s expression suddenly changed.","Gu Zheng said slowly, “I wasn’t as childish as you guys.”","Qiao Xi knew it. How could someone like him play house with them? He even said he wanted to marry Yao Mengqing?","The corners of Yao Mengqing’s mouth twitched a few times. She forced out a smile and made herself calm down. “I-It’s possible that I remembered it wrong. So it was Gu Yao. That’s even better. Xi Xi won’t be angry anymore.”","Lin Jie frowned. It was just a game when they were young, yet Gu Zheng was not sparing Meng Qing any dignity. Wasn’t this too much?","He went up to Gu Zheng and said, “It’s normal for one to remember things wrong if they happened so long ago. Do you have to be so unreasonable?”","“Ah Zheng, it’s fine that you didn’t tell us about your marriage. But why did I hear from Meng Qing that if we want to come to your house to hang out, Qiao Xi won’t let us?”","Lin Jie had a look of disbelief on his face. “Ah Zheng, are you serious? We’re such good friends, but we can’t see each other anymore just because your wife doesn’t welcome us?”","The atmosphere instantly fell silent.","The butler also became nervous. Was Young Master Lin crazy?","He ran to Longwan Residential to ask the president to choose between them in front of Young Madam?","Gu Zheng sneered, and it seemed slightly strange with the silent atmosphere. He raised his eyes to look at Qiao Xi. “What do you think?”","Qiao Xi sat on the sofa with her legs crossed and smiled lightly. “I initially wanted to save some dignity for Miss Yao, but I couldn’t stop Miss Yao from being shameless enough to come over time and time again. So I’ll say it clearly, you’re the only one I don’t welcome.”","Yao Mengqing’s face turned pale.","Lin Jie immediately defended her. “Qiao Xi! This is Ah Zheng’s house, and we’re his good friends. It doesn’t matter whether you welcome us or not!”","“What Mrs. Gu means is very important,” Gu Zheng said coldly, “I support everything she does.”","Yao Mengqing’s body went soft and she almost stopped in her tracks. Her heart was so heavy that she could not breathe.","“I... I’m not feeling well. I’m sorry.”","With that, she covered her face and rushed out.","Gu Zheng’s expression was calm as he held Qiao Xi’s hand. “Let’s go.”","“Gu Zheng!” Lin Jie said in shock, “What do you mean? You know that Meng Qing likes you and only has you in her heart, yet you’re still hurting her like this? Do you still treat us as friends?”"]},{"number":280,"title":"Chapter 280 - The President And Young Madam Are So Sweet","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Zheng’s eyes were cold.","Lin Jie was so angry that his whole body was trembling. “It’s all because of this woman that you’ve distanced yourself from us. Looks like we don’t have to come to Longwan Residential anymore!”","Gu Zheng said indifferently, “Very good. Please get out now.”","Lin Jie must be tired of living to dare to scold Mrs. Gu in front of him.","Lin Jie was stunned on the spot, then he shouted in exasperation, “You’re chasing me away because of this woman? You must have been bewitched by this vixen! Miss Qiao, what method did you use to make Ah Zheng listen to you? What a good method!”","With that, he left angrily.","Qiao Xi pouted. “I haven’t settled the score with him yet but he even barked at me.”","Gu Zheng said indifferently, “Ignore him. He’ll definitely come again. We’ll settle the score with him then.”","Qiao Xi looked at him in doubt. Why was he so sure that Lin Jie would come again? Could it be that it was for Yao Mengqing?","...","In the backyard of Longwan Residential.","Lin Jie chased after Yao Mengqing and saw her sobbing softly.","“Mengqing, stop crying. It’s all Qiao Xi’s fault for egging Ah Zheng on to distance himself from us!”","Yao Mengqing wiped her tears. She looked pitiful, but her eyes were filled with resentment.","She had to fight back. If this went on, she would never have the chance again.","As long as Qiao Xi was around, she would forever be unable to approach Gu Zheng. Since it was like that, then she would eliminate Qiao Xi!","“Mengqing, don’t be sad.” Lin Jie comforted her.","Yao Mengqing wiped her tears and slowly looked up. “Ah Jie, I’m fine.”","Lin Jie looked at her aggrieved appearance and felt anger surge in his heart. “Since Qiao Xi doesn’t welcome us, then we won’t come again! Let’s go!”","Qiao Xi wanted to bully such a gentle and kind woman like Mengqing. She was too much!","“I’ll remember what happened today. I’ll definitely not let Qiao Xi off!”","Yao Mengqing quickly tried to persuade him. “Ah Jie, don’t... Don’t offend her. Ah Zheng likes her so much. If we do that, it’ll only make things difficult for him. I-I can’t leave Ah Zheng. I can’t...","“Moreover, it’s normal for Miss Qiao to hate me. Mengqi offended her previously, and she still remembers that incident. That’s why she doesn’t welcome me. I understand her, so don’t blame her.","“I don’t want things to be so tense. Go apologize with me, Ah Jie.”","Lin Jie frowned and felt very annoyed.","He had also heard about Yao Mengqi offending Qiao Xi, but it had been a long time since then. However, this woman was still unwilling to let go of the matter. She was too petty!","Gu Zheng liked that woman only because she was good-looking and was also a teacher at Li City University. If he knew that Qiao Xi was lying and was an idiot, would he still like her?","He had reported Qiao Xi for getting in through the back door but there was no update yet. Logically speaking, Qiao Xi should have already been notified about her expulsion.","Even if she was not fired, she would not be able to raise her head in Li City University anymore.","Lin Jie smirked. “Alright, let’s go back.”","Yao Mengqing held Lin Jie and lowered her head, revealing a sinister smile.","...","Lunch had already been prepared in Longwan Residential. It was a scrumptious feast.","Gu Zheng bent down and kissed Qiao Xi lightly on the lips. The butler saw this and smiled widely. “The president is even kissing Young Madam before dinner. How loving!”","Gu Zheng’s expression was calm as he smiled lightly. “Yes, we’re very loving.”","However, Qiao Xi was so shy that her face turned red.","She and Gu Zheng were not kissing because of their affection for each other. She had to recover her taste buds before eating. Perhaps Gu Zheng could not be bothered to explain.","The butler picked up some food for Qiao Xi with a pair of chopsticks. “Young Madam, try this dish and see how it tastes. These dishes are all very healthy, and they’re all prepared according to the standards of preparing to conceive.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","The butler sure knew a lot. He even knew how to prepare dishes for conceiving?","After the butler left, Qiao Xi began to be picky with her food. She picked up all the dishes that she did not like and gave them to Gu Zheng. “I’m not eating this. Take them all!”","The man lowered his head to look at the dishes in the bowl with a calm expression. He slowly picked up his chopsticks and placed the food in his mouth.","Qiao Xi had always done this. She would give whatever food she did not like to Gu Zheng.","However, when she was putting food into Gu Zheng’s bowl, Yao Mengqing happened to come in."]},{"number":281,"title":"Chapter 281 - Miss Yao Is An Outsider","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","When Yao Mengqing saw this scene, she immediately cried out in surprise, “Xi Xi, Ah Zheng doesn’t like to eat carrots, let alone the other food that you’re putting in his bowl. Why are you forcing him to eat? As his wife, why don’t you know how to take care of your husband?!”","Qiao Xi’s movements froze. This woman really returned!","Yao Mengqing rushed up to him and looked at him worriedly. “Ah Zheng, stop eating.”","Then, she looked at Qiao Xi and frowned as she educated her, “Xi Xi, don’t you know that Ah Zheng never eats carrots?","“Besides, he doesn’t like it when others take food for him. How can he eat it if you used your own chopsticks to take the food for him? Why are you so inconsiderate of him?”","As soon as she finished speaking, Gu Zheng picked up the carrot in his bowl and ate it elegantly.","Yao Mengqing’s lips twitched in disbelief.","Qiao Xi smiled lightly as well. “Miss Yao, didn’t you leave? Why did you return?”","Yao Mengqing stared at Gu Zheng as if she was going to cry the next second.","Why?! Why would such a high and mighty person like him have to endure it for Qiao Xi’s sake and even eat carrots, something that he did not like?","He was a serious clean freak and did not like anyone approaching him. However, he could eat the food Qiao Xi took for him with her chopsticks.","Lin Jie frowned. “Ah Zheng! If you don’t want to eat, then don’t. Why make things difficult for yourself because of her? Previously, when Mengqing put food in your bowl, you wouldn’t even eat a bite. Now, you...”","“I’m indeed a clean freak, but that’s only for outsiders.”","Gu Zheng’s voice was calm. Yao Mengqing’s face was ashen, and her entire body was trembling.","She was an outsider?","They had grown up together since they were young. They had been good friends for so many years, but now, they were outsiders?","It was all Qiao Xi’s fault!","Ah Zheng definitely did not know that Qiao Xi was faking it. She was just an idiot. He had to know that she got into Li City University through the back door. He would definitely hate her.","Yao Mengqing gradually calmed down and looked at Qiao Xi with an apologetic expression. “Xi Xi, I’m sorry. I just wanted to remind you that Ah Zheng doesn’t like to eat carrots, so I was a little agitated. You mustn’t take it to heart.”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. Miss Yao was really quick at changing her words!","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully when she saw Yao Mengqing’s humble appearance.","“Thank you, Miss Yao, but I think Gu Zheng likes eating carrots. He eats whatever dishes I put in his bowl because I’m Mrs. Gu while you’re an outsider!”","In their house, she pretended to be close to Gu Zheng and pointed at Yao Mengqing. Was there something wrong with Yao Mengqing’s brain?","If Gu Zheng did not like to eat something, he would say it himself. He did not need to get an outsider to remind Qiao Xi about it.","Qiao Xi had been putting food that she did not like into Gu Zheng’s bowl, but he had never refused. He would even finish everything.","Yao Mengqing was so angry that her body was trembling. She suppressed the anger and viciousness in her heart.","She took a deep breath and forced a gentle smile. “I just think that Ah Zheng is my good friend. I hope he can lead a better life. I forgot that he’s already married.","“Xi Xi, you won’t blame me, right?”","Lin Jie saw that Yao Mengqing was trembling but was still forcing herself to apologize to Qiao Xi. He was instantly infuriated.","He wanted Gu Zheng to see what kind of trash Qiao Xi was! He wanted her to be hated and abandoned!","Lin Jie sneered. “Ah Zheng, something happened at Li City University today. A woman got in through the back door and the university announced that they would fire her.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. She really could not endure it any longer.","Gu Zheng was composed.","Lin Jie looked at Qiao Xi and continued, “If I remember correctly, the person who got in through the back door is Mrs. Gu.”","Qiao Xi glanced at him and sneered. Gu Zheng happened to be holding a piece of meat for her, so she opened her mouth to take it.","She was still eating as if she had not heard what Lin Jie just said. It made Lin Jie angry. “How shameless. I heard that it was her sugar daddy who helped her.”","Gu Zheng put down his chopsticks, and his eyes turned cold.","Yao Mengqing asked probingly, “Xi Xi, there are rumors that you didn’t take the college entrance examination and got into Li University through the back door. This should just be a rumor, right? I believe you wouldn’t have done such a thing..”"]},{"number":282,"title":"Chapter 282 - Her Achievements Are Beyond Your Reach","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Lin Jie had a face full of disdain. “Mengqing, you’re really kind. That’s not a rumor at all but the truth. Look at Qiao Xi, she doesn’t even dare to say anything. She must be tacitly agreeing to it!”","Yao Mengqing pretended to be kind and said, “Xi Xi, don’t blame Ah Jie. He’s just too straightforward... If you’re not willing to talk about this, then I won’t ask you any further.","“Ah Jie and I will pretend not to know about this.”","Qiao Xi sneered. These words were so magnanimous!","Pretending not to know about this matter meant that it did exist. It meant that Qiao Xi had indeed used the back door. Seemingly for Qiao Xi’s sake, Yao Mengqing said she would forget about it, making her seem gentle and considerate.","Qiao Xi asked casually, “Who did you hear it from?”","Yao Mengqing still said gently, “Xi Xi, they’re just rumors from the students in the university. Don’t take them to heart. We all know that you worked hard to enter Li City University. That’s enough. With Ah Zheng around, you won’t be fired.”","“I’m afraid the two of you are mistaken.” Qiao Xi raised her eyes, and her gaze was filled with ridicule. She was already tired of looking at Yao Mengqing’s hypocritical face.","“I don’t know where you heard the rumors, Miss Yao, but it seems you haven’t found out that the person who’s removed from Li City University isn’t me.”","The smile on Yao Mengqing’s face vanished instantly.","Qiao Xi slowly said, “I was the champion of the International Real-time Translation Competition for five consecutive years and received the top international design award. That’s why the previous chancellor of Li City University specially recruited me into this university. At that time, more than ten famous universities in the country and abroad had extended invitations to me.","“But I’m from Li City, so I chose Li University in the end.”","Yao Mengqing’s expression changed. She was specially recruited?","The top international design award? And the champion of the International Real-time Translation Competition?","She blurted out, “Xi Xi, you can’t make up countless lies one after another. Even if you didn’t take the college entrance examination, I wouldn’t look down on you...”","“Why does Miss Yao think that I’m lying? Could it be that you think I’m not worthy of being the champion and receiving the design award?”","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully and said, “Miss Yao, you’ll never be able to catch up to my accomplishments. It’s understandable that you find it difficult to believe.”","Yao Mengqing immediately choked. She felt like a huge rock was pressing on her heart.","Qiao Xi’s accomplishments would forever be beyond her reach?","This b*tch dared to mock her?","Yao Mengqing looked at Lin Jie pleadingly. Lin Jie snorted. “More than ten famous universities invited you to join them? Don’t lie!”","“If you think I’m lying to you, you can go and check. Young Master Lin, you should have that ability. Among the more than ten famous universities, one of them is the one Miss Yao wanted to enter back then but failed.”","Qiao Xi’s lips curled up.","Yao Mengqing was embarrassed and bit her lip.","Qiao Xi’s brows raised. “Young Master Lin, if you still don’t believe me, do you want me to help you investigate? Right, I also want to ask which university you graduated from? I wonder if you have the qualifications to speak to me?”","...","The atmosphere became awkward.","Lin Jie was uneducated. Although he had gone to a decent university, it was only because his family had spent a fortune on him. If he had relied on his own strength, he would not have been able to enter a university.","Seeing that the two of them were silent, Qiao Xi spoke first, “Young Master Lin, aren’t you embarrassed for not saying anything? Let me remind you not to spread rumors in the future. Wang Qing, who spread rumors before this, has already been expelled. Could it be that you haven’t heard about it?”","Lin Jie’s face turned green. He wanted to retort, but he was so angry that he could not say anything.","He was silent for a long time before he slowly stood up. He was strong and calm. “Mengqing and I are just reminding you not to throw Ah Zheng’s reputation around. Since you don’t appreciate our gesture, then forget it! Mengqing, let’s go!”","Yao Mengqing smiled helplessly. “Xi Xi, Ah Jie is doing this for Ah Zheng’s sake. He’s afraid that it won’t be good for Ah Zheng’s reputation. Since the misunderstanding has been resolved, don’t be angry anymore... I-I’ll leave with Ah Jie!”","She followed closely behind and was about to leave with Lin Jie.","Qiao Xi smiled lightly. Were they in such a rush to leave because they were afraid she would look for trouble?","“Song Shijing,” Gu Zheng suddenly said.","Song Shijing walked over immediately and stopped them.. He said coldly, “I’m sorry, but you can’t leave yet.”"]},{"number":283,"title":"Chapter 283 - Only A Righteous Person Has Nothing To Be Afraid Of","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Lin Jie turned around in disbelief. “Ah Zheng, what are you doing?”","Gu Zheng took a sip of wine and slowly looked up. “Who exactly reported my wife? Young Master Lin, shouldn’t you explain?”","The two of them instantly turned pale. Lin Jie pretended to be calm. “What do I have to explain? Do you think I was the one who reported her? How could I have done such a thing?”","Gu Zheng looked calm. Song Shijing took out his laptop and said in a cold, distant voice, “Young Master Lin, the surveillance video of you going to the vice chancellor’s office is on this computer. It’s enough to prove that you reported Young Madam. What else do you have to say?”","After Song Shijing finished speaking, Lin Jie widened his eyes and stared at the computer on the table. He gritted his teeth and shouted, “Fine! You’re good!”","“You don’t want to explain?”","Gu Zheng casually replied, “Alright.”","Although he only said one word, it meant that Lin Jie’s death had been determined.","Yao Mengqing’s heart trembled. She looked at Gu Zheng in horror. She knew that Gu Zheng was really angry this time.","She bit her lip tightly, and her voice trembled. “Ah Zheng, don’t blame Ah Jie. Ah Jie did report Xi Xi and made her suffer, but when he did, he didn’t know that Xi Xi was the one who took the back door. It was only for the sake of Li City University’s reputation. Moreover, you’re the director of Li City University. This kind of news is slanderous to you. He did it all for you!”","Qiao Xi nodded. “Young Master Lin is really good to Ah Zheng.”","Gu Zheng said unhurriedly, “You didn’t even investigate it clearly yet you just casually reported it. Young Master Lin, don’t you have a brain?”","Lin Jie felt humiliated.","Yao Mengqing explained awkwardly, “Ah Zheng, don’t blame Ah Jie. If you want to blame someone, blame me.","“Actually, he thought that we had always been close when we were young. He thought that you would marry me, but who would have thought that you would marry Xi Xi instead. Hence, he stood up for me...”","Qiao Xi was so angry that she laughed. “Miss Yao, didn’t you say that Lin Jie reported someone? Now, you’re saying that he was defending you. Are you stupid?”","Yao Mengqing’s lips froze.","Lin Jie protected Yao Mengqing and said indignantly, “Mengqing doesn’t know that I reported you. I admit that I reported you. I thought that you got into Li City University through the back door because you didn’t take the college entrance examination, so I reported you. It isn’t in line with the university’s values, after all. What did I do wrong?","“Qiao Xi, a clear conscience won’t have to be afraid of anything. Since you didn’t get in through the back door, what are you afraid of?”","Qiao Xi had really learned something today. People who made mistakes could still be so self-righteous?","She was about to speak when Gu Zheng beat her to it. “Song Shijing, report the Lin family’s food factory immediately!”","Lin Jie’s face instantly turned pale as he shouted, “Ah Zheng, why is our food factory not up to standard? You’re simply taking revenge!”","Gu Zheng said unhurriedly, “This is for your own good. Reporting the Lin family will allow you to improve yourself.”","Qiao Xi: “...” Amazing!","Lin Jie’s face looked as if he was constipated. He looked ferocious but there was also some forbearance. Even though there was nothing wrong with the Lin family’s food factory, as it was Gu Zheng who reported it, everyone would think that they had missed out on something and start to go against the Lin family’s products.","Lin Jie felt a sharp pain in his heart. “Ah Zheng, stop fooling around. Business in the food factory is not good. If you report us, we’ll be doomed!”","Gu Zheng sneered. “What does this have to do with me? Didn’t you say that a righteous person has nothing to be afraid of? If there’s nothing wrong with your Lin family’s food products, why would you be afraid of being reported?”","Lin Jie immediately choked.","Gu Zheng had said everything he just said. This was clearly revenge.","For that b*tch, he could even harm his own brother?","It was not the same thing for him to report Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng to report the Lin family.","After Qiao Xi was reported, everything was clarified. However, after the Lin family was reported, their shares would plunge and it would affect the company’s reputation. They would lose a lot of money!","Yao Mengqing forced out a smile. “Ah Zheng, don’t say things out of anger. Moreover, the misunderstanding has been resolved. The person who spread the rumors has been expelled, so it won’t affect Xi Xi at all.. Why don’t you just ask Ah Jie to apologize and forget about this matter?”"]},{"number":284,"title":"Chapter 284 - Taking Revenge For Mrs. Gu","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“It affected Xi Xi.”","Gu Zheng’s voice was low as he said word by word, “My wife is unhappy.","“I want to take revenge for her!”","Yao Mengqing’s expression froze.","Take revenge for Qiao Xi?","Gu Zheng said indifferently, “If Lin Jie makes my wife unhappy, he has to pay the price. If my wife is not appeased, the Lin family’s food factory’s operations will continue to be suspended.","“Yao Mengqing, I’ve warned you long ago that Mrs. Gu is my bottom line. I hope you’ll remember this.”","Yao Mengqing’s body went soft, and her breathing trembled.","No! Impossible!","How could Ah Zheng... attack the Lin family for Qiao Xi?","Qiao Xi held Gu Zheng’s hand and said arrogantly, “You’re not apologizing, right? Then wait for the Lin family to go bankrupt!”","Lin Jie gritted his teeth. “Qiao Xi! Do you have the ability to make my family go bankrupt?”","“I don’t, but Gu Zheng can do it. He already said that if I’m not appeased, your factory will be suspended!”","Qiao Xi pretended to be surprised. “You’re not possibly thinking that Gu Zheng is just scaring you, right?”","Lin Jie’s throat tightened. “Gu Zheng, are you breaking off all ties with me because of this woman? Are you going to make the entire Lin family pay the price? I’ve been your friend for so many years, and this is how you’re going to treat me?”","Qiao Xi was speechless. If he really treated Gu Zheng as a friend, why would he ruin their relationship?","Actually, Lin Jie only treated Gu Zheng as a money tree because the title of being Gu Zheng’s friend could let him succeed in high society.","Lin Jie was so scared that his whole body was trembling. He was afraid that if Gu Zheng gave the order, the Lin family would be doomed.","In his panic, he blurted out, “What spell did this b*tch cast on you?! She’s—”","“Ah Jie!” Yao Mengqing interrupted him with a loud voice. If he insulted Qiao Xi in front of her, it would only make the situation worse.","Yao Mengqing walked in front of Qiao Xi and bowed deeply. “Xi Xi, I’m sorry. I apologize on behalf of Ah Jie. After Ah Jie reported you, he regretted it very much and wanted to clarify the matter.","“I didn’t expect you to explain yourself so quickly. You also got Wang Qing expelled. I’m glad that you weren’t affected. You’re so gentle and kind. Can you forgive Ah Jie? He did it for Ah Zheng and doesn’t have any ill intention against you.”","Qiao Xi took a sip of tea. The warm taste made her frown ease.","Yao Mengqing was such a two-faced b*tch.","“Miss Yao, I’m not a gentle and kind person. On the contrary, I’m vengeful. If someone doesn’t apologize, I’ll be unhappy. If I’m unhappy, Gu Zheng will attack the Lin family.","“Even if he apologizes, I might not forgive him. If apologizing is useful, why would we need the police?”","Yao Mengqing bit her lip. This Qiao Xi was really too difficult to deal with.","It was just a misunderstanding. Why could she not forgive Ah Jie?","“I...”","“If I slapped Miss Yao and immediately apologized to you, would you forgive me?” Qiao Xi asked.","Yao Mengqing looked at Gu Zheng helplessly. She was about to cry.","How could Ah Zheng like such a petty woman like Qiao Xi?","He should like those kinds of young misses who were aloof from worldly affairs and gentle like water.","Hence, Yao Mengqing had always been gentle to make Gu Zheng think that she was the most suitable woman for him.","Yao Mengqing choked softly. “Xi Xi... You’re Ah Zheng’s wife. No matter what you’ve done, as long as you apologize, I’ll forgive you.”","The atmosphere was silent.","Qiao Xi smiled lightly and walked straight to the kitchen. When she appeared again, she was holding a shiny kitchen knife.","Without saying anything, she raised the kitchen knife and threw it at Yao Mengqing. The knife spun in the air a few times and pierced into Yao Mengqing’s side.","“Ah!”","Yao Mengqing shouted loudly, her face pale from fright. Her body could not help but tremble. “Xi Xi, have you gone mad?”","“Qiao Xi! You want to kill someone?” Lin Jie hurriedly stood in front of Yao Mengqing and shouted.","Qiao Xi slowly walked to the side and picked up the kitchen knife. She said with a calm voice, “I’m sorry!”","“You think apologizing is enough? Are you trying to kill someone? I was the one who reported you. If you have any problems, come at me.. Why are you making things difficult for Meng Qing? If the Yao family finds out about this, they won’t let you off!”"]},{"number":285,"title":"Chapter 285 - Giving Them A Taste Of Their Own Medicine","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi calmly looked at the infuriated Young Master Lin with an indifferent expression.","“Miss Yao, I wanted to kill you, but I’ve already apologized. You said that no matter what I do, you’ll forgive me. You even wanted to force me to forgive Lin Jie, so you can forgive me, right?”","Lin Jie and Yao Mengqing were so angry that they were trembling.","Yao Mengqing could not say anything.","Qiao Xi threw the knife to the table and said with an aggrieved expression, “Gu Zheng, I’m so angry. Lin Jie reported me, and Miss Yao even forced me to forgive him. If I don’t forgive him, that would make me cruel and heartless. I feel so wronged!","“I just wanted to tell Miss Yao that even if one apologizes, one might not be forgiven. You’re already a married man, yet she still keeps pestering you. If others see this, they’ll definitely say that she’s a mistress. I’m doing this for her sake!”","Yao Mengqing was so angry that she almost vomited blood.","Gu Zheng said casually, “Song Shijing, the second young master of the Yao family was drunk and caused a scene before this. He beat up his girlfriend in public. The Yao family’s biggest rival should be very happy to learn about this.”","“Yes, President. I’ll get it done right away.”","Yao Mengqing’s face darkened. “Ah Zheng, wait, don’t...”","Gu Zheng said indifferently, “I’m sorry, I’ll apologize. Please forgive me.”","Qiao Xi: “...”","Gu Zheng was of a higher status. One sentence from him could anger someone to death!","Yao Mengqing’s legs went weak as she fell onto the sofa. If the Yao family found out that she had offended Gu Zheng and affected the family, they would definitely not let her off!","What right did Qiao Xi have to be protected by Gu Zheng like this?!","Lin Jie saw Yao Mengqing crying and said unwillingly, “Gu Zheng, are you crazy? Are you going to kill Mengqing because of her?”","At this moment, the phone suddenly rang. Lin Jie looked at the caller ID and his heart skipped a beat. When the call connected, he heard an anxious voice from the other end. “Lin Jie! The food factory has been reported to have failed to meet the requirements. An excessive amount of toxic substances have been found. Now that the factory has been closed, the company has also been affected!”","‘It’s over! I wonder how much money I’ll lose this time?!’","“Fine! Gu Zheng, you’re actually so heartless. I won’t let this go! Qiao Xi, just you wait!”","Lin Jie roared and left, but Qiao Xi said loudly, “Young Master Lin, think carefully. Who caused you to become like this?”","Yao Mengqing’s face turned pale.","Lin Jie could not help but look at Yao Mengqing. Seeing that she was crying pitifully, his heart ached very much. He said fiercely, “It’s you! It’s all because of you, Qiao Xi!”","Qiao Xi: “...”","Alright, she would not say anything more.","She looked at Yao Mengqing coldly. “In order to help you, your friend’s company was greatly affected. Why are you still standing here instead of comforting him?”","Yao Mengqing’s face was filled with sorrow. “Ah Zheng, you’re too much. Ah Jie did it for your own good. Moreover, Qiao Xi...”","“Scram!” Gu Zheng said.","“Yao Mengqing, I hope you’ll disappear from my sight immediately. Don’t make me repeat myself.”","“Ah Zheng, you’ve misunderstood me. I’m just...”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were cold. “I’ve already given you a chance. This time, Lin Jie stood up for you. Before that, it was your cousin. What about in the future? Who else do you think can shoulder the responsibility for you?”","The Lin family had suffered heavy losses this time. If they stood up for her again, the entire family would be doomed.","Yao Mengqing’s expression darkened.","She originally thought that by coming to Longwan Residential this time, she could let Gu Zheng see Qiao Xi’s true colors clearly. Unexpectedly, she harmed herself instead.","Yao Mengqing’s head was heavy. She tried her best to squeeze out a smile. “Ah Zheng, I’m sorry. I didn’t do it on purpose. I just treat you as a friend. You... Don’t misunderstand me. I-I’ll... go first.”","Qiao Xi was really helpless. The entire Longwan Residential knew what this woman wanted to do, yet she just had to pretend to be a good friend. Did she think that everyone else was a fool?","“Are you happy now?”","Gu Zheng suddenly said.","Qiao Xi nodded with a smile. “I’m happy, extremely happy!”","Reporting the Lin family’s food factory must not have been a last-minute idea.. Gu Zheng must have long ago prepared to give Lin Jie a taste of his own medicine."]},{"number":286,"title":"Chapter 286 - Confronting Fear","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Zheng nodded in satisfaction, and his tightly furrowed brows relaxed. He said in a domineering voice, “If you’re happy, what should you do?”","Qiao Xi: “...?”","She looked puzzled. “Thank you?” she asked tentatively.","Gu Zheng frowned.","Before this, Song Shiyu had said that a woman’s way of expressing her gratitude to her lover was through a kiss. Hence, Young Madam would definitely give him a kiss in excitement, so he had to be more reserved now.","Gu Zheng said, “Yes, and then?”","And then?","Qiao Xi pondered for a moment, and her voice trembled slightly. “Then... Then I’ll kiss you?”","‘Gu Zheng doesn’t look right. Has he been influenced by Song Shiyu? What’s on his mind?’","Gu Zheng frowned when he heard what she was thinking.","Qiao Xi did not seem to like Song Shiyu’s idea.","Immediately after, he heard something again.","‘What does he mean? He can’t be asking me to kiss him, right? When did Senior become so lustful?’","Gu Zheng could not help but cough to hide the blush on his face. He pretended to be calm and said, “What do you think?”","Qiao Xi grunted coldly in her heart.","‘Hah! Just say it if you want me to kiss you. Why are you beating around the bush?’","Gu Zheng smiled. Not bad. Mrs. Gu was also willing to kiss him. It was just that he did not manage to react in time at first.","‘That’s not right. Why should I thank him?’","Qiao Xi suddenly paused and frowned.","‘If it weren’t for him, how would I have been reported? Yao Mengqing did it for him, and Lin Jie did it for Yao Mengqing. That’s why such a thing happened. The culprit is this bastard, Gu Zheng!","‘It’s only right for him to take revenge for me!’","The smile on Gu Zheng’s face vanished abruptly as he felt disappointed.","After that, the gratitude in Qiao Xi’s heart instantly vanished like smoke. When she was about to turn gentle, she stopped herself in time and hurriedly ran away.","“I suddenly feel like swimming. I’m going to change!”","Song Shiyu, who was hiding in the corner, was speechless.","‘Holy sh*t! I feel embarrassed for the president.’ “President, why don’t you chase after her? After you chase after her, just pull her along and kiss her forcefully. Young Madam will definitely fall under your ferocious attacks! Why are you standing there in such an awkward position?... President, President, where are you going? You’re going the wrong way!”","Gu Zheng walked upstairs.","He pushed open the cloakroom and looked at the bathing suit he had bought for Qiao Xi.","Song Shiyu caught up with him. “President, what are you doing? Why are you...”","“Shut up. Be careful if you want to keep your salary.” Song Shijing stopped him.","Song Shiyu said, “I’m doing this for the president. It doesn’t matter if my salary is deducted. He’ll understand how good I am sooner or later.”","Song Shijing: “...” Fine, forget it.","Just then, Gu Zheng took out the bathing suit. His eyes darkened when he saw the pitiful amount of fabric on it.","At this moment, Qiao Xi was looking for a bathing suit when a male voice came from the door. “Are you sure you want to swim?”","Qiao Xi asked without turning her head, “What’s wrong?”","There was a large pool in the backyard of Longwan Residential. She had always wanted to try it out and it was a good day today.","Gu Zheng’s eyes darkened. “I remember you’re afraid of water.”","Qiao Xi’s body abruptly froze.","That’s right, she was indeed afraid of water. It was because Qiao Rou had pushed her into the lake and she almost drowned, so she had always been afraid of water.","That suffocating feeling had haunted her for many years. She would even wake up from nightmares.","Due to her fear of water, she could not use too much water when bathing. Furthermore, she would feel afraid when walking near a lake or a pool.","When her grandfather and brothers asked her about it, she only said that she did not want to learn to swim. However, she once told her senior that it was because of her childhood trauma.","As long as she saw deep water, the image of her sinking into the water and not being able to even struggle would appear in her mind. Meanwhile, she would see Qiao Rou standing on the shore and laughing out loud. Hence, Qiao Xi hated swimming.","During that time in the countryside, it was her senior who had always been by her side. It was her senior who told her that the only way to defeat fear was to face it head-on.","From then on, she began trying to face it. Even though she was so scared that her body would tremble, she forced herself to adapt. Gradually, she could enter the water and swim. She even enjoyed it.","Seeing that she was silent, Gu Zheng stroked her head.","After that, he handed two exquisite bags to Qiao Xi. His ears were slightly red, and he silently looked away so that Qiao Xi could not see his expression.."]},{"number":287,"title":"Chapter 287 - A Present After Many Years","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi accepted the bags. They seemed to contain clothes.","She opened one of the bags and looked at them with a subtle expression.","There was a bathing suit inside. It was a pink and white one. The sleeves were made of muslin and were light and elegant. There was a butterfly knot on the chest and a pure-white short skirt.","She could not find a bathing suit, so Gu Zheng brought one over. The size was just right too. It was too sweet.","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with excitement as she hurriedly looked at the other bag. The bag was covered in dust, and it seemed to have been there for a long time.","She took out the clothes inside and took a look. This bathing suit...","Did he buy a size too small?","Song Shiyu hid at the door and stuck his head out quietly. He was dumbfounded when he saw the bathing suit. “Damn! That’s a children’s bathing suit! What kind of hobby does the president have?","“How shocking!”","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with shock as she held the swimsuit. She sized up Gu Zheng and said helplessly, “Did you buy the wrong one?”","Gu Zheng was calm as he said gently, “No, I bought it for you.”","Qiao Xi was puzzled.","Gu Zheng’s ears were red, but his face remained calm. “The first time you went into the water, I bought you this bathing suit. I hoped you could wear it to face your fears.”","Qiao Xi sank into her memories. When she was young, she got into the water for the first time under Gu Zheng’s encouragement. Her third brother was so scared that he directly carried her.","After that, she excitedly told her senior about it but he had only replied with an ‘okay’. He seemed to be very busy during those few days. Sometimes, he would only reply after a long time. However, she never got tired of texting him.","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at Gu Zheng, a wave of bitterness surging in her heart while her eyes were heavy.","“You... You still remember?”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were gentle. “It’s just that I never had the chance to give it to you after I bought it.”","At that time, Qiao Xi was especially happy to tell him that she had entered the water. Mo Yuan had only replied with an ‘okay’ and said that he would reward her. After that, they lost contact. It was only later that she found out that he had been injured.","After that, Qiao Xi forgot about this reward.","It turned out that he had already bought a gift many years ago.","Gu Zheng said gently, “After I bought the gift, I ran into some trouble and got injured. After a while, when I wanted to give you the gift again, the bathing suit didn’t fit you anymore.","“And you seemed to have forgotten about it, so I didn’t mention it.”","Qiao Xi was slightly puzzled. “You didn’t even know if I could swim or not, so why did you buy me a new one?”","She looked at the pink bathing suit. She had to admit that Gu Zheng had good taste.","Gu Zheng smiled. “The present I promised you doesn’t fit anymore, so I should give you a new one.”","Qiao Xi was almost moved to tears.","Her senior was too kind. It was just a casual remark, but he remembered it.","Qiao Xi picked up the pink bathing suit and rushed into the bathroom, shouting, “Gu Zheng, quickly change your clothes. Let’s go swim!”","In next to no time, Qiao Xi pushed open the door of the bathroom and casually put on a towel before rushing to the backyard.","Gu Zheng took a deep breath. Although it was only for a moment, he could still see her slender waist and long legs clearly.","Her skin was fair, and her figure was well-proportioned. Every part of her body was perfect. She was like a fairy who had fallen into the mortal world.","Qiao Xi did not realize how beautiful she was at this moment.","Gu Zheng grabbed her hand and covered his blushing cheeks. He waved his hand to signal Song Shiyu and Song Shijing to leave before he felt relieved again.","After Song Shiyu and Song Shijing left, Gu Zheng opened the door and held her hand as they prepared to go to the backyard.","Qiao Xi pushed the door open and was about to leave when a male voice sounded—","“Gu Zheng, are you going for a swim?”","Gu Yao rushed over like a silly boy and chuckled. “Bring me along! I haven’t been swimming for a long time too!”","Gu Zheng’s expression darkened as he picked Qiao Xi up and wrapped her tightly with a towel. He turned around coldly and closed the door with a bang.","Gu Yao had just rushed to the door when he was rejected. He looked innocent.."]},{"number":288,"title":"Chapter 288 - Do You Want To Be Beaten?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Gu Yao scratched his head, muttering, “Gu Zheng, why are you hiding from me? I think I saw a naked woman just now?”","Naked?","Gu Zheng’s Adam’s apple moved.","Qiao Xi was stunned, suddenly realizing that the woman Gu Yao was talking about was her.","She looked down at her bathing suit and shouted in a hoarse voice, “You call this naked?”","Gu Zheng: “...”","He helped Qiao Xi put on a towel again and after confirming that her body was not exposed, he opened the door with relief and grabbed Gu Yao’s collar.","Gu Yao was still confused when he felt something gripping his neck. He was so scared that he panicked.","“Brother, Brother, what are you doing? I just saw Qiao Xi wearing a towel.”","He only saw a towel. It was alright.","Actually, Gu Yao had wanted to come to Longwan Residential to swim a long time ago, but Gu Zheng did not let him. He finally had a chance this time.","“Qiao Xi, do you want to swim?”","Gu Zheng looked at him coldly.","Gu Yao said, “Let’s swim together. We’ll compete, and the loser can promise the other party something.”","Qiao Xi was instantly interested when she heard about the competition. She pulled Gu Yao along and was about to leave.","Seeing that the towel on her body was about to fall, Gu Zheng hurriedly pulled her back, then looked at the other person. “Gu Yao, when is your birthday?”","Gu Yao was stunned, then smiled. “April 1st. You don’t even remember it? It’s April Fool’s Day! It’s still too early for my birthday, but you can prepare a gift for me in advance! I won’t ask for much, just buy me the latest sports car.”","Gu Zheng said, “I know it’s April 1st, I just wanted to remind you.”","Gu Yao looked at him in disdain. “Are you crazy? How could I forget my own birthday?”","With Qiao Xi’s understanding of Gu Zheng, this bastard was absolutely not good at holding back his anger.","Gu Zheng sneered. “Looks like you forgot that I gave you a beating on your birthday last time.”","“Oh, it’s this. What’s the matter...”","Gu Yao was suddenly shocked. “It’s fine if you don’t agree to let me swim in your house, but why do you have to hit me? I’m your younger brother. You’re too heartless!”","Gu Yao then ran to the backyard and jumped into the pool with a splash. He smiled very annoyingly.","‘I’m not leaving. Hit me if you can!’","Gu Yao swam freely in the water, then waved at Qiao Xi. “Qiao Xi! Come quickly! Let’s compete!”","Qiao Xi was eager to give it a try. Although her swimming skills were not as good as Gu Yao’s, she was still very happy to play in the water.","She turned to look at the man beside her and said in a warning tone, “Gu Zheng, I’m going for a swim!”","Gu Zheng: “...”","If he had known earlier, he would have bought a more conservative bathing suit. Who knew that Gu Yao would come? Wearing such a thin layer of clothes to swim with Gu Yao?","Couldn’t she tell that he was already unhappy?","She did not care about him at all!","Gu Zheng’s heart ached. Seeing Qiao Xi and Gu Yao being so close and talking about everything, he was extremely annoyed and had the urge to hit someone.","The pool was not big. Gu Zheng’s eyes turned cold when he thought about the possibility of the two of them leaning against each other while swimming.","Gu Zheng grabbed Qiao Xi tightly. “No.”","The smile on Qiao Xi’s face vanished abruptly.","Gu Zheng’s expression was serious as he pulled her away.","Seeing that he was so determined, Qiao Xi did not resist. She returned to her room in a huff and abruptly closed the door.","Gu Zheng looked at her angry expression and could not help but smile.","“Butler.”","The butler walked over and waited for instructions.","“After Gu Yao leaves, go clean up the pool.”","The water in the pool that Gu Yao had swum in would definitely be very dirty, so he could not let Mrs. Gu use it after this.","He continued, “Place two foldable beds and umbrellas beside the pool, as well as a few towels.”","Qiao Xi was so afraid of water previously, but her eyes lit up when she heard that she could swim. It was really miraculous.","At this moment, in the bedroom.","Qiao Xi lay on the bed angrily, then picked up her phone and made a call.","“I want to swim! There’s a pool at home but Gu Zheng doesn’t even let me swim! Sister Xue Yi, quickly check if Gu Zheng has gone bankrupt. He doesn’t even let me play in the pool!”","Xue Yi was having afternoon tea and eating a bite of cake. “Little Six, what’s wrong?”"]},{"number":289,"title":"Chapter 289 - Why Are You Lying On My Bed?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi told her what had just happened and said angrily, “I just thought that the weather was good and wanted to play in the water. He even gave me a bathing suit. Although the bathing suit is a little revealing, it’s still quite pretty!”","“Wait!” Xue Yi was alarmed as she spat out a mouthful of coffee. It splashed onto Qin An’s face, and he slammed the table in anger.","Xue Yi hurriedly lowered her voice. “Qiao Xi, say that again? The bathing suit Gu Zheng gave you is very revealing?”","Qiao Xi had not taken off her bathing suit. She walked to the bathroom and looked at herself in the mirror. Her cheeks were slightly red.","“Who knew that Gu Zheng would be so lustful? He gave me such revealing clothes.”","Xue Yi picked up a tissue and wiped her mouth. “Little Six, have you ever thought that Gu Zheng might not let you swim because he’s jealous?”","Qiao Xi was stunned.","Huh? Jealous?","“You’re wearing such revealing clothes, so of course, you can only show it to him. All men are like this. Seeing you so close to Gu Yao, of course, he’d be jealous. Moreover, you’re wearing so little. Would he feel good if other men looked at you?”","Qiao Xi’s expression eased up slightly, but she was still slightly depressed.","She picked up the strawberry from the table and took a bite, but it tasted like nothing.","Right, only by kissing Gu Zheng could she recover her taste buds. This was too troublesome.","When Xue Yi heard that she was eating, she was a little puzzled. “What are you eating? Have your taste buds recovered?”","Qiao Xi looked at the strawberry in her hand. Her taste buds did not work before, so she would not have any snacks and would just eat to fill her stomach. Since she couldn’t taste anything, she just ate to fill up her stomach.","However, now... fruits and snacks would appear in her room from time to time. The dining table would be full too.","It was because Gu Zheng was around, and this man was her husband. Whenever she wanted to recover her taste buds, she would run to kiss Gu Zheng before returning to her room to eat snacks and fruits.","However, she could not tell Xue Yi about this!","Xue Yi did not hear her reply and found it a little strange. “Qiao Xi, did you hear me? Did Gu Zheng help you recover your taste buds?”","Qiao Xi’s face turned red. After thinking for a moment, she still decided to tell Xue Yi how she could recover her taste buds.","There was silence on the other end of the phone. The air seemed to have frozen.","Xue Yi was shocked and said excitedly, “Little Six, you mean to say that kissing Gu Zheng can briefly restore your taste buds? Then don’t you want to recover forever?”","Qiao Xi hurriedly said, “Of course I do, but...”","“I think...” Xue Yi paused for a moment. “There’s a method that you can try. Your taste buds might be permanently recovered then. ”","Qiao Xi had a serious expression as she waited for her to continue.","Xue Yi chuckled. “You’ll probably recover after you sleep with him.”","Qiao Xi’s body abruptly froze, then her face turned red as she shouted, “Sister Xue Yi! You...”","Sleep with Gu Zheng?","...","When night fell, Qiao Xi tossed and turned in bed, unable to sleep.","Xue Yi’s words echoed in her mind. Sleep with him!","At this moment, Gu Zheng’s footsteps came from outside the door, and Qiao Xi felt her entire body heat up.","‘Should I seduce him again?’","Gu Zheng walked to the door, pushed it open, and slowly walked in. His eyes were full of smiles.","“Why is Mrs. Gu lying on my bed instead of returning to her own room?”","Qiao Xi’s body trembled as the corners of her mouth curled into a crafty smile.","She lay there quietly with the blanket wrapped around her body. Gu Zheng’s charming scent filled her nose, and her palms were full of sweat.","Should she be more reserved?","However, that was what Sister Xue Yi had taught her.","Her grandfather and brothers had tried treating her taste buds but it was to no avail. She thought that she would never taste food again.","However, Gu Zheng’s kiss could let her recover her taste buds for a short period of time. This meant that Gu Zheng was her savior.","A kiss could restore her taste buds for a few minutes. If she did that, would it increase the recovery time?","They were husband and wife, so they had to do it sooner or later.","Qiao Xi was slightly shy as she slowly turned around and lifted the blanket.","Gu Zheng’s expression froze as his body tensed."]},{"number":290,"title":"Chapter 290 - Save Me, Senior!","paragraphs":["At this moment, Qiao Xi was still wearing the pink bathing suit, which made her skin look delicate.","Qiao Xi said shyly, “Gu Zheng, I, I...”","Looking at her helpless look and flushed cheeks, Gu Zheng immediately understood. He looked up and smiled. “Mrs. Gu, do you know what you’re doing? Do you want it?”","The blush on Qiao Xi’s face spread to the back of her ears.","She lowered her eyes and gritted her teeth. This man was not being nice at all.","Hence, she retorted, “No!”","If she admitted that she was thinking about that, would Gu Zheng dislike her?","Gu Zheng smirked. “Why don’t you tell me what you’re going to do in a bathing suit, then, Mrs. Gu?”","Qiao Xi wished for nothing more than to find a hole in the ground and crawl into it.","What was she doing here?","Of course, she would not tell Gu Zheng her motive so easily, but she was already here. She could not just leave like this, right?","Qiao Xi stared at Gu Zheng’s face, feeling very conflicted.","‘How awkward. If I had known earlier, I wouldn’t have said so much. I would’ve just pounced on him. Does he dislike me? If my taste buds don’t recover even after we do that, what if he beats me up?","‘Does this bastard even want to sleep with me? What does this smile mean? He must know what I mean. He thinks I’m shy and is playing with me!’","Gu Zheng smirked.","She was shy? Would a shy person take the initiative to come over?","‘I’m going to sleep with you today. Come on! Take off your clothes!","‘This is a little too bold and unrestrained. I’d better change my method. Otherwise, I’m afraid Gu Zheng won’t be able to accept it.’","After thinking for a long time, a bright light flashed in Qiao Xi’s mind as she stood up.","Gu Zheng looked at her fair skin and curvy figure, gulping.","Qiao Xi walked in front of him and revealed a crafty smile. “Mr. Gu, don’t you know what I want to do?”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow. “Mrs. Gu, you...”","“I want to swim!” Qiao Xi interrupted him. “I’m wearing a bathing suit, so of course, I have to swim! Could it be that I want to sleep with you?! I’m not that bored!”","Gu Zheng retracted his words and smiled calmly. “Are we going for a swim now?”","Qiao Xi nodded and said, “Yes, I just want to swim. Can’t I?”","She could not tell Gu Zheng that she was here to sleep with him. Would that not be embarrassing?","After thinking about it, she thought that it would be better to let Gu Zheng accompany her to swim. When they were in the pool, their skin would be against each other and Gu Zheng would reveal his strong upper body. She would then seduce him from time to time. After that, it would be logical...","She was such a charming beauty. How could Gu Zheng not be tempted?","Then, Qiao Xi said with certainty, “I want to swim!”","Gu Zheng looked at her indifferently, then leaned against her ear and said gently, “Alright, I’ll go with you.”","Qiao Xi instantly felt her body go limp and numb.","Oh my God! Was Gu Zheng flirting with her?","...","At this moment, the pool in the backyard had already been cleaned up. Furthermore, the pool had a temperature change system that could be adjusted accordingly. Even at night, the temperature of the water would not go cold.","Qiao Xi took off the towel and jumped into the water. She did not feel cold at all.","She swam leisurely for a while before looking up at Gu Zheng who was above the pool. She asked shyly, “Gu... Ah Zheng, come down!”","Gu Zheng knew what she was thinking and nodded. The corners of his lips curled up as he tossed the towel aside and jumped into the water in an elegant posture.","His body proportions could be said to be perfect, and his strong upper body was even more perfect than a model’s. It caused Qiao Xi to blush.","The next second, she was stunned.","... Was this bastard going to swim by himself? Did he not care about her anymore?","That was not right. Shouldn’t he be embracing her, kissing her, hugging her, and raising her up high?","She watched Gu Zheng swim around and suddenly thought of an idea. She pretended to lose her balance and cried out in surprise before sinking into the water.","Of course, Gu Zheng saw this scene.","Qiao Xi struggled helplessly and gradually swam to Gu Zheng’s side.. She stretched out her hand with the intention of approaching him and shouted from time to time, “Senior, save me...”"]},{"number":291,"title":"Chapter 291 - Turns Out Gu Zheng Has A Hidden Disease","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Qiao Xi flailed about violently, but Gu Zheng did not react in the slightest.","‘Why isn’t the bastard saving me? I’m about to drown. Isn’t he worried at all?","‘Although I’m here to swim, I can’t be too proactive. I have to pretend to be drowning and get Gu Zheng to save me. Then, he’ll carry me and perform mouth-to-mouth resuscitation on me. Our skin will touch, and we’ll kiss and hug. It’ll be like a fire burning!’","Gu Zheng glanced sideways at the woman who was acting and curled his lips.","She was still thinking about this while struggling. It seemed that she was really unafraid of water now.","Gu Zheng watched her act calmly and asked slowly, “Mrs. Gu, don’t you know how to swim?”","Qiao Xi struggled weakly. “I... don’t. Gulp, gulp.”","In order to perform well, she even blew a few bubbles on purpose.","“Mrs. Gu.”","He said softly, “Why don’t you try standing up? The water level here seems to only reach your chest.”","Qiao Xi’s body instantly stiffened, and she stood up with an embarrassed expression.","“...” She was mercilessly exposed. She wiped the water from her face and smiled helplessly. “Er, is that so?”","Qiao Xi sighed in her heart. This damn man was really difficult to deceive. He saw through her trick with a single glance, so there was no need to continue acting. In any case, her intention was already very obvious.","She gritted her teeth and pounced into Gu Zheng’s arms, hugging him tightly with both hands. She said shyly, “Ah Zheng, teach me how to swim!”","Gu Zheng’s expression froze.","He could clearly feel their skin touching.","Qiao Xi was playing with fire. She was wearing a bathing suit and still dared to tease him like this?","Gu Zheng’s body was burning hot. His voice was hoarse. “Let go.”","She slowly looked up and smiled shyly. “Ah Zheng, although I’m not afraid of water anymore, I still don’t know how to swim. Can you teach me?”","Her breathing sprayed onto his chest, tickling and driving him crazy.","Gu Zheng’s hand landed on her back. Feeling the smoothness of her skin, his cheeks turned slightly red. “Okay.”","Qiao Xi secretly revealed a crafty smile. It was very easy to seduce a man like this.","She held onto the edge of the pool and slowly floated up. Her fair legs moved a few times as she said softly, “Ah Zheng, are we going to swim like this?”","Gu Zheng’s Adam’s apple bobbed. “Stop fooling around.”","He knew very well in his heart that Qiao Xi did not really want to have sex with him but just wanted to recover her taste buds. Besides, this was the pool. It was too casual.","Gu Zheng took a deep breath, placed his hands on her waist, and slowly turned his face away. “Your posture is wrong.”","With that, he showed her his professional posture and said seriously, “Give it a try.”","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with disappointment. She could only imitate him and swim a few times.","Wait, how did it become an actual swimming lesson?","Hearing her heartfelt thoughts, Gu Zheng smiled. “Don’t you want to learn how to swim? Swim for me.”","Qiao Xi obeyed and swam one round.","However, she immediately realized that the plot was not right!","Qiao Xi immediately rushed in front of Gu Zheng and said coyly, “I’m so scared. Ah Zheng, can you hug me and we’ll swim together?”","This bathing suit was in two separate garments, so her slender waist was revealed. If he hugged her, he would be touching her bare skin there.","Qiao Xi looked pitiful. “Ah Zheng, I’m so scared.”","Gu Zheng smiled, lowered his head, and abruptly approached. “Alright.”","Qiao Xi felt her heart skip a beat. This man was too tempting.","His hot palm was on her waist like a small stove.","Gu Zheng caressed her smooth skin, his heart thumping furiously.","He still maintained his calm. “Qiao Xi.”","Qiao Xi was just thinking about what to do next and how to seduce Gu Zheng when she heard him suddenly call out to her.","Immediately after, Gu Zheng said slowly, “I’m teaching you how to swim, so swim. Why are you struggling on the spot?”","Qiao Xi: “...”","Ah! She was going crazy!","She was trying so hard to seduce him, but this wretched man did not bite the bait and even poured cold water on her.","Qiao Xi stood in the water with a gloomy expression and silently pondered.","Could it be that Gu Zheng really had a hidden disease?","A beauty like her was taking the initiative to seduce him. She even tried her best but to no avail. Perhaps it was really because Gu Zheng could not do it.."]},{"number":292,"title":"Chapter 292 - Bastard, Just You Wait!","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","If that was the case, she could only rely on kissing to recover her taste buds.","Qiao Xi looked at the calm water surface. It was already midnight.","Not only did she not succeed, but she also proved that Gu Zheng had an underlying disease.","After thinking about it, she realized that all her efforts had been in vain. Hence, she turned red with anger.","Gu Zheng went out of the pool and turned around to say gently, “Let’s go. We should rest.”","Qiao Xi smiled lightly and pretended to be gentle.","[Bastard, just you wait!]","The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth twitched.","After the two of them were done washing up, she returned to the villa and went straight into Gu Zheng’s room.","Gu Zheng was stunned. “You’re sleeping here?”","Qiao Xi frowned and sighed. “Ah Zheng, don’t be sad. I won’t look down on you.”","Gu Zheng looked confused, not understanding what she meant. Then, he heard her say earnestly, “If I don’t accompany you, how are you going to survive this painful and long night alone?”","Why would it be painful?","Qiao Xi continued, “The world says that you’re cold, but you were willing to swim with me and even gave me a gift...”","Gu Zheng frowned.","Qiao Xi was slightly sad. “I know that you have me in your heart. Otherwise, why would you be so good to me? It’s just that... A beauty like me is standing in front of you, yet you can’t do anything. I understand the pain in your heart.”","Gu Zheng seemed to understand something.","Qiao Xi’s tone was helpless. “Men won’t tell others about their hidden illness, much less let their partners know about it. But it’s fine, I won’t despise you. Since I’ve married you, I’ll accompany you. We won’t do anything tonight. We’ll just hug each other and sleep.","“That’s why I’ve decided not to leave tonight. I’ll be by your side. Don’t be sad!”","Gu Zheng: “...”","Qiao Xi started giving a long speech. “Senior, we’ve shared a relationship for ten years, so I won’t mind. Even if you can’t do that forever, I won’t mind.","“I like you, so it doesn’t matter whether you can do that or not. Don’t feel inferior. Besides, medical technology is so advanced nowadays. You’ll definitely be able to recover. I can also treat you. Don’t be afraid of treatment. This isn’t a big problem.","“If it really can’t be cured, you’ll still be handsome, rich, and better than other men.”","Gu Zheng’s expression was gloomy like ink. “Qiao Xi!”","Qiao Xi quickly rushed into the bed. “Come on, Senior! Come into my arms. Don’t be afraid!”","Gu Zheng: “...”","This woman was definitely doing this on purpose!","Qiao Xi ignored the man standing by the bed. She fell asleep not long after closing her eyes.","The lights in the room were dim, and there was only a weak ray of light. The scattered ray of light was better than nothing to Gu Zheng.","His vision was gray, and he could only rely on his memory to move closer to the bed. He stroked her face gently before kissing her soft lips.","Mrs. Gu was too naughty today and he almost could not control himself.","He was lying on the bed when his phone rang. Gu Zheng unlocked his phone and heard Gu Yao’s voice.","“Gu Zheng, someone from the Lu family... came to the Gu family’s old mansion because of the heir.”","...","Late at night, the lights were still switched on in the Gu family’s old residence.","Gu Yao was awakened by the noise downstairs. When he came out, he saw that the Lu family had arrived.","He was about to leave when someone stopped him. “Are you Gu Yao?”","Gu Yao was stunned. The person in front of him looked a little familiar.","Madam Gu hurriedly introduced them. “Ah Yao, quickly come and greet him. This is Lu Yan.”","Lu Yan?","Gu Yao reacted for a while. Lu Yan was the adopted son of the Lu family?","Rumor had it that Lu Yan was Lu Qingyun’s biological son and was also a descendant of the Gu family.","Madam Gu greeted him warmly. “Lu Yan, what would you like to drink? I’ll go prepare it now.”","Lu Yan gently replied, “It’s fine, no need to trouble yourself.”","Gu Yao: “...”","Why did this scene feel a little wrong? The mistress seemed to be quite enthusiastic about the first wife’s son?","It was as though Lu Yan was her child while Gu Zheng was Lu Qingyun’s child.","Chairman Gu, Gu Weiming, was sitting on the sofa in the living room with Madam Gu and Huang Lilan beside him."]},{"number":293,"title":"Chapter 293 - The Gu Familys Successor","paragraphs":["Gu Weiming and Huang Lilan doted on Gu Yao very much, so they hurriedly waved at him to come downstairs. “Ah Yao, quickly call him ‘Brother’!”","Gu Yao: “...?”","In terms of bloodline, he should indeed call Lu Yan ‘elder brother’, but was there a mistake? Was it normal for a mistress to be so passionate about her first wife’s son?","Gu Yao was in a dilemma. In the end, he suppressed the doubts in his heart and called out obediently, “Brother.”","Gu Weiming immediately broke into a smile and said to Lu Xiang, “Please take care of Ah Yan.”","Lu Xiang sized up Gu Weiming and Huang Lilan. Lu Qingyun’s life was ruined by these two people, so she was grateful to them.","“Brother-in-law, it’s only right I take care of Ah Yan.”","Gu Yao was enlightened. “This is Eldest Miss Lu’s younger sister?”","Lu Xiang said warmly, “Ah Yao is really talented. I’m really envious of Madam Gu for having such an outstanding child.”","Huang Lilan was overjoyed. “Yes, Ah Yao has always been very sensible.”","Gu Yao thought that the atmosphere was very strange. He could not help it anymore. Who did not know how to act crazy?","“Miss Lu, you’re Eldest Miss Lu’s younger sister. You clearly know that my mother is the third party here, so why are you still so passionate? I remember that your Lu family can’t wait to kill Gu Zheng. I thought you couldn’t wait to kill my mother as well. My mother became the third party and indirectly caused Eldest Miss Lu’s death. Shouldn’t you hate her?”","...","It was so quiet that one could hear a pin drop in the living room.","Huang Lilan’s expression was ashen as she clenched her fists.","However, Lu Xiang remained calm. “That’s all in the past. Besides, my sister was a little boring. It’s normal for Brother-in-law not to like her. Since they don’t have any feelings for each other, how were they supposed to maintain their marriage? It’s reasonable for Madam Gu to marry Brother-in-law.”","Huang Lilan quickly said, “That’s right, Miss Lu is so sensible.”","Gu Yao widened his eyes in disbelief.","Was Lu Xiang Eldest Miss Lu’s biological sister?","She did not feel sorry for Eldest Miss Lu at all and even thought that it was only right for his mother to be the third party. Was she even blaming her sister for not being able to control her man?","“Lu Yan has something important to discuss with the Gu family. Ah Yao, listen to it as well.” Gu Weiming changed the topic.","Gu Yao looked at Gu Weiming, equally shocked.","Gu Weiming said, “It’s the old master’s birthday in a few days. At that time, I’ll announce that Lu Yan is my son and the heir of the Gu family. Gu Corporation will be handed to him to manage.”","“Ah Yao...” Gu Weiming was stunned for a moment. “You’re still a child. You can’t manage the family’s business well, but you can inherit 20% of the family’s shares. It’s enough for you to live a carefree life.","“Lu Yan, as Ah Yao’s elder brother, you must take care of your younger brother in the future.”","Lu Yan curled his lips. “Okay.”","Sweat broke out on Gu Yao’s forehead. He had never thought of inheriting the family business because he was an illegitimate child. He also did not want to be tied down by the family’s affairs, but the sudden 20% of shares was enough to shock him.","Never mind living a carefree life, even his son and grandson would probably be able to squander away that money.","Gu Yao hesitated for a moment before suddenly breaking the harmonious atmosphere. “Um... If the Gu family’s heir is Lu Yan, then what about Gu Zheng?”","...","The living room was eerily quiet.","Huang Lilan and Lu Xiang’s expressions darkened.","Gu Weiming frowned. “Gu Zheng is an illegitimate child. He has no right to be the heir!”","Huang Lilan chimed in, “Ah Yao, it’s good that you’re close to Gu Zheng, but the Gu family has to be handed to Sister Qingyun’s son to inherit. How could we hand it to an illegitimate child?”","Gu Weiming nodded. “Ah Yao, your mother is right. Lu Yan is the child of Qingyun and me. The Gu family should be handed to him to inherit. This way, the entire Gu family will accept it. Gu Zheng is just an illegitimate child. He has no right to inherit the Gu family. Moreover, Lu Yan has already forgotten about the past and is willing to return to the Gu family. I have to compensate him!”","Hearing his father’s words, Gu Yao muttered softly, “Gu Zheng is the one who made the Gu Corporation so prosperous today. Leaving it to Lu Yan...”","“Gu Corporation belongs to the Gu family! Gu Zheng has only contributed a little to the original foundation. He has already received enough.. Next, the corporation should be handed to Lu Yan to manage!”"]},{"number":294,"title":"Chapter 294 - Ill Always Be Your Brother","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Huang Lilan was a little angry. “Ah Yao, children shouldn’t care so much. The company’s matters have nothing to do with you. Go back to your room and rest.”","Even though Gu Yao was simple-minded, he still felt that Gu Zheng was not his mother’s biological child.","Back then, when Gu Zheng managed Gu Corporation, he relied on his own strength to build it bit by bit. He did not use any of the Gu family’s resources. Now, they actually wanted to snatch it away from him?","He was weak and words were useless, so he went upstairs.","After Gu Yao left, Gu Weiming said obsequiously, “Ah Yan, Gu Yao has always thought of Gu Zheng as his biological brother, so he’s a little closer to him. However, you know very well that Ah Yao is your younger brother. You have to take good care of him in the future.”","Lu Yan nodded with a warm smile.","The group of people was extremely satisfied, but Lu Xiang was still thinking about Gu Zheng.","They all knew Lu Yan’s true identity and why they were gathered here today, but they all had a tacit understanding and did not point it out.","To the outside world, it seemed logical for Lu Yan to inherit the Gu family. He was the child of Gu Weiming and Lu Qingyun, who were previously married. He was the most qualified to inherit everything in the Gu family.","As an illegitimate child, Gu Zheng was despised and hated by everyone. He was not qualified to be the head of the Gu family.","If the Gu family let Lu Yan be the heir, everyone would definitely say that Chairman Gu and Madam Gu were kind-hearted.","Everyone would think that although the Gu family had let Lu Qingyun and her child down, this was considered compensation. There was no need to pursue the events of the past anymore.","However, no one would investigate if Lu Yan was really Lu Qingyun’s child.","Lu Xiang smiled smugly.","If Lu Qingyun saw this scene, how would she feel? Whether it was the Lu family or the Gu family, no one cared about her. They were all using her.","So what if she was the eldest daughter of the Lu family? In the end, her son was still played by them.","Both families knew of Lu Yan and Gu Zheng’s identities. They even pretended to pass off the pauper for the prince. This way, the Lu and Gu families’ reputation would be preserved. From now on, the two families would not have to go against each other.","...","At this moment, Gu Yao was calling Gu Zheng to tell him about the situation just now. However, he realized that Gu Zheng was not replying. He asked hurriedly, “Gu Zheng, what exactly is going on? Don’t tell me you’re Eldest Miss Lu’s...”","“None of your business.”","Gu Yao was anxious. “I’m just concerned about you! If you’re not my mother’s son, then you’re not an illegitimate child. Lu Yan is. You’re Eldest Miss Lu’s son!”","“Whether I’m Huang Lilan’s son or not, I’m still your elder brother.”","Gu Zheng sneered. “The Lu and Gu families don’t matter to me. You’re the only one who’s my younger brother. Don’t worry. Hurry up and rest.”","Gu Yao’s heart skipped a beat.","That’s right. Gu Zheng had never cared about this because he did not care about the Lu family or the Gu family at all.","In Gu Zheng’s eyes, these two families were like clowns, but Gu Yao could not take it lying down.","Gu Yao gritted his teeth. It was all because of Gu Zheng’s blood, sweat, and tears that the Gu family could enjoy their riches now. Why should he hand over everything to Lu Yan?","If Gu Zheng really handed it to Lu Yan, he would use his power as a hedonistic son to destroy the entire Gu family!","...","The next morning, Qiao Xi was awakened by the ringing of her phone. “Are you participating in the auction?”","Qiao Xi knew that Li City was going to hold a grand auction. She liked one of the violins very much, and Xue Liang had promised to give it to her.","This auction was for charity. The violin was donated by a mysterious madam. It was extremely valuable as a collector’s item.","After hanging up, Gu Zheng asked, “Do you want to go?”","Before Qiao Xi could answer, Gu Zheng interrupted her. “I’ll go with you.”","She opened her mouth. Gu Zheng was the one who wanted to go, yet he said it as though he was only going to accompany her. What a wretched man!","...","At eight in the evening.","Everyone was already seated. The people present were all big shots of Li City.","These rich and powerful elites not only had successful careers but also good reputations. Hence, they had to attend such a charity auction.","Even if they did not like it, they would have to buy at least two pieces.. Then, they could say that they were doing charity."]},{"number":295,"title":"Chapter 295 - Mysterious Item","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The staff member handed out the auction booklet to everyone present and introduced the items for auction today.","Inside the lounge, Qiao Xi flipped it open and took a glance. It was mostly jewelry and some famous paintings, ornaments, and musical instruments.","However...","“Why is there another mysterious item here? What exactly is it?” she asked Gu Zheng in confusion.","Gu Zheng swept a glance over and said indifferently, “You’ll know in a bit.”","When he put it that way, the more curious Qiao Xi became.","After a while, she suddenly received a message on her phone. It was from Xue Liang.","“Gu Zheng, Fourth Brother is here too. I’m going to look for him. I’ll be back in a while.”","“Alright.” The man nodded.","Qiao Xi had just left when Gu Zheng said coldly, “Since you’re here, then stop hiding.”","At this moment, someone walked in.","Lu Yan had a smile on the corner of his mouth as he walked in naturally without any awkwardness or restraint. “President Gu, you’re really alert!”","Gu Zheng sneered.","Lu Yan gently said, “Gu Zheng, do you not want to see me so much?”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and did not want to care at all. “Even if that’s the case, won’t you still come, Mr. Lu?”","Lu Yan was not angry but smiled indifferently.","The two of them knew very well about the grudge between them. Lu Yan was very glad that his family had paved the way for him back then. Otherwise, he would have to bear the reputation of an illegitimate child for the rest of his life.","Their fates had completely changed. He had become the eldest young master of the Gu family, while Gu Zheng was an illegitimate child.","Lu Yan was calm. “Rumor has it that President Gu is arrogant and doesn’t take anyone seriously. It’s my honor to be someone you hate!","“I know why you don’t want to see me. You’re afraid that I’ll hit on Qiao Xi, right? And your younger brother, Gu Yao. They’re the most important people to you. You don’t want me to get close to them, right?”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were deep.","To be able to say these words so indifferently, Lu Yan’s skin was really thick.","Gu Zheng raised his eyes and glanced at him. Lu Yan looked gentle like jade on the surface, but he was actually a vicious snake.","“Scram!”","Lu Yan’s smile gradually vanished. “Gu Zheng.”","Gu Zheng exuded a murderous aura.","Lu Yan did not expect that even after 20 years of scheming and Gu Zheng becoming an illegitimate child that Gu Zheng would not care at all.","He removed all pretenses. “President Gu, you’re skilled, so you’re naturally not afraid of me. But don’t you want to think about Qiao Xi and Gu Yao?”","Gu Zheng looked at him indifferently. After a long time, he sneered.","“Lu Yan, you don’t have to threaten me. Gu Yao is your younger brother, so you won’t do anything to him. As for Qiao Xi, you don’t dare!”","Lu Yan’s expression darkened.","Gu Zheng said slowly, “Get lost! Don’t make me do it myself!”","Lu Yan was slightly stunned. He did not understand why Gu Zheng was still so arrogant. At this moment, should he not be feeling uneasy in his heart? Should he not be afraid that his inheritance would be taken away by others?","However, Gu Zheng was very calm as if he had long been prepared for this.","He indeed could not touch Gu Yao and Qiao Xi, because if he wanted to take Gu Zheng’s position, he could not hurt those two people.","He wanted to snatch Qiao Xi away and become Gu Yao’s most respected elder brother.","Lu Yan smiled again and said meaningfully, “The auction is about to start. I’ll leave first. I heard that today’s auction will be very exciting!”","Gu Zheng had never cared about reputation, so he rarely participated in such auctions. However, he was here for that mysterious item this time.","If he did not guess wrong, it was the same for Lu Yan.","In that case, they would have to see who the winner would be.","...","Qiao Xi walked around but did not find Xue Liang. She casually found a seat and sent a message to Xue Liang.","Qiao Xi: [Fourth Brother, where are you?]","Xue Liang: [Little Six, I have something urgent to attend to. I’ll be back as soon as possible. If I don’t make it back, you can bid for that violin. I’ll make the payment later.]","Qiao Xi was extremely excited. [Alright! Don’t blame me if the price is too high!]","Xue Liang did not mind at all. [It doesn’t matter how much it is. As long as you’re happy, it’s fine. I can even spend 100 million. Raise the price!]","Qiao Xi smiled with satisfaction. She was just about to stand up and leave when she heard a voice not far away.","“Mengqing, no matter what, we have to get that violin today!”"]},{"number":296,"title":"Chapter 296 - Why Cant My Wife Come?","paragraphs":["At this moment, Madam Yao reminded her in a low voice, “Our Yao family offended Xue Liang previously. After all, he has a lot of influence in the country and he might cause problems for the Yao family’s business. Therefore, we have to earn his forgiveness.","“I heard that he has wanted this violin for a long time. We’ll get it and give it to Xue Liang as an apology.”","Yao Mengqing nodded. “What if others snatch it from me?”","“I don’t think so. No one else should know about Xue Liang wanting this violin.”","Madam Yao smiled and said, “Moreover, Xue Liang has something to attend to and left at the last minute. He doesn’t have time to come. We can bid for it and give it to him. He’ll definitely forgive us.”","Yao Mengqing said, “Mom, don’t worry. I’ll definitely get it.”","Qiao Xi smiled and left.","Ever since Xue Liang chased the Yao family out of the art exhibition, there were rumors in high society that the elders of the Yao family had done something shameless.","This matter started because of Xue Liang, so they naturally had to make amends with him.","Hence, the Yao family had targeted Xue Liang. They knew that he wanted this violin, so they specially came to the auction house to bid for it and beg for Xue Liang’s forgiveness.","However...","Fourth Brother wanted the violin because he wanted to give it to her!","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. How would Yao Mengqing feel if she found out that she was the one who wanted this violin?","She returned to Gu Zheng’s side and looked at the violin in the auction book with interest.","Gu Zheng looked up. “You like this?”","Qiao Xi replied, “Yes.”","Gu Zheng said, “I’ll get it for you.”","Qiao Xi smiled thoughtfully. “No rush, you don’t have to spend your money. Someone will bid for it and give it to me.”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow. “Xue Liang?”","“Fourth Brother did say that he would give me the violin, but he’s not going to be the one spending the money.”","Qiao Xi chuckled. “This violin will be mine sooner or later. Why should I trouble myself? Let’s look at something else.”","Seeing how confident she was, Gu Zheng did not ask anymore.","After a while, Qiao Xi asked curiously, “Gu Zheng, do you think all these noble families gathered together to participate in the auction just for the sake of getting a good reputation? But is it worth it to spend so much money for one’s reputation?”","He said indifferently, “These people don’t lack money. They care very much about their reputation. Furthermore, when someone donates, there’ll be a lot of people who’ll follow. This is how charity auctions started.”","Qiao Xi understood what was going on. Actually, they were all done for the sake of the outside world, and there were probably not many people who were truly doing charity.","Everyone was gathered here today to display the strength of their family. It would definitely be something to look forward to.","Qiao Xi flipped through the auction book. “This necklace is inlaid with ten-carat diamonds. It looks good. They’re even auctioning this painting of Mr. Qi’s? So many...”","Before she could finish, she heard a woman’s mocking voice.","“I advise you not to look anymore. You don’t have the money to buy it anyway!”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and watched the two women slowly walk over.","Yao Mengqi looked at her in disdain. Yao Mengqing stood at the side, expressionless.","“What kind of place is this? How is it that just anyone has the right to enter? Since you don’t have money to buy anything, why are you here? How laughable!”","Qiao Xi was instantly speechless.","Did she look very poor?","Gu Zheng slowly looked up with cold eyes. “If the Yao family has the right to come, why can’t my wife?”","Yao Mengqi was shocked when she met his cold eyes.","She thought that Gu Zheng did not like Qiao Xi, so he would not stand up for this woman. It was rumored in high society that Gu Zheng only married Qiao Xi on an impulse and did not like her at all.","Yao Mengqing stopped Yao Mengqi in time and said gently, “Ah Zheng, don’t be angry. Mengqi is young and insensible. She’s a little straightforward. She must have forgotten that Xi Xi married you.”","“Moreover, today’s auction is very important. Many big shots from Li City are attending. She’s just afraid that Xi Xi will be too reckless and offend some noble gentleman or madam.”","“Yao Mengqing, let me remind you again.” Gu Zheng did not even raise his eyes as impatience filled his face.."]},{"number":297,"title":"Chapter 297 - Miss Yao, Can’t You Understand Human Language?","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Yao Mengqing’s expression changed. “Ah Zheng, I...”","“I told you that only people I’m close with can call me ‘Ah Zheng’. You’re not worthy!” Gu Zheng showed no mercy.","Yao Mengqing’s face was ghastly pale as she looked at Qiao Xi with grievances.","“I’m your friend, Ah Zheng.","“Does Xi Xi not like me calling you that? But all these years, I...” Yao Mengqing choked and said, “Ah Zheng...”","Gu Zheng narrowed his eyes.","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with ridicule. “Miss Yao, Gu Zheng has already stopped you from calling him that. Do you not understand human language?”","Gu Zheng did not let her call him ‘Ah Zheng’ but she kept doing it. Yao Mengqing was still acting pitiful. She was so annoying!","Qiao Xi sneered. “Only his grandma and I can call him that. Do you think you’re qualified?”","There was silence. Yao Mengqing bit her lip.","She lowered her head and was about to cry. Her voice was trembling. “Xi Xi, I... I really didn’t do it on purpose. I’ve always called him that in the past, so I’m just used to it.”","“Qiao Xi! Aren’t you going too far? It’s just a greeting. Meng Qing has called him that for many years. Do you have to be so unforgiving?”","Not far away, Lin Jie saw that Yao Mengqing was aggrieved. He took a big stride forward and shouted at Qiao Xi.","He snorted. “Ah Zheng, you and Mengqing are childhood sweethearts. Why can’t you be a little kinder? Besides...”","“I’ve already warned Miss Yao a long time ago and she has agreed not to call me that again. Furthermore, we’re not close, so calling me that so affectionately will cause misunderstandings.”","Gu Zheng waved his hand and gestured to Song Shiyu. “If she still can’t remember, you have to remind her.”","“Yes!” Song Shiyu replied without hesitation.","The corners of Yao Mengqing’s lips twitched as she forced out a smile.","“Mengqing, let’s go! Why should we be angry with them?”","Lin Jie pulled Yao Mengqing and was about to leave. “Qiao Xi! Just you wait. It’s such an important occasion today, so I won’t bicker with you!”","Yao Mengqing said humbly, “Xi Xi, we’re leaving. If you like something, you can tell me. I’ll get it and give it to you as an apology.”","After saying that, Lin Jie pulled Yao Mengqing and left angrily.","Qiao Xi rolled her eyes. What an adulterous pair!","Yao Mengqing was not that kind-hearted. Although she was just saying it, she took it seriously. It just so happened that those few sets of jewelry were decent.","Since Yao Mengqing said so, Qiao Xi would reluctantly accept her offer, then!","...","Yao Mengqing and Lin Jie had just sat down. Lin Jie was filled with righteous indignation. “Mengqing, you shouldn’t have been so gentle with her. Otherwise, she’ll always bully you! What right does she have to participate in the auction? Does she have money?”","Everyone looked over. Although the Yao family had offended Xue Liang, the Yao family was still part of the high society. Who were they mocking?","Who dared to bully Miss Yao? Had they gone mad?!","Yao Mengqing said helplessly, “Ah Jie, it’s better to avoid trouble.”","“Isn’t this a charity auction? Why is she here if she doesn’t have money? She’s merely occupying a position that doesn’t belong to her! Why isn’t she getting lost?!”","Yao Mengqing looked at the gazes of the people around her and pretended to stop him. “How could Xi Xi be poor? The jewelry on her is expensive. She definitely doesn’t lack money...”","“She bought luxury goods with that bit of money she had, but she doesn’t have the money to donate! Meng Qing, don’t speak up for her!”","Lin Jie said boldly, “She doesn’t even donate her money! She’s just a greedy, selfish b*tch!”","These words had completely ruined Qiao Xi’s image.","Everyone looked at her with disdain. Since they were already at the charity auction, they had to donate a little even if they had to pretend. Being able to donate to the children who were fighting against illnesses was also a good thing to do.","Since she was unwilling to donate anything, why did she come to the charity auction?","Yao Mengqing heard the discussions around her and secretly revealed a proud smile. “Ah Jie, Xi Xi isn’t someone like that. She must be facing some trouble.","“She has her own difficulties. Maybe it’s just that she doesn’t want to talk about it. Xi Xi grew up in the countryside when she was young. It’s reasonable for her to be reluctant to donate..”"]},{"number":298,"title":"Chapter 298 - Worlds Apart","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Lin Jie’s face was full of disdain. “Qiao Xi is really too unpresentable. She hid all her savings just like that. You’re busy donating money to charity, so why can’t she learn from you?”","Yao Mengqing smiled smugly.","A moment later, the auction officially began.","The first item was a calligraphy piece, but it was not a master’s work, so no one raised their placards.","Even if one wanted to donate, one had to buy something useful. They could not just casually spend money.","At this moment, a sweet female voice sounded. “200,000.”","No one liked this painting, so the 200,000 yuan was wasted.","“Miss Yao, you’re so sensible. Only a person like her would spend money to get this piece.”","“Although 200,000 yuan is just a drop in the ocean for the Yao family, spending 200,000 yuan for nothing is too much of a loss. Compared to Miss Yao, some people are simply unbearable to look at. Yet they still have the cheek to come?”","Everyone looked at Qiao Xi in unison and muttered in a low voice, “Young Master Lin is right. Even if she doesn’t have any money, she can still fork out 200,000 yuan, right? If she doesn’t even bid for such a cheap thing, then the rest of the items won’t even be auctioned off!”","Gu Zheng’s expression turned cold.","The auctioneer put down the mallet. The final winner of the first item was Yao Mengqing. No one wanted to compete with her.","The venue erupted in applause. Everyone was praising her for her beauty and kind heart.","The next item was a jade pendant. Mr. Song had carved it himself and the starting price was two million.","Qiao Xi was instantly interested.","Sister Xue Yi had recently taken a liking to these things and had been looking for a jade pendant. Qiao Xi knew with a glance that this jade pendant was of good quality and Sister Xue Yi would probably like it.","Everyone also had their eyes on this item and gradually raised their hands.","Before long, the price of the jade pendant increased to 3.5 million.","In the end, only Yao Mengqing and a madam were bidding for it. The price kept rising. In the end, Yao Mengqing bid 5 million before the madam gave up.","Everyone gasped.","Although this jade pendant was expensive, it was not worth 5 million yuan. If Eldest Miss Yao spent 5 million yuan on it, was she not planning to bid for the rest of the items?","Yao Mengqi said proudly, “My sister is kind-hearted. She doesn’t care about this small amount of money for a donation. Look at some other people. They’re really shameless!”","Everyone muttered in low voices. Even though Qiao Xi was not as rich as Yao Mengqing, since she was here, she should do her best to bid for something.","Yao Mengqi mocked, “This is a charity auction. It’s for the medical treatment of children from poor families. If some people don’t have the ability and compassion, they should just quickly get lost. Don’t just sit here and pretend to be rich! How disgusting!”","As soon as she finished speaking, the crowd fell silent.","Soon, everyone was discussing.","“Miss Yao spent five million without batting an eye. I heard that she has taken a liking to a few things. She’ll probably donate tens of millions tonight.”","“Also, I heard that President Gu’s female partner for such events previously was Miss Yao. After that, it suddenly became Qiao Xi. Who knows what’s fishy about this?”","“Miss Yao is beautiful and a daughter of a noble family. How can Qiao Xi compare to Miss Yao? Could it be that President Gu really likes Qiao Xi?”","Everyone nodded, and they felt that Qiao Xi would definitely lose all her reputation today.","If Yao Mengqing became the person who donated the most, the foundation would be named after her. This was another honor.","Qiao Xi was just a toy next to President Gu, while Yao Mengqing was the woman who was truly worthy of President Gu. The two of them were worlds apart.","The auctioneer knocked on the auction mallet. “5 million going once!”","“5 million going twice...”","Yao Mengqing was filled with confidence when she heard the praise from her surroundings. She would completely crush Qiao Xi and become the most suitable woman for Gu Zheng.","Right at the last moment, when the gavel was about to land, Qiao Xi slowly raised the bid. “8 million!”","8 million?","Yao Mengqing’s expression changed and her smile vanished.","Everyone stared at her in shock.","Normally, the auction process involved increases of 100,000 yuan or 1,000,000 yuan. They had never seen someone like her who directly raised the price to 8 million yuan. Even the auctioneer was stunned.."]},{"number":299,"title":"Chapter 299 - The Highest Bidder","paragraphs":["At this moment, Qiao Xi spoke out in reminder, “Isn’t 8 million enough?”","The auctioneer nodded hurriedly. “8, 8 million. Yes, yes! Miss Qiao is offering 8 million. Is there a higher bid?”","A few passers-by who were mocking Qiao Xi for not spending money just earlier immediately lowered their heads with awkward expressions.","No way? Didn’t Miss Yao say that Qiao Xi had no money at all? Why would she fork out 8 million to buy a jade pendant?","Although this jade pendant was not cheap, it was at most 3 million. 8 million was a sky-high price.","Had Qiao Xi gone mad? Was she mistaken to spend so much money?","Yao Mengqing’s face was livid. Her nails dug into her palms.","Looking at the current situation, Yao Mengqi shouted angrily, “Qiao Xi! You did it on purpose, right?! My sister has already offered 5 million yuan! Why are you still fighting for it?”","“I’m also doing this for the sake of those sick children.” Qiao Xi smiled indifferently and continued, “Actually, it doesn’t matter how much money I spend. For the sake of treating the children, so what if I spend a little money? The highest bidder will obtain the item being auctioned. Could it be that I can’t bid for what your sister has taken a liking to?”","“You...” Yao Mengqi’s face instantly turned red.","Qiao Xi’s words actually caused her to be unable to retort, but Qiao Xi was clearly pretending. She even said that she did it for the sake of the sick children.","Yao Mengqing’s eyes were vicious. When she looked up again, she revealed a gentle smile. “It’s okay. If Xi Xi wants it, I’ll give it to her.”","The auctioneer slammed the gavel, and everyone could not help but look at Qiao Xi.","Most of them only brought 5 million yuan with them when they attended the auction. They only wanted to bid for a few small items, but Qiao Xi spent 8 million yuan on a jade pendant!","That was money!","It would seem that Qiao Xi was not as selfish as Young Master Lin had said?","“Miss Qiao is quite generous. Young Master Lin even said that she wouldn’t donate. He must have misunderstood her.”","“She just spent 8 million yuan. She’s definitely not a greedy and selfish woman. We were wrong this time.”","“It’s all because of Yao Mengqing. She slandered Qiao Xi’s reputation together with Lin Jie. Qiao Xi doesn’t lack money at all. Not just anyone can fork out 8 million!”","Yao Mengqi heard the discussion around her and stomped her feet in anger.","“Sister, don’t be angry. Qiao Xi’s limelight is temporary. She’ll only be able to bid on this one item. Moreover, it’s uncertain if she can even fork out the 8 million!”","Yao Mengqing smiled with difficulty. “Xi Xi is doing this for those poor children. Xi Xi, thank you. Your donation will be greatly appreciated.”","The next second, the auctioneer took out the next item.","Yao Mengqi immediately broke into a smile. “Sister, Qiao Xi will definitely not have any money left so you can bid for this.”","The auctioneer said, “This is a 10-carat diamond necklace from South Africa. Rumor has it that this is the work of the jewelry master, Ella. It represents unwavering love. I believe all the ladies here will like it very much.”","Everyone’s eyes lit up when they heard that. A few noblewomen immediately begged the man beside them to raise the placard.","Although 10-carat diamonds were not considered rare, this necklace was embedded with many precious gems. Under the illumination of the lights, it was dazzling and shot out five colors.","Someone had once estimated that this diamond necklace was worth about 10 million yuan.","Such things were worth collecting. It was worth it even if it was 15 million.","Yao Mengqing was not in a rush to raise her placard. She only started raising the price in the end. The price soon soared to 15 million.","She could not help but glance at Qiao Xi. The other party had her head lowered as if she was not interested in this.","Yao Mengqing’s expression softened. Fortunately, Qiao Xi was not bidding for this.","“Sister, I knew that she could only fork out 8 million yuan. She doesn’t have the money to buy anything else. She didn’t even raise her placard for this necklace. She must be broke!”","Yao Mengqi’s voice was heard by everyone. Her tone was very arrogant.","Yao Mengqing advised her gently, “Qi Qi, you can’t say that. Perhaps Xi Xi doesn’t like diamonds?”","Yao Mengqi retorted, “Which woman doesn’t like diamonds? I think she just doesn’t have any money! Didn’t she say she wanted to donate? If she has the ability, she should continue raising the price!","“Some people are just good at talking but in reality, they can only afford to spend 8 million yuan..”"]},{"number":300,"title":"Chapter 300 - 20 Million, I Want It","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The auctioneer said, “15 million going once, 15 million going twice—”","Yao Mengqi was extremely proud and became even more arrogant. “Sister! Do you think she doesn’t dare? She only knows how to puff herself up at her own expense! Why is she pretending to be rich when she doesn’t have any money? How laughable...”","“20 million!” Qiao Xi suddenly said.","Yao Mengqi immediately swallowed her words.","Qiao Xi took a sip of tea and said indifferently, “20 million, I want this necklace.”","Hearing Qiao Xi’s nonchalant voice, Yao Mengqi felt that she had been deeply mocked, so she roared in exasperation, “Qiao Xi! Are you crazy?! Are you going to bid for whatever my sister is bidding?”","“Can’t I donate? Miss Yao, you’re so nosy. Are you only allowing your sister to donate?”","Yao Mengqi choked.","Qiao Xi said slowly, “Miss Yao, if you’re unwilling, you can continue to increase the price. I have no objections. The highest bidder wins!”","Yao Mengqing’s expression froze. She said with difficulty, “... Forget it, forget it. I’ll take the next one.”","Qiao Xi’s expression was composed as she smiled indifferently.","Qiao Xi remained calm and collected throughout the auction. As long as Yao Mengqing managed to bid for something till the end, she would definitely raise the price and intercept it. Moreover, Qiao Xi would bid at a high price and not give Yao Mengqing a chance to further raise it.","Yao Mengqi instantly cursed, “Qiao Xi! You’re despicable! Why are you snatching all of my sister’s bids? Even if you’re jealous that my sister and President Gu were childhood sweethearts, you can’t keep targeting her!”","Everyone raised their eyes in surprise, and their gazes fell on Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi said lightly, “I’m jealous of Miss Yao? Your Yao family really knows how to flatter yourselves.”","Just then, Madam Yao said, “Miss Qiao, mind your words. Qi Qi is right. You’re just jealous of President Gu and Mengqing—”","Qiao Xi interrupted her words. “I’m bidding for these things because I want to donate money. After all, Miss Yao has been mocking me for being selfish and unwilling to donate just now. I just want to give a little help to those sick children. Is there anything wrong with that?”","Qiao Xi smiled lightly. “Miss Yao, you called me cheap just now. I don’t understand. How am I cheap after donating so much money? You mean to say that I shouldn’t donate?","“Or is it that only the Yao family can donate but no one else can? Why don’t we hold this charity auction exclusively for the Yao family to participate, then? The rest of us don’t have to waste time here anymore, right?”","Everyone immediately reacted and looked at the Yao family angrily.","No matter who was the one bidding, the money gathered today was to treat sick children. A portion of the money would also be donated to the villages in the mountainous areas.","Qiao Xi had done a good deed by bidding so many times, so why was the Yao family calling her cheap now?","Miss Qiao was right. The Yao family thought that Qiao Xi had stolen Yao Mengqing’s limelight, so they kept scolding her.","The Yao family’s upbringing was really questionable. One moment, they said that Miss Qiao was going through troubles. The next moment, they said that she was cheap. In the beginning, they even mocked Miss Qiao for being poor.","Moreover, how was this matter related to President Gu?","Yao Mengqi could not explain herself. “You...”","“Miss Yao, you have nothing to say, right? If the Yao family really wants to donate so much, then don’t waste any more time. Just buy something.”","Yao Mengqi was so angry that her whole body was trembling. Qiao Xi, this b*tch, was jealous of her sister’s relationship with President Gu. That was why she kept bidding for these items.","Yao Mengqing, who was at the side, shed tears out of grievances and sobbed softly. “Qi Qi, Ah Jie, don’t say anymore.”","Qiao Xi sneered with an indifferent expression.","She had intercepted so many times not because she wanted to act on impulse but because she wanted to set a trap for Yao Mengqing.","There were a total of 20 items. Qiao Xi had bid for eight and spent over 100 million.","She would take everything that Yao Mengqing liked.","At this moment, Yao Mengqing’s face was livid. She listened to the mocking words that were uttered from time to time and bit her lip.","The most powerful people in today’s auction were the Gu family and the Yao family.","Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng, who were sitting together, naturally represented the Gu family. The Yao family, who kept saying that they would donate, only managed to bid for a painting worth 200,000 yuan. If news of this were to spread, where would they put their dignity?","Before entering the auction, Yao Mengqing had even said in an interview that she would do her best to help the sick children recover from their illness.","Yet, she had only spent 200,000 yuan? That was too shabby."]}]);
